(2039970, 277821, 10432, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Ren Faire.  ;-)<br/>Nice capture - sharp subject, good colors, and shallow DoF.  The lighting seems a little harsh on his hand.</td>', 'Looks like a Ren Faire.  ;-)Nice capture - sharp subject, good colors, and shallow DoF.  The lighting seems a little harsh on his hand.', '2006-01-16 00:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039971, 277181, 34247, '<td valign="top">Hello Joey. Your perspective is beyond your years. The blown out spot anchors the image. The processing is sublime. You sure you''re not a front for some overpaid, aged photographer who is going through mid-life crisis? 10.</td>', 'Hello Joey. Your perspective is beyond your years. The blown out spot anchors the image. The processing is sublime. You sure you''re not a front for some overpaid, aged photographer who is going through mid-life crisis? 10.', '2006-01-16 00:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
