(2040022, 275519, 43671, '<td valign="top">Sweet colors and I love silhouettes but the horizon will prolly get some comments like this one but I''m giving ya an 8. The title is dead on very nice.</td>', 'Sweet colors and I love silhouettes but the horizon will prolly get some comments like this one but I''m giving ya an 8. The title is dead on very nice.', '2006-01-16 00:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040024, 274652, 47294, '<td valign="top">Damn this is a GREAT photo....I hope you do really well! 10 :)</td>', 'Damn this is a GREAT photo....I hope you do really well! 10 :)', '2006-01-16 00:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040028, 275177, 10867, '<td valign="top">This is a very nicely shot image, bgut I find it a bit oversaturated for my taste.  Also, some of the rocks are a bit hot.</td>', 'This is a very nicely shot image, bgut I find it a bit oversaturated for my taste.  Also, some of the rocks are a bit hot.', '2006-01-16 00:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040033, 277075, 33947, '<td valign="top">GORGEOUS coloration and luminosity!!! Like the rich, vivid tones as well as the light highlights on the sap. Effective contrast with the muted background both in terms of color and texture. Nice positioning and cropping. Like it VERY much.</td>', 'GORGEOUS coloration and luminosity!!! Like the rich, vivid tones as well as the light highlights on the sap. Effective contrast with the muted background both in terms of color and texture. Nice positioning and cropping. Like it VERY much.', '2006-01-16 00:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040035, 278877, 30861, '<td valign="top">serious oversharpening hurts this striking image; particularly disturbing is the halo on the right edge of the most vertical crag, and the haloes aroudn the skiers. Beautifully seen.</td>', 'serious oversharpening hurts this striking image; particularly disturbing is the halo on the right edge of the most vertical crag, and the haloes aroudn the skiers. Beautifully seen.', '2006-01-16 00:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040036, 275352, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wow, so that''s what that looks like! I''ve flown over many times and wondered what it was like down there. The contrast between the crisp ice and smooth clouds is excellent, as is the contrast between the cool blue ice and the warm clouds. And the two birds (cormorants?) provide a center of attraction.  Just wish the image were full 640 pixels wide! 8</td>', 'Wow, so that''s what that looks like! I''ve flown over many times and wondered what it was like down there. The contrast between the crisp ice and smooth clouds is excellent, as is the contrast between the cool blue ice and the warm clouds. And the two birds (cormorants?) provide a center of attraction.  Just wish the image were full 640 pixels wide! 8', '2006-01-16 00:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040037, 275321, 37544, '<td valign="top">This is one amazing black and white photograph...added it to my favs!</td>', 'This is one amazing black and white photograph...added it to my favs!', '2006-01-16 00:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040038, 280903, 10867, '<td valign="top">Stark and interesting image.</td>', 'Stark and interesting image.', '2006-01-16 00:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040041, 277143, 39349, '<td valign="top">Bright eyes indeed. Beautiful shot, this young lady has STUNNING eyes! Bravo on a warm and inviting shot. I love your choice of DOF, only think I might suggest is that perhaps lighten up the shadow on the right side of her face?</td>', 'Bright eyes indeed. Beautiful shot, this young lady has STUNNING eyes! Bravo on a warm and inviting shot. I love your choice of DOF, only think I might suggest is that perhaps lighten up the shadow on the right side of her face?', '2006-01-16 00:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040043, 274614, 714, '<td valign="top">Such a sweet capture of a beautiful baby.  Love the eyes and her cute smile.</td>', 'Such a sweet capture of a beautiful baby.  Love the eyes and her cute smile.', '2006-01-16 00:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040046, 278871, 30861, '<td valign="top">Truly strange image. In a sense I feel almost "offended" that you''ve included the other photographers in this pristine environment, but I''m also intrigued by it. Beautifully exposed/rendered.</td>', 'Truly strange image. In a sense I feel almost "offended" that you''ve included the other photographers in this pristine environment, but I''m also intrigued by it. Beautifully exposed/rendered.', '2006-01-16 00:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040052, 276762, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pure delight.  I like her feet!!! ha ha ha  Cute.</td>', 'Pure delight.  I like her feet!!! ha ha ha  Cute.', '2006-01-16 00:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040053, 274858, 10867, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit too much solid black, especially in the central portion of the image.  Lovely idea, though, and lovely sunset colours.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit too much solid black, especially in the central portion of the image.  Lovely idea, though, and lovely sunset colours.', '2006-01-16 00:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040074, 277201, 10432, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors in the sunset.  The beach almost looks like moon surface in that lighting.<br/> <br/>The shadow is actually distracting and I think this would be improved without it.  I also think the photo could use something else to add interest to the photo.  BOL</td>', 'Pretty colors in the sunset.  The beach almost looks like moon surface in that lighting. The shadow is actually distracting and I think this would be improved without it.  I also think the photo could use something else to add interest to the photo.  BOL', '2006-01-16 00:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
