(2040387, 281641, 1827, '<td valign="top">Neat, I like the shape of the bird soaring in the negative space of the clouds.  You''ve captured such a feeling of movement in a landscape, which is nice.  Also, I really like that the colors aren''t everly digital.</td>', 'Neat, I like the shape of the bird soaring in the negative space of the clouds.  You''ve captured such a feeling of movement in a landscape, which is nice.  Also, I really like that the colors aren''t everly digital.', '2006-01-16 01:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
