(2040453, 280493, 1827, '<td valign="top">First thought: I hope she''s 18!  (I''m sure she is, so that isn''t offered as criticism, merely to let you know my gut reaction to the shot.)  Unpon further viewing, the lens distorion, combined with the pose (the way she''s leaning forward) give the impression of sitting on a toilet - the panties probably further that impression.  The softening of the skin is too much for my taste, and the removal/cloning of the wrinkling in her forhead seems off to me.  By that I mean both that I can see remnants of the process of removal, and that it seems unnatural with her eyebrows raised like that for there not to be some wrinkling in her forhead.</td>', 'First thought: I hope she''s 18!  (I''m sure she is, so that isn''t offered as criticism, merely to let you know my gut reaction to the shot.)  Unpon further viewing, the lens distorion, combined with the pose (the way she''s leaning forward) give the impression of sitting on a toilet - the panties probably further that impression.  The softening of the skin is too much for my taste, and the removal/cloning of the wrinkling in her forhead seems off to me.  By that I mean both that I can see remnants of the process of removal, and that it seems unnatural with her eyebrows raised like that for there not to be some wrinkling in her forhead.', '2006-01-16 01:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
