(2040487, 277821, 43463, '<td valign="top">A good candid of a colorful individual. Love the colors and the costume especially his smiling poise here. It makes me wonder what he sees that he is smiling - not only that but with the poise of his hands makes me think that he may be a magician of sorts (nothing up my sleeve). My only critique on this photo is that I think you could have easily zoomed in on the subject more or a closer crop for the real star of the photo is this costumed character. Too much background can draw our focus away from the main subject.</td>', 'A good candid of a colorful individual. Love the colors and the costume especially his smiling poise here. It makes me wonder what he sees that he is smiling - not only that but with the poise of his hands makes me think that he may be a magician of sorts (nothing up my sleeve). My only critique on this photo is that I think you could have easily zoomed in on the subject more or a closer crop for the real star of the photo is this costumed character. Too much background can draw our focus away from the main subject.', '2006-01-16 01:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040492, 278245, 25464, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and image.  I would have liked to see a bit more detail on the face.  This was kinda hard to figure out at first glance, but interesting enough to keep me looking.</td>', 'Interesting angle and image.  I would have liked to see a bit more detail on the face.  This was kinda hard to figure out at first glance, but interesting enough to keep me looking.', '2006-01-16 01:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040495, 281602, 43930, '<td valign="top">Always happens to the best fishermen!</td>', 'Always happens to the best fishermen!', '2006-01-16 01:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040500, 277075, 47933, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Great title as well. Nicely done!</td>', 'I really like this. Great title as well. Nicely done!', '2006-01-16 01:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040502, 277181, 18932, '<td valign="top">Sharp, moody, texture, this one is great. The girl adds immensely to this shot as does the overall brownish tone. 8/10 easily for me.</td>', 'Sharp, moody, texture, this one is great. The girl adds immensely to this shot as does the overall brownish tone. 8/10 easily for me.', '2006-01-16 01:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040503, 278952, 25921, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a little soft to me.  Or maybe it is the level of detail packed in to this small space makes it seem a little noisy.  I''m not sure.  I love the photo.  I would love to see a huge printout of this one.</td>', 'The focus seems a little soft to me.  Or maybe it is the level of detail packed in to this small space makes it seem a little noisy.  I''m not sure.  I love the photo.  I would love to see a huge printout of this one.', '2006-01-16 01:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040504, 275478, 15711, '<td valign="top">This so rocks.  I liked it the first time I saw it and I love it more now.  Excellent grunge effect and the eyes - wow. BRAVO!!! 10</td>', 'This so rocks.  I liked it the first time I saw it and I love it more now.  Excellent grunge effect and the eyes - wow. BRAVO!!! 10', '2006-01-16 01:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040505, 274782, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great picture! The expression is priceless. Great exposure - nicely done.</td>', 'Great picture! The expression is priceless. Great exposure - nicely done.', '2006-01-16 01:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040506, 275225, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great opportunity, but the shaded eyes and bright spot on the cheek and chin are distracting.  I also think it is cropped a bit tight and too centered.</td>', 'Great opportunity, but the shaded eyes and bright spot on the cheek and chin are distracting.  I also think it is cropped a bit tight and too centered.', '2006-01-16 01:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040507, 275667, 43930, '<td valign="top">Wow... nice! THis is a hard comp... slow shutter but clear water in the foreground... Congrats!</td>', 'Wow... nice! THis is a hard comp... slow shutter but clear water in the foreground... Congrats!', '2006-01-16 01:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040508, 276895, 18932, '<td valign="top">One of the Sydney gtg''ers? The light is really good on this one except the slight overexposure, but the depth of field is awesome as is the cheeky look perfectly captured on his face! 7/10</td>', 'One of the Sydney gtg''ers? The light is really good on this one except the slight overexposure, but the depth of field is awesome as is the cheeky look perfectly captured on his face! 7/10', '2006-01-16 01:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040511, 279286, 43930, '<td valign="top">Cute model!</td>', 'Cute model!', '2006-01-16 01:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040514, 281857, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wow, the effect is making me dizzy just looking at it.  Very cool!</td>', 'Wow, the effect is making me dizzy just looking at it.  Very cool!', '2006-01-16 01:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040515, 279655, 25921, '<td valign="top">The focus is a little soft in this, or perhaps it is motion blur, or perhaps both.  Awesome color though.  Emotes a perfect mood for this nighttime music scene.</td>', 'The focus is a little soft in this, or perhaps it is motion blur, or perhaps both.  Awesome color though.  Emotes a perfect mood for this nighttime music scene.', '2006-01-16 01:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040517, 275841, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and detail in this wildlife shot. Background is a nice simple blueish white that does not distract attention away from this bird on watch. Composition is well framed with attention focused right on the pelican on his perch and nothing else in the composition to distract attention away from the main focus.</td>', 'Love the colors and detail in this wildlife shot. Background is a nice simple blueish white that does not distract attention away from this bird on watch. Composition is well framed with attention focused right on the pelican on his perch and nothing else in the composition to distract attention away from the main focus.', '2006-01-16 01:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040518, 281365, 51359, '<td valign="top">Love the mystery of this image, great lines and colour.</td>', 'Love the mystery of this image, great lines and colour.', '2006-01-16 01:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040519, 277182, 25464, '<td valign="top">Subjects are leaving the frame.  Otherwise nice.</td>', 'Subjects are leaving the frame.  Otherwise nice.', '2006-01-16 01:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040520, 281629, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent portrait as far as the face goes. The lighting is really good. The shadow behind her is distracting though. Not sure about the red something in front of the chest. I''d crop that out.  I''d like to see this in more of a studio setting with a solid backdrop.  The skin tones are good and for a "regular" setting, nicely done.</td>', 'This is an excellent portrait as far as the face goes. The lighting is really good. The shadow behind her is distracting though. Not sure about the red something in front of the chest. I''d crop that out.  I''d like to see this in more of a studio setting with a solid backdrop.  The skin tones are good and for a "regular" setting, nicely done.', '2006-01-16 01:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040521, 279371, 25921, '<td valign="top">The DOF is so shallow, the head almost seems disembodied.  Good composition, but I find the overall blur effect distracting.</td>', 'The DOF is so shallow, the head almost seems disembodied.  Good composition, but I find the overall blur effect distracting.', '2006-01-16 01:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040522, 277162, 34114, '<td valign="top">colours are beautiful.</td>', 'colours are beautiful.', '2006-01-16 01:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040523, 276519, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great use of light.  Different, out of the box.  Hee hee, couldn''t resist.</td>', 'Great use of light.  Different, out of the box.  Hee hee, couldn''t resist.', '2006-01-16 01:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040524, 280799, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great action shot!  Love the expression. Nice capture.</td>', 'Great action shot!  Love the expression. Nice capture.', '2006-01-16 01:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040525, 278040, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really cool. Has that dragan effect with the colors. Love the lighting. I remember this, and liked it then. Still do.</td>', 'Really cool. Has that dragan effect with the colors. Love the lighting. I remember this, and liked it then. Still do.', '2006-01-16 01:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040531, 276055, 47933, '<td valign="top">Very nice! You certainly have captured the cobra at it''s finest. Some may not like the lighting (shadowing) but I think it''s near perfect. Sort of a hidden, waiting to defend shot. A++</td>', 'Very nice! You certainly have captured the cobra at it''s finest. Some may not like the lighting (shadowing) but I think it''s near perfect. Sort of a hidden, waiting to defend shot. A++', '2006-01-16 01:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040533, 281413, 25921, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling there is deep emotional significance in this photo, based partly on the title of course, but unfortunately I find myself asking "what is dedicated to her" with no clear subject jumping out at me.  Great mood in the photo though.</td>', 'I get the feeling there is deep emotional significance in this photo, based partly on the title of course, but unfortunately I find myself asking "what is dedicated to her" with no clear subject jumping out at me.  Great mood in the photo though.', '2006-01-16 01:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040534, 276444, 43930, '<td valign="top">a little more exposure...</td>', 'a little more exposure...', '2006-01-16 01:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040535, 275323, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Wish the rest of the gun had been included in the frame.  Seems a little too close on the top.</td>', 'Great shot.  Wish the rest of the gun had been included in the frame.  Seems a little too close on the top.', '2006-01-16 01:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040536, 281316, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, very unique.  A little over processed for my liking. Definite halo affect on the people on the boat.  Little heavy on the saturation as well.  Cool image though!</td>', 'Nice picture, very unique.  A little over processed for my liking. Definite halo affect on the people on the boat.  Little heavy on the saturation as well.  Cool image though!', '2006-01-16 01:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040537, 280797, 51359, '<td valign="top">Great moody lighting, showing the contours of her body. Very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Great moody lighting, showing the contours of her body. Very pleasing to the eye.', '2006-01-16 01:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040538, 281095, 1827, '<td valign="top">I was enjoying the beautiful idyllic peacefulness of this scene. UntilI got to the little boys jacket and the white stripes (what is that?) are so harsh that it yanked me right out of my reverie.  I think I would have cropped him out.</td>', 'I was enjoying the beautiful idyllic peacefulness of this scene. UntilI got to the little boys jacket and the white stripes (what is that?) are so harsh that it yanked me right out of my reverie.  I think I would have cropped him out.', '2006-01-16 01:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040540, 281316, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great image, but looks overprocessed.</td>', 'Great image, but looks overprocessed.', '2006-01-16 01:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040544, 276802, 23913, '<td valign="top">use of a polorizer may have aided in cutting down the reflections om the side of the car.<br/> <br/>the composition is getting there but not quite rule of thirds which would''ve given this image a much stronger look far more graphic then it is now.</td>', 'use of a polorizer may have aided in cutting down the reflections om the side of the car. the composition is getting there but not quite rule of thirds which would''ve given this image a much stronger look far more graphic then it is now.', '2006-01-16 01:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040545, 281634, 43930, '<td valign="top">little brighter...</td>', 'little brighter...', '2006-01-16 01:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040548, 276970, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh wow. Now THIS is a contender. It has all of the elements of a winning photo: lighting, rich tones, leading line, beautiful composition.  Amazing.</td>', 'Oh wow. Now THIS is a contender. It has all of the elements of a winning photo: lighting, rich tones, leading line, beautiful composition.  Amazing.', '2006-01-16 01:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040549, 278093, 51359, '<td valign="top">Lovely rich colours, would like to have seen it larger as it looses the impact.</td>', 'Lovely rich colours, would like to have seen it larger as it looses the impact.', '2006-01-16 01:51:41.000000', NULL, 1);
