(2040600, 277970, 39349, '<td valign="top">Stunning lighting effect. I like this portrait, no, I REALLY like this portrait. Tones are warm and I like how this shot is composed. Model is beautiful and her pose is perfect. Well done.</td>', 'Stunning lighting effect. I like this portrait, no, I REALLY like this portrait. Tones are warm and I like how this shot is composed. Model is beautiful and her pose is perfect. Well done.', '2006-01-16 01:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
