(2040615, 279985, 27812, '<td valign="top">Great shot, sharp and in perfect lighting. Few people will ever get this right the way you did it. Excellent colors, love that tonge.10</td>', 'Great shot, sharp and in perfect lighting. Few people will ever get this right the way you did it. Excellent colors, love that tonge.10', '2006-01-16 02:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
