(2040656, 281885, 43463, '<td valign="top">This Lady in Red really and truly stands out from the background. Compositionally interesting is that the washed out stark white background really compliments this lady''s face which is a white carnival mask. The red and blacks of her costume adds bold vibrancy and really pops off of that stark white (and very cold day I imagine) background.</td>', 'This Lady in Red really and truly stands out from the background. Compositionally interesting is that the washed out stark white background really compliments this lady''s face which is a white carnival mask. The red and blacks of her costume adds bold vibrancy and really pops off of that stark white (and very cold day I imagine) background.', '2006-01-16 02:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
