(2040670, 276007, 27164, '<td valign="top">Great portrati - I like the expression, eyes and hair.  The background, however, could be a bit better I think.  The reason I say this is because the background seems to almost blend in with her clothing and makes her stand out less.  I think perhaps a white background would have provided more contrast to make her stand out from her background even more.</td>', 'Great portrati - I like the expression, eyes and hair.  The background, however, could be a bit better I think.  The reason I say this is because the background seems to almost blend in with her clothing and makes her stand out less.  I think perhaps a white background would have provided more contrast to make her stand out from her background even more.', '2006-01-16 02:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
