(2040781, 281100, 18932, '<td valign="top">Strong points: the pink of her swimmers, and the texture of the water. I''m sad to say that the overall picture doesn''t sit well. I hope it goes better, but I am going to vote a 4/10. Cute though.</td>', 'Strong points: the pink of her swimmers, and the texture of the water. I''m sad to say that the overall picture doesn''t sit well. I hope it goes better, but I am going to vote a 4/10. Cute though.', '2006-01-16 02:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040783, 278766, 43463, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective of this shot of a lighthouse. Not the atypical shot of a lighthouse on the beach or a straight shot. This is trully unique in approach. The lighthouse is seen in the background behind the riggings and mast of a ship. Love the relationship you capture here. For these two subjects do have a working relationship to one another. The ship relies on the lighthouse to give it safe harbor in times of need and the lighthouse provides the service of being a beacon to ships in trouble.</td>', 'I really like the perspective of this shot of a lighthouse. Not the atypical shot of a lighthouse on the beach or a straight shot. This is trully unique in approach. The lighthouse is seen in the background behind the riggings and mast of a ship. Love the relationship you capture here. For these two subjects do have a working relationship to one another. The ship relies on the lighthouse to give it safe harbor in times of need and the lighthouse provides the service of being a beacon to ships in trouble.', '2006-01-16 02:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
