(2040826, 275946, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love how the rich and vibrantly warm color of the orange red sky contrast so sharply with the stark white and cold ground plane covered with snow. What makes the photo so appealing isn''t just the contrast between cold and warm in colors but there is the feeling of cold isolation seen in the abandoned and falling apart buildings. That feeling/mood of abandoned dwellings of a ''cold still life'' if you will plays into and complements the cold environment of the icy snow.</td>', 'Love how the rich and vibrantly warm color of the orange red sky contrast so sharply with the stark white and cold ground plane covered with snow. What makes the photo so appealing isn''t just the contrast between cold and warm in colors but there is the feeling of cold isolation seen in the abandoned and falling apart buildings. That feeling/mood of abandoned dwellings of a ''cold still life'' if you will plays into and complements the cold environment of the icy snow.', '2006-01-16 02:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040827, 280521, 70, '<td valign="top">And somehow, I feel like I''ve seen this before.<br/> <br/>Lovely colors though and what a crazy, surreal scene. I would like the clouds to be made out of mohair, please.</td>', 'And somehow, I feel like I''ve seen this before. Lovely colors though and what a crazy, surreal scene. I would like the clouds to be made out of mohair, please.', '2006-01-16 02:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040833, 281367, 18932, '<td valign="top">Great take, shame there wasn''t a bit less depth of field to remove the onlookers a little bit, going to give this 7/10.</td>', 'Great take, shame there wasn''t a bit less depth of field to remove the onlookers a little bit, going to give this 7/10.', '2006-01-16 02:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040839, 281747, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love how the curves of the road twist and bend. We can visually follow the path of the cyclist through the curvey mountain road. A shame that the cyclist was not wearing a vibrantly bold color that would make him pop off the dark black road - but that is not in your control.</td>', 'Love how the curves of the road twist and bend. We can visually follow the path of the cyclist through the curvey mountain road. A shame that the cyclist was not wearing a vibrantly bold color that would make him pop off the dark black road - but that is not in your control.', '2006-01-16 03:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040849, 281552, 18932, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and take all told. Something is slightly off with the composition but I can''t put my finger on it. Maybe the lean on the building, not sure. 7/10</td>', 'Nice colours and take all told. Something is slightly off with the composition but I can''t put my finger on it. Maybe the lean on the building, not sure. 7/10', '2006-01-16 03:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040851, 280263, 43434, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot, I almost thought it was in the singled out challenge wih a troubling DOF ... for this challenge the DOF works, the kids work, and I think it is lovely.</td>', 'This is a lovely shot, I almost thought it was in the singled out challenge wih a troubling DOF ... for this challenge the DOF works, the kids work, and I think it is lovely.', '2006-01-16 03:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040858, 280721, 18932, '<td valign="top">Sorry but not much is being reflected because of the rocks, and it''s slightly overexposed to boot. Would have looked for a smaller portion of the scene if I had to shoot something here. 3/10</td>', 'Sorry but not much is being reflected because of the rocks, and it''s slightly overexposed to boot. Would have looked for a smaller portion of the scene if I had to shoot something here. 3/10', '2006-01-16 03:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040862, 274611, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love how this shapes from the window are included in this composition. It really adds a dramatic and artistic flare to the downtown scene of seattle. I love how one ''panel'' you see the landmark Needle. Again the windows create an interesting shaped panel look that turns this downtown scene into a dynamic and dramatic eyecatching photo.</td>', 'Love how this shapes from the window are included in this composition. It really adds a dramatic and artistic flare to the downtown scene of seattle. I love how one ''panel'' you see the landmark Needle. Again the windows create an interesting shaped panel look that turns this downtown scene into a dynamic and dramatic eyecatching photo.', '2006-01-16 03:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040864, 276545, 18932, '<td valign="top">Nice. Sure this has been done before, but good take. Is the guy in the bottom left posing for you? Either way I really like this one, the texture and everything is just right. 9/10</td>', 'Nice. Sure this has been done before, but good take. Is the guy in the bottom left posing for you? Either way I really like this one, the texture and everything is just right. 9/10', '2006-01-16 03:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
