(2041056, 276207, 31443, '<td valign="top">Looks like a page from a fairy tales''s book, like it!</td>', 'Looks like a page from a fairy tales''s book, like it!', '2006-01-16 04:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041059, 277821, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very good subject. Has a high interest factor. Good use of dof. Nice color management. I have nothing against borders, I think the right border can really enhance the presentation of many images, but in this case, I find the blue of the border keeps grabbing my eye and taking the attention away from the image itself. Perhaps a more neutral color could work better?</td>', 'Very good subject. Has a high interest factor. Good use of dof. Nice color management. I have nothing against borders, I think the right border can really enhance the presentation of many images, but in this case, I find the blue of the border keeps grabbing my eye and taking the attention away from the image itself. Perhaps a more neutral color could work better?', '2006-01-16 04:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041060, 274852, 14212, '<td valign="top">christmas card it is! Superb photo. Fav. 10</td>', 'christmas card it is! Superb photo. Fav. 10', '2006-01-16 04:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041061, 281083, 28592, '<td valign="top">It sure is butifull, but for my sake, then I would have wanted some person or animal or a boat to make it interesting</td>', 'It sure is butifull, but for my sake, then I would have wanted some person or animal or a boat to make it interesting', '2006-01-16 04:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041067, 274594, 17507, '<td valign="top">My initial reaction to this image was that I was impressed by the near perfect perspective and clean lines of this photograph. Then I noticed the area to the left of the shack... which struck me as weird, because it''s unnaturally flat and lower than the rest of the horizon. Did you clone something out there? It really looks weird.</td>', 'My initial reaction to this image was that I was impressed by the near perfect perspective and clean lines of this photograph. Then I noticed the area to the left of the shack... which struck me as weird, because it''s unnaturally flat and lower than the rest of the horizon. Did you clone something out there? It really looks weird.', '2006-01-16 04:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041068, 281052, 14212, '<td valign="top">Great color.</td>', 'Great color.', '2006-01-16 04:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041071, 276525, 28592, '<td valign="top">Well, it could have been good if would have been in focus.</td>', 'Well, it could have been good if would have been in focus.', '2006-01-16 04:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041086, 280226, 19831, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of zoom blur. Like how it serves a definite purpose in the shot, and not just for the sake of the effect. Cool image :-)</td>', 'Interesting use of zoom blur. Like how it serves a definite purpose in the shot, and not just for the sake of the effect. Cool image :-)', '2006-01-16 04:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041092, 279612, 28592, '<td valign="top">This one will score a lot</td>', 'This one will score a lot', '2006-01-16 04:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041096, 275713, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. The reflections are beautiful and great color management. I really like how you''ve included the little weeds in the foreground, it gives a good sense of depth to the shot. Great job :-)</td>', 'Very nice image. The reflections are beautiful and great color management. I really like how you''ve included the little weeds in the foreground, it gives a good sense of depth to the shot. Great job :-)', '2006-01-16 04:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041100, 281743, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Good interest factor. I like the point of view from above. Nice job.</td>', 'Cool shot. Good interest factor. I like the point of view from above. Nice job.', '2006-01-16 04:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041103, 281524, 18932, '<td valign="top">It''s simple. 10 out of 10. Absolutely awesome. Shame about the living creatures though :P</td>', 'It''s simple. 10 out of 10. Absolutely awesome. Shame about the living creatures though :P', '2006-01-16 04:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041113, 279318, 18932, '<td valign="top">Nice purple tones. Slightly odd in that the centre of the flower is sharp, then goes less sharp on the petals only to go sharper again later and then blurry again. A very lovely photo anyways, 9/10</td>', 'Nice purple tones. Slightly odd in that the centre of the flower is sharp, then goes less sharp on the petals only to go sharper again later and then blurry again. A very lovely photo anyways, 9/10', '2006-01-16 04:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041115, 279776, 28592, '<td valign="top">Good face, but bad reflection, the arm out of the gorillas head is really bad.</td>', 'Good face, but bad reflection, the arm out of the gorillas head is really bad.', '2006-01-16 04:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041119, 277093, 18932, '<td valign="top">Not a bad landscape by any means but the sky lets all the tension go for me, and weakens an otherwise very strong photo 6/10. Sharpness is good throughout. Nice take, sometimes the sky just isn''t being particularly friendly.</td>', 'Not a bad landscape by any means but the sky lets all the tension go for me, and weakens an otherwise very strong photo 6/10. Sharpness is good throughout. Nice take, sometimes the sky just isn''t being particularly friendly.', '2006-01-16 04:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041120, 281894, 28592, '<td valign="top">bad dream, but good picture</td>', 'bad dream, but good picture', '2006-01-16 04:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041121, 279544, 31443, '<td valign="top">I like the very warm tone in this one, could have been sharpened a little more though</td>', 'I like the very warm tone in this one, could have been sharpened a little more though', '2006-01-16 04:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041125, 277432, 18932, '<td valign="top">Certainly amusing the focus transitions in this one just end up distracting from the main subject which is I presume not the leaf that looks like one of the sharpest points in the photo. 5/10</td>', 'Certainly amusing the focus transitions in this one just end up distracting from the main subject which is I presume not the leaf that looks like one of the sharpest points in the photo. 5/10', '2006-01-16 04:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041126, 281845, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great detail, and I love the soft yet vivid and flowing colors. Nice job :-)</td>', 'Great detail, and I love the soft yet vivid and flowing colors. Nice job :-)', '2006-01-16 04:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041134, 279931, 18932, '<td valign="top">Sorry to say but I really don''t like the haloing around the man. It ruins what would have been a 7, possibly an 8 to a 4/10. It just looks bizarre to my eyes. Hope I haven''t missed something.</td>', 'Sorry to say but I really don''t like the haloing around the man. It ruins what would have been a 7, possibly an 8 to a 4/10. It just looks bizarre to my eyes. Hope I haven''t missed something.', '2006-01-16 04:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
