(2041145, 279171, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice.<br/>great juxtaposition and color treatment.<br/>based on the angle of view, it <i>looks</i> like you were in the passenger''s seat - I hope I''m right :)</td>', 'Nice.great juxtaposition and color treatment.based on the angle of view, it looks like you were in the passenger''s seat - I hope I''m right :)', '2006-01-16 05:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041151, 279653, 18932, '<td valign="top">Except for what looks like either slight oversharpening or overexposure this is stunning. Colours and texture, subject matter and overall sharpness, and story behind the photo. 10/10 despite the gripe mostly because it made me wonder, whose bicycle is it?, where do they live?, etc.</td>', 'Except for what looks like either slight oversharpening or overexposure this is stunning. Colours and texture, subject matter and overall sharpness, and story behind the photo. 10/10 despite the gripe mostly because it made me wonder, whose bicycle is it?, where do they live?, etc.', '2006-01-16 05:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041155, 274643, 18932, '<td valign="top">Love to know how you did this one. For me the mist and the overlapping hills make this one. 7/10</td>', 'Love to know how you did this one. For me the mist and the overlapping hills make this one. 7/10', '2006-01-16 05:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041159, 277621, 17507, '<td valign="top">holy cripes this is an amazing picture. those deer look like they just walked straight out of the Kingdom of God.</td>', 'holy cripes this is an amazing picture. those deer look like they just walked straight out of the Kingdom of God.', '2006-01-16 05:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
