(2041161, 280493, 18932, '<td valign="top">The perspective doesn''t really help too much, but everything else is very nice. Her face and the way you''ve captured this make the image. 8/10</td>', 'The perspective doesn''t really help too much, but everything else is very nice. Her face and the way you''ve captured this make the image. 8/10', '2006-01-16 05:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041167, 281743, 28592, '<td valign="top">And how the #$@% does this work? It is funny because it''s true ;)</td>', 'And how the #$@% does this work? It is funny because it''s true ;)', '2006-01-16 05:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041168, 280323, 17507, '<td valign="top">goodness, what an image. it portends nothing of what came next. this is almost weirder than seeing photos of the WTC</td>', 'goodness, what an image. it portends nothing of what came next. this is almost weirder than seeing photos of the WTC', '2006-01-16 05:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041169, 276285, 19095, '<td valign="top">I find this photo not clear enough - it is hard to see what it is about - if it wasn''t for the title I would be totally lost.</td>', 'I find this photo not clear enough - it is hard to see what it is about - if it wasn''t for the title I would be totally lost.', '2006-01-16 05:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041172, 280776, 18932, '<td valign="top">Well captured. Tried one kinda like this a while back and didn''t get it quite right, I know how hard these are, but you''ve said alot with this one, and I really do get the feeling of idyllic from this one so 9/10.</td>', 'Well captured. Tried one kinda like this a while back and didn''t get it quite right, I know how hard these are, but you''ve said alot with this one, and I really do get the feeling of idyllic from this one so 9/10.', '2006-01-16 05:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041175, 281733, 18932, '<td valign="top">Didn''t think much of this as it loaded with a big blue sky but the reeds and the softness of the water take this one all the way to a 10, Big effort.</td>', 'Didn''t think much of this as it loaded with a big blue sky but the reeds and the softness of the water take this one all the way to a 10, Big effort.', '2006-01-16 05:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041176, 274592, 36606, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot! Lovely tones and lighting. Great processing too! Best of luck.</td>', 'beautiful shot! Lovely tones and lighting. Great processing too! Best of luck.', '2006-01-16 05:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041181, 278283, 19831, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail. Unique composition. Cool macro shot.</td>', 'Amazing detail. Unique composition. Cool macro shot.', '2006-01-16 05:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041183, 281221, 36606, '<td valign="top">nice view, shame for me it is too blurry. Good luck though</td>', 'nice view, shame for me it is too blurry. Good luck though', '2006-01-16 05:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041184, 278434, 18932, '<td valign="top">Sorry just a little bit too distracting from the landscape. I think you needed to find a way to do it less obviously. Not a bad idea, just not the best ever execution.</td>', 'Sorry just a little bit too distracting from the landscape. I think you needed to find a way to do it less obviously. Not a bad idea, just not the best ever execution.', '2006-01-16 05:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041189, 279330, 36606, '<td valign="top">this looks very cool! Nice action shot, movement and angle! Best of luck!</td>', 'this looks very cool! Nice action shot, movement and angle! Best of luck!', '2006-01-16 05:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041193, 281481, 19831, '<td valign="top">What a cool shot. Great composition. Awesome concept. I would love to hear the story about this one :-)</td>', 'What a cool shot. Great composition. Awesome concept. I would love to hear the story about this one :-)', '2006-01-16 05:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041194, 276017, 18932, '<td valign="top">Nice. Love the colours, hope they''re natural or close, the sand and the rocks amd clouds let the sun to be the objecr of focus. 9/10 - would''ve been better without some of the grain and noise.</td>', 'Nice. Love the colours, hope they''re natural or close, the sand and the rocks amd clouds let the sun to be the objecr of focus. 9/10 - would''ve been better without some of the grain and noise.', '2006-01-16 05:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041199, 280695, 18932, '<td valign="top">Nice take. The lines on his face, the turban, make this a very interesting piece to look at for a while. 7/10</td>', 'Nice take. The lines on his face, the turban, make this a very interesting piece to look at for a while. 7/10', '2006-01-16 05:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041200, 282016, 16520, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors nice and sharp too good job.  7</td>', 'Awesome colors nice and sharp too good job.  7', '2006-01-16 05:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041203, 276617, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cool concept, like the lighting and dramatic clouds. Don''t know if I like the frame tilted or not. Jaap? The guy''s name?</td>', 'Cool concept, like the lighting and dramatic clouds. Don''t know if I like the frame tilted or not. Jaap? The guy''s name?', '2006-01-16 05:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041205, 279644, 9668, '<td valign="top">Really makes me feel like i''m on the slope with you. Love the snow in motion. Composition seems a little akward though.</td>', 'Really makes me feel like i''m on the slope with you. Love the snow in motion. Composition seems a little akward though.', '2006-01-16 05:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041209, 282012, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouettes. I like the centering on this, the composition seems mostly balanced. Wish that either more of the tree line below would be shown, or none of it.</td>', 'Nice silhouettes. I like the centering on this, the composition seems mostly balanced. Wish that either more of the tree line below would be shown, or none of it.', '2006-01-16 05:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041210, 274561, 9668, '<td valign="top">Seems like I would find this picture on an album cover. Like the tones.</td>', 'Seems like I would find this picture on an album cover. Like the tones.', '2006-01-16 05:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041211, 276602, 9668, '<td valign="top">Like the high contrast. The clouds lead nicely to your focal point. Nice job</td>', 'Like the high contrast. The clouds lead nicely to your focal point. Nice job', '2006-01-16 05:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
