(2041235, 281383, 31443, '<td valign="top">Looks like an ancient one, if so maybe you should have indicated that, people may think it''s soiled..</td>', 'Looks like an ancient one, if so maybe you should have indicated that, people may think it''s soiled..', '2006-01-16 05:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041236, 279372, 31443, '<td valign="top">Cute! Sharpness could be a little better though..</td>', 'Cute! Sharpness could be a little better though..', '2006-01-16 05:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041242, 281225, 17507, '<td valign="top">could you imagine even trying to bring in the groceries if you lived there? man, those people must have been hardcore.</td>', 'could you imagine even trying to bring in the groceries if you lived there? man, those people must have been hardcore.', '2006-01-16 05:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041244, 281365, 17507, '<td valign="top">ingenious minimalism - very intelligent imagery</td>', 'ingenious minimalism - very intelligent imagery', '2006-01-16 05:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041246, 281316, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great photo, there''s a little halo around the boat and the people that bothers me a bit, but otherwise a great catch, good luck.</td>', 'Great photo, there''s a little halo around the boat and the people that bothers me a bit, but otherwise a great catch, good luck.', '2006-01-16 05:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041248, 279637, 19831, '<td valign="top">Excellant composition. Very smart. The squiggly reflections of the masts are very cool. I like how you''ve cropped/framed this, so that the reflections kind of stand as their own entities. Very cool.</td>', 'Excellant composition. Very smart. The squiggly reflections of the masts are very cool. I like how you''ve cropped/framed this, so that the reflections kind of stand as their own entities. Very cool.', '2006-01-16 05:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041249, 281857, 17507, '<td valign="top">I guess you must have selected the background and added a zoom blur? however you achieved this effect, it''s brilliant - the head-on view of the bird couldn''t have been better emphasized. obviously you are also very quick with your camera! I''m certain I would have missed this shot if I were in your place. Very well done.</td>', 'I guess you must have selected the background and added a zoom blur? however you achieved this effect, it''s brilliant - the head-on view of the bird couldn''t have been better emphasized. obviously you are also very quick with your camera! I''m certain I would have missed this shot if I were in your place. Very well done.', '2006-01-16 05:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041251, 275862, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. And I like your processing here. Looks like a painting. And very ''dreamy''. Nice job :-)</td>', 'Nice composition. And I like your processing here. Looks like a painting. And very ''dreamy''. Nice job :-)', '2006-01-16 05:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
