(2041680, 276970, 43463, '<td valign="top">Composition is really good. The foreground is interesting to look upon with all the craggy rocks and small pools of water. As our eye travels to the background we are naturally drawn to the mount and the ''castle'' that rests upon it. That mount is centered in the middle top of the frame - again our eye is easily drawn there to travel up the path past the craggy rocks. The colors of the photo invoke a mood of a dark and stormy night. My only suggestion on how to improve this photo is keeping the mount in the same center position but the photographer to have physically moved such that the winding and curving road we see here is also dead center. This would act as a complementary ''visual path'' that the eye would travel up to reach the top of the mount. It would beholve you to keep the foreground of the craggy rocks if possible because resting just a few feet beyond is what appears to be an ''L'' shaped concrete ''path''on the left hand side of the photo. By lining up that concrete road to the be centered with the winding road in the background would also strenthen the composition by acting as a visual road that bridges the foreground and background together. It is possible that this change in angle maynot be  possible for some elements may be lost - but it is certainly an angle worth exploring.</td>', 'Composition is really good. The foreground is interesting to look upon with all the craggy rocks and small pools of water. As our eye travels to the background we are naturally drawn to the mount and the ''castle'' that rests upon it. That mount is centered in the middle top of the frame - again our eye is easily drawn there to travel up the path past the craggy rocks. The colors of the photo invoke a mood of a dark and stormy night. My only suggestion on how to improve this photo is keeping the mount in the same center position but the photographer to have physically moved such that the winding and curving road we see here is also dead center. This would act as a complementary ''visual path'' that the eye would travel up to reach the top of the mount. It would beholve you to keep the foreground of the craggy rocks if possible because resting just a few feet beyond is what appears to be an ''L'' shaped concrete ''path''on the left hand side of the photo. By lining up that concrete road to the be centered with the winding road in the background would also strenthen the composition by acting as a visual road that bridges the foreground and background together. It is possible that this change in angle maynot be  possible for some elements may be lost - but it is certainly an angle worth exploring.', '2006-01-16 08:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041681, 279258, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the composition could be better with a closer crop, which would cut out the empty space on the left, and at the bottom, and would put the tiger more in line with the rule of thirds.</td>', 'I think the composition could be better with a closer crop, which would cut out the empty space on the left, and at the bottom, and would put the tiger more in line with the rule of thirds.', '2006-01-16 08:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041683, 275086, 35804, '<td valign="top">I love it! I''m favin'' this right now...I do think the harsh flash lighting is completely appropriate...esp. with the green wall in the backgroud...this is just a really fun picture! I also like the craggy border you have used...it reminds me of medium format film for some reason...nice job!</td>', 'I love it! I''m favin'' this right now...I do think the harsh flash lighting is completely appropriate...esp. with the green wall in the backgroud...this is just a really fun picture! I also like the craggy border you have used...it reminds me of medium format film for some reason...nice job!', '2006-01-16 08:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041686, 281919, 2780, '<td valign="top">The colours here are really stunning, but I think the composition is weak. Maybe having extra black space at the bottom would ground the objects of interest more, adding to their impact?</td>', 'The colours here are really stunning, but I think the composition is weak. Maybe having extra black space at the bottom would ground the objects of interest more, adding to their impact?', '2006-01-16 08:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041688, 275197, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent wide angle shot with great wibrant colours and great contrast. A technically and aesthetically sound image.</td>', 'Excellent wide angle shot with great wibrant colours and great contrast. A technically and aesthetically sound image.', '2006-01-16 08:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041691, 278751, 35804, '<td valign="top">A nice warm portrait..I can sense a genuine closeness...very nice.</td>', 'A nice warm portrait..I can sense a genuine closeness...very nice.', '2006-01-16 08:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041695, 279653, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. I love the shapes created by the composition, and the muted colours which add so much to the scene. It also asks a lot of questions in a viewers mind. Great work.</td>', 'Really nice shot. I love the shapes created by the composition, and the muted colours which add so much to the scene. It also asks a lot of questions in a viewers mind. Great work.', '2006-01-16 09:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041697, 277143, 35804, '<td valign="top">Really nice light! And her gorgeous blue eyes certainly pop...I really like this alot...so simple and straight forward...nicely done.</td>', 'Really nice light! And her gorgeous blue eyes certainly pop...I really like this alot...so simple and straight forward...nicely done.', '2006-01-16 09:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041698, 281938, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and shapes created by the reflections of the sky but I think you should have cropped out the grass and other background since it detracts from the photo in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the colours and shapes created by the reflections of the sky but I think you should have cropped out the grass and other background since it detracts from the photo in my opinion.', '2006-01-16 09:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041699, 280965, 43463, '<td valign="top">The model has a soft and sultry look as she lays upon the pool table. Her poise of hand over the head and parted lips gives off a ''come hither'' look. I have two critiques on this piece. I think you could easily strenthen the relation between the model and her environment to ''play'' up on the voluptious and sultry mood presented. First had the model wore a shade of red lipstick it would visually tie into the red pool table ball seen here in the photo. The color red is also symbolic of passion and having a connection to those two objects would strengthen the connection that there is a sultry game to be played here. Second , I would have turned the black 8 ball such that the number is very visible to the viewer. This would help strenthen the visual of a game being played.</td>', 'The model has a soft and sultry look as she lays upon the pool table. Her poise of hand over the head and parted lips gives off a ''come hither'' look. I have two critiques on this piece. I think you could easily strenthen the relation between the model and her environment to ''play'' up on the voluptious and sultry mood presented. First had the model wore a shade of red lipstick it would visually tie into the red pool table ball seen here in the photo. The color red is also symbolic of passion and having a connection to those two objects would strengthen the connection that there is a sultry game to be played here. Second , I would have turned the black 8 ball such that the number is very visible to the viewer. This would help strenthen the visual of a game being played.', '2006-01-16 09:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041700, 274541, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice B&amp;W, really good contrast and I actually like the unusual hcoice of having the horizon dead centre. It might just be an illusion but the horizon does seem a bit wonky to me though.</td>', 'Very nice B&W, really good contrast and I actually like the unusual hcoice of having the horizon dead centre. It might just be an illusion but the horizon does seem a bit wonky to me though.', '2006-01-16 09:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041701, 275223, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo, the colours in the sky, whether real or photoshopped, compliment the colour of the castle really well.</td>', 'Excellent photo, the colours in the sky, whether real or photoshopped, compliment the colour of the castle really well.', '2006-01-16 09:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041703, 274554, 23877, '<td valign="top">This is great 9</td>', 'This is great 9', '2006-01-16 09:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041705, 279639, 1041, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t figure out what was in the background until I read your title.  I think the image would''ve been a stronger one without that glass and hand.  Black and white works well here, like the tonality range.</td>', 'Couldn''t figure out what was in the background until I read your title.  I think the image would''ve been a stronger one without that glass and hand.  Black and white works well here, like the tonality range.', '2006-01-16 09:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041706, 281482, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. I think I would have preferred to see more of the land and less of the sky, composition-wise, however as it is, it is still very appealing. The blue thing in the left tree is a bit distracting though.</td>', 'Very nice image. I think I would have preferred to see more of the land and less of the sky, composition-wise, however as it is, it is still very appealing. The blue thing in the left tree is a bit distracting though.', '2006-01-16 09:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041707, 278245, 43463, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot of a fire dancer as he lays posed on the ground balancing the burning stick on his raised leg. The play of light on his skin creates a warm orange hue that is complementary to the skin tones. The critique I have on this photo is that unfortunately his head/face is in shadow that we are unable to see his expression. If the viewer could see his expression and the face of this fire dancer it would go a long way to strengthening the visual interest of this photo.</td>', 'This is a good shot of a fire dancer as he lays posed on the ground balancing the burning stick on his raised leg. The play of light on his skin creates a warm orange hue that is complementary to the skin tones. The critique I have on this photo is that unfortunately his head/face is in shadow that we are unable to see his expression. If the viewer could see his expression and the face of this fire dancer it would go a long way to strengthening the visual interest of this photo.', '2006-01-16 09:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041708, 276106, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo! The red of the hair against the blue of the background is great, and the expression is really nice too. I love the contrast and vibrancy of this shot.</td>', 'Excellent photo! The red of the hair against the blue of the background is great, and the expression is really nice too. I love the contrast and vibrancy of this shot.', '2006-01-16 09:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041709, 281132, 1041, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2006-01-16 09:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041714, 279356, 2780, '<td valign="top">To me, it is distracting that the horizon is so un-level. I also think the photo seems a bit flat. Maybe boosting teh contrast in PP would look good? Also, I think that the composition would be improved if you were to crop a bit of empty sky from the top.</td>', 'To me, it is distracting that the horizon is so un-level. I also think the photo seems a bit flat. Maybe boosting teh contrast in PP would look good? Also, I think that the composition would be improved if you were to crop a bit of empty sky from the top.', '2006-01-16 09:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041716, 281842, 28710, '<td valign="top">Powder please?<br/> <br/>Nice eyes, but could use a bit of help in the make-up department! <br/> <br/>Technically, it''s not terrible, but it''s very jarring to look at.</td>', 'Powder please? Nice eyes, but could use a bit of help in the make-up department!  Technically, it''s not terrible, but it''s very jarring to look at.', '2006-01-16 09:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041717, 281142, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo! Really spectacular scene, and the flare coming off the sun really adds a lot to the shot. I would probably crop a little off the top, to add more impact to the clounds underneath, but that''s just a personal preference :)</td>', 'Excellent photo! Really spectacular scene, and the flare coming off the sun really adds a lot to the shot. I would probably crop a little off the top, to add more impact to the clounds underneath, but that''s just a personal preference :)', '2006-01-16 09:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041720, 276779, 28710, '<td valign="top">There is something I like about this pic, but I can''t decide if I like it better with or without that dead flower in the corner of the pic. hmmm</td>', 'There is something I like about this pic, but I can''t decide if I like it better with or without that dead flower in the corner of the pic. hmmm', '2006-01-16 09:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041726, 278785, 41522, '<td valign="top">A nice photo indeed.  Wonderful little moment captured.  I really like the partial framing on the left side and the overall composition.  I find the red bows to be a bit distracting, but that''s probably just me.  Also, the nose looks a little overexposed.  JMO</td>', 'A nice photo indeed.  Wonderful little moment captured.  I really like the partial framing on the left side and the overall composition.  I find the red bows to be a bit distracting, but that''s probably just me.  Also, the nose looks a little overexposed.  JMO', '2006-01-16 09:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041733, 275352, 43463, '<td valign="top">I really like the expanse of scenery seen here in this cold landscape. What adds visual interest is thos sharp spiky mountains seen in the background which really adds to the idea that this is can indeed be a very cold and hostile land. Also there are two lone birds (the ones resting lower are not as visible because their grey/white hues dissapear into the landscape) on top of the ice shelf seen on the right hand side of the photo that adds interest because it shows us life can exist here. I think you could easily have presented this composition by filling the frame with just those four birds standing on the ice shelf and the sharp spiky mountains in the background with a smattering of sky. A closer crop would call more attention to focus the viewers attention on the two elements of the birds and the sharp mountains.</td>', 'I really like the expanse of scenery seen here in this cold landscape. What adds visual interest is thos sharp spiky mountains seen in the background which really adds to the idea that this is can indeed be a very cold and hostile land. Also there are two lone birds (the ones resting lower are not as visible because their grey/white hues dissapear into the landscape) on top of the ice shelf seen on the right hand side of the photo that adds interest because it shows us life can exist here. I think you could easily have presented this composition by filling the frame with just those four birds standing on the ice shelf and the sharp spiky mountains in the background with a smattering of sky. A closer crop would call more attention to focus the viewers attention on the two elements of the birds and the sharp mountains.', '2006-01-16 09:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041739, 279637, 28710, '<td valign="top">This is a neat pic. I used some paper to slice the top off, leaving just the hulls cut off where the three boats on the right happen to have the same top edge and I liked it better.</td>', 'This is a neat pic. I used some paper to slice the top off, leaving just the hulls cut off where the three boats on the right happen to have the same top edge and I liked it better.', '2006-01-16 09:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041740, 281718, 38234, '<td valign="top">nice strong composition and great perspective, to me it would have been that much stronger without the small bit of leaves in the upper left corner</td>', 'nice strong composition and great perspective, to me it would have been that much stronger without the small bit of leaves in the upper left corner', '2006-01-16 09:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041743, 275997, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think if you had used the full 640px limit we could see the detail in this better. It also seems to be rotated too much to the left.</td>', 'I think if you had used the full 640px limit we could see the detail in this better. It also seems to be rotated too much to the left.', '2006-01-16 09:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041746, 275251, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent patterns in this shot, and the figure adds the extra focal point it needs. Really nice shot.</td>', 'Excellent patterns in this shot, and the figure adds the extra focal point it needs. Really nice shot.', '2006-01-16 09:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041748, 281937, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think this is a bit grainy - maybe a light application of neatimage could fix it? Ignoring the grain, I really like the lighting and centered composition.</td>', 'I think this is a bit grainy - maybe a light application of neatimage could fix it? Ignoring the grain, I really like the lighting and centered composition.', '2006-01-16 09:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041749, 278980, 33000, '<td valign="top">Ég þekki þessa og finnst hún ennþá brilljant :)</td>', 'Ég þekki þessa og finnst hún ennþá brilljant :)', '2006-01-16 09:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041753, 275968, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot! Great exposure in difficult conditions, specially with such a light coloured horse too! I think I would have left a little more space on the left for the horse to leap into compositionally-wise though.</td>', 'Really nice shot! Great exposure in difficult conditions, specially with such a light coloured horse too! I think I would have left a little more space on the left for the horse to leap into compositionally-wise though.', '2006-01-16 09:21:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2041755, 281893, 34192, '<td valign="top">very pretty scene and technically proficient.  However, it holds no impact for me.  will return after viewing others.</td>', 'very pretty scene and technically proficient.  However, it holds no impact for me.  will return after viewing others.', '2006-01-16 09:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041757, 281265, 43463, '<td valign="top">I can almost hear the sounds of the saxophone belting out a tune about the city . The city skyscrapers and harbor are decked out in hues of blue and black - the cities ''tuxedo'' that it dons when putting on the ritz. The city light sparkle in the night. This is a very visually appealing photo.</td>', 'I can almost hear the sounds of the saxophone belting out a tune about the city . The city skyscrapers and harbor are decked out in hues of blue and black - the cities ''tuxedo'' that it dons when putting on the ritz. The city light sparkle in the night. This is a very visually appealing photo.', '2006-01-16 09:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041758, 276753, 34192, '<td valign="top">good stop action.</td>', 'good stop action.', '2006-01-16 09:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041759, 281217, 34192, '<td valign="top">pretty, has depth.</td>', 'pretty, has depth.', '2006-01-16 09:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041760, 281529, 34192, '<td valign="top">centered composition leaves the image static.  I like the fence againstt he clouds - interesting approach.</td>', 'centered composition leaves the image static.  I like the fence againstt he clouds - interesting approach.', '2006-01-16 09:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041762, 279548, 34192, '<td valign="top">pretty. good color rendition.</td>', 'pretty. good color rendition.', '2006-01-16 09:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041764, 274786, 34192, '<td valign="top">humorous, good lighting, DOF and focus well done.7</td>', 'humorous, good lighting, DOF and focus well done.7', '2006-01-16 09:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041767, 279612, 28710, '<td valign="top">Yes inDEED. Wow.<br/> <br/>My only gripe here is the furls of the black fabric. If you could have cut that off somehow, I think it would look even better....<br/> <br/>You know you have voted on too many amazing pics when you see a pic like this and you look at the furls in the fabric... *smacks forehead*</td>', 'Yes inDEED. Wow. My only gripe here is the furls of the black fabric. If you could have cut that off somehow, I think it would look even better.... You know you have voted on too many amazing pics when you see a pic like this and you look at the furls in the fabric... *smacks forehead*', '2006-01-16 09:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041769, 277497, 37719, '<td valign="top">looks slightly out of focus</td>', 'looks slightly out of focus', '2006-01-16 09:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041770, 279372, 26756, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite photos all year.  That look on her face is priceless and of course there''s the hand.  Love how they are all dressed up too.  This shot wouldn''t have had the same impact if they were both in t-shirts.  Love it!</td>', 'One of my favorite photos all year.  That look on her face is priceless and of course there''s the hand.  Love how they are all dressed up too.  This shot wouldn''t have had the same impact if they were both in t-shirts.  Love it!', '2006-01-16 09:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041771, 280942, 31443, '<td valign="top">A fill in flash would have done nicely here to light up the face, specially her eyes..</td>', 'A fill in flash would have done nicely here to light up the face, specially her eyes..', '2006-01-16 09:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041773, 280090, 34192, '<td valign="top">very good as is but for me, would have a much larger impact, if you juxtaposed the smallness of the group of men against the vastness of the sea - move them to the corner and extend the top and right.  I know - that''s not the image I have in front of me but just a thought for a future image. good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'very good as is but for me, would have a much larger impact, if you juxtaposed the smallness of the group of men against the vastness of the sea - move them to the corner and extend the top and right.  I know - that''s not the image I have in front of me but just a thought for a future image. good luck in the challenge!', '2006-01-16 09:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041774, 281959, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like this composition of the simple shape of the mason jar as it ''emerges'' out of the darkness. The lighting is very good and complements the main object. The curves of the of the lid seem to protrude and not only come out of the darkness but seem to come our direction. My only critique on this piece is that    the lid needs a bit more lighting such that the element of curves are continued  in the photo. As it stands now the top portion of the lid is a broken circle. By making it an unbroken circle it would add to the curves seen here and add a readily recognized shape that would strengthen the visual appeal.</td>', 'I like this composition of the simple shape of the mason jar as it ''emerges'' out of the darkness. The lighting is very good and complements the main object. The curves of the of the lid seem to protrude and not only come out of the darkness but seem to come our direction. My only critique on this piece is that    the lid needs a bit more lighting such that the element of curves are continued  in the photo. As it stands now the top portion of the lid is a broken circle. By making it an unbroken circle it would add to the curves seen here and add a readily recognized shape that would strengthen the visual appeal.', '2006-01-16 09:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041776, 276026, 37719, '<td valign="top">wish this wasn''t so centered</td>', 'wish this wasn''t so centered', '2006-01-16 09:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041777, 275932, 46097, '<td valign="top">stunning capture. I can''t fault it.</td>', 'stunning capture. I can''t fault it.', '2006-01-16 09:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041779, 277052, 34192, '<td valign="top">good color and focus.  Unfortunately, 2 of the 3 faces are hidden, hiding some of the impact of the image.</td>', 'good color and focus.  Unfortunately, 2 of the 3 faces are hidden, hiding some of the impact of the image.', '2006-01-16 09:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041781, 281483, 3569, '<td valign="top">wonderful egret</td>', 'wonderful egret', '2006-01-16 09:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041782, 281142, 34192, '<td valign="top">beautiful rendering of the clouds.</td>', 'beautiful rendering of the clouds.', '2006-01-16 09:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
