(2041796, 276026, 34192, '<td valign="top">pretty image but the impact is lessened by centered composition (and I love centered composition).  Cropping the bottom 1/4 would have lightened the image (all that dark) and would strengthen the flower.</td>', 'pretty image but the impact is lessened by centered composition (and I love centered composition).  Cropping the bottom 1/4 would have lightened the image (all that dark) and would strengthen the flower.', '2006-01-16 09:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
