(2041802, 281964, 34192, '<td valign="top">fascinating.  not really drawn to her eyes (as per the title) but I love the lighting and the composition.</td>', 'fascinating.  not really drawn to her eyes (as per the title) but I love the lighting and the composition.', '2006-01-16 09:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
