(2041836, 279719, 41522, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice moment, and I like the look in B&amp;W.  There are some unusual lines in sky, not to mention the white lines along the side.  Also, the horizon line of the water is very slanted.</td>', 'It''s a nice moment, and I like the look in B&W.  There are some unusual lines in sky, not to mention the white lines along the side.  Also, the horizon line of the water is very slanted.', '2006-01-16 09:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
