(2042046, 276086, 2780, '<td valign="top">I with this used the full 640 pixels so we could see more detail. Its a nice long exposure waterfall shot though, and well exposed.</td>', 'I with this used the full 640 pixels so we could see more detail. Its a nice long exposure waterfall shot though, and well exposed.', '2006-01-16 10:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042047, 279258, 13719, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2006-01-16 10:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042049, 281554, 18932, '<td valign="top">Nice, lots to see here. Slightly oversaturated? But the hills are awesome and the house adds great perspective. Mist is a nice catch. Composition could''ve been a little better for mine, in the front right, but probably being a bit nit-picky. 7/10</td>', 'Nice, lots to see here. Slightly oversaturated? But the hills are awesome and the house adds great perspective. Mist is a nice catch. Composition could''ve been a little better for mine, in the front right, but probably being a bit nit-picky. 7/10', '2006-01-16 10:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042050, 276964, 41794, '<td valign="top">Amazing color and detail.</td>', 'Amazing color and detail.', '2006-01-16 10:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042053, 277033, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great conceptual shot. I really like the colours and the contrast. The shadows coming across really add a lot of impact to the shot even though they may not be noticed at first. Looks like some long fingernails or claws or something, creeping up, Nosferatu style! Great shot, 10</td>', 'Great conceptual shot. I really like the colours and the contrast. The shadows coming across really add a lot of impact to the shot even though they may not be noticed at first. Looks like some long fingernails or claws or something, creeping up, Nosferatu style! Great shot, 10', '2006-01-16 10:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042055, 281609, 13719, '<td valign="top">oh wow, lol I like this one, nice shot</td>', 'oh wow, lol I like this one, nice shot', '2006-01-16 10:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042056, 274541, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great use of your tonal range and a very pleasing scene.</td>', 'Great use of your tonal range and a very pleasing scene.', '2006-01-16 10:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042057, 281264, 18932, '<td valign="top">Love the high-key effect here and the sharpness of the eyes amd the rest is great. Sorta feel like a little too much is white, but I''m giving this a 9 anyway.</td>', 'Love the high-key effect here and the sharpness of the eyes amd the rest is great. Sorta feel like a little too much is white, but I''m giving this a 9 anyway.', '2006-01-16 10:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042059, 281497, 13719, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot</td>', 'beautiful shot', '2006-01-16 10:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042061, 280803, 2780, '<td valign="top">In future challenges it''s probably best to use the full 640px limit. Also, it''s against the rules to have text and multiple images. Its a shame because the base photo with the wall is actually pretty good!</td>', 'In future challenges it''s probably best to use the full 640px limit. Also, it''s against the rules to have text and multiple images. Its a shame because the base photo with the wall is actually pretty good!', '2006-01-16 10:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042063, 277303, 1054, '<td valign="top">Well-captured emotion.</td>', 'Well-captured emotion.', '2006-01-16 10:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042064, 281529, 6405, '<td valign="top">No detail on the bird,use flash sometimes !</td>', 'No detail on the bird,use flash sometimes !', '2006-01-16 10:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042065, 281875, 2780, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is, but I really like it. I''m a bit fan of abstracts and this one is excellent. The composition, and mix of shapes, lines, and mixture of dark/light work really well. Great shot. 10</td>', 'I have no idea what this is, but I really like it. I''m a bit fan of abstracts and this one is excellent. The composition, and mix of shapes, lines, and mixture of dark/light work really well. Great shot. 10', '2006-01-16 10:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042066, 277005, 1054, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Love the grain and the reflections.</td>', 'Excellent. Love the grain and the reflections.', '2006-01-16 10:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042067, 275248, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think it is cropped a bit close to the beak on the left, it needs some breathing room I think.</td>', 'I think it is cropped a bit close to the beak on the left, it needs some breathing room I think.', '2006-01-16 10:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042069, 281933, 18932, '<td valign="top">Nice. Would''ve personally tried to get the shadows a bit deeper, but it''s a grand sight anyways. 8/10</td>', 'Nice. Would''ve personally tried to get the shadows a bit deeper, but it''s a grand sight anyways. 8/10', '2006-01-16 10:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042070, 276619, 1054, '<td valign="top">Excellent timing. I would have liked to see the ballplayer''s feet in view.</td>', 'Excellent timing. I would have liked to see the ballplayer''s feet in view.', '2006-01-16 10:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042074, 282005, 1054, '<td valign="top">Color and composition are outstanding.</td>', 'Color and composition are outstanding.', '2006-01-16 10:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042076, 281529, 18932, '<td valign="top">Sorry would have loved this without the cage. It''s also a little distracting because it''s a silhouette, bt then can see red colour and some detail, but not quite enough. 5/10</td>', 'Sorry would have loved this without the cage. It''s also a little distracting because it''s a silhouette, bt then can see red colour and some detail, but not quite enough. 5/10', '2006-01-16 10:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042078, 276959, 35804, '<td valign="top">Holy cow...this is just cool...</td>', 'Holy cow...this is just cool...', '2006-01-16 10:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042082, 274776, 35804, '<td valign="top">Oh My! What a moment! Thanks for the giggle.  : }</td>', 'Oh My! What a moment! Thanks for the giggle.  : }', '2006-01-16 10:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042083, 281524, 31443, '<td valign="top">Impressive image, don''t know about the slightly overexposed areas, impressive still..</td>', 'Impressive image, don''t know about the slightly overexposed areas, impressive still..', '2006-01-16 10:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042084, 275479, 2780, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo. I remember seeing it before I think? But I don''t remember who''s it is. Whoever you are, you''re a genious. Everything about this photo is perfect. 10.</td>', 'Fantastic photo. I remember seeing it before I think? But I don''t remember who''s it is. Whoever you are, you''re a genious. Everything about this photo is perfect. 10.', '2006-01-16 10:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042085, 280525, 28710, '<td valign="top">Pretty pic of the Snowy Owl. I''m confused by your title. I can''t see any water anywhere. I think Knots is a measure of speed, not distance. Nautical Miles are nautial miles, Knots are Nautical Miles per hour? Maybe I''m wrong.</td>', 'Pretty pic of the Snowy Owl. I''m confused by your title. I can''t see any water anywhere. I think Knots is a measure of speed, not distance. Nautical Miles are nautial miles, Knots are Nautical Miles per hour? Maybe I''m wrong.', '2006-01-16 10:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042086, 280508, 18932, '<td valign="top">Oooh. Niced. Sharp, nice texture and feel and the colour is dreamy (whoops sound a bit girly there). Don''t normally like this kind of thing but 8/10</td>', 'Oooh. Niced. Sharp, nice texture and feel and the colour is dreamy (whoops sound a bit girly there). Don''t normally like this kind of thing but 8/10', '2006-01-16 10:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042087, 281896, 32139, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting!</td>', 'Nice lighting!', '2006-01-16 10:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042088, 279938, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the gaussian blur effect that it looks like you applied in photoshop kind of spoils the photo for me. It does add a good dreamy effect, but it just doesn''t appeal to me. I''m sure other people will think differently though :)</td>', 'I think the gaussian blur effect that it looks like you applied in photoshop kind of spoils the photo for me. It does add a good dreamy effect, but it just doesn''t appeal to me. I''m sure other people will think differently though :)', '2006-01-16 10:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042093, 278916, 2780, '<td valign="top">I''m not really a fan of this type of border, but its a very cute photo. Maybe a soft focus filter or something would add a nice dreamy quality? :)</td>', 'I''m not really a fan of this type of border, but its a very cute photo. Maybe a soft focus filter or something would add a nice dreamy quality? :)', '2006-01-16 10:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042098, 275078, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, except for the weird colour banding around the sun, which is a bit distracting. I think a closer crop on the bridge and Alcatraz(?) with less water at the bottom would improve the shot a bit, although I like the sense of distance this crop suggests.</td>', 'Very nice photo, except for the weird colour banding around the sun, which is a bit distracting. I think a closer crop on the bridge and Alcatraz(?) with less water at the bottom would improve the shot a bit, although I like the sense of distance this crop suggests.', '2006-01-16 10:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042101, 281779, 35804, '<td valign="top">Oh! I am so glad you entered this one Skip! This is truly an awesome capture...you can feel the excitement, the rush, the speed...excellent choice.</td>', 'Oh! I am so glad you entered this one Skip! This is truly an awesome capture...you can feel the excitement, the rush, the speed...excellent choice.', '2006-01-16 10:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042103, 281746, 3735, '<td valign="top">No Sleepwalkers in this community I bet !!!</td>', 'No Sleepwalkers in this community I bet !!!', '2006-01-16 10:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042107, 278697, 32139, '<td valign="top">Nice translucent patterns. I would have taken a slight more closeup approach to remove the distracting background (top left and bottom right) and change slightly the back lighting to remove teh cast shadow of the stem and and brighten the center piece.</td>', 'Nice translucent patterns. I would have taken a slight more closeup approach to remove the distracting background (top left and bottom right) and change slightly the back lighting to remove teh cast shadow of the stem and and brighten the center piece.', '2006-01-16 10:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042110, 281726, 18932, '<td valign="top">Very fresh looking and quite sharp. Just a thought - maybe red apples would have worked better as a background red. Still nice either way - 6/10</td>', 'Very fresh looking and quite sharp. Just a thought - maybe red apples would have worked better as a background red. Still nice either way - 6/10', '2006-01-16 10:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042111, 277676, 2780, '<td valign="top">Surreal photo! The detail everywhere is great, and the exposure is spot on. Did you use multiple exposures from the same raw file for it? However it was done, it looks excellent!</td>', 'Surreal photo! The detail everywhere is great, and the exposure is spot on. Did you use multiple exposures from the same raw file for it? However it was done, it looks excellent!', '2006-01-16 10:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042113, 280701, 18932, '<td valign="top">Sorry but way too overexposed for mine. Hope some like the feel, but just doesn''t click with me sorry. 4/10</td>', 'Sorry but way too overexposed for mine. Hope some like the feel, but just doesn''t click with me sorry. 4/10', '2006-01-16 10:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042115, 276630, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of DoF to isolate the subject. I think some extra space on the left for it to look into would have improved the composition a tad.</td>', 'Very nice use of DoF to isolate the subject. I think some extra space on the left for it to look into would have improved the composition a tad.', '2006-01-16 10:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042116, 282001, 28710, '<td valign="top">I do like a good bit of well-used lens flare.<br/> <br/>And I love a good street dance!</td>', 'I do like a good bit of well-used lens flare. And I love a good street dance!', '2006-01-16 10:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042117, 274611, 32139, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and good lighting of the needle. The framing is much more interesting than the usual photos of this item.</td>', 'Interesting composition and good lighting of the needle. The framing is much more interesting than the usual photos of this item.', '2006-01-16 10:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042123, 281265, 35804, '<td valign="top">Yep...I thought this disappeared from my favs...glad to see it was for the sake of this challenge...I still absolutely love this...10.</td>', 'Yep...I thought this disappeared from my favs...glad to see it was for the sake of this challenge...I still absolutely love this...10.', '2006-01-16 10:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
