(2042164, 274611, 18191, '<td valign="top">Fantastic framing and tones.</td>', 'Fantastic framing and tones.', '2006-01-16 10:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042165, 281753, 18932, '<td valign="top">It''s obviously only about the shirt here! Nah the depth of field is great. Shame about the rather blank expression (at least as it looks to me) - some fill flash may have helped too. 5/10</td>', 'It''s obviously only about the shirt here! Nah the depth of field is great. Shame about the rather blank expression (at least as it looks to me) - some fill flash may have helped too. 5/10', '2006-01-16 10:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042169, 279198, 1202, '<td valign="top">Tilts to the left, needs to be level for such a great scene.</td>', 'Tilts to the left, needs to be level for such a great scene.', '2006-01-16 10:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042170, 281548, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky and silhouettes.</td>', 'Beautiful sky and silhouettes.', '2006-01-16 10:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042174, 281315, 32139, '<td valign="top">Nice photoshop work. I am nevertheless a bit disatisfied with the asymetry of the road leading to the pyramid. Again some people would find this more interesting. I would have instead centered the frame on the right side of the path to use the difference of patterns That would also have de-centered the small pyramid from the large one. Nice anyway.</td>', 'Nice photoshop work. I am nevertheless a bit disatisfied with the asymetry of the road leading to the pyramid. Again some people would find this more interesting. I would have instead centered the frame on the right side of the path to use the difference of patterns That would also have de-centered the small pyramid from the large one. Nice anyway.', '2006-01-16 10:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042178, 282014, 2780, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice shot, but it would have been so much better if you''d used the full 640 pixels.</td>', 'Looks like a nice shot, but it would have been so much better if you''d used the full 640 pixels.', '2006-01-16 10:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042179, 275508, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great colors and I love how the reflections add to this.</td>', 'Great colors and I love how the reflections add to this.', '2006-01-16 10:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042181, 274709, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot with an excellent title. Really great work.</td>', 'Excellent shot with an excellent title. Really great work.', '2006-01-16 10:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042182, 274594, 10848, '<td valign="top">Perfect image, the colors are amazing, the detail is great. Great shot!</td>', 'Perfect image, the colors are amazing, the detail is great. Great shot!', '2006-01-16 10:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042184, 274769, 32139, '<td valign="top">Will look most likely very nice in larger print than permitted by dpchallenge.</td>', 'Will look most likely very nice in larger print than permitted by dpchallenge.', '2006-01-16 10:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042189, 279776, 18191, '<td valign="top">haha what a great expression! nice job.</td>', 'haha what a great expression! nice job.', '2006-01-16 10:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042190, 281737, 18932, '<td valign="top">Wow. 10/10. Colour, tone, texture, composition this has it all with a feeling of mystery to boot. This wasn''t a hard one to vote on.</td>', 'Wow. 10/10. Colour, tone, texture, composition this has it all with a feeling of mystery to boot. This wasn''t a hard one to vote on.', '2006-01-16 10:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042192, 281930, 1054, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but the focus seems a little soft on the nose.</td>', 'I like this photo but the focus seems a little soft on the nose.', '2006-01-16 10:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042193, 277057, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful fisheye and wonderful lighting... this is a stellar shot</td>', 'Beautiful fisheye and wonderful lighting... this is a stellar shot', '2006-01-16 10:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042194, 280782, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love this.  So 50''s, so real life down to earth.  However, I feel the crop is a little too tight and the depth of field not short enough to make this a truly great photo.  It also might be improved by change to black and white.  This is the kind of subject I often dream of finding and you have done well here.  I don''t think typical DPC voters will enjoy the image for what it is - no sunset here, but its a good photo non-the-less.  Something more you would expect to see at a gallery handling ''real life'' images.  Diners are great spots for that. :) Subject, technical merit, connection to viewer - 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I love this.  So 50''s, so real life down to earth.  However, I feel the crop is a little too tight and the depth of field not short enough to make this a truly great photo.  It also might be improved by change to black and white.  This is the kind of subject I often dream of finding and you have done well here.  I don''t think typical DPC voters will enjoy the image for what it is - no sunset here, but its a good photo non-the-less.  Something more you would expect to see at a gallery handling ''real life'' images.  Diners are great spots for that. :) Subject, technical merit, connection to viewer - 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-01-16 10:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042195, 281938, 18191, '<td valign="top">&lt;--- jealous!<br/> <br/>nice even lighting</td>', '<--- jealous! nice even lighting', '2006-01-16 10:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042196, 276096, 18191, '<td valign="top">Cute shot with some great eyes</td>', 'Cute shot with some great eyes', '2006-01-16 10:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042197, 278217, 1202, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the distracting mirror.</td>', 'Don''t like the distracting mirror.', '2006-01-16 10:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042198, 277621, 47117, '<td valign="top">When I give a photo a 10, it is because I feel it is wonderfual all the way around.  Therefore, I have no real comment other than to say I gave you a 10!</td>', 'When I give a photo a 10, it is because I feel it is wonderfual all the way around.  Therefore, I have no real comment other than to say I gave you a 10!', '2006-01-16 10:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042199, 274564, 18191, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones and simple background make this effective</td>', 'Wonderful tones and simple background make this effective', '2006-01-16 10:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042200, 275691, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think using the full 640px would have helped here. In my opinion the grass is too saturated - I''m not sure if that was done in post processing? There seem to be some artifacts created by that. Also looks like you clones something out at the top right? Repearing patterns there, which really draw attention to themselves.</td>', 'I think using the full 640px would have helped here. In my opinion the grass is too saturated - I''m not sure if that was done in post processing? There seem to be some artifacts created by that. Also looks like you clones something out at the top right? Repearing patterns there, which really draw attention to themselves.', '2006-01-16 10:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042201, 280107, 18191, '<td valign="top">The lighting here seems a little harsh and the angle is also a little bit off.. probably out of your control... an interesting capture for sure</td>', 'The lighting here seems a little harsh and the angle is also a little bit off.. probably out of your control... an interesting capture for sure', '2006-01-16 10:59:34.000000', NULL, 1);
