(2042488, 274540, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - interesting light, nice frozen water motion and just the right amount of blur in the bird''s wings.</td>', 'Nice capture - interesting light, nice frozen water motion and just the right amount of blur in the bird''s wings.', '2006-01-16 11:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042489, 280701, 2780, '<td valign="top">The artistic post processing is quite effective here in making the colour really stand out, but I think the negative point about the photo is that the lamp post is not straight. It is quite a distraction in my opinion.</td>', 'The artistic post processing is quite effective here in making the colour really stand out, but I think the negative point about the photo is that the lamp post is not straight. It is quite a distraction in my opinion.', '2006-01-16 11:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042490, 278666, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait. I really like your choice to get in close and to crop off the top of his/ her head. I love the eye contact and the shallow DOF too. What an endearing shot!</td>', 'Lovely portrait. I really like your choice to get in close and to crop off the top of his/ her head. I love the eye contact and the shallow DOF too. What an endearing shot!', '2006-01-16 11:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042491, 274696, 37392, '<td valign="top">Good. Thank you! this bird remember me a friend, he died last december, and loves this birds.</td>', 'Good. Thank you! this bird remember me a friend, he died last december, and loves this birds.', '2006-01-16 11:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042493, 275292, 2780, '<td valign="top">The mist really makes this photo great. Maybe slightly less water on the bottom would improve the composition and stop the birds being so centered.</td>', 'The mist really makes this photo great. Maybe slightly less water on the bottom would improve the composition and stop the birds being so centered.', '2006-01-16 11:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042496, 280692, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice colours in this shot, although it seems slightly over-exposed to me, specially on that branch in the background. I think I would have burned the background a little to give more impact to the strong colours of the macaw.</td>', 'Really nice colours in this shot, although it seems slightly over-exposed to me, specially on that branch in the background. I think I would have burned the background a little to give more impact to the strong colours of the macaw.', '2006-01-16 11:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042497, 274695, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wow this is great!</td>', 'Wow this is great!', '2006-01-16 11:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042499, 281955, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great detail, amazing colors.</td>', 'Great detail, amazing colors.', '2006-01-16 11:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042501, 274735, 27562, '<td valign="top">I love the tonality of the rocks and foreground, but the tilted sky looks artificial (burn tool?).   Good work.</td>', 'I love the tonality of the rocks and foreground, but the tilted sky looks artificial (burn tool?).   Good work.', '2006-01-16 11:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042505, 275322, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think this could do with 3 main alterations.<br/> - I think it needs to be rotated slightly anti-clockwise since the first line you look at is the one by her face, and that one isnt vertical.<br/> - It would look really nice with a soft focus diffuse glow or something to make it seem dreamy. It would also hide some of the noise that seems to be in your photo.<br/> - A very slight USM because it seems slightly out of focus currently</td>', 'I think this could do with 3 main alterations. - I think it needs to be rotated slightly anti-clockwise since the first line you look at is the one by her face, and that one isnt vertical. - It would look really nice with a soft focus diffuse glow or something to make it seem dreamy. It would also hide some of the noise that seems to be in your photo. - A very slight USM because it seems slightly out of focus currently', '2006-01-16 11:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042507, 280499, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites, the color is amazing on this image, good DOF,</td>', 'This is one of my favorites, the color is amazing on this image, good DOF,', '2006-01-16 11:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042508, 275320, 37392, '<td valign="top">same idea.... <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=249981" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/397/thumb/249981.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/397/thumb/249981.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/397/thumb/249981.jpg"/></a></td>', 'same idea.... ', '2006-01-16 11:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042509, 280558, 18932, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. To underexposed though. Sorry 5/10</td>', 'Very nice composition. To underexposed though. Sorry 5/10', '2006-01-16 11:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042510, 276082, 28710, '<td valign="top">Strange Christmas gift. Do you know who gave it?</td>', 'Strange Christmas gift. Do you know who gave it?', '2006-01-16 11:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042512, 275483, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice andlge here and leading lines.</td>', 'Nice andlge here and leading lines.', '2006-01-16 11:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042514, 278040, 3087, '<td valign="top">Funky! I like that you''ve cropped away the head - makes it at once universal and private/ intimate. Great composition. Yellow lighting actually works well. The colour noise seems a bit high - particularly obvious on her skin.</td>', 'Funky! I like that you''ve cropped away the head - makes it at once universal and private/ intimate. Great composition. Yellow lighting actually works well. The colour noise seems a bit high - particularly obvious on her skin.', '2006-01-16 11:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042518, 275344, 35444, '<td valign="top">I would have scored this higher if it wasn''t for the thick white border.  I feel it detracts so much and makes the snow look dingy.</td>', 'I would have scored this higher if it wasn''t for the thick white border.  I feel it detracts so much and makes the snow look dingy.', '2006-01-16 11:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042519, 279903, 28710, '<td valign="top">Wow. This has got some really weird optical illusions going on here. Certain parts of this picture seem to move when I stare at other parts.<br/> <br/>Wild stuff.</td>', 'Wow. This has got some really weird optical illusions going on here. Certain parts of this picture seem to move when I stare at other parts. Wild stuff.', '2006-01-16 11:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042520, 278337, 18191, '<td valign="top">This seems out of focus. Also the composition is dead in the center.. try placing your subject on the ROT intersections.</td>', 'This seems out of focus. Also the composition is dead in the center.. try placing your subject on the ROT intersections.', '2006-01-16 11:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042521, 280366, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of lighting to evoke a mood. That shaft of light from window to person is great. Like the obvious lines on both floor and ceiling - they give a real sense of perspective/ depth. Like too the textures of wood and brick and metal. The warm tones are great too. This is a really intriguing and well exectured image that makes me look and look.</td>', 'Wonderful use of lighting to evoke a mood. That shaft of light from window to person is great. Like the obvious lines on both floor and ceiling - they give a real sense of perspective/ depth. Like too the textures of wood and brick and metal. The warm tones are great too. This is a really intriguing and well exectured image that makes me look and look.', '2006-01-16 11:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042523, 281836, 27562, '<td valign="top">Interesting juxtaposition of delicate looking model in a hard environment, but  I do wish there would have been eye contact to convey additional emotional response.  Good work.</td>', 'Interesting juxtaposition of delicate looking model in a hard environment, but  I do wish there would have been eye contact to convey additional emotional response.  Good work.', '2006-01-16 11:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042524, 278365, 3087, '<td valign="top">How beautiful and what an interesting detail to capture!</td>', 'How beautiful and what an interesting detail to capture!', '2006-01-16 11:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042526, 279887, 18932, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Colour to everything, texture particularly the mossy rocks and the water. Love the flow through effect the waterfall has on the photo but there''s also a lot to look at without it being busy. 10/10</td>', 'Lovely. Colour to everything, texture particularly the mossy rocks and the water. Love the flow through effect the waterfall has on the photo but there''s also a lot to look at without it being busy. 10/10', '2006-01-16 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042528, 279118, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely eye contact!</td>', 'Lovely eye contact!', '2006-01-16 11:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042531, 280136, 3087, '<td valign="top">The spiral of that leaf edge is a wonderful compositional tool and the position of the ant on the very tip of the leaf works very well. Great saturated colours too.</td>', 'The spiral of that leaf edge is a wonderful compositional tool and the position of the ant on the very tip of the leaf works very well. Great saturated colours too.', '2006-01-16 11:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042532, 280022, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is precious! I love it, the softness of the image makes it almost magical!</td>', 'This is precious! I love it, the softness of the image makes it almost magical!', '2006-01-16 11:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042533, 280923, 28710, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what priest or saint or whatever that is, but it''s pretty neat how you made it look like he''s using a really old SLR with a flash hotshoed and a really straight telephoto lens (prime?)<br/> <br/>St. _____ - Patron Saint of the Photographer.</td>', 'I don''t know what priest or saint or whatever that is, but it''s pretty neat how you made it look like he''s using a really old SLR with a flash hotshoed and a really straight telephoto lens (prime?) St. _____ - Patron Saint of the Photographer.', '2006-01-16 11:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042535, 281607, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great landscape! I like the way there are stripes of interest - the crater in the foreground, the orange flat lands behind, the mountains behind that and then the cloudy sky. Great detail too.</td>', 'Great landscape! I like the way there are stripes of interest - the crater in the foreground, the orange flat lands behind, the mountains behind that and then the cloudy sky. Great detail too.', '2006-01-16 11:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042539, 281716, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait - love the composition with head on the right of frame looking to the left. Eye detail, colour and catch light are great. Nice DOF choice blurring background but still showing a touch of the environment nonetheless. Nice one!</td>', 'Beautiful portrait - love the composition with head on the right of frame looking to the left. Eye detail, colour and catch light are great. Nice DOF choice blurring background but still showing a touch of the environment nonetheless. Nice one!', '2006-01-16 11:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042540, 281505, 18932, '<td valign="top">The perspective is weird with the lines of the planks and the line of waves meeting at odd angle and the colour is a little bizarre too. Sorry but 4/10</td>', 'The perspective is weird with the lines of the planks and the line of waves meeting at odd angle and the colour is a little bizarre too. Sorry but 4/10', '2006-01-16 11:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042542, 277364, 2780, '<td valign="top">Wow great shot. Can''t be a real ice berg lit like that with a dark sky, but even so, the impact against the back background is very strong. Would have liked to have seen the full 640px tho! :)</td>', 'Wow great shot. Can''t be a real ice berg lit like that with a dark sky, but even so, the impact against the back background is very strong. Would have liked to have seen the full 640px tho! :)', '2006-01-16 11:53:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2042544, 281404, 20662, '<td valign="top">:-) My daughter''s name is Grace Olivia. She''s very cute and I love the slight desat.</td>', ':-) My daughter''s name is Grace Olivia. She''s very cute and I love the slight desat.', '2006-01-16 11:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042545, 280788, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really great shot. The B&amp;W is perfectly done, as is the exposure and the composition, and everything. Excellent. 10</td>', 'Really great shot. The B&W is perfectly done, as is the exposure and the composition, and everything. Excellent. 10', '2006-01-16 11:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042547, 281914, 18932, '<td valign="top">Wow. 10/10 Smooth. Sharp. Great depth of field. Good fore, middle and background and the sky does wonders. Who could ask for anything more.</td>', 'Wow. 10/10 Smooth. Sharp. Great depth of field. Good fore, middle and background and the sky does wonders. Who could ask for anything more.', '2006-01-16 11:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042548, 275350, 34991, '<td valign="top">I would rate this photo a lot higher if it were just sand in the foreground instead of the sand balls. They distract from what is otherwise a beautiful picture.</td>', 'I would rate this photo a lot higher if it were just sand in the foreground instead of the sand balls. They distract from what is otherwise a beautiful picture.', '2006-01-16 11:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042549, 281057, 20662, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2006-01-16 11:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042550, 279454, 2780, '<td valign="top">It might just be my eyes but I think the horizon looks a bit off - could do with a slight rotation anti-clockwise maybe? Also there are halos around the posts in the water which looks like the result of oversharpening.</td>', 'It might just be my eyes but I think the horizon looks a bit off - could do with a slight rotation anti-clockwise maybe? Also there are halos around the posts in the water which looks like the result of oversharpening.', '2006-01-16 11:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042551, 281896, 3087, '<td valign="top">How beautiful! You''ve captured the light and morning mis so wonderfully! I love the way the mist gives depth by creating halos around the tree tops and also the way the sun lights up many of the balloons.</td>', 'How beautiful! You''ve captured the light and morning mis so wonderfully! I love the way the mist gives depth by creating halos around the tree tops and also the way the sun lights up many of the balloons.', '2006-01-16 11:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042552, 281813, 35444, '<td valign="top">Good pose.  I think it would be even more visually appealing if she were off to one side instead of smack in the middle (rule of thirds)</td>', 'Good pose.  I think it would be even more visually appealing if she were off to one side instead of smack in the middle (rule of thirds)', '2006-01-16 11:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042553, 280787, 18191, '<td valign="top">The water here is beautiful! Nice capture of an amazing scene.</td>', 'The water here is beautiful! Nice capture of an amazing scene.', '2006-01-16 11:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042554, 279655, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot, and altho the focus isnt dead sharp, who cares! 10</td>', 'Great shot, and altho the focus isnt dead sharp, who cares! 10', '2006-01-16 11:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042555, 277052, 18191, '<td valign="top">Very funny shot. Wish the size was a little bit larger.</td>', 'Very funny shot. Wish the size was a little bit larger.', '2006-01-16 11:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042556, 281052, 3087, '<td valign="top">I remember this image well from when I first saw it (and I think I commented then on how much I liked it). Lovely saturation of colour and what a wonderful quality of light.</td>', 'I remember this image well from when I first saw it (and I think I commented then on how much I liked it). Lovely saturation of colour and what a wonderful quality of light.', '2006-01-16 11:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042559, 277621, 18191, '<td valign="top">Ah I''ve seen this before :)<br/> <br/>Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful. 9.</td>', 'Ah I''ve seen this before :) Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful. 9.', '2006-01-16 11:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042561, 275361, 2780, '<td valign="top">The colours seem a bit flat to me here, maybe boosting up the contrast a tad would help the photo have more impact visually.</td>', 'The colours seem a bit flat to me here, maybe boosting up the contrast a tad would help the photo have more impact visually.', '2006-01-16 11:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042563, 274680, 18191, '<td valign="top">I love how the truck seems to have turned into part of the landscape over time... great piece.</td>', 'I love how the truck seems to have turned into part of the landscape over time... great piece.', '2006-01-16 11:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042564, 279645, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.</td>', 'Nice capture.', '2006-01-16 11:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042565, 275143, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning photo that looks like a work of art!   Your title adds to the wonderful feeling of it!  I love the colors.  The softness, and the composition of where the horse is in connection with the background and all that beautiful golden grass in the foreground.  Fantastic job!!</td>', 'This is a stunning photo that looks like a work of art!   Your title adds to the wonderful feeling of it!  I love the colors.  The softness, and the composition of where the horse is in connection with the background and all that beautiful golden grass in the foreground.  Fantastic job!!', '2006-01-16 11:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042569, 275826, 2780, '<td valign="top">I don''t know the story behind this but it makes you think! The tones are very nicely done but I find the shadow across the eyes a bit distracting, as the eyes are what I try to look at first in an emotional piece, and I can''t here.</td>', 'I don''t know the story behind this but it makes you think! The tones are very nicely done but I find the shadow across the eyes a bit distracting, as the eyes are what I try to look at first in an emotional piece, and I can''t here.', '2006-01-16 11:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042571, 278919, 2022, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, good composition, the border is actually very distracting (7)</td>', 'Love the colors, good composition, the border is actually very distracting (7)', '2006-01-16 11:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042572, 275343, 18191, '<td valign="top">I love the reflections and the pastel tones that were used here!</td>', 'I love the reflections and the pastel tones that were used here!', '2006-01-16 11:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042574, 278624, 18932, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. Love the stones of the wall and the clouds look good too. Needed something to raise above average. 6/10</td>', 'Nice colours. Love the stones of the wall and the clouds look good too. Needed something to raise above average. 6/10', '2006-01-16 11:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042575, 275371, 18191, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot... composition could have improved</td>', 'Interesting shot... composition could have improved', '2006-01-16 11:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042576, 278980, 2022, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and patterns, great shot (8)</td>', 'I like the lighting and patterns, great shot (8)', '2006-01-16 11:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042583, 274776, 20662, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh! Very cute</td>', 'Made me laugh! Very cute', '2006-01-16 11:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042585, 278777, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Amazing color combinations, wonderful detail! 9</td>', 'Great shot! Amazing color combinations, wonderful detail! 9', '2006-01-16 11:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042586, 281264, 2780, '<td valign="top">Those are great green eyes! Contrasted well against the pink. I like the high key treatment you''ve done but I don''t really like how the photo cuts off into teh white border. I find it a bit distracting.</td>', 'Those are great green eyes! Contrasted well against the pink. I like the high key treatment you''ve done but I don''t really like how the photo cuts off into teh white border. I find it a bit distracting.', '2006-01-16 12:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042588, 275282, 3102, '<td valign="top">Funny shot, but not very strong photographically, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Funny shot, but not very strong photographically, I''m afraid.', '2006-01-16 12:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042589, 279839, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, great colours and lots of different areas of interest :) I like it!</td>', 'Very nice shot, great colours and lots of different areas of interest :) I like it!', '2006-01-16 12:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042591, 274557, 43434, '<td valign="top">not sharp .. I don''t think it is meant to be, good attitude ... I think it really deserved to be called "staunch" he just looks pissed at you.<br/> <br/>Nice cadid ... well cropped.<br/> <br/>K</td>', 'not sharp .. I don''t think it is meant to be, good attitude ... I think it really deserved to be called "staunch" he just looks pissed at you. Nice cadid ... well cropped. K', '2006-01-16 12:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042592, 276970, 2022, '<td valign="top">Cool (9)</td>', 'Cool (9)', '2006-01-16 12:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042594, 277758, 2022, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple (8)</td>', 'Nice and simple (8)', '2006-01-16 12:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042595, 274540, 20168, '<td valign="top">Dynamic photo! Full range of B/W tonal zones; with a lovely chiastic pattern (an X pattern) of upper left (white) to lower right (black) and upper right (dark) to lower left (light), with the seabird (black) upon the white breakers...genius! Clarity of focus, great aperture setting, and such wonderful movement. The energy is felt rather than seen. A sheer delight! 10</td>', 'Dynamic photo! Full range of B/W tonal zones; with a lovely chiastic pattern (an X pattern) of upper left (white) to lower right (black) and upper right (dark) to lower left (light), with the seabird (black) upon the white breakers...genius! Clarity of focus, great aperture setting, and such wonderful movement. The energy is felt rather than seen. A sheer delight! 10', '2006-01-16 12:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042596, 276866, 2022, '<td valign="top">Wow, great shot (8)</td>', 'Wow, great shot (8)', '2006-01-16 12:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042599, 278666, 2780, '<td valign="top">They are great eyes! The DoF here is excellent, really focusses on the eyes. Priceless expression :)</td>', 'They are great eyes! The DoF here is excellent, really focusses on the eyes. Priceless expression :)', '2006-01-16 12:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042600, 277676, 2022, '<td valign="top">Wow ! (9)</td>', 'Wow ! (9)', '2006-01-16 12:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042601, 281435, 35444, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s stuffed!</td>', 'Looks like he''s stuffed!', '2006-01-16 12:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042607, 281629, 14476, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautiful image.  Only the unfortunate background shadow mars this excellent photograph. I think you could have gotten rid of most of the shadow with cropping and then cleaned up the remainder since this is Advanced Editing.  Nevertheless, great work.</td>', 'Beautiful, beautiful image.  Only the unfortunate background shadow mars this excellent photograph. I think you could have gotten rid of most of the shadow with cropping and then cleaned up the remainder since this is Advanced Editing.  Nevertheless, great work.', '2006-01-16 12:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042608, 280481, 6519, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, but the crooked horizon spoils it.</td>', 'I love this photo, but the crooked horizon spoils it.', '2006-01-16 12:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042612, 281852, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice idea with the tropical atmosphere.  Unfortunately, the horizon goes downhill, emptying out the ocean to the left.  <br/>;&gt;)</td>', 'Nice idea with the tropical atmosphere.  Unfortunately, the horizon goes downhill, emptying out the ocean to the left.  ;>)', '2006-01-16 12:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042614, 274729, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like the dark tratment to this and the splash of color. Well done.</td>', 'I like the dark tratment to this and the splash of color. Well done.', '2006-01-16 12:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042619, 277093, 14476, '<td valign="top">Love the early morning shadows.  Wonder if a neutral density filter (or even a polarizer) would have brought out the color in the sky a bit more.  Still, it makes me want to be there.</td>', 'Love the early morning shadows.  Wonder if a neutral density filter (or even a polarizer) would have brought out the color in the sky a bit more.  Still, it makes me want to be there.', '2006-01-16 12:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042620, 276859, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with good leading lines</td>', 'Nice shot with good leading lines', '2006-01-16 12:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042621, 280226, 2022, '<td valign="top">Cool (9)</td>', 'Cool (9)', '2006-01-16 12:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042623, 280642, 41521, '<td valign="top">I love the expressions on their faces!  Great capture, excellent title.</td>', 'I love the expressions on their faces!  Great capture, excellent title.', '2006-01-16 12:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042625, 275136, 14476, '<td valign="top">lovely contrasts. interesting sky.</td>', 'lovely contrasts. interesting sky.', '2006-01-16 12:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
