(2042702, 279015, 3102, '<td valign="top">I could have submitted a similar shot had this been the best of 1995 :)<br/> <br/>I remember this guy well when I toured Pompeii a decade ago.  If I''m not mistaken, this is a plaster cast they made by pouring the plaster into holes where bodies had been surrounded by lava.  The belt on this guy indicated that he was a slave.  I''d love to go back there with the aid of a digital camera -- I took lots of shots the first time around, but I''m sure I''d fill a few cards nowadays!</td>', 'I could have submitted a similar shot had this been the best of 1995 :) I remember this guy well when I toured Pompeii a decade ago.  If I''m not mistaken, this is a plaster cast they made by pouring the plaster into holes where bodies had been surrounded by lava.  The belt on this guy indicated that he was a slave.  I''d love to go back there with the aid of a digital camera -- I took lots of shots the first time around, but I''m sure I''d fill a few cards nowadays!', '2006-01-16 12:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
