(2042827, 280323, 29797, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition here. There''s great (yet subtle) framing, and it''s well balanced. The fact that it''s not a "spectacular" sunset shot with the whole sky lit up intensifies the mood to this photo. It makes me wish that I was there on the bench watching everything. Nice job.</td>', 'Really nice composition here. There''s great (yet subtle) framing, and it''s well balanced. The fact that it''s not a "spectacular" sunset shot with the whole sky lit up intensifies the mood to this photo. It makes me wish that I was there on the bench watching everything. Nice job.', '2006-01-16 12:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042828, 281896, 38234, '<td valign="top">wow stunning shot!!</td>', 'wow stunning shot!!', '2006-01-16 12:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042830, 280416, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing capture.  A Sports Illustrated-esque shot!</td>', 'This is an amazing capture.  A Sports Illustrated-esque shot!', '2006-01-16 12:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042831, 279895, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great movement and colors. I think an adjustment of curves would really deepen it up. The stop action is well captured.</td>', 'Great movement and colors. I think an adjustment of curves would really deepen it up. The stop action is well captured.', '2006-01-16 12:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042832, 281554, 50466, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites so far, great job....9</td>', 'one of my favorites so far, great job....9', '2006-01-16 12:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042833, 281192, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lovely geometric designs in this mosque. With blue in the title, my eye calls out to see the color blue.</td>', 'Lovely geometric designs in this mosque. With blue in the title, my eye calls out to see the color blue.', '2006-01-16 12:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042835, 281238, 50466, '<td valign="top">fantastic shot...is that an old prison in the background?  9</td>', 'fantastic shot...is that an old prison in the background?  9', '2006-01-16 12:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042837, 277970, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a stunning portrait!  A standout even in a challenge like this!!!  10</td>', 'What a stunning portrait!  A standout even in a challenge like this!!!  10', '2006-01-16 12:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042839, 279691, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lacks clarity in subject, intent, focus. Title is confusing.</td>', 'Lacks clarity in subject, intent, focus. Title is confusing.', '2006-01-16 12:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042840, 275725, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so interesting.  I find myself wanting to keep looking at it.  Very artistic and beautiful.</td>', 'This is so interesting.  I find myself wanting to keep looking at it.  Very artistic and beautiful.', '2006-01-16 13:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042841, 280500, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting</td>', 'Nice lighting', '2006-01-16 13:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042842, 281315, 15711, '<td valign="top">Stunning capture with the older style architecture mixed with the geometric modern.  The leading line of the diamon pattern of the sidewalk mimics those on the pyramid.  This is complex, yet not overly busy.  The dark subjects are great too.  Nice!! 8</td>', 'Stunning capture with the older style architecture mixed with the geometric modern.  The leading line of the diamon pattern of the sidewalk mimics those on the pyramid.  This is complex, yet not overly busy.  The dark subjects are great too.  Nice!! 8', '2006-01-16 13:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042847, 275968, 24454, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful and majestic!</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful and majestic!', '2006-01-16 13:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042848, 280634, 20168, '<td valign="top">Amazing macro of the insect world. The upright verticle composition seems lacking in dynamic verve. If this was cropped, try a diagonal crop to see what would happen to the movement. Great focus and clarity.</td>', 'Amazing macro of the insect world. The upright verticle composition seems lacking in dynamic verve. If this was cropped, try a diagonal crop to see what would happen to the movement. Great focus and clarity.', '2006-01-16 13:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042849, 281214, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the abstraction in this photo.</td>', 'I like the abstraction in this photo.', '2006-01-16 13:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042850, 274696, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rendering of a snowy owl. I know how hard it can be to get the exposure right on them. I would try dodging its eyes a little bit: you can usually obtain a nice glow,<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=129398" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/288/thumb/129398.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/288/thumb/129398.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/288/thumb/129398.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Beautiful rendering of a snowy owl. I know how hard it can be to get the exposure right on them. I would try dodging its eyes a little bit: you can usually obtain a nice glow, ', '2006-01-16 13:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042851, 281859, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is so serene...and the B &amp; W was such a perfect choice, it really lets the viewer concentrate on the light, which is stunning...it is the "star" of this image so to speak. I know this would not have had the same effect on me if this were in color...very nice.</td>', 'This is so serene...and the B & W was such a perfect choice, it really lets the viewer concentrate on the light, which is stunning...it is the "star" of this image so to speak. I know this would not have had the same effect on me if this were in color...very nice.', '2006-01-16 13:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042852, 276007, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit portrait. I find the shadow below her hair on camera left to be a little distacting, but overall it''s a beautiful piece.</td>', 'Beautifully lit portrait. I find the shadow below her hair on camera left to be a little distacting, but overall it''s a beautiful piece.', '2006-01-16 13:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042853, 281988, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I think it''s missing a focal point.  It would be great if there were a single bird, or animal or a bare tree in the background to draw your eye to it.  I might do a single hue adjustment and "unblack" the snow to make it whiter.</td>', 'I like this, but I think it''s missing a focal point.  It would be great if there were a single bird, or animal or a bare tree in the background to draw your eye to it.  I might do a single hue adjustment and "unblack" the snow to make it whiter.', '2006-01-16 13:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042855, 277626, 24454, '<td valign="top">Stunning capture!  It is so crisp and sharp for being mid-action.</td>', 'Stunning capture!  It is so crisp and sharp for being mid-action.', '2006-01-16 13:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042856, 279330, 35804, '<td valign="top">...feel the power...this is almost otherworldly.</td>', '...feel the power...this is almost otherworldly.', '2006-01-16 13:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042857, 274791, 48245, '<td valign="top">The tree is distracting...</td>', 'The tree is distracting...', '2006-01-16 13:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042864, 276617, 6405, '<td valign="top">That would work fine with a naked female model ,this dude looks like he is forced to pose ! 5<br/> <br/>something like <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=25272" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/107/thumb/25272.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/107/thumb/25272.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/107/thumb/25272.jpg"/></a> :-)</td>', 'That would work fine with a naked female model ,this dude looks like he is forced to pose ! 5 something like  :-)', '2006-01-16 13:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042866, 274615, 24642, '<td valign="top">A very good portrait.  I like the softness and the balance between the upper and lower parts.  Good luck.</td>', 'A very good portrait.  I like the softness and the balance between the upper and lower parts.  Good luck.', '2006-01-16 13:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042869, 276713, 18450, '<td valign="top">Superb!!</td>', 'Superb!!', '2006-01-16 13:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042871, 274680, 29797, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, gorgeuous shot. A little more contrast in the dark areas and a slight bump up on the red channel saturation would make this "pop" even more. But as it is, really nice.</td>', 'Nice composition, gorgeuous shot. A little more contrast in the dark areas and a slight bump up on the red channel saturation would make this "pop" even more. But as it is, really nice.', '2006-01-16 13:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042873, 279810, 38234, '<td valign="top">The focus is good as is the DOF, this just seems to lack contrast and brightness leaving it a bit flat to me.  Maybe a diagonal composition would have give it a bit more dynamic also.</td>', 'The focus is good as is the DOF, this just seems to lack contrast and brightness leaving it a bit flat to me.  Maybe a diagonal composition would have give it a bit more dynamic also.', '2006-01-16 13:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042874, 276397, 1041, '<td valign="top">I think this image, while nice, could be stronger if you cropped more off the sky.  You have a beautiful leading line with the shore on the right, and lots of interest in the mountain range and its reflection.  The sky doesn''t add too much IMO.  Cropping it would move the waterline more toward the rule of thirds, which, makes this image stronger.  Alternatively, if you feel that is too much water, leaving the sky and cropping so that the horizon is exactly in the middle works, too.  I guess at the moment the image seems a little indecisive to me since you could go either way.  If that makes sense.</td>', 'I think this image, while nice, could be stronger if you cropped more off the sky.  You have a beautiful leading line with the shore on the right, and lots of interest in the mountain range and its reflection.  The sky doesn''t add too much IMO.  Cropping it would move the waterline more toward the rule of thirds, which, makes this image stronger.  Alternatively, if you feel that is too much water, leaving the sky and cropping so that the horizon is exactly in the middle works, too.  I guess at the moment the image seems a little indecisive to me since you could go either way.  If that makes sense.', '2006-01-16 13:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042877, 280955, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL  - this is hilarious.  Copying that black kitty, eh??  The expression really makes the shot.  I''d like to see the entire stem of the glass. Thanks for the laugh.</td>', 'ROFL  - this is hilarious.  Copying that black kitty, eh??  The expression really makes the shot.  I''d like to see the entire stem of the glass. Thanks for the laugh.', '2006-01-16 13:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042878, 279171, 35804, '<td valign="top">Ah! Talk about being in the right place at the right time! The selective desta. is just perfect for this image...nicely seen!</td>', 'Ah! Talk about being in the right place at the right time! The selective desta. is just perfect for this image...nicely seen!', '2006-01-16 13:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042882, 281716, 24454, '<td valign="top">How absolutely stunning!  That head seems to literally poke itself outside of my computer screen!  The deep, rich colors.  The xpression.  This is better than perfect!  A standout, even in a challenge like this!  10</td>', 'How absolutely stunning!  That head seems to literally poke itself outside of my computer screen!  The deep, rich colors.  The xpression.  This is better than perfect!  A standout, even in a challenge like this!  10', '2006-01-16 13:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
