(2042898, 281730, 18403, '<td valign="top">Your image has a strange embossed look, as if possibly oversharpened, but weirdness of the effect makes this a striking photo!</td>', 'Your image has a strange embossed look, as if possibly oversharpened, but weirdness of the effect makes this a striking photo!', '2006-01-16 13:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
