(2042901, 281367, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is such a striking photo.   The angle adds so much.  The focus on the subject is perfect!  Everything about it is just plain interesting!</td>', 'This is such a striking photo.   The angle adds so much.  The focus on the subject is perfect!  Everything about it is just plain interesting!', '2006-01-16 13:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
