(2043440, 281435, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love these kinds of photos, where every single little feather looks 3-dimensional!   I love the full-framed composition.  The colors.  It''s all very striking!</td>', 'I love these kinds of photos, where every single little feather looks 3-dimensional!   I love the full-framed composition.  The colors.  It''s all very striking!', '2006-01-16 15:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043441, 278007, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and tonality in this picture - nicely done.</td>', 'Nice detail and tonality in this picture - nicely done.', '2006-01-16 15:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043442, 275399, 46634, '<td valign="top">One good push, and I can get started...I just know it. I just hope that engine overhaul holds up.<br/> <br/> <br/>Nice clarity, great DoF. The ligh reflects beautifully off of the wings 7</td>', 'One good push, and I can get started...I just know it. I just hope that engine overhaul holds up.  Nice clarity, great DoF. The ligh reflects beautifully off of the wings 7', '2006-01-16 15:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
