(2043449, 281090, 42615, '<td valign="top">color on his shoulder is a little too blown out for me.</td>', 'color on his shoulder is a little too blown out for me.', '2006-01-16 15:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043450, 280701, 42615, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and arrangement.  I don''t particularly like the dark shadow of the basket underneath</td>', 'I like the concept and arrangement.  I don''t particularly like the dark shadow of the basket underneath', '2006-01-16 15:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043452, 280517, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhhhwuhhhh!!!!!That is amazing!  I love the angle of the little fellow, and the sloppy milk on his chin. .. beautiful!!!   Definitely speaks to me on an emotional level -- which is how I vote -  10</td>', 'Ohhhhhhwuhhhh!!!!!That is amazing!  I love the angle of the little fellow, and the sloppy milk on his chin. .. beautiful!!!   Definitely speaks to me on an emotional level -- which is how I vote -  10', '2006-01-16 15:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043454, 281362, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!</td>', 'Very interesting!', '2006-01-16 15:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043457, 278337, 1041, '<td valign="top">Orchids are beautiful flowers and do make great subjects.  I like that you took this outside, is it even a wild orchid?  I think your focus is what lets you down most with this shot.  I would like to b e able to see every detail in the petals and I can''t.  Overall, the colors could pop a little more, too, but that is easily fixable in post-processing.  A larger image (submit as large as you can on DPC, it often helps) would also be better.</td>', 'Orchids are beautiful flowers and do make great subjects.  I like that you took this outside, is it even a wild orchid?  I think your focus is what lets you down most with this shot.  I would like to b e able to see every detail in the petals and I can''t.  Overall, the colors could pop a little more, too, but that is easily fixable in post-processing.  A larger image (submit as large as you can on DPC, it often helps) would also be better.', '2006-01-16 15:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043459, 281090, 24454, '<td valign="top">How SAD!  Most assuredly a photo that will be treasured for a lifetime!</td>', 'How SAD!  Most assuredly a photo that will be treasured for a lifetime!', '2006-01-16 15:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043461, 276397, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  I love this place, was there a couple years ago. good luck.</td>', 'Very nice capture.  I love this place, was there a couple years ago. good luck.', '2006-01-16 15:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043462, 279171, 40019, '<td valign="top">Cool image!  Nice use of desat!  Good title - I would have missed the boy otherwise.</td>', 'Cool image!  Nice use of desat!  Good title - I would have missed the boy otherwise.', '2006-01-16 15:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043464, 281983, 24454, '<td valign="top">Amazing!   Perfect composition, pleasing from front to back, with just the right things in crystal clear focus.  I''m not usually drawn to any type of bug photo. . .but this one. . .broke the stereotype!   10</td>', 'Amazing!   Perfect composition, pleasing from front to back, with just the right things in crystal clear focus.  I''m not usually drawn to any type of bug photo. . .but this one. . .broke the stereotype!   10', '2006-01-16 15:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043471, 280732, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and symmetry.  This looks like something Itsimring would have done.  Nice image.</td>', 'Great lighting and symmetry.  This looks like something Itsimring would have done.  Nice image.', '2006-01-16 15:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043473, 275299, 47704, '<td valign="top">Ahhh yes, someone ALWAYS has to get their cat into a challenge!!  However, there aren''t enough contrasting colors to make this picture great.  It''s rather flat.  Nothing catches the eye and sucks me in.  The background behind the ears is distracting.  3</td>', 'Ahhh yes, someone ALWAYS has to get their cat into a challenge!!  However, there aren''t enough contrasting colors to make this picture great.  It''s rather flat.  Nothing catches the eye and sucks me in.  The background behind the ears is distracting.  3', '2006-01-16 15:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043474, 281836, 24454, '<td valign="top">How pretty!!!  I love the contrast of the elegant, feminine with the old, dark, rough.  She is lovely, and this is a beautiful photo.</td>', 'How pretty!!!  I love the contrast of the elegant, feminine with the old, dark, rough.  She is lovely, and this is a beautiful photo.', '2006-01-16 15:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043475, 274847, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wow.  If I came across this shot in National Geographic I''d be pausing to gaze at the page and drink in every detail.  This is fantastic.  It tells a story, I love that it is in color, yet almost monochrome, and I feel I''m right there watching this.  Definitely a top 10 contender.  Congrats!</td>', 'Wow.  If I came across this shot in National Geographic I''d be pausing to gaze at the page and drink in every detail.  This is fantastic.  It tells a story, I love that it is in color, yet almost monochrome, and I feel I''m right there watching this.  Definitely a top 10 contender.  Congrats!', '2006-01-16 15:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043476, 281481, 40019, '<td valign="top">Now this is hilarious!  Nice pic.</td>', 'Now this is hilarious!  Nice pic.', '2006-01-16 15:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
