(2043479, 281317, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yes. . .what a gorgeous morning it is!!</td>', 'Yes. . .what a gorgeous morning it is!!', '2006-01-16 15:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043480, 280366, 1041, '<td valign="top">You definitely have a top 10 contender here.  The light is fantastic, as is the location for the image ... drab and closed off and brown, what a contrast to the one lightbeam.  Guy''s position is great, too, as is the taken down board still leaning against the window.  One to be proud of!</td>', 'You definitely have a top 10 contender here.  The light is fantastic, as is the location for the image ... drab and closed off and brown, what a contrast to the one lightbeam.  Guy''s position is great, too, as is the taken down board still leaning against the window.  One to be proud of!', '2006-01-16 15:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043481, 279446, 38234, '<td valign="top">I think a rule of thirds composition would have had this score higher from me.</td>', 'I think a rule of thirds composition would have had this score higher from me.', '2006-01-16 15:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043482, 279931, 24454, '<td valign="top">Amazing lighting.  This is the perfect capture of elegance!</td>', 'Amazing lighting.  This is the perfect capture of elegance!', '2006-01-16 15:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043484, 280955, 40019, '<td valign="top">Ha, great image!  Would have been a fun one for the Greeting Card challenge as well.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Ha, great image!  Would have been a fun one for the Greeting Card challenge as well.  Nicely done.', '2006-01-16 15:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043485, 277353, 31794, '<td valign="top">this could be a beautiful image, it just needs some work..<br/>I find the reflection of the clouds really distracting, as does the white spot in the center.<br/>my monitor is calibrated I don''t know if your''s is, but I find the image rather dark, so details are missing from the forest.<br/>as for composition, I find centered images usually dull, so a little crop of the right side might help, or even crop the white thing from the bottom and make it a panorama.<br/> <br/>just my 2¢<br/> <br/>you only get a 5 this time...</td>', 'this could be a beautiful image, it just needs some work..I find the reflection of the clouds really distracting, as does the white spot in the center.my monitor is calibrated I don''t know if your''s is, but I find the image rather dark, so details are missing from the forest.as for composition, I find centered images usually dull, so a little crop of the right side might help, or even crop the white thing from the bottom and make it a panorama. just my 2¢ you only get a 5 this time...', '2006-01-16 15:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043489, 278342, 25754, '<td valign="top">a very colourful bonnett and lovely blue eye peeking out from underneath :) my eye keeps wandering to the objects behind your model. Some burning in that area would have helped.</td>', 'a very colourful bonnett and lovely blue eye peeking out from underneath :) my eye keeps wandering to the objects behind your model. Some burning in that area would have helped.', '2006-01-16 15:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043490, 282003, 47704, '<td valign="top">Wow, now this is a great picture.  I''m not sure if you put her in the chair or captured this as a candid but it''s a great capture.  When a picture catches your eye immediately I think it''s a great picture.  I didn''t have to seek out the brilliance of the picture, it found me.  10</td>', 'Wow, now this is a great picture.  I''m not sure if you put her in the chair or captured this as a candid but it''s a great capture.  When a picture catches your eye immediately I think it''s a great picture.  I didn''t have to seek out the brilliance of the picture, it found me.  10', '2006-01-16 15:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043493, 274564, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful capture!  This warms my heart to look at it.  Very well done with the sepia tones to compliment that look with those hats.   Great job!</td>', 'What a beautiful capture!  This warms my heart to look at it.  Very well done with the sepia tones to compliment that look with those hats.   Great job!', '2006-01-16 15:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043498, 281716, 42615, '<td valign="top">Darkness of the background compliments the shadows on the cat.  Eyes have a nice sharp focus.  Nice pic</td>', 'Darkness of the background compliments the shadows on the cat.  Eyes have a nice sharp focus.  Nice pic', '2006-01-16 15:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043500, 280695, 24454, '<td valign="top">What character jumps out at you from this photo!  So expertly done.  It seems as if he''s in the room with me here!</td>', 'What character jumps out at you from this photo!  So expertly done.  It seems as if he''s in the room with me here!', '2006-01-16 15:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043506, 280695, 35357, '<td valign="top">A colourful portrait of an interesting subject.  The harsh lighting suits the environment very well, I think.  Very nicely exposed.</td>', 'A colourful portrait of an interesting subject.  The harsh lighting suits the environment very well, I think.  Very nicely exposed.', '2006-01-16 15:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043510, 281743, 31794, '<td valign="top">well.. I really don''t know what to say.. even though it''s kinda funny to see old geezers comparing phones, I really doubt this is your best picture from 2005.<br/> <br/>compostion is bad, the main focus is on the phones, and they are dead center, and most leading lines in the image point to the center, so a really tight crop to put the phones on the 2/3 line would really help this image.<br/> <br/>only a 4.. better luck next time...</td>', 'well.. I really don''t know what to say.. even though it''s kinda funny to see old geezers comparing phones, I really doubt this is your best picture from 2005. compostion is bad, the main focus is on the phones, and they are dead center, and most leading lines in the image point to the center, so a really tight crop to put the phones on the 2/3 line would really help this image. only a 4.. better luck next time...', '2006-01-16 15:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043512, 280780, 46634, '<td valign="top">And God said, here are the Alps, let there come beautiful people to ski and spend money!<br/> <br/>Nice shot! love the shadows of the clouds 7</td>', 'And God said, here are the Alps, let there come beautiful people to ski and spend money! Nice shot! love the shadows of the clouds 7', '2006-01-16 15:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043515, 275196, 24454, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture.   I always try to catch them just like this, and I''m never quick enough.  That''s why I appreciate a photo like this so much!  Great job.   I love the effect of the water droplets splashing too.</td>', 'Fantastic capture.   I always try to catch them just like this, and I''m never quick enough.  That''s why I appreciate a photo like this so much!  Great job.   I love the effect of the water droplets splashing too.', '2006-01-16 15:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043520, 281973, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the colours &amp; patterns.  I''m a fan of fractals &amp; this is a great, natural representation of them.</td>', 'I like the colours & patterns.  I''m a fan of fractals & this is a great, natural representation of them.', '2006-01-16 15:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043521, 278825, 24454, '<td valign="top">That is amazing!  So professional looking.  A photo that will never grow old!</td>', 'That is amazing!  So professional looking.  A photo that will never grow old!', '2006-01-16 15:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043530, 281912, 41066, '<td valign="top">Once I got over the initial feeling of vertigo, I could only say WOW!  Great shot!</td>', 'Once I got over the initial feeling of vertigo, I could only say WOW!  Great shot!', '2006-01-16 15:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043532, 281131, 46634, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, your going to let me come out, or I will do to you what I did to this bear!<br/> <br/>Adorable! So sweet 7</td>', 'Oh yes, your going to let me come out, or I will do to you what I did to this bear! Adorable! So sweet 7', '2006-01-16 15:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043533, 281052, 31794, '<td valign="top">this is almost gorgeous, composition is great, colors are great, but I find the details from the skies have been damaged by overworking the image ,and the skies are a bit too blue since it''s a storm.. should be gray.<br/> <br/>but still a stunning image, would be better on a bad monitor ;)<br/> <br/>you get a 6 for composition and color...</td>', 'this is almost gorgeous, composition is great, colors are great, but I find the details from the skies have been damaged by overworking the image ,and the skies are a bit too blue since it''s a storm.. should be gray. but still a stunning image, would be better on a bad monitor ;) you get a 6 for composition and color...', '2006-01-16 15:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043536, 274735, 14476, '<td valign="top">Much as I like the black and white treatment you gave this nice image, the horizon tilt is just a bit much (imo - of course).</td>', 'Much as I like the black and white treatment you gave this nice image, the horizon tilt is just a bit much (imo - of course).', '2006-01-16 15:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
