(2043553, 281842, 40019, '<td valign="top">I love the clarity and sharpness of the eyes.  Great tonality and coloring overall.  I''m not so hot on the glare coming off the cheek and chin - I would have liked to have seen this softened up a bit, to provide more shadows and contours of the face. Nicely done overall!!</td>', 'I love the clarity and sharpness of the eyes.  Great tonality and coloring overall.  I''m not so hot on the glare coming off the cheek and chin - I would have liked to have seen this softened up a bit, to provide more shadows and contours of the face. Nicely done overall!!', '2006-01-16 15:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
