(2043698, 275891, 46634, '<td valign="top">We tried to tell her, but she wouldnt listen, Dancing on the Ceiling was just a song...<br/> <br/>Great image. The look in her eyes as she stares at the camera is captivating. 7</td>', 'We tried to tell her, but she wouldnt listen, Dancing on the Ceiling was just a song... Great image. The look in her eyes as she stares at the camera is captivating. 7', '2006-01-16 15:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043699, 281067, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think in this shot the colours look a bit washed out. Increasing contrast and lowering the brightness just slightly should help give the colours in the shot more vibrancy :)</td>', 'I think in this shot the colours look a bit washed out. Increasing contrast and lowering the brightness just slightly should help give the colours in the shot more vibrancy :)', '2006-01-16 15:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043700, 280419, 31794, '<td valign="top">first.. don''t take this the wrong way..<br/> <br/>this image really really needs color adjustments...<br/> <br/>composition is bad.. I can''t even see what I''m looking at, it''s way too dark and that spotlight in the lower right corner, well normally I''d say let it go, but in this image it''s the only interresting thing... sorry<br/> <br/>just my 2¢</td>', 'first.. don''t take this the wrong way.. this image really really needs color adjustments... composition is bad.. I can''t even see what I''m looking at, it''s way too dark and that spotlight in the lower right corner, well normally I''d say let it go, but in this image it''s the only interresting thing... sorry just my 2¢', '2006-01-16 15:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043701, 279966, 46634, '<td valign="top">The troll waited for the children to pass over its bridge..<br/> <br/> <br/>Beautfully captured. Just enough speed to get a nice flow. 7</td>', 'The troll waited for the children to pass over its bridge..  Beautfully captured. Just enough speed to get a nice flow. 7', '2006-01-16 15:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043702, 275478, 32111, '<td valign="top">I''m a wee bit disappointed you did so much post-processing on this shot - I think it probably spoke for itself. Anyway, I do like it and I hope you post a more natural version in your profile after the compo is over.</td>', 'I''m a wee bit disappointed you did so much post-processing on this shot - I think it probably spoke for itself. Anyway, I do like it and I hope you post a more natural version in your profile after the compo is over.', '2006-01-16 15:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043703, 275320, 46634, '<td valign="top">I told her, it didnt matter if the seat was up or down, I would still hit the target...<br/> <br/> <br/>Nice. The way the shapes reflect in the water as well as the drop 7</td>', 'I told her, it didnt matter if the seat was up or down, I would still hit the target...  Nice. The way the shapes reflect in the water as well as the drop 7', '2006-01-16 15:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043704, 275371, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the crop is too far out, I feel like I need to get in closer with the subject. There is also a lot of what seems to be wasted space at the top and on the right. I can also see signs of cloning to the right of the head. When cloning it is important to always try and avoid repeating patterns, as human brains are designed to pick up on patterns, and this was the first thing I noticed about the photo.</td>', 'I think the crop is too far out, I feel like I need to get in closer with the subject. There is also a lot of what seems to be wasted space at the top and on the right. I can also see signs of cloning to the right of the head. When cloning it is important to always try and avoid repeating patterns, as human brains are designed to pick up on patterns, and this was the first thing I noticed about the photo.', '2006-01-16 15:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043706, 275248, 38234, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I would have scored this higher had there been more room in front of the beak and top of the head - this just seems very very tight and squished to me.</td>', 'Nice shot!  I would have scored this higher had there been more room in front of the beak and top of the head - this just seems very very tight and squished to me.', '2006-01-16 15:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043707, 280561, 47704, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I''d love to try this effect.  Please post your process after voting.  9</td>', 'Beautiful.  I''d love to try this effect.  Please post your process after voting.  9', '2006-01-16 15:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043708, 281316, 24454, '<td valign="top">What an amazing photo!  I love the effect that the boat with the splashes of color add to this.  Such an amazing privilege to see these majestic animals in action like this!  I think this photo is perfect in every way!  10</td>', 'What an amazing photo!  I love the effect that the boat with the splashes of color add to this.  Such an amazing privilege to see these majestic animals in action like this!  I think this photo is perfect in every way!  10', '2006-01-16 15:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
