(2043716, 281552, 35357, '<td valign="top">A postcard shot for the cottages.  I like the saturation of the greens.  Beautiful scenery.</td>', 'A postcard shot for the cottages.  I like the saturation of the greens.  Beautiful scenery.', '2006-01-16 15:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043719, 279776, 46634, '<td valign="top">Hmm, was I really that wasted last night? I cant remember a thing<br/> <br/> <br/>Nice capture of his expression. The spot on his head bothers me and I assume those are glass reflections I see? Great image though</td>', 'Hmm, was I really that wasted last night? I cant remember a thing  Nice capture of his expression. The spot on his head bothers me and I assume those are glass reflections I see? Great image though', '2006-01-16 15:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043720, 275946, 41802, '<td valign="top">What an amazing capture.  The lighting and time of day are perfect for this shot.</td>', 'What an amazing capture.  The lighting and time of day are perfect for this shot.', '2006-01-16 15:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043721, 281529, 1041, '<td valign="top">Backlit photos are hard to do.  You have a great subject here, and an interesting angle, but due to the white clouds in the background, the bird (which should be your main subject) is severely underexposed and almost just a silhouette.  Not sure what camera you are using, if you have exposure compensation, deliberately overexpose, or use shutter-priority to achieve the same.  You''d have a much stronger photo then.</td>', 'Backlit photos are hard to do.  You have a great subject here, and an interesting angle, but due to the white clouds in the background, the bird (which should be your main subject) is severely underexposed and almost just a silhouette.  Not sure what camera you are using, if you have exposure compensation, deliberately overexpose, or use shutter-priority to achieve the same.  You''d have a much stronger photo then.', '2006-01-16 15:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043722, 281139, 47704, '<td valign="top">And yet another obligatory cat picture.  At least this one is better than the last!!  5</td>', 'And yet another obligatory cat picture.  At least this one is better than the last!!  5', '2006-01-16 15:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
