(2043791, 280782, 35357, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is an oddly compelling shot.  It''s like the year 2005 caught in a time-warp via these interesting ladies.  There is so much interesting detail to take in.  I love how the lady on the left has her serviette tucked up into her shirt!</td>', 'Wow, this is an oddly compelling shot.  It''s like the year 2005 caught in a time-warp via these interesting ladies.  There is so much interesting detail to take in.  I love how the lady on the left has her serviette tucked up into her shirt!', '2006-01-16 16:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
