(2043930, 276206, 17033, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve been a little shy with this photo. What I mean by that is I think you are too far away from the subject and perhaps distracting the viewer from it (and the textures of the wall) with the rubble and the roof. Perhaps with an ''urban'' subject like this you should look for interesting lighting (different time of day) or processing techniques (Draganisation is popular at DPC at the moment). Good luck with this.</td>', 'I think you''ve been a little shy with this photo. What I mean by that is I think you are too far away from the subject and perhaps distracting the viewer from it (and the textures of the wall) with the rubble and the roof. Perhaps with an ''urban'' subject like this you should look for interesting lighting (different time of day) or processing techniques (Draganisation is popular at DPC at the moment). Good luck with this.', '2006-01-16 16:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
