(2044007, 276537, 21362, '<td valign="top">A somewhat of a cliche shot, but for very good reason. What a great image to have to look back on. A beautiful first page for the baby book. :)<br/> <br/>I think the lighting is excellent here. I love the shading that emphasizes the fullness of her shape. My criticism would be the appearence of the elastic marks from her clothing. (I assume thats what all those little vertical lines are anyway...) She should have worn a robe for an hour or two before posing for this so those would have time to fade.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, it''s very beautiful and emotional.</td>', 'A somewhat of a cliche shot, but for very good reason. What a great image to have to look back on. A beautiful first page for the baby book. :) I think the lighting is excellent here. I love the shading that emphasizes the fullness of her shape. My criticism would be the appearence of the elastic marks from her clothing. (I assume thats what all those little vertical lines are anyway...) She should have worn a robe for an hour or two before posing for this so those would have time to fade. Otherwise, it''s very beautiful and emotional.', '2006-01-16 16:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044010, 275404, 25754, '<td valign="top">This is going to sound wrong, but my eye is drawn to that run in her stocking. The clone tool would have fixed that up :) <br/>Other than that you''ve captured a nice moment! I like the sense of motion.</td>', 'This is going to sound wrong, but my eye is drawn to that run in her stocking. The clone tool would have fixed that up :) Other than that you''ve captured a nice moment! I like the sense of motion.', '2006-01-16 16:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
