(2044124, 275612, 19978, '<td valign="top">Though technically OK, this shot comes off as very uninteresting. We can tell from her expression and the little bit of her hand that''s visible that she''s doing something, but there''s no way to know what. Your title calls attention to the red cape, but nothing in the picture really suggests an emotional hook or story to draw me in.</td>', 'Though technically OK, this shot comes off as very uninteresting. We can tell from her expression and the little bit of her hand that''s visible that she''s doing something, but there''s no way to know what. Your title calls attention to the red cape, but nothing in the picture really suggests an emotional hook or story to draw me in.', '2006-01-16 17:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044125, 275997, 19978, '<td valign="top">A fairly bland and unremarkable photo. No real subject or central element to draw the attention.</td>', 'A fairly bland and unremarkable photo. No real subject or central element to draw the attention.', '2006-01-16 17:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044126, 277181, 21430, '<td valign="top">Nice effect. Please share how you obtained this effect after the challenge is over...<br/> <br/>To me, the angle makes the image more interesting then it otherwise would be. The scene itself is an interesting contrast and matches the title nicely.<br/> <br/>Good job.</td>', 'Nice effect. Please share how you obtained this effect after the challenge is over... To me, the angle makes the image more interesting then it otherwise would be. The scene itself is an interesting contrast and matches the title nicely. Good job.', '2006-01-16 17:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044128, 280590, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait. Great eyes. THe lighting is spot on. I like the hint of reflection fro her earring is nice.  Her hair wisps over her face add to it  Gorgeous.</td>', 'Lovely portrait. Great eyes. THe lighting is spot on. I like the hint of reflection fro her earring is nice.  Her hair wisps over her face add to it  Gorgeous.', '2006-01-16 17:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044129, 277511, 28141, '<td valign="top">Nice color, but the composition is a little dull and being able to see three feet and only one head is a little confusing.</td>', 'Nice color, but the composition is a little dull and being able to see three feet and only one head is a little confusing.', '2006-01-16 17:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044130, 277431, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow amazing shot, I love the contrast of the bridal outfit and the darkness of the backdrop.</td>', 'Wow amazing shot, I love the contrast of the bridal outfit and the darkness of the backdrop.', '2006-01-16 17:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044131, 276042, 30392, '<td valign="top">great capture, but the post processing is too strong, with artifacts around the girl''s and stone''s outline</td>', 'great capture, but the post processing is too strong, with artifacts around the girl''s and stone''s outline', '2006-01-16 17:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044132, 277052, 19978, '<td valign="top">Nice snapshot but not much more. Little of interest to capture my attention and hold it. It''s also smaller than the maximum allowed. Don''t be afraid to make use of the full 640 pixels, and to use a subject that grabs the attention.</td>', 'Nice snapshot but not much more. Little of interest to capture my attention and hold it. It''s also smaller than the maximum allowed. Don''t be afraid to make use of the full 640 pixels, and to use a subject that grabs the attention.', '2006-01-16 17:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044133, 275222, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great sport photo, something we don''t see everyday.</td>', 'Great sport photo, something we don''t see everyday.', '2006-01-16 17:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044134, 277879, 30392, '<td valign="top">Ah venice.. Nice tranquil capture.</td>', 'Ah venice.. Nice tranquil capture.', '2006-01-16 17:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044135, 280457, 28141, '<td valign="top">The rock in the foreground distracts from the much more interesting scene behind it.</td>', 'The rock in the foreground distracts from the much more interesting scene behind it.', '2006-01-16 17:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044138, 275478, 19978, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this shot. The earth tones, textures and grain add an element of grit to the photo and his expression does the rest. I''m drawn to his face and eyes. The composition is genius and the processing job is brilliant. I expect to see this near the top of the challenge results!</td>', 'I absolutely love this shot. The earth tones, textures and grain add an element of grit to the photo and his expression does the rest. I''m drawn to his face and eyes. The composition is genius and the processing job is brilliant. I expect to see this near the top of the challenge results!', '2006-01-16 17:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044139, 279356, 1792, '<td valign="top">Horizon seems to slope to right.  Nice, moody shot, well-composed.</td>', 'Horizon seems to slope to right.  Nice, moody shot, well-composed.', '2006-01-16 17:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044141, 274801, 28141, '<td valign="top">A little dark, but otherwise very nice!</td>', 'A little dark, but otherwise very nice!', '2006-01-16 17:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044142, 276040, 24642, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2006-01-16 17:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044143, 279887, 30392, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, always harder than it seems to get these right. In your case the exposure is perfect! Maybe a tad oversharpened but that''s me being very picky. Good luck!</td>', 'Lovely shot, always harder than it seems to get these right. In your case the exposure is perfect! Maybe a tad oversharpened but that''s me being very picky. Good luck!', '2006-01-16 17:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044147, 278867, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice. My fav. horse of this challenge so far. I like the use of negative space. The angle from which you took it is good - you are on his level. The movement of him walking is adding to its appeal. Beautiful coloration amidst a rather neutral pallette. Gotta give this one a 9. Good luck!!!</td>', 'Very nice. My fav. horse of this challenge so far. I like the use of negative space. The angle from which you took it is good - you are on his level. The movement of him walking is adding to its appeal. Beautiful coloration amidst a rather neutral pallette. Gotta give this one a 9. Good luck!!!', '2006-01-16 17:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044149, 281747, 19978, '<td valign="top">A remarkable shot. Wonderful use of lines to lead they eye gently up the photo. The earth tones and textures are a feast for the imagination. The bicyclist is a perfect detail to tease the viewer. Congrats on a wonderful work of art.</td>', 'A remarkable shot. Wonderful use of lines to lead they eye gently up the photo. The earth tones and textures are a feast for the imagination. The bicyclist is a perfect detail to tease the viewer. Congrats on a wonderful work of art.', '2006-01-16 17:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044150, 275621, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice coloring and landscape image, I like the warmth of the shot.</td>', 'Nice coloring and landscape image, I like the warmth of the shot.', '2006-01-16 17:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044151, 278390, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh my - this encapsulates a whole little world in one image. Talk about panoramic!! Holy smokes.  The blues to aquas is perfect. I love the rich sky and the moevement of the clouds. 9 all day long!!!</td>', 'Oh my - this encapsulates a whole little world in one image. Talk about panoramic!! Holy smokes.  The blues to aquas is perfect. I love the rich sky and the moevement of the clouds. 9 all day long!!!', '2006-01-16 17:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044152, 281988, 7560, '<td valign="top">Okay- not totally sure what post processing you used. On my monitor, the snow is coming out too grey to be appealing. I''d suggest calibrating your monitor if you see the snow as white. If this was the effect you were going for, then it just doesn''t hit me quite right. I like the composition a good bit, but there''s not enough contrast in the shot. 6</td>', 'Okay- not totally sure what post processing you used. On my monitor, the snow is coming out too grey to be appealing. I''d suggest calibrating your monitor if you see the snow as white. If this was the effect you were going for, then it just doesn''t hit me quite right. I like the composition a good bit, but there''s not enough contrast in the shot. 6', '2006-01-16 17:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044153, 276521, 41802, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach, very attention demanding and a great subject.</td>', 'Interesting approach, very attention demanding and a great subject.', '2006-01-16 17:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044154, 278040, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing amazing work of art.  If I could vote twice I would give it two tens.  I''m sure it used to be in my favorites but I cant remember who''s image it is.  I love the light and shadow on her calfs, the awkward position of her toes, the relaxed hang of her fingers, the underwear, the headless anomimity, the unusual beackgroudn color, the grain.  This might be my most favorite picture EVER!</td>', 'This is an amazing amazing work of art.  If I could vote twice I would give it two tens.  I''m sure it used to be in my favorites but I cant remember who''s image it is.  I love the light and shadow on her calfs, the awkward position of her toes, the relaxed hang of her fingers, the underwear, the headless anomimity, the unusual beackgroudn color, the grain.  This might be my most favorite picture EVER!', '2006-01-16 17:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044156, 281451, 2764, '<td valign="top">So exquisite!  Testbook composition leading the viewer into the photo with the stream.  What magic is uo there?  All the trees are bending to look, the wise old log is pointing that way.  I love the contrast of the small rocks int he lower right with the misty trees of the upper left.  I love the way that the separation between earth and sky disappears at the same point the stream disappears- the image wants me to leave behind the myriad details of daily life (stones) and follow the dreams in the distance.  Ok, I will.  10</td>', 'So exquisite!  Testbook composition leading the viewer into the photo with the stream.  What magic is uo there?  All the trees are bending to look, the wise old log is pointing that way.  I love the contrast of the small rocks int he lower right with the misty trees of the upper left.  I love the way that the separation between earth and sky disappears at the same point the stream disappears- the image wants me to leave behind the myriad details of daily life (stones) and follow the dreams in the distance.  Ok, I will.  10', '2006-01-16 17:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044157, 278697, 2764, '<td valign="top">Wow - such detail, so much green.  This should do well with the voters (like me) who are currently facing a bleak colorless winter.  I love the little bit of blue in the corner, it reminds me that this is a leaf, growing under the blue sky, ad not just an abstract of branching lines.</td>', 'Wow - such detail, so much green.  This should do well with the voters (like me) who are currently facing a bleak colorless winter.  I love the little bit of blue in the corner, it reminds me that this is a leaf, growing under the blue sky, ad not just an abstract of branching lines.', '2006-01-16 17:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044158, 276397, 19978, '<td valign="top">Majestic and sweeping. The way you''ve placed the lake shore on the right side of the image creates a wonderful line leading up to the distant peaks. I might have tried to knock a little of the haze out with a curves adjustment, but maybe you were going for that moody, foggy feel. Either way, you''ve done a wonderful job, making this picture!</td>', 'Majestic and sweeping. The way you''ve placed the lake shore on the right side of the image creates a wonderful line leading up to the distant peaks. I might have tried to knock a little of the haze out with a curves adjustment, but maybe you were going for that moody, foggy feel. Either way, you''ve done a wonderful job, making this picture!', '2006-01-16 17:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044160, 281730, 2764, '<td valign="top">Could you ask your friends to step out of the image and leave the landscape and the lonely guy up on the ridge?  It would, of course be a differnt image.  I find it disconcerting that I can''t figure out what the people are doing and that detracts from the imapct the scene should have.  It SHOULD be a 10 but because they make me stare at them instead of admiring the scene it might be a nine.  Are  they taking pictures of you taking pictures of them?  Does she have a teddy bear in her arms? Is it a little dog?  Is she even a she?  I am forgetting to look at the spectacular clouds, the wonderful contrasts of textures, the subtle colors, the patterns of the earth.  Does he have a camera also? or a gun?  You see how distracting it is?</td>', 'Could you ask your friends to step out of the image and leave the landscape and the lonely guy up on the ridge?  It would, of course be a differnt image.  I find it disconcerting that I can''t figure out what the people are doing and that detracts from the imapct the scene should have.  It SHOULD be a 10 but because they make me stare at them instead of admiring the scene it might be a nine.  Are  they taking pictures of you taking pictures of them?  Does she have a teddy bear in her arms? Is it a little dog?  Is she even a she?  I am forgetting to look at the spectacular clouds, the wonderful contrasts of textures, the subtle colors, the patterns of the earth.  Does he have a camera also? or a gun?  You see how distracting it is?', '2006-01-16 17:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044162, 278864, 48245, '<td valign="top">I think this would make a better shot if it didn''t have the lights in the mountain... just the city and the water reflecting...</td>', 'I think this would make a better shot if it didn''t have the lights in the mountain... just the city and the water reflecting...', '2006-01-16 17:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044163, 281100, 2764, '<td valign="top">Wow- the splash looks like a little angel in her hands!  I LOVE parts of this image but something about the composition as a whole doesn''t work as well as its parts.  The colors are delightfully subtle.  The background tile floor is especially intriuing witht the water over it, I wish there were more of ot in the shot to balance the weight of the little girl. I love the way the colors of her bathing suit are matched but the reflections on the water.  The leading lines (arms, legs and tiles) all point to the angel which is in a good rule-of-thirds spot.  I can''t quite figure out what makes this a 7 shot instead of a 10.</td>', 'Wow- the splash looks like a little angel in her hands!  I LOVE parts of this image but something about the composition as a whole doesn''t work as well as its parts.  The colors are delightfully subtle.  The background tile floor is especially intriuing witht the water over it, I wish there were more of ot in the shot to balance the weight of the little girl. I love the way the colors of her bathing suit are matched but the reflections on the water.  The leading lines (arms, legs and tiles) all point to the angel which is in a good rule-of-thirds spot.  I can''t quite figure out what makes this a 7 shot instead of a 10.', '2006-01-16 17:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044164, 279839, 28141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  However, having the stand of trees centered ruins the composition in my opinion.  It almost makes the trees distracting.  Cropping a little of the right and maybe a tad off the bottom would make this so much more dynamic.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  However, having the stand of trees centered ruins the composition in my opinion.  It almost makes the trees distracting.  Cropping a little of the right and maybe a tad off the bottom would make this so much more dynamic.', '2006-01-16 17:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044165, 274801, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great re-enactment! WOW The colors are spectacular. 8</td>', 'Great re-enactment! WOW The colors are spectacular. 8', '2006-01-16 17:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044166, 274844, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool?  Looks downright cold!</td>', 'Cool?  Looks downright cold!', '2006-01-16 17:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044169, 277561, 2764, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture - I love how the field and sky have similar colors and contrasting textures.</td>', 'Beautiful picture - I love how the field and sky have similar colors and contrasting textures.', '2006-01-16 17:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044170, 281955, 2764, '<td valign="top">Nice blue feathers!  Clever macro - I wonder if a tighter crop wold have made the image more of an abstract, since we cant see the bird anyways, but I don''t see a god alternative.  the lower right seems to mute the color overall, just by covering up a little of the gray makes the blue bluer.  Something to learn next is how to clone out the white spots.</td>', 'Nice blue feathers!  Clever macro - I wonder if a tighter crop wold have made the image more of an abstract, since we cant see the bird anyways, but I don''t see a god alternative.  the lower right seems to mute the color overall, just by covering up a little of the gray makes the blue bluer.  Something to learn next is how to clone out the white spots.', '2006-01-16 17:14:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2044172, 275452, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice lion photo from an unusual angle. I like the DoF here too, nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice lion photo from an unusual angle. I like the DoF here too, nice shot.', '2006-01-16 17:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044174, 277676, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective.  There is so much texture and detail to this shot.  Amazing clarity.  Beautiful. This should do well!!! 9</td>', 'Excellent perspective.  There is so much texture and detail to this shot.  Amazing clarity.  Beautiful. This should do well!!! 9', '2006-01-16 17:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044176, 278744, 2764, '<td valign="top">Ewww. More pixels please.  Read the tutorial on sizing photos for DPC- undersized photos never score well.</td>', 'Ewww. More pixels please.  Read the tutorial on sizing photos for DPC- undersized photos never score well.', '2006-01-16 17:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044177, 280585, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like this</td>', 'I like this', '2006-01-16 17:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044178, 277676, 16488, '<td valign="top">Wow! I look at this and think, "My mother would absolutely love that!" It is a favorite place to visit whenever I''ve been in Maine. The light and texture, the extrme angle of view, just wonderful how it all works together! Superb! (...and, thank you for sharing it.)</td>', 'Wow! I look at this and think, "My mother would absolutely love that!" It is a favorite place to visit whenever I''ve been in Maine. The light and texture, the extrme angle of view, just wonderful how it all works together! Superb! (...and, thank you for sharing it.)', '2006-01-16 17:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044179, 278315, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great eyes, you''ve really captured the look perfectly. I''m unsure about cropping thru the mouth though, seems slightly awkward.</td>', 'Great eyes, you''ve really captured the look perfectly. I''m unsure about cropping thru the mouth though, seems slightly awkward.', '2006-01-16 17:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044180, 281214, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow something from the deep blue.  This is amazing the movement of the tentacles is prefect.</td>', 'Wow something from the deep blue.  This is amazing the movement of the tentacles is prefect.', '2006-01-16 17:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044181, 279755, 1792, '<td valign="top">Composition seems a little off and the bright white wall right in front is sort of overwhelming.  Otherwise, nice, crisp colors.</td>', 'Composition seems a little off and the bright white wall right in front is sort of overwhelming.  Otherwise, nice, crisp colors.', '2006-01-16 17:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044182, 276519, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I like the background, makes a really good change from the usual plain colours. The composition and lighting are really well done too.</td>', 'Very nice shot. I like the background, makes a really good change from the usual plain colours. The composition and lighting are really well done too.', '2006-01-16 17:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044184, 280021, 1827, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit and composed.</td>', 'Beautifully lit and composed.', '2006-01-16 17:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044185, 280585, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent B&amp;W. I love the contrast here, fantastic shot.</td>', 'Excellent B&W. I love the contrast here, fantastic shot.', '2006-01-16 17:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044186, 275787, 15711, '<td valign="top">THIS IS FAB!!!! ha ha ha ha  What a nice surprise. I hope it does well because I think it deserves a high placement. Great detail. Excellent capture. 9</td>', 'THIS IS FAB!!!! ha ha ha ha  What a nice surprise. I hope it does well because I think it deserves a high placement. Great detail. Excellent capture. 9', '2006-01-16 17:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044187, 280808, 41802, '<td valign="top">Amazing work, the clarity is amazing. I really like the simple yellow background.</td>', 'Amazing work, the clarity is amazing. I really like the simple yellow background.', '2006-01-16 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044190, 281716, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is great, I love the DoF and the nice rich colours.</td>', 'This is great, I love the DoF and the nice rich colours.', '2006-01-16 17:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044192, 282005, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow one of the best landscapes I have seen so far.  The purple coloring is exceptional.</td>', 'Wow one of the best landscapes I have seen so far.  The purple coloring is exceptional.', '2006-01-16 17:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044193, 281265, 15711, '<td valign="top">Be-auuuuuutiful! My fav. skyline picture by far.  The cool blues to grays to blacks to whites.  Stellar.  10 from me.</td>', 'Be-auuuuuutiful! My fav. skyline picture by far.  The cool blues to grays to blacks to whites.  Stellar.  10 from me.', '2006-01-16 17:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044195, 275725, 28141, '<td valign="top">I honestly don''t find this sort of extreme high key all that appealing, particularly for a human subject.  I also don''t like some of the yellowish orange tones that are left, particularly below the lips.  It''s a brave entry, good luck!</td>', 'I honestly don''t find this sort of extreme high key all that appealing, particularly for a human subject.  I also don''t like some of the yellowish orange tones that are left, particularly below the lips.  It''s a brave entry, good luck!', '2006-01-16 17:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044196, 280136, 34888, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Love the DOF here</td>', 'Awesome. Love the DOF here', '2006-01-16 17:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044197, 280561, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like the high contrast treatment but I think it''s a bit too dark at the bottom.</td>', 'I really like the high contrast treatment but I think it''s a bit too dark at the bottom.', '2006-01-16 17:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044198, 278461, 7560, '<td valign="top">I like the cropping choice here. It''s interesting and captivating.</td>', 'I like the cropping choice here. It''s interesting and captivating.', '2006-01-16 17:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044200, 276521, 16488, '<td valign="top">I rarely like cemetary shots despite the fact I''ve been known to take them. I like that you decided to take it from behind the stones so no names are shown--it gives it a timeless and placeless (if you will) feel. The selective desaturation is so appropriate here. Nicely done!</td>', 'I rarely like cemetary shots despite the fact I''ve been known to take them. I like that you decided to take it from behind the stones so no names are shown--it gives it a timeless and placeless (if you will) feel. The selective desaturation is so appropriate here. Nicely done!', '2006-01-16 17:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044201, 280198, 34888, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2006-01-16 17:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044203, 281602, 48245, '<td valign="top">it''s in need of some rotation...</td>', 'it''s in need of some rotation...', '2006-01-16 17:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044204, 281482, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful scenery. Nice sky! I wonder if you saturated the colors a bit more, if it wouldn''t really add MORE pop!! I''m a big fan of rich sweeping color. Hope this does well for you!!! Good luck. ;~D</td>', 'Really beautiful scenery. Nice sky! I wonder if you saturated the colors a bit more, if it wouldn''t really add MORE pop!! I''m a big fan of rich sweeping color. Hope this does well for you!!! Good luck. ;~D', '2006-01-16 17:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044205, 280940, 2780, '<td valign="top">Lovely emotion shown in this shot.</td>', 'Lovely emotion shown in this shot.', '2006-01-16 17:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044207, 278093, 19978, '<td valign="top">Too, too small. Please make use of all the 640 pixels you are allowed to use. It''s difficult to tell what your shot is. I can see trees and foliage, but beyond that, it''s really tough to tell what I''m looking at.</td>', 'Too, too small. Please make use of all the 640 pixels you are allowed to use. It''s difficult to tell what your shot is. I can see trees and foliage, but beyond that, it''s really tough to tell what I''m looking at.', '2006-01-16 17:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044208, 279044, 15711, '<td valign="top">I hope a newspaper got ahold of this when all of that protest was going on.  It makes quite a poignant statement.  Thanks for sharing it.</td>', 'I hope a newspaper got ahold of this when all of that protest was going on.  It makes quite a poignant statement.  Thanks for sharing it.', '2006-01-16 17:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044209, 281832, 28141, '<td valign="top">I think this would be a lot better without the dog.  It''s a perfectly nice dog, but it doesn''t really add anything to the impact of the image, so it just seems out of place.</td>', 'I think this would be a lot better without the dog.  It''s a perfectly nice dog, but it doesn''t really add anything to the impact of the image, so it just seems out of place.', '2006-01-16 17:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044210, 276787, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love the gothic feel here.</td>', 'I love the gothic feel here.', '2006-01-16 17:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044212, 281883, 2780, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the post-processing here, it''s like it''s been posterized or something, just looks a bit odd.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the post-processing here, it''s like it''s been posterized or something, just looks a bit odd.', '2006-01-16 17:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044217, 274852, 26313, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad the mountain isn''t a little more visible, as it certainly figures large in the identity of this place. Nice composition though.</td>', 'It''s too bad the mountain isn''t a little more visible, as it certainly figures large in the identity of this place. Nice composition though.', '2006-01-16 17:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044223, 282002, 2780, '<td valign="top">Hehe cute shot. I think the brightness is too high, maybe bring it down a little bit.</td>', 'Hehe cute shot. I think the brightness is too high, maybe bring it down a little bit.', '2006-01-16 17:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044226, 276207, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow what an amazing shot.  The coloring is magically looking.</td>', 'Wow what an amazing shot.  The coloring is magically looking.', '2006-01-16 17:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044230, 276791, 28141, '<td valign="top">For the most part, this is a great shot.  My only complaint is the out of focus bangs/forehead.  Not sure if that''s a matter of depth of field or what, but somehow, since the rest of her face is in decent focus, it makes it look like there''s some kind of smudge or something on the lens.  Very out of place.</td>', 'For the most part, this is a great shot.  My only complaint is the out of focus bangs/forehead.  Not sure if that''s a matter of depth of field or what, but somehow, since the rest of her face is in decent focus, it makes it look like there''s some kind of smudge or something on the lens.  Very out of place.', '2006-01-16 17:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
