(2044397, 281894, 15711, '<td valign="top">I remember this.  Still love its poignant sadness. Love the silvery tones of the metal and sky.   It''s interesting. The lines and angles of the window, door opening and the fallen down metal structure are softened by the bloowy clouds and waving grasses. Very nice indeed. Different from the usual landscape. 9</td>', 'I remember this.  Still love its poignant sadness. Love the silvery tones of the metal and sky.   It''s interesting. The lines and angles of the window, door opening and the fallen down metal structure are softened by the bloowy clouds and waving grasses. Very nice indeed. Different from the usual landscape. 9', '2006-01-16 17:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044398, 279722, 4793, '<td valign="top">At first glance I thought to dark, but it has nice dreamy look to it.</td>', 'At first glance I thought to dark, but it has nice dreamy look to it.', '2006-01-16 17:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044399, 278876, 1792, '<td valign="top">Lighthouse seems too white.  Composition might be enhanced by cropping vertically with less stuff to either side of lighthouse but not centering the lighthouse.</td>', 'Lighthouse seems too white.  Composition might be enhanced by cropping vertically with less stuff to either side of lighthouse but not centering the lighthouse.', '2006-01-16 17:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044402, 279614, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice high key portrait. I think having the blacks a little blacker, rather than grey as they are now, would improve the shot''s impact somewhat though.</td>', 'Nice high key portrait. I think having the blacks a little blacker, rather than grey as they are now, would improve the shot''s impact somewhat though.', '2006-01-16 17:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
