(2044407, 274718, 15711, '<td valign="top">This could as easily be in a book form 1893 as today.  Beautiful capture. Every crevice and line of his face is shown in detail. The post editing filter is wonderful. Great image for sure. 9</td>', 'This could as easily be in a book form 1893 as today.  Beautiful capture. Every crevice and line of his face is shown in detail. The post editing filter is wonderful. Great image for sure. 9', '2006-01-16 17:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
