(2044523, 275932, 41794, '<td valign="top">Making room for the next meal I guess? Regardless...this is a great shot of nature in action. Vivid color, great detail..nice "stop action". Love this shot.</td>', 'Making room for the next meal I guess? Regardless...this is a great shot of nature in action. Vivid color, great detail..nice "stop action". Love this shot.', '2006-01-16 18:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
