(2045128, 281778, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love those reds and pinks that are very vibrant in this candid photo of this (Bolivian or Peruvian?) woman. And to make the composition interesting is the juxtaposition of two ''cultures'': one is the south american culture with the woman dressed in the native costume and the other is the red brick wall advertising a bit of americana, Coca-Cola. I have two critiques on improving this photo. The first is to crop out the bit of street that you see on the left hand side of the composition. It adds nothing to the overall composition - in fact it distracts attention away from the main focus. The second is to see if you could get your model/subject to pose a tad more relaxed. It appears here that she is a little too nervous to pose for the camera; she is a bit too wooden. Hmmm, it maybe that the culture might still hold to the ideas that by taking a picture you are capturing there soul which would explain her unease.</td>', 'Love those reds and pinks that are very vibrant in this candid photo of this (Bolivian or Peruvian?) woman. And to make the composition interesting is the juxtaposition of two ''cultures'': one is the south american culture with the woman dressed in the native costume and the other is the red brick wall advertising a bit of americana, Coca-Cola. I have two critiques on improving this photo. The first is to crop out the bit of street that you see on the left hand side of the composition. It adds nothing to the overall composition - in fact it distracts attention away from the main focus. The second is to see if you could get your model/subject to pose a tad more relaxed. It appears here that she is a little too nervous to pose for the camera; she is a bit too wooden. Hmmm, it maybe that the culture might still hold to the ideas that by taking a picture you are capturing there soul which would explain her unease.', '2006-01-16 20:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045131, 275177, 18624, '<td valign="top">Can''t say anything but this is a beautiful shot.  Everything''s right.</td>', 'Can''t say anything but this is a beautiful shot.  Everything''s right.', '2006-01-16 20:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
