(2045552, 276040, 19978, '<td valign="top">Some of the best entries to this challenge are people and your photo stands out from the pack. This guy has one heckuva lot of character and personality and you''ve captured it with this shot. Wonderful crop too. Chopping his hat and forehead really draws my eyes back again and again to this delightfully thick and scratched glasses. There''s just enough eye visible to assure me that his smile is genuine and pleased. A wonderful find!</td>', 'Some of the best entries to this challenge are people and your photo stands out from the pack. This guy has one heckuva lot of character and personality and you''ve captured it with this shot. Wonderful crop too. Chopping his hat and forehead really draws my eyes back again and again to this delightfully thick and scratched glasses. There''s just enough eye visible to assure me that his smile is genuine and pleased. A wonderful find!', '2006-01-16 22:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
