(2046395, 277676, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome image! Very, very strong composition. The rugged, sweeping foreground leads my eye very nicely to the lighthouse, with a lot of interest on the way. The lighting is beautiful, that with the white of the building against all the predominant neutral tones really make the subject stand out strongly. Very well done, great entry for this challenge :-)</td>', 'This is an awesome image! Very, very strong composition. The rugged, sweeping foreground leads my eye very nicely to the lighthouse, with a lot of interest on the way. The lighting is beautiful, that with the white of the building against all the predominant neutral tones really make the subject stand out strongly. Very well done, great entry for this challenge :-)', '2006-01-17 01:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046396, 281383, 37252, '<td valign="top">as much as I love the flag and what she stands for - this lacks pop. Might try bumping up the saturations.</td>', 'as much as I love the flag and what she stands for - this lacks pop. Might try bumping up the saturations.', '2006-01-17 01:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
