(2047194, 274696, 11738, '<td valign="top">Those beautiful eyes could have been lightened considerably to add more punch to the image.</td>', 'Those beautiful eyes could have been lightened considerably to add more punch to the image.', '2006-01-17 08:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047206, 276649, 11738, '<td valign="top">Focus seems quite off on this one.  Village in the distance is quite blurry.  Nice colours though.</td>', 'Focus seems quite off on this one.  Village in the distance is quite blurry.  Nice colours though.', '2006-01-17 08:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047212, 280712, 11738, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if it''s an illusion due to image composition or the actual case, but this image feels like it''s leaning towards the right quite a bit.  I also find it a bit funny that you entitled your image "Serenity" and typed it in ALL CAPITALS, as if you are shouting the title out.</td>', 'I''m not sure if it''s an illusion due to image composition or the actual case, but this image feels like it''s leaning towards the right quite a bit.  I also find it a bit funny that you entitled your image "Serenity" and typed it in ALL CAPITALS, as if you are shouting the title out.', '2006-01-17 08:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047220, 281857, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think it detracts from the impact to have the background look so fake.</td>', 'I think it detracts from the impact to have the background look so fake.', '2006-01-17 08:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047221, 274863, 46634, '<td valign="top">As she went to meet him by the lake, in her mind she realized, he would not show.<br/> <br/>Nice capture. Very peaceful. I think (opinion) that a crop that cut the tree right down the middle would have added even more feeling to the image, still a nice shot.</td>', 'As she went to meet him by the lake, in her mind she realized, he would not show. Nice capture. Very peaceful. I think (opinion) that a crop that cut the tree right down the middle would have added even more feeling to the image, still a nice shot.', '2006-01-17 08:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047223, 281938, 46634, '<td valign="top">can you just ship this to my house? Appreciate it ;-)</td>', 'can you just ship this to my house? Appreciate it ;-)', '2006-01-17 08:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047224, 276545, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like where all the eyes are pointing. It''s like a composition (or choreography) of glances.</td>', 'I like where all the eyes are pointing. It''s like a composition (or choreography) of glances.', '2006-01-17 08:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047225, 275621, 46634, '<td valign="top">Take a long walk off a short...<br/> <br/> <br/>Nice imagery. It appears to be an old dock with stories of its own.</td>', 'Take a long walk off a short...  Nice imagery. It appears to be an old dock with stories of its own.', '2006-01-17 08:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047228, 281582, 46634, '<td valign="top">Are we there yet?<br/> <br/>This is surely grandpa with the boys. Love those old cars as you can only imagine the stories they could tell if they could talk. Nice black and white conversion too, it adds to the picture greatly.</td>', 'Are we there yet? This is surely grandpa with the boys. Love those old cars as you can only imagine the stories they could tell if they could talk. Nice black and white conversion too, it adds to the picture greatly.', '2006-01-17 08:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047231, 281192, 50695, '<td valign="top">that yellowish light on the left is remarkably distracting, not in a good way. I would have thought this was a black and white photo if not for that.</td>', 'that yellowish light on the left is remarkably distracting, not in a good way. I would have thought this was a black and white photo if not for that.', '2006-01-17 08:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047234, 279318, 46634, '<td valign="top">Sometimes not being a rose is a good thing.<br/> <br/> <br/>Beautiful image. Nice DoF. The softening effect makes it feel inviting and warm, but yet it remains cool and refreshing.</td>', 'Sometimes not being a rose is a good thing.  Beautiful image. Nice DoF. The softening effect makes it feel inviting and warm, but yet it remains cool and refreshing.', '2006-01-17 09:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047236, 279985, 50034, '<td valign="top">Haaaakkk...HHhaaakkkk......!  Hairball!  Hairball!<br/>We have three cats at our house...Can you tell?  :)</td>', 'Haaaakkk...HHhaaakkkk......!  Hairball!  Hairball!We have three cats at our house...Can you tell?  :)', '2006-01-17 09:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047238, 278462, 11738, '<td valign="top">Cool image, but too orange for my taste.  It also seems that the camera was leaning towards the right when the image was taken: all the vertical lines in the ruin lean to the right.  Those branches popping up into the sky on the right edge are also a distraction.</td>', 'Cool image, but too orange for my taste.  It also seems that the camera was leaning towards the right when the image was taken: all the vertical lines in the ruin lean to the right.  Those branches popping up into the sky on the right edge are also a distraction.', '2006-01-17 09:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047240, 277932, 2780, '<td valign="top">A nicely composed shot, however I feel the image is too flat, and it needs some contrast added to it to get the blacks actually black, and to make the skin tone variations show up better. Also it would be wise to use the full 640px limit in the future :)</td>', 'A nicely composed shot, however I feel the image is too flat, and it needs some contrast added to it to get the blacks actually black, and to make the skin tone variations show up better. Also it would be wise to use the full 640px limit in the future :)', '2006-01-17 09:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047241, 279465, 46634, '<td valign="top">Joey realized that writing your name in the snow isnt such a good idea on a date.<br/> <br/> <br/>Wow to capture a rainbow in such clarity is no easy task. Nicely done. I love the way it captures your eye against the white foreground, now if we could just get rid of those distracting people ;-)~</td>', 'Joey realized that writing your name in the snow isnt such a good idea on a date.  Wow to capture a rainbow in such clarity is no easy task. Nicely done. I love the way it captures your eye against the white foreground, now if we could just get rid of those distracting people ;-)~', '2006-01-17 09:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047242, 274718, 50695, '<td valign="top">the hat adds so much to the composition.</td>', 'the hat adds so much to the composition.', '2006-01-17 09:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047243, 274647, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, I like how all the lines draw a viewers gase into the middle.</td>', 'Very nice shot, I like how all the lines draw a viewers gase into the middle.', '2006-01-17 09:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047245, 275508, 50695, '<td valign="top">amazing reflection.</td>', 'amazing reflection.', '2006-01-17 09:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047246, 277617, 2780, '<td valign="top">A well exposed water photo, although I think it would better with a slightly slower shutter speed so that the water was even smoother.</td>', 'A well exposed water photo, although I think it would better with a slightly slower shutter speed so that the water was even smoother.', '2006-01-17 09:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047247, 281914, 46634, '<td valign="top">"Oh yes", the Grinch thought gazing down on Whoville "there shall be no Christmas this year"<br/> <br/>Great shot.Love the way you captured the snow of the mountain but then the view of the nice green valley below contrasting against it.</td>', '"Oh yes", the Grinch thought gazing down on Whoville "there shall be no Christmas this year" Great shot.Love the way you captured the snow of the mountain but then the view of the nice green valley below contrasting against it.', '2006-01-17 09:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047249, 275713, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice crystal clear reflections! I feel that the bottom grass is a distraction though.</td>', 'Nice crystal clear reflections! I feel that the bottom grass is a distraction though.', '2006-01-17 09:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047252, 274981, 45764, '<td valign="top">Once again great shot!  I wanted to know where one of my favorites went.  So I will just have to add it all over again.</td>', 'Once again great shot!  I wanted to know where one of my favorites went.  So I will just have to add it all over again.', '2006-01-17 09:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047253, 277435, 46634, '<td valign="top">Now we know who stole all the crazy straws at Chuck E Cheese.<br/> <br/>Love the contrasting colors. This image takes you back to the early childhood days and the fun that came along with them.</td>', 'Now we know who stole all the crazy straws at Chuck E Cheese. Love the contrasting colors. This image takes you back to the early childhood days and the fun that came along with them.', '2006-01-17 09:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047254, 280726, 2780, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit over contrasty to me, but it''s a nice macro. I think the composition positions the butterfly a bit too close to the bottom of the frame though.</td>', 'Seems a bit over contrasty to me, but it''s a nice macro. I think the composition positions the butterfly a bit too close to the bottom of the frame though.', '2006-01-17 09:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047256, 274643, 11854, '<td valign="top">Very emotive. Excellent title. I really love this. 10</td>', 'Very emotive. Excellent title. I really love this. 10', '2006-01-17 09:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047257, 277201, 2780, '<td valign="top">For some reason this doesn''t look natural to me. Maybe it''s because the sea is such a different colour to the sky, which it''s supposed to be reflecting. Also I think this photo is missing a focal point.</td>', 'For some reason this doesn''t look natural to me. Maybe it''s because the sea is such a different colour to the sky, which it''s supposed to be reflecting. Also I think this photo is missing a focal point.', '2006-01-17 09:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047260, 280517, 11854, '<td valign="top">So precious! The milk really stands out on the mouth. Great lighting. 10</td>', 'So precious! The milk really stands out on the mouth. Great lighting. 10', '2006-01-17 09:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047261, 275197, 46634, '<td valign="top">Gazing out upon the ocean, Christopher Columbus was sure he would find a McDonalds on the other side.<br/> <br/> <br/>Nice depth, beautiful rich colors. Looks like a great "thinking" spot</td>', 'Gazing out upon the ocean, Christopher Columbus was sure he would find a McDonalds on the other side.  Nice depth, beautiful rich colors. Looks like a great "thinking" spot', '2006-01-17 09:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047262, 280705, 2780, '<td valign="top">The photo seems a bit flat to me, have you tried adjusting the levels to increase contrast?</td>', 'The photo seems a bit flat to me, have you tried adjusting the levels to increase contrast?', '2006-01-17 09:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047264, 275320, 11854, '<td valign="top">The drop almost looks like a fingerprint. Very detailed. I love it.</td>', 'The drop almost looks like a fingerprint. Very detailed. I love it.', '2006-01-17 09:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047265, 281760, 2780, '<td valign="top">Despite the colours seeming a bit flat this is a good macro. I think maybe a slightly wider DoF to get the front arms in focus would improve it.</td>', 'Despite the colours seeming a bit flat this is a good macro. I think maybe a slightly wider DoF to get the front arms in focus would improve it.', '2006-01-17 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047266, 279722, 11854, '<td valign="top">This looks like something out of a fantasy. Beautiful. Perfection! 10</td>', 'This looks like something out of a fantasy. Beautiful. Perfection! 10', '2006-01-17 09:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047269, 277249, 11854, '<td valign="top">Such crisp detail. Absoutely beautiful! 10</td>', 'Such crisp detail. Absoutely beautiful! 10', '2006-01-17 09:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047271, 280022, 46634, '<td valign="top">Little Lily Tucker decided today would be a great day to run away. But as she jolted across the field she realized she couldnt do it, it would upset mommy too much.<br/> <br/> <br/>Such a sweet capture. Softness adds to the image and the desat tends to accent it nicely as well.</td>', 'Little Lily Tucker decided today would be a great day to run away. But as she jolted across the field she realized she couldnt do it, it would upset mommy too much.  Such a sweet capture. Softness adds to the image and the desat tends to accent it nicely as well.', '2006-01-17 09:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047272, 281896, 45945, '<td valign="top">Best of 2005 indeed</td>', 'Best of 2005 indeed', '2006-01-17 09:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
