(2047462, 275483, 43774, '<td valign="top">Horizon looks tilted.</td>', 'Horizon looks tilted.', '2006-01-17 10:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047466, 280701, 46634, '<td valign="top">Look Mr. Tumnus! Its the lamp post. This should lead me back to the wardrobe!!<br/> <br/> <br/>Nice color contrast between the lamp, the flowers and the sky. It really makes the image pop!</td>', 'Look Mr. Tumnus! Its the lamp post. This should lead me back to the wardrobe!!  Nice color contrast between the lamp, the flowers and the sky. It really makes the image pop!', '2006-01-17 10:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047467, 279722, 31443, '<td valign="top">Like a painting! Nice..</td>', 'Like a painting! Nice..', '2006-01-17 10:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047470, 277089, 10390, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, good composition. The person there looks like a little toy, the surroundings is much bigger than I would have thought if the person wouldn''t be there. Nice work.</td>', 'I really like this photo, good composition. The person there looks like a little toy, the surroundings is much bigger than I would have thought if the person wouldn''t be there. Nice work.', '2006-01-17 10:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047472, 278122, 46634, '<td valign="top">Robert E. Lee will never surrender!<br/> <br/>Beautiful image. I love the way the sky is reflecting off of the canon. Its a "reflection" on the past.</td>', 'Robert E. Lee will never surrender! Beautiful image. I love the way the sky is reflecting off of the canon. Its a "reflection" on the past.', '2006-01-17 10:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047474, 280550, 31443, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t be able to tell except for the teeth, to bad he seems so young and not bad looking..</td>', 'Wouldn''t be able to tell except for the teeth, to bad he seems so young and not bad looking..', '2006-01-17 10:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047476, 281265, 30772, '<td valign="top">WOW...I mean seriously, WOW</td>', 'WOW...I mean seriously, WOW', '2006-01-17 10:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047477, 275478, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interesting. His eyes are amazing, very intense. I have never been a fan of this type of processing, though. It''s just too much and over done, giving a plastic like appearance to the photo.</td>', 'Interesting. His eyes are amazing, very intense. I have never been a fan of this type of processing, though. It''s just too much and over done, giving a plastic like appearance to the photo.', '2006-01-17 10:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047478, 277445, 36981, '<td valign="top">I don''t remember this image from my initial sort, and I can''t imagine why not.  It''s very beautiful!  I love the range of tones and the composition.</td>', 'I don''t remember this image from my initial sort, and I can''t imagine why not.  It''s very beautiful!  I love the range of tones and the composition.', '2006-01-17 10:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047482, 274764, 10390, '<td valign="top">great work on this photo, if the expression of the girl''s face would be "better" then this photo would be outstanding!</td>', 'great work on this photo, if the expression of the girl''s face would be "better" then this photo would be outstanding!', '2006-01-17 10:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047484, 275713, 30772, '<td valign="top">fantastic composition and color</td>', 'fantastic composition and color', '2006-01-17 10:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047485, 281875, 35739, '<td valign="top">What is it?</td>', 'What is it?', '2006-01-17 10:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047487, 281321, 34413, '<td valign="top">A little too hazy but water effect was captured nicely.</td>', 'A little too hazy but water effect was captured nicely.', '2006-01-17 10:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047488, 279684, 46634, '<td valign="top">It had been a hard summer for the man on 57th street, but nothing was going to keep him from getting to his granddaughters birthday party today. Not even the painful arthritis he felt in his legs every time he took a step.<br/> <br/> <br/>Great shot! It draws you in to want to know more about what this man has gone through and what he is going through.</td>', 'It had been a hard summer for the man on 57th street, but nothing was going to keep him from getting to his granddaughters birthday party today. Not even the painful arthritis he felt in his legs every time he took a step.  Great shot! It draws you in to want to know more about what this man has gone through and what he is going through.', '2006-01-17 10:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047489, 274782, 34413, '<td valign="top">Fun picture that could have been in a Childhood competition</td>', 'Fun picture that could have been in a Childhood competition', '2006-01-17 10:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047491, 276895, 34413, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot.</td>', 'Nicely shot.', '2006-01-17 10:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047492, 277892, 35739, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Perhaps alittle washed out from the flash?</td>', 'Very cute.  Perhaps alittle washed out from the flash?', '2006-01-17 10:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047493, 279719, 43774, '<td valign="top">Horizon is tilted, not sure what sort of processing you did but there appear to be streaks or lines in the background.</td>', 'Horizon is tilted, not sure what sort of processing you did but there appear to be streaks or lines in the background.', '2006-01-17 10:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047494, 276928, 34413, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Beautifully captures the artistry of God.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Beautifully captures the artistry of God.', '2006-01-17 10:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047495, 279198, 34413, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Looks almost like the temple was drawn in.</td>', 'Cool.  Looks almost like the temple was drawn in.', '2006-01-17 10:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047497, 276210, 46634, '<td valign="top">Looking out across the field, Jim realized that today was going to be his day. Today would be the day he started everything new.<br/> <br/> <br/>I enjoy the transition from horizon to sky and the seperation provided by the grassline in the field.</td>', 'Looking out across the field, Jim realized that today was going to be his day. Today would be the day he started everything new.  I enjoy the transition from horizon to sky and the seperation provided by the grassline in the field.', '2006-01-17 10:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047499, 281915, 34413, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrasting color.  maybe would have been better if she had been looking at the camera with a happy smile.</td>', 'Beautiful contrasting color.  maybe would have been better if she had been looking at the camera with a happy smile.', '2006-01-17 10:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047500, 281862, 43774, '<td valign="top">Looks out of focus</td>', 'Looks out of focus', '2006-01-17 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047501, 275288, 43463, '<td valign="top">What a fabulous close-up of this hummingbird! Love how you can see all the wonderful details of it''s plummage - and those shimmering greens are lovely to look upon. I know that it is difficult to capture these birds stationary but I am going to offer my suggestion anyhow. The stark white ''background'' does nothing to complement this composition of the hummingbird. I do like that splash of red on the bird feeder for that adds a splash of color. The only thing that I can think of that you might have been able to do to eliminate the ''background'' at the time of the shot is to have taken it at a slight angle (45 degrees to the subject) looking up such that the blue sky would then become the background. Then the blue sky would be a nicer complementary color to those wonderful greens pictured here....of course it would also depend on if there was a nice blue sky to be found on the day of this shot.</td>', 'What a fabulous close-up of this hummingbird! Love how you can see all the wonderful details of it''s plummage - and those shimmering greens are lovely to look upon. I know that it is difficult to capture these birds stationary but I am going to offer my suggestion anyhow. The stark white ''background'' does nothing to complement this composition of the hummingbird. I do like that splash of red on the bird feeder for that adds a splash of color. The only thing that I can think of that you might have been able to do to eliminate the ''background'' at the time of the shot is to have taken it at a slight angle (45 degrees to the subject) looking up such that the blue sky would then become the background. Then the blue sky would be a nicer complementary color to those wonderful greens pictured here....of course it would also depend on if there was a nice blue sky to be found on the day of this shot.', '2006-01-17 10:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047502, 274936, 43774, '<td valign="top">Looks blurry, as if there were some camera movement during a long exposure. Also a lot of grain.</td>', 'Looks blurry, as if there were some camera movement during a long exposure. Also a lot of grain.', '2006-01-17 10:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047503, 279466, 10390, '<td valign="top">Very "clean" and beautiful mild photo, I could see it framed large up on a wall.</td>', 'Very "clean" and beautiful mild photo, I could see it framed large up on a wall.', '2006-01-17 10:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047505, 280860, 34413, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  All different stages of flight captured in one picture that looks eerily like a painting.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  All different stages of flight captured in one picture that looks eerily like a painting.  Nicely done.', '2006-01-17 10:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047506, 277958, 46634, '<td valign="top">Nobody believed he existed, but here alas is the Moleman of Istanbul.<br/> <br/> <br/>Crisp and clean. Captured the expression quite well</td>', 'Nobody believed he existed, but here alas is the Moleman of Istanbul.  Crisp and clean. Captured the expression quite well', '2006-01-17 10:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
