(2047532, 281524, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great photo, nice tones...</td>', 'Great photo, nice tones...', '2006-01-17 10:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047533, 281436, 46634, '<td valign="top">So, you say it just popped up on your back like this?<br/> <br/>Nice DoF. I like how the foreground is blurred and your attention is brought to the one in the back. Good shot</td>', 'So, you say it just popped up on your back like this? Nice DoF. I like how the foreground is blurred and your attention is brought to the one in the back. Good shot', '2006-01-17 10:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047534, 276537, 34413, '<td valign="top">Very sweet.  I like the interlacing of the fingers the shadows and highlights.  The only distraction is the impression of the ribbing from her pants that is left on her stomach.  Maybe would have smoothed that out a bit.</td>', 'Very sweet.  I like the interlacing of the fingers the shadows and highlights.  The only distraction is the impression of the ribbing from her pants that is left on her stomach.  Maybe would have smoothed that out a bit.', '2006-01-17 10:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047535, 275147, 50695, '<td valign="top">great reflection!</td>', 'great reflection!', '2006-01-17 10:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047537, 276970, 10390, '<td valign="top">Very good, I like what you''ve done here, good work.</td>', 'Very good, I like what you''ve done here, good work.', '2006-01-17 10:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047538, 280538, 34413, '<td valign="top">too busy.</td>', 'too busy.', '2006-01-17 10:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047540, 280918, 34413, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  Very Ansel Adams-ish.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  Very Ansel Adams-ish.', '2006-01-17 10:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047541, 281751, 46634, '<td valign="top">And God said let there be light, and He did and it was good. Which is good because without it, how would we know if we were clean or not when we went to the bathroom??<br/> <br/> <br/>Beautiful, breathtaking shot. To capture the light flowing in this way is quite difficult, but very well executed. Great shot</td>', 'And God said let there be light, and He did and it was good. Which is good because without it, how would we know if we were clean or not when we went to the bathroom??  Beautiful, breathtaking shot. To capture the light flowing in this way is quite difficult, but very well executed. Great shot', '2006-01-17 10:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047542, 279793, 21430, '<td valign="top">I have seen these birds before. Let me guess... Walt Disney World''s Animal Kingdom? (Am I right?) I took a few pictures of birds exactly like these two (if they aren''t the birds I am thinking off) a few years ago on our honeymoon.<br/> <br/>  Anyway, great capture. The bird that is the primary focus is pin sharp and seems to be looking straight at you. The bokeh effect is very good as well. The  image is a little bright for my tastes, I think it could use a slight darkening and then up some of the saturation levels to "pop" the blue, yellow and green in the image.</td>', 'I have seen these birds before. Let me guess... Walt Disney World''s Animal Kingdom? (Am I right?) I took a few pictures of birds exactly like these two (if they aren''t the birds I am thinking off) a few years ago on our honeymoon.   Anyway, great capture. The bird that is the primary focus is pin sharp and seems to be looking straight at you. The bokeh effect is very good as well. The  image is a little bright for my tastes, I think it could use a slight darkening and then up some of the saturation levels to "pop" the blue, yellow and green in the image.', '2006-01-17 10:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
