(2047786, 277184, 39349, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot but the title leaves little to be desired. The tones in this shot are perfect IMOH, small hot spot on her right shoulder and I do love the detail in her eyes. <br/> <br/>Overall well done, but I don''t like the title...good luck.<br/> <br/>Back for one further comment. The title of this shot in no way shape or form effected my vote on your photo.</td>', 'Lovely shot but the title leaves little to be desired. The tones in this shot are perfect IMOH, small hot spot on her right shoulder and I do love the detail in her eyes.  Overall well done, but I don''t like the title...good luck. Back for one further comment. The title of this shot in no way shape or form effected my vote on your photo.', '2006-01-17 11:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
