(2047869, 274963, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think I remember this shot :-) Nice one. Great model, very fitting title. I definitely see ''confidence'' in her eyes, appearance, and stance. Good processing and composition. I like how the bricks in the background are slanted, adds good dynamics to the image. Great job!</td>', 'I think I remember this shot :-) Nice one. Great model, very fitting title. I definitely see ''confidence'' in her eyes, appearance, and stance. Good processing and composition. I like how the bricks in the background are slanted, adds good dynamics to the image. Great job!', '2006-01-17 11:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
