(2048024, 280010, 25464, '<td valign="top">Walk up a few steps and put that cactus in the foreground for a more dramatic photo.  The dead center horizon splits the frame in half.  It will be more interesting with the horizon on a third.  Crop this shot in half way and up from the bottom leaving the tallest cactus in the lower left of the frame and you will see what I mean.  Nice spot and interesting lighting.</td>', 'Walk up a few steps and put that cactus in the foreground for a more dramatic photo.  The dead center horizon splits the frame in half.  It will be more interesting with the horizon on a third.  Crop this shot in half way and up from the bottom leaving the tallest cactus in the lower left of the frame and you will see what I mean.  Nice spot and interesting lighting.', '2006-01-17 12:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048031, 280198, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but I think it looks a bit overprocessed and lacks contrast in the background.  He seems to be glowing.  Also, I find it is almost always better to have the subject looking into the frame rather than out.  I would leave more space on the left than right in this shot.  The fence and the man are very interesting.  Good subject choice.</td>', 'I like this shot, but I think it looks a bit overprocessed and lacks contrast in the background.  He seems to be glowing.  Also, I find it is almost always better to have the subject looking into the frame rather than out.  I would leave more space on the left than right in this shot.  The fence and the man are very interesting.  Good subject choice.', '2006-01-17 12:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048032, 279887, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very lovely.   Just my kind of photo.  That slow dreamy water just warms my heart.   This is composed well too without a lot of unnecessary "stuff" cluttering up the photo.   You did very  good  :)</td>', 'Very lovely.   Just my kind of photo.  That slow dreamy water just warms my heart.   This is composed well too without a lot of unnecessary "stuff" cluttering up the photo.   You did very  good  :)', '2006-01-17 12:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
