(2048686, 276602, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky and landscape.</td>', 'Beautiful sky and landscape.', '2006-01-17 14:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048687, 281826, 18191, '<td valign="top">Wonderful town in a great even light. This is a superb photograph. Loving the leading lines and the contrast of the greens and reds --- nice!</td>', 'Wonderful town in a great even light. This is a superb photograph. Loving the leading lines and the contrast of the greens and reds --- nice!', '2006-01-17 14:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048688, 276522, 34192, '<td valign="top">tones excellent. I honestly don''t think the composition here, what I can see what I can''t see, matters much.  You will probably get the "too dark" comments as people want to see it all (they need a new monitor) but I think subtlety is this images strong point. This is even shown in the fact that there are no blacks or whites  in this image. Put together with the title, a strong statement indeed.  Sorrow is one of those subtle emotions that sneaks up on you, much like this image.  Bump up to 10.  Good luck in the challenge. I have a feeling this will be way under-rated...</td>', 'tones excellent. I honestly don''t think the composition here, what I can see what I can''t see, matters much.  You will probably get the "too dark" comments as people want to see it all (they need a new monitor) but I think subtlety is this images strong point. This is even shown in the fact that there are no blacks or whites  in this image. Put together with the title, a strong statement indeed.  Sorrow is one of those subtle emotions that sneaks up on you, much like this image.  Bump up to 10.  Good luck in the challenge. I have a feeling this will be way under-rated...', '2006-01-17 14:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048689, 275309, 22748, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous. It feels like the water is actually moving in the picture, and the sky is so awesome, and the contrast of cool colors in the water to the warm orange left in the sky is beautiful.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous. It feels like the water is actually moving in the picture, and the sky is so awesome, and the contrast of cool colors in the water to the warm orange left in the sky is beautiful.', '2006-01-17 14:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048695, 276549, 41794, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots that can say a thousand words....the depth of emotion in her face is captured very well in this photo. I can only imagine the stories she would have to share.</td>', 'This is one of those shots that can say a thousand words....the depth of emotion in her face is captured very well in this photo. I can only imagine the stories she would have to share.', '2006-01-17 14:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048696, 280416, 15539, '<td valign="top">I love the layers of sky, and water and then the punch of color that is the surfers.</td>', 'I love the layers of sky, and water and then the punch of color that is the surfers.', '2006-01-17 14:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048709, 274545, 24454, '<td valign="top">Absolutely STUNNING!  Everything about it is perfect.  It''s one of my favorites in this challenge -- and I''ve voted on 830 so far!  So that''s saying a lot.  10</td>', 'Absolutely STUNNING!  Everything about it is perfect.  It''s one of my favorites in this challenge -- and I''ve voted on 830 so far!  So that''s saying a lot.  10', '2006-01-17 14:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048710, 281524, 41794, '<td valign="top">Great black and white photo. The people in the shot really add a sense of perspective.</td>', 'Great black and white photo. The people in the shot really add a sense of perspective.', '2006-01-17 14:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048712, 275478, 41794, '<td valign="top">Love the "grunge" effect on this photo. Really makes it more emotive. The blue eyes stand out against the overall darkness of the photo.</td>', 'Love the "grunge" effect on this photo. Really makes it more emotive. The blue eyes stand out against the overall darkness of the photo.', '2006-01-17 14:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048718, 276960, 41794, '<td valign="top">Good composition with the ferris wheel to the left instead of dead center. Wish there was a little more light/detail on the other buildings.</td>', 'Good composition with the ferris wheel to the left instead of dead center. Wish there was a little more light/detail on the other buildings.', '2006-01-17 14:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048726, 277201, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful late afternoon lighting and great sky colors.</td>', 'Beautiful late afternoon lighting and great sky colors.', '2006-01-17 14:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048737, 277758, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great exposure... It can be tricky with that much water... nice job.</td>', 'Great exposure... It can be tricky with that much water... nice job.', '2006-01-17 14:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048741, 274594, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and saturation!</td>', 'Beautiful colors and saturation!', '2006-01-17 14:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
