(2048752, 279380, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF but find that the bright reflections in the glasses are distracting. A good tone was picked however but the aforementioned problem is detrimental.</td>', 'I like the DOF but find that the bright reflections in the glasses are distracting. A good tone was picked however but the aforementioned problem is detrimental.', '2006-01-17 14:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
