(2048765, 281452, 36238, '<td valign="top">Hmm... I''m not sure if I want to mess with that kid if a police line is sent in after him.  lol  Nice humour.</td>', 'Hmm... I''m not sure if I want to mess with that kid if a police line is sent in after him.  lol  Nice humour.', '2006-01-17 14:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
