(2048792, 281042, 37961, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. A slower shutterspeed may have given you the smoother water effect, but perhaps it works best this way for winter water. The sky is nice. and the exposure is good.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. A slower shutterspeed may have given you the smoother water effect, but perhaps it works best this way for winter water. The sky is nice. and the exposure is good.', '2006-01-17 14:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048793, 276756, 36238, '<td valign="top">I probably would have liked this photo if the two spectators were cropped out.  Nice action still. 6</td>', 'I probably would have liked this photo if the two spectators were cropped out.  Nice action still. 6', '2006-01-17 14:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048805, 278952, 35994, '<td valign="top">Very fitting title, nice shot!</td>', 'Very fitting title, nice shot!', '2006-01-17 14:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048807, 275238, 36238, '<td valign="top">Interesting feel for the portrait.  I think the grain works well with the diffused colours and the flower is a nice touch.  7</td>', 'Interesting feel for the portrait.  I think the grain works well with the diffused colours and the flower is a nice touch.  7', '2006-01-17 14:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048811, 274680, 47933, '<td valign="top">Just great. Nice job!!</td>', 'Just great. Nice job!!', '2006-01-17 14:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048812, 276522, 35804, '<td valign="top">...or melancholy...they both go hand in hand sometimes I think, or are they one in the same? This is so beautiful...the light, the different crimson tones you have chosen to use, the rain on the window...the delicate texture/pattern on the curtains...the complete and utter stillness...10 and fav.</td>', '...or melancholy...they both go hand in hand sometimes I think, or are they one in the same? This is so beautiful...the light, the different crimson tones you have chosen to use, the rain on the window...the delicate texture/pattern on the curtains...the complete and utter stillness...10 and fav.', '2006-01-17 14:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048814, 281362, 12268, '<td valign="top">I absolutely LOVE this picture. Adding it to my faves &amp; wishing you good luck in getting a ribbon! 10.</td>', 'I absolutely LOVE this picture. Adding it to my faves & wishing you good luck in getting a ribbon! 10.', '2006-01-17 14:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048817, 280590, 12268, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this pic in your pbase account &amp; really, really , love it. It''s deep &amp; vast &amp; that''s just from the eyes. I think there is a distinct flavour to your photography that most dpcers are familiar with by now. I suspect that this will ribbon &amp; rightly so. 10.</td>', 'I''ve seen this pic in your pbase account & really, really , love it. It''s deep & vast & that''s just from the eyes. I think there is a distinct flavour to your photography that most dpcers are familiar with by now. I suspect that this will ribbon & rightly so. 10.', '2006-01-17 14:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048821, 277497, 12268, '<td valign="top">I suspect that this place is rich with stuff great for photography. Unfortunately, there is seems to be too much in this shot with no central focal point that pops out at you. The focus seems to be too soft as well.</td>', 'I suspect that this place is rich with stuff great for photography. Unfortunately, there is seems to be too much in this shot with no central focal point that pops out at you. The focus seems to be too soft as well.', '2006-01-17 14:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048822, 279771, 35804, '<td valign="top">...so strange...the background looks like a cyanotype...quite a wonderful effect really...very different and unique.The image has the overall effect of a painting also...the more I look at this the more I like it...very nice.</td>', '...so strange...the background looks like a cyanotype...quite a wonderful effect really...very different and unique.The image has the overall effect of a painting also...the more I look at this the more I like it...very nice.', '2006-01-17 14:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048828, 275932, 31443, '<td valign="top">Now, that''s amazing! This little guy is hard enough to catch but to catch him in this situation is short of a miracle!</td>', 'Now, that''s amazing! This little guy is hard enough to catch but to catch him in this situation is short of a miracle!', '2006-01-17 14:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048829, 275921, 12268, '<td valign="top">very nice prospective. good luck!</td>', 'very nice prospective. good luck!', '2006-01-17 14:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048831, 280475, 47933, '<td valign="top">Nice job on this gorgeous shot. I do wish that photos would''ve been upped at least 800 across for this challenge as the only thing that may hold this one back is the size. Good score from me though. A+++</td>', 'Nice job on this gorgeous shot. I do wish that photos would''ve been upped at least 800 across for this challenge as the only thing that may hold this one back is the size. Good score from me though. A+++', '2006-01-17 14:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048833, 279724, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and nice action as well.  I have never had the opportunity to see the thunderbirds or the blue angels.  10</td>', 'Excellent composition and nice action as well.  I have never had the opportunity to see the thunderbirds or the blue angels.  10', '2006-01-17 14:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048838, 280525, 25754, '<td valign="top">Great minimalist shot. Nice catch!</td>', 'Great minimalist shot. Nice catch!', '2006-01-17 14:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
