(2048849, 278871, 772, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna visit this place one day... great idea to show the photographers.  I hope you got a few shots without them as well.. excellent work :) 10</td>', 'I''m gonna visit this place one day... great idea to show the photographers.  I hope you got a few shots without them as well.. excellent work :) 10', '2006-01-17 14:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048850, 275404, 772, '<td valign="top">simply elegant and beautiful... great capture :) 10</td>', 'simply elegant and beautiful... great capture :) 10', '2006-01-17 14:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048851, 279724, 47933, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. A++++</td>', 'Excellent capture. A++++', '2006-01-17 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048852, 280563, 772, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this photo in the top 10 somewhere at the end of the voting.  Great capture... 10</td>', 'I would love to see this photo in the top 10 somewhere at the end of the voting.  Great capture... 10', '2006-01-17 14:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048854, 279604, 35804, '<td valign="top">Of all the sunset and such images of the challenge...this is one that really stands out for me...the light is beautiful, the viewer is not knocked over by an oversaturated explosion of color...instead the color creeps up on us in a subtle and quiet way...serene and quiet...this makes me wish I were there.</td>', 'Of all the sunset and such images of the challenge...this is one that really stands out for me...the light is beautiful, the viewer is not knocked over by an oversaturated explosion of color...instead the color creeps up on us in a subtle and quiet way...serene and quiet...this makes me wish I were there.', '2006-01-17 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1);
