(2049347, 277621, 41794, '<td valign="top">I have seen this shot in the forums...absolutely beautiful to look at. Gorgeous creatures in an almost surreal setting. Still can''t believe you were able to get such a wonderful shot. Very lucky!</td>', 'I have seen this shot in the forums...absolutely beautiful to look at. Gorgeous creatures in an almost surreal setting. Still can''t believe you were able to get such a wonderful shot. Very lucky!', '2006-01-17 16:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
