(2049369, 281197, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like it that you choose B&amp;W to emphasize the lines and shadows, it has a nice classic feel. I personally might have chosen to drop the sky to focus all attention on the sand dunes. 8</td>', 'I like it that you choose B&W to emphasize the lines and shadows, it has a nice classic feel. I personally might have chosen to drop the sky to focus all attention on the sand dunes. 8', '2006-01-17 17:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2049376, 274847, 3032, '<td valign="top">Despite the fact that they run out of the frame with their legs a very cool photo. Love the way the water and dust show the motion and action. The hippo makes the shot, they all seem to want to get accross in front of it. :)</td>', 'Despite the fact that they run out of the frame with their legs a very cool photo. Love the way the water and dust show the motion and action. The hippo makes the shot, they all seem to want to get accross in front of it. :)', '2006-01-17 17:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
