(2049556, 278365, 3032, '<td valign="top">The 640px size is too small for photos like this. ;)<br/> <br/>Don''t get me wrong, I like the photo, but I don''t like the colors. It is like as if there is a cold purple/blue haze over it.<br/> <br/>Here is what I mean (workshop photo):<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=282783" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/3032/thumb/282783.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/3032/thumb/282783.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/3032/thumb/282783.jpg"/></a> <br/>Layer your original and this one in photoshop and flip between them.</td>', 'The 640px size is too small for photos like this. ;) Don''t get me wrong, I like the photo, but I don''t like the colors. It is like as if there is a cold purple/blue haze over it. Here is what I mean (workshop photo): Layer your original and this one in photoshop and flip between them.', '2006-01-17 17:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
