(2049666, 281242, 25890, '<td valign="top">Very interesting juxtaposition of the man and the machine, which echo each other and have such a strong symbolic tie between them. This has pretty much all the elements of great street/candid photography. Congratulations for seeing the moment and acting fast to capture it. It''s a pity that there are a few technical problems, such as overexposure. Nevertheless, I believe the photographer''s vision alone deserves a good score.</td>', 'Very interesting juxtaposition of the man and the machine, which echo each other and have such a strong symbolic tie between them. This has pretty much all the elements of great street/candid photography. Congratulations for seeing the moment and acting fast to capture it. It''s a pity that there are a few technical problems, such as overexposure. Nevertheless, I believe the photographer''s vision alone deserves a good score.', '2006-01-17 18:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
