(2049721, 276859, 35602, '<td valign="top">I would love to be able to get shots like this, but any mall I go into in my area, they confiscate your camera.  Love the balls floating.  To make them appear even more suspended, I would suggest that you clone out all the strings holding them so that they can''t be seen.  You did a pretty good job of it in the closest balls, but the ones in the back have real tell tale signs of strings.  Nice saturation and color.</td>', 'I would love to be able to get shots like this, but any mall I go into in my area, they confiscate your camera.  Love the balls floating.  To make them appear even more suspended, I would suggest that you clone out all the strings holding them so that they can''t be seen.  You did a pretty good job of it in the closest balls, but the ones in the back have real tell tale signs of strings.  Nice saturation and color.', '2006-01-17 18:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
