(2050001, 280588, 40386, '<td valign="top">This is one of the nicest tiny baby shots I have seen, maybe would have been nice to see the baby''s feet,I like way you have used the hands, I love it 10</td>', 'This is one of the nicest tiny baby shots I have seen, maybe would have been nice to see the baby''s feet,I like way you have used the hands, I love it 10', '2006-01-17 19:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050003, 281739, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait and great expression around the eyes, but I feel too much space is left at the top.</td>', 'Nice portrait and great expression around the eyes, but I feel too much space is left at the top.', '2006-01-17 19:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050005, 278434, 8860, '<td valign="top">Subject is not doing a great deal for me and your horizon is a bit drunk. I could relax if I was there mind, but I don''t know whether your intention of winning the ''Best of 2005'' with this shot was entirely ernest.<br/> <br/>Hope you enjoyed your holiday and book though.<br/>: )</td>', 'Subject is not doing a great deal for me and your horizon is a bit drunk. I could relax if I was there mind, but I don''t know whether your intention of winning the ''Best of 2005'' with this shot was entirely ernest. Hope you enjoyed your holiday and book though.: )', '2006-01-17 19:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050006, 280112, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not at all fond of the use of selective desat here, keep in mind that this is just my private and personal opinion.  Would have liked this shot a whole lot better if it was in colour with the same muted colours as in the backround.  Not trying to offend you, just figured I owed you an explanation why I gave it a relatively low score of 3.</td>', 'Not at all fond of the use of selective desat here, keep in mind that this is just my private and personal opinion.  Would have liked this shot a whole lot better if it was in colour with the same muted colours as in the backround.  Not trying to offend you, just figured I owed you an explanation why I gave it a relatively low score of 3.', '2006-01-17 19:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050007, 278871, 40386, '<td valign="top">Wow this is an incredible photo taken under extreme conditions, fabulous 10</td>', 'Wow this is an incredible photo taken under extreme conditions, fabulous 10', '2006-01-17 19:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050009, 279724, 40386, '<td valign="top">Great timing, exposure, focus and framing, the blue sky just makes it, wonderful, good luck 10</td>', 'Great timing, exposure, focus and framing, the blue sky just makes it, wonderful, good luck 10', '2006-01-17 19:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050012, 279649, 27482, '<td valign="top">I actually like this image, don´t know what it is but it just works for me.  Perhaps because I am a basketball fan.  Gave this a 7.  Just watch the highlights next time, they are totally blown out in all the three guys shirts that are wearing white.</td>', 'I actually like this image, don´t know what it is but it just works for me.  Perhaps because I am a basketball fan.  Gave this a 7.  Just watch the highlights next time, they are totally blown out in all the three guys shirts that are wearing white.', '2006-01-17 19:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050016, 279330, 23053, '<td valign="top">Great capture...almost looks like a composite with all of the varrying levels of light and dark, and the many, many interesting elements.  Good work and good luck.</td>', 'Great capture...almost looks like a composite with all of the varrying levels of light and dark, and the many, many interesting elements.  Good work and good luck.', '2006-01-17 19:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050017, 281896, 40386, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, the mist and trees and balloons, a difficult shot to get such great detail despite difficult lighting conditions.  Has a great eirie feeling 10</td>', 'I love this shot, the mist and trees and balloons, a difficult shot to get such great detail despite difficult lighting conditions.  Has a great eirie feeling 10', '2006-01-17 19:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050019, 281983, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro! Great vibrant colours and nice contrast. I find the flower in the background a bit of a distraction though.</td>', 'Very nice macro! Great vibrant colours and nice contrast. I find the flower in the background a bit of a distraction though.', '2006-01-17 19:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050022, 280809, 2780, '<td valign="top">Fantastic expression, and great work with the B&amp;W.</td>', 'Fantastic expression, and great work with the B&W.', '2006-01-17 19:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050024, 281429, 23053, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful and naturally appealing.</td>', 'Very beautiful and naturally appealing.', '2006-01-17 19:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050025, 281314, 2780, '<td valign="top">Maybe slightly over-done with the highlights, as they look a bit blown out which I find a bit distracting, but overall a nice photo.</td>', 'Maybe slightly over-done with the highlights, as they look a bit blown out which I find a bit distracting, but overall a nice photo.', '2006-01-17 19:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050029, 281859, 2780, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. 10</td>', 'Fantastic. 10', '2006-01-17 19:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050030, 279625, 40718, '<td valign="top">Man I wish this had been bigger...</td>', 'Man I wish this had been bigger...', '2006-01-17 19:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050031, 279198, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad, I just have to put a question mark about the composition, wouldn´t this shot have been better composed with a straight horizon and the two women in the lower right corner so that the water would have been all in the frame.</td>', 'Not bad, I just have to put a question mark about the composition, wouldn´t this shot have been better composed with a straight horizon and the two women in the lower right corner so that the water would have been all in the frame.', '2006-01-17 19:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050032, 276000, 51359, '<td valign="top">Cute, gorgoeous shot.</td>', 'Cute, gorgoeous shot.', '2006-01-17 19:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050034, 281453, 2780, '<td valign="top">Hehehe that is such a great expressions! Focus seems a bit soft to me but the hilarious face makes up for it! :P</td>', 'Hehehe that is such a great expressions! Focus seems a bit soft to me but the hilarious face makes up for it! :P', '2006-01-17 19:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050035, 274594, 10818, '<td valign="top">This photo has so much appeal to me.  Its very simple, yet very effective.<br/> <br/>The colors are wonderful, and it would look great on a wall.</td>', 'This photo has so much appeal to me.  Its very simple, yet very effective. The colors are wonderful, and it would look great on a wall.', '2006-01-17 19:33:19.000000', NULL, 1);
