(2050059, 276444, 27482, '<td valign="top">Argh, sorry but the light up in the right corner with the flare is really killing the shot for me, I find it almost impossible to look beyond it at the rest of the photo, it´s really is working as a black hole as far as my attention to this photo goes.  Not trying to offend, just wanted to explain why I gave it a low score.</td>', 'Argh, sorry but the light up in the right corner with the flare is really killing the shot for me, I find it almost impossible to look beyond it at the rest of the photo, it´s really is working as a black hole as far as my attention to this photo goes.  Not trying to offend, just wanted to explain why I gave it a low score.', '2006-01-17 19:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050060, 276207, 14837, '<td valign="top">WOW!  This is beautiful!</td>', 'WOW!  This is beautiful!', '2006-01-17 19:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050061, 277093, 51359, '<td valign="top">Would like to see the foreground cropped, about half way</td>', 'Would like to see the foreground cropped, about half way', '2006-01-17 19:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050062, 277058, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think moving forward a bit so the fence wasnt in frame would really improve this, as would a slightly longer exposure to smoothen the falls a bit and make them a little brighter.</td>', 'I think moving forward a bit so the fence wasnt in frame would really improve this, as would a slightly longer exposure to smoothen the falls a bit and make them a little brighter.', '2006-01-17 19:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
