(2050083, 274654, 34481, '<td valign="top">nice pixelated effect, really sets the mood.  I may have framed the dam adn people a little lower in the frame.  Good luck.</td>', 'nice pixelated effect, really sets the mood.  I may have framed the dam adn people a little lower in the frame.  Good luck.', '2006-01-17 19:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
