(2050090, 280484, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad as concert shows go but not really that good either, good enough for most newspapers though I think, nice job on the lighting.  However, I really wish I could see more of her face, this shot IMHO needs more power or emotion and here I think the face would have been the key.  6 from me.</td>', 'Not bad as concert shows go but not really that good either, good enough for most newspapers though I think, nice job on the lighting.  However, I really wish I could see more of her face, this shot IMHO needs more power or emotion and here I think the face would have been the key.  6 from me.', '2006-01-17 19:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050091, 276602, 34481, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of b/w.  Great sky.  Looks like it is somewhere on the altiplano of Peru or Bolivia?  Am I right?  Good luck!</td>', 'Very effective use of b/w.  Great sky.  Looks like it is somewhere on the altiplano of Peru or Bolivia?  Am I right?  Good luck!', '2006-01-17 19:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
