(2050285, 281760, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, wonderful details here, so delicate. It just seems too cropped or tight with the wing tips and tail cut off but its a very good picture, National Geographic quality.</td>', 'Wow, wonderful details here, so delicate. It just seems too cropped or tight with the wing tips and tail cut off but its a very good picture, National Geographic quality.', '2006-01-17 20:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050286, 277249, 36988, '<td valign="top">What can be said about this capture other than perfect... Well done on a wonderful wildlife entry... :)</td>', 'What can be said about this capture other than perfect... Well done on a wonderful wildlife entry... :)', '2006-01-17 20:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050288, 278864, 41794, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, good reflection. The only distraction to me is the line of lights on top of the mountain. I understand the 2005, but what are the rest of the lights up there? I kinda think the shot would be prettier without it...but that is just my humble opinion.</td>', 'Lovely shot, good reflection. The only distraction to me is the line of lights on top of the mountain. I understand the 2005, but what are the rest of the lights up there? I kinda think the shot would be prettier without it...but that is just my humble opinion.', '2006-01-17 20:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050290, 279644, 50680, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t pull my camera out in those conditions : ) Looks really cold.<br/>Would make a great cover for the REI catalog.<br/>Super nice job</td>', 'I wouldn''t pull my camera out in those conditions : ) Looks really cold.Would make a great cover for the REI catalog.Super nice job', '2006-01-17 20:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
