(2050317, 280955, 37252, '<td valign="top">roflmao - awww look at that poor boy''s facial expression. He is pleading you to hurry up and get him out of there. lol<br/> <br/>I love it - as a person who shares her home with 5 pugs and co-chairs a pug rescue I can''t give you anything but a good score!<br/> <br/>The composition is very nice, and the white background is perfect.</td>', 'roflmao - awww look at that poor boy''s facial expression. He is pleading you to hurry up and get him out of there. lol I love it - as a person who shares her home with 5 pugs and co-chairs a pug rescue I can''t give you anything but a good score! The composition is very nice, and the white background is perfect.', '2006-01-17 20:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2050320, 275391, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, Very nice close-up. Those eyes are amazing.</td>', 'Wow, Very nice close-up. Those eyes are amazing.', '2006-01-17 20:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
