(2050325, 280500, 50680, '<td valign="top">The edges of the rose have a white line that looks oddly pixulated to me. Especially on the top right of the rose. Makes it seem like it isn''t a real flower. Did it look like that in the native resolution? Did you use unsharpen or something in photoshop that might have created that? Just wondering. Still a good effort.</td>', 'The edges of the rose have a white line that looks oddly pixulated to me. Especially on the top right of the rose. Makes it seem like it isn''t a real flower. Did it look like that in the native resolution? Did you use unsharpen or something in photoshop that might have created that? Just wondering. Still a good effort.', '2006-01-17 20:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
