(2051029, 277006, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors and use of the curve in the road.  Would make more of an impact for voting if you''d use the full size allowance.  I look forward to seeing where this was taken.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors and use of the curve in the road.  Would make more of an impact for voting if you''d use the full size allowance.  I look forward to seeing where this was taken.', '2006-01-17 22:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
