(2051055, 280786, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good looking cat!  The lighting is a little flat and the dark background hides his/her ears.  (I have the same problem with my black and white cat - I try to get him with a color background, but he never sits still.)</td>', 'Good looking cat!  The lighting is a little flat and the dark background hides his/her ears.  (I have the same problem with my black and white cat - I try to get him with a color background, but he never sits still.)', '2006-01-17 22:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2051058, 279724, 36762, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the Thunderbirds.</td>', 'Great shot of the Thunderbirds.', '2006-01-17 22:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2051060, 277956, 43671, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2006-01-17 22:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2051061, 281609, 17937, '<td valign="top">Thats a great photo.  Reminds me of the little crab guy on the little mermaid.  Nice job.</td>', 'Thats a great photo.  Reminds me of the little crab guy on the little mermaid.  Nice job.', '2006-01-17 22:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2051063, 279938, 30982, '<td valign="top">Moonlight?  Like the softness.</td>', 'Moonlight?  Like the softness.', '2006-01-17 22:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2051065, 281813, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the centered position works well here, but I feel the hand is slightly too close to the top of the frame. I feel it should have the same amount of space, or more, than the space between the feet and the bottom.</td>', 'I think the centered position works well here, but I feel the hand is slightly too close to the top of the frame. I feel it should have the same amount of space, or more, than the space between the feet and the bottom.', '2006-01-17 22:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2051066, 276802, 20530, '<td valign="top">This is a tough one. Cars are difficult to photograph, IMO. I''m not sure whether I''m seeing compression artifacts or paint bubbles, but it''s missing the smooth, glossy look I would expect to see in such a closeup of a car. Composition doesn''t appeal to me, either. The color is definitely and attetion grabber, though.</td>', 'This is a tough one. Cars are difficult to photograph, IMO. I''m not sure whether I''m seeing compression artifacts or paint bubbles, but it''s missing the smooth, glossy look I would expect to see in such a closeup of a car. Composition doesn''t appeal to me, either. The color is definitely and attetion grabber, though.', '2006-01-17 22:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2051067, 274678, 2780, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo, love the pastel colours, technically sound. 10</td>', 'Fantastic photo, love the pastel colours, technically sound. 10', '2006-01-17 22:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
