(2051070, 274777, 20530, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of potential, here. It''s pretty small, but looks really cute. The clutter takes away from it, IMO.</td>', 'There''s a lot of potential, here. It''s pretty small, but looks really cute. The clutter takes away from it, IMO.', '2006-01-17 22:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
