(2051105, 277303, 41802, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot, I can''t imagine how cold it could have been.  I love the snow on his head.  Good choice of black and white.</td>', 'Amazing shot, I can''t imagine how cold it could have been.  I love the snow on his head.  Good choice of black and white.', '2006-01-17 22:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
