(2051125, 278859, 42100, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph, I love the tones of this photograph.  Even with the dark shadows you really show the heart and soul of this giant.  "10" from me, good luck!</td>', 'Excellent photograph, I love the tones of this photograph.  Even with the dark shadows you really show the heart and soul of this giant.  "10" from me, good luck!', '2006-01-17 22:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
