(2052248, 281726, 43434, '<td valign="top">This is really good almost fantastic.  I would have looked at cropping more of the thirds with the stalk ... It would have off balanced the picture completing a more balanced piece.</td>', 'This is really good almost fantastic.  I would have looked at cropping more of the thirds with the stalk ... It would have off balanced the picture completing a more balanced piece.', '2006-01-18 01:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
