(2052281, 279756, 19831, '<td valign="top">A refreshingly disturbing image! Totally ''in your face'' composition (literally, hehe). Very crisp, and I really like the lighting you''ve used, really adds to the shot. Great job, very cool!</td>', 'A refreshingly disturbing image! Totally ''in your face'' composition (literally, hehe). Very crisp, and I really like the lighting you''ve used, really adds to the shot. Great job, very cool!', '2006-01-18 02:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052308, 279625, 19831, '<td valign="top">The small size of this photo looks like it really does not do it justice. I think it would benefit greatly from using the full 640 pix size allowed. There is a great tutorial in the learn section here on sizing photos for challenges. I''m sure the size here is hindering your score pretty strongly.</td>', 'The small size of this photo looks like it really does not do it justice. I think it would benefit greatly from using the full 640 pix size allowed. There is a great tutorial in the learn section here on sizing photos for challenges. I''m sure the size here is hindering your score pretty strongly.', '2006-01-18 02:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052324, 281212, 50799, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred colour I think. 6.</td>', 'Would have preferred colour I think. 6.', '2006-01-18 02:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052395, 280454, 37252, '<td valign="top">A very sceinc phot with good composition. I really like the feeling of depth, the lines and curves of the rocky mountains. The clouds in the sky are over-exposed - otherwise a nice image.</td>', 'A very sceinc phot with good composition. I really like the feeling of depth, the lines and curves of the rocky mountains. The clouds in the sky are over-exposed - otherwise a nice image.', '2006-01-18 03:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052402, 274823, 37252, '<td valign="top">Pretty close up, composed well. Lacking in sharpness, and does not look to be intentionally soft-focused. Nice DOF between the flower and the ground.</td>', 'Pretty close up, composed well. Lacking in sharpness, and does not look to be intentionally soft-focused. Nice DOF between the flower and the ground.', '2006-01-18 03:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052406, 275282, 37252, '<td valign="top">This image just lacks appeal for me - sorry, but the colors are washed out, the composition suffers as it does not show where the taxi came from or where it is going, and there is a lot of noise. I hope this cooment can help you as you learn and grow with DPC</td>', 'This image just lacks appeal for me - sorry, but the colors are washed out, the composition suffers as it does not show where the taxi came from or where it is going, and there is a lot of noise. I hope this cooment can help you as you learn and grow with DPC', '2006-01-18 03:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052411, 275658, 37252, '<td valign="top">The clouds in the sky give a nice feeling of depth. The image lacks in color though - might try lightening up the foreground - or try dodging some of the dark areas to a point that at least some details show. I would love to see what that is down by the waters edge but it is too dark.</td>', 'The clouds in the sky give a nice feeling of depth. The image lacks in color though - might try lightening up the foreground - or try dodging some of the dark areas to a point that at least some details show. I would love to see what that is down by the waters edge but it is too dark.', '2006-01-18 03:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052412, 280808, 37252, '<td valign="top">wow - in your face bug macro! Lovely colors - the bug and the background. Nice sharp details.</td>', 'wow - in your face bug macro! Lovely colors - the bug and the background. Nice sharp details.', '2006-01-18 03:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052413, 276096, 37252, '<td valign="top">sweet moment between mom and baby. A photo I''m sure you cherish.</td>', 'sweet moment between mom and baby. A photo I''m sure you cherish.', '2006-01-18 03:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052414, 276928, 37252, '<td valign="top">interesting colors, but a bit too pink for me.</td>', 'interesting colors, but a bit too pink for me.', '2006-01-18 03:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052424, 275725, 37252, '<td valign="top">interesting effect - carried out well. Not so sure I care for the expression on this face though.</td>', 'interesting effect - carried out well. Not so sure I care for the expression on this face though.', '2006-01-18 03:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052426, 281197, 37252, '<td valign="top">beautiful lines and curves!</td>', 'beautiful lines and curves!', '2006-01-18 03:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052429, 276207, 37252, '<td valign="top">would like to see more vibrant colors. I''m sure the color tones here were intended, I just prefer brighter scens, but that''s me. Nicely composed</td>', 'would like to see more vibrant colors. I''m sure the color tones here were intended, I just prefer brighter scens, but that''s me. Nicely composed', '2006-01-18 03:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052434, 276053, 37252, '<td valign="top">I missing the feeling of looking up high here. For some reason it looks like this is falling down on me. Nice colors.</td>', 'I missing the feeling of looking up high here. For some reason it looks like this is falling down on me. Nice colors.', '2006-01-18 03:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052437, 276754, 37252, '<td valign="top">very crisp and sharp - I like that in an image. The color tones are also very nice. The crop however seems a little too tight.</td>', 'very crisp and sharp - I like that in an image. The color tones are also very nice. The crop however seems a little too tight.', '2006-01-18 03:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052444, 279258, 37252, '<td valign="top">Good shutter speed - kept the movement of the water without making your subject  too soft.  I like the reflection in the water, and the way this is composed.</td>', 'Good shutter speed - kept the movement of the water without making your subject  too soft.  I like the reflection in the water, and the way this is composed.', '2006-01-18 03:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052490, 276713, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I like the subject''s head in perfect stillness and focus. Well done.</td>', 'Great shot. I like the subject''s head in perfect stillness and focus. Well done.', '2006-01-18 03:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052495, 281542, 45689, '<td valign="top">A marvellous portrait!</td>', 'A marvellous portrait!', '2006-01-18 03:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
