(2053431, 274948, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think some added contrast to totally remove the detail in the building, and to brighten up the sky a little, would help improve this shot. I would like to see a closer crop too, to put more emphasis on the photographers. As it is, there''s a lot of wasted space in my opinion.</td>', 'I think some added contrast to totally remove the detail in the building, and to brighten up the sky a little, would help improve this shot. I would like to see a closer crop too, to put more emphasis on the photographers. As it is, there''s a lot of wasted space in my opinion.', '2006-01-18 09:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053432, 274654, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great image, I like it! good use of grain..</td>', 'Great image, I like it! good use of grain..', '2006-01-18 09:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053433, 275903, 2780, '<td valign="top">I dont think the centered composition works well here, it doesn''t add any interest. I also feel the colours are slightly oversaturated on the red since detail is lost at the top of the plant.</td>', 'I dont think the centered composition works well here, it doesn''t add any interest. I also feel the colours are slightly oversaturated on the red since detail is lost at the top of the plant.', '2006-01-18 09:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053438, 280493, 4517, '<td valign="top">I don`t normally like the neatimaged, plastic looking skin but here it makes for a great effect. I may have cloned the grass in all the way to the top. 9</td>', 'I don`t normally like the neatimaged, plastic looking skin but here it makes for a great effect. I may have cloned the grass in all the way to the top. 9', '2006-01-18 09:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053439, 281807, 29797, '<td valign="top">Great capture and composition. A little sharpening could help this a bit, but otherwise very nice.</td>', 'Great capture and composition. A little sharpening could help this a bit, but otherwise very nice.', '2006-01-18 09:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053443, 280454, 2780, '<td valign="top">Its a shame the white is overexposed in the clouds, and the rest of the photo also seems slightly washed out. I find it''s normally better to slightly underexpose and then bring up the brightness in the areas you want, because once somethings overexposed you can''t get any detail back.</td>', 'Its a shame the white is overexposed in the clouds, and the rest of the photo also seems slightly washed out. I find it''s normally better to slightly underexpose and then bring up the brightness in the areas you want, because once somethings overexposed you can''t get any detail back.', '2006-01-18 09:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053444, 275352, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo, its just a shame you submitted such a small version!</td>', 'Really nice photo, its just a shame you submitted such a small version!', '2006-01-18 09:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053445, 277383, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and DoF, making them more blurred the further back they are. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the composition and DoF, making them more blurred the further back they are. Nice shot.', '2006-01-18 09:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053448, 280263, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the photo seems a little washed out, which could be fixed easily with a contrast boost, but other than that it''s a nice shot :)</td>', 'I think the photo seems a little washed out, which could be fixed easily with a contrast boost, but other than that it''s a nice shot :)', '2006-01-18 09:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053452, 278122, 2780, '<td valign="top">Its a nice sky, but the ground lacks contrast and seems flat. The blacks arent actually black, but a grey purple? If you see them as black I think you need to try recalibrating your monitor, or use the eyedropper tool in editing to find out what colours they really are.</td>', 'Its a nice sky, but the ground lacks contrast and seems flat. The blacks arent actually black, but a grey purple? If you see them as black I think you need to try recalibrating your monitor, or use the eyedropper tool in editing to find out what colours they really are.', '2006-01-18 09:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053455, 280797, 2780, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait. I really like the lighting, altho maybe slightly more light on the right side of her face would improve it a little.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait. I really like the lighting, altho maybe slightly more light on the right side of her face would improve it a little.', '2006-01-18 09:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053456, 275098, 5728, '<td valign="top">I prefer the processing you have done to this image compared to the same image I saw in your portfolio some time back. I can see you put more time and thought into it. This has so much more impact and this time I will favourite it :)</td>', 'I prefer the processing you have done to this image compared to the same image I saw in your portfolio some time back. I can see you put more time and thought into it. This has so much more impact and this time I will favourite it :)', '2006-01-18 09:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053458, 281954, 2780, '<td valign="top">Cute photo :) I''m wondering how this would look in black and white with a dreamy soft glow filter or something applied?</td>', 'Cute photo :) I''m wondering how this would look in black and white with a dreamy soft glow filter or something applied?', '2006-01-18 09:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053461, 281716, 10848, '<td valign="top">One word comes to mind when I look at this image WOW! Good luck! 10</td>', 'One word comes to mind when I look at this image WOW! Good luck! 10', '2006-01-18 09:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053462, 278381, 2780, '<td valign="top">The composition here is good, so we can see the mirror and the people outside it. I think it needs to be slightly rotated so that the vertical lines are straight.</td>', 'The composition here is good, so we can see the mirror and the people outside it. I think it needs to be slightly rotated so that the vertical lines are straight.', '2006-01-18 09:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
