(2053603, 276204, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the shot and the processing is quite well done to give it an old kind of feel. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the shot and the processing is quite well done to give it an old kind of feel. Nice shot.', '2006-01-18 10:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
