(2053643, 274673, 7322, '<td valign="top">A beatiful scene that sets a mood. I wish the fisher was wearing a red shirt or something so he stood out more from his surroundings but that''s very likely something you had no control over. The water is a bit too contrasty--I''d like to see more midtones. Water can be a difficult subject to capture though.</td>', 'A beatiful scene that sets a mood. I wish the fisher was wearing a red shirt or something so he stood out more from his surroundings but that''s very likely something you had no control over. The water is a bit too contrasty--I''d like to see more midtones. Water can be a difficult subject to capture though.', '2006-01-18 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053646, 277005, 2780, '<td valign="top">I don''t like how oversharpened it is (since there is a halo around the person) but it''s a really nice scene you captured. The sky is particularly dramatic.</td>', 'I don''t like how oversharpened it is (since there is a halo around the person) but it''s a really nice scene you captured. The sky is particularly dramatic.', '2006-01-18 10:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
