(2053650, 279057, 2780, '<td valign="top">Hehe that''s a great expression on the horse! This is a really good action shot, however I feel it needs a little more space to breathe at the top.</td>', 'Hehe that''s a great expression on the horse! This is a really good action shot, however I feel it needs a little more space to breathe at the top.', '2006-01-18 10:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053654, 274718, 2780, '<td valign="top">John, this is a fantastic portrait, filled with such character. The B&amp;W work is also extremely well done, as per your usual standards. I''m sorry to hear about him passing away.</td>', 'John, this is a fantastic portrait, filled with such character. The B&W work is also extremely well done, as per your usual standards. I''m sorry to hear about him passing away.', '2006-01-18 10:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053656, 280498, 7322, '<td valign="top">The background is blurred nicely--we recognize the objects which places the main subject in context and the color scheme is simple and pleasing. Nice job!</td>', 'The background is blurred nicely--we recognize the objects which places the main subject in context and the color scheme is simple and pleasing. Nice job!', '2006-01-18 10:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053668, 281857, 2780, '<td valign="top">I''m really not a fan of the post processing here, I think it borders more in digital art that photography.</td>', 'I''m really not a fan of the post processing here, I think it borders more in digital art that photography.', '2006-01-18 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053674, 279171, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the use of selected desaturation here. The yellow of the car and the bus are a good way to bring the piece together. I think the bus is slightly too close to the edge of the frame but that''s just a minor point :)</td>', 'I like the use of selected desaturation here. The yellow of the car and the bus are a good way to bring the piece together. I think the bus is slightly too close to the edge of the frame but that''s just a minor point :)', '2006-01-18 10:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053676, 276525, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think that it could be a nice portrait, however it seems as though nothing in the shot is in focus and I don''t really see a reason why this should be the case in this photo. I also think B&amp;W would have suited this well, with high contrast.</td>', 'I think that it could be a nice portrait, however it seems as though nothing in the shot is in focus and I don''t really see a reason why this should be the case in this photo. I also think B&W would have suited this well, with high contrast.', '2006-01-18 10:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053677, 274939, 2780, '<td valign="top">This feels a little too oversharpened to me, although it does show a lot of detail.</td>', 'This feels a little too oversharpened to me, although it does show a lot of detail.', '2006-01-18 10:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053679, 281057, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of high key and selective desaturation. Fantastic portrait - I wish I could take them like this! How did you light and post process it?</td>', 'Excellent use of high key and selective desaturation. Fantastic portrait - I wish I could take them like this! How did you light and post process it?', '2006-01-18 10:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053681, 281964, 7322, '<td valign="top">The model is beautiful and intriguing. I don''t think this is quite successful though. Her eyes aren''t quite focused enough. Or perhaps it is that they are too far away from the viewer to make a strong impact. Her full blue lips are what draw my focus. Also, she should have been separated more from the background to avoid  <br/>the shadows. A light pointed at the background behind the subject can eliminate those shadows. I don''t care for the dark shadow under her jaw line. <br/> <br/>I think that is body glitter on her shoulders and collar bone but it appears a bit overexposed and is reading more like dust to me. <br/> <br/>I like the pose, the composition, and the model is beautiful. I think this is suffering from improper lighting mainly. Nice effort.</td>', 'The model is beautiful and intriguing. I don''t think this is quite successful though. Her eyes aren''t quite focused enough. Or perhaps it is that they are too far away from the viewer to make a strong impact. Her full blue lips are what draw my focus. Also, she should have been separated more from the background to avoid  the shadows. A light pointed at the background behind the subject can eliminate those shadows. I don''t care for the dark shadow under her jaw line.  I think that is body glitter on her shoulders and collar bone but it appears a bit overexposed and is reading more like dust to me.  I like the pose, the composition, and the model is beautiful. I think this is suffering from improper lighting mainly. Nice effort.', '2006-01-18 10:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053682, 279931, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot. I love the red and oranges and yellows, it creates a really warm atmosphere. The expressions are also caught very nicely :)</td>', 'This is a really nice shot. I love the red and oranges and yellows, it creates a really warm atmosphere. The expressions are also caught very nicely :)', '2006-01-18 10:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053683, 281747, 7322, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. I only wish the cyclist were wearing something bright to stand out a bit more from the background. Obviously not something under your control.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. I only wish the cyclist were wearing something bright to stand out a bit more from the background. Obviously not something under your control.', '2006-01-18 10:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053684, 278142, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a really good shot. The cars in the background add to the story and let us know he is a street performer while still allowing you to get close up.</td>', 'This is a really good shot. The cars in the background add to the story and let us know he is a street performer while still allowing you to get close up.', '2006-01-18 10:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053689, 275350, 2780, '<td valign="top">Thats the best tower of sand balls I''ve seen all day! lol :)<br/>I really like the colour and tropical feeling I get from this shot, but I think the crop should be closer in to the sand balls :)</td>', 'Thats the best tower of sand balls I''ve seen all day! lol :)I really like the colour and tropical feeling I get from this shot, but I think the crop should be closer in to the sand balls :)', '2006-01-18 10:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053692, 282001, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and perspective in this shot, and how the one blue light contrasts with the orangeness of the rest of the photo.</td>', 'I like the angle and perspective in this shot, and how the one blue light contrasts with the orangeness of the rest of the photo.', '2006-01-18 10:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053694, 274735, 2780, '<td valign="top">I love the angle you took this at, and the B&amp;W work is great. The slightly longer exposure to make the waves smoother really adds a lot to the photo too. Great shot - 10</td>', 'I love the angle you took this at, and the B&W work is great. The slightly longer exposure to make the waves smoother really adds a lot to the photo too. Great shot - 10', '2006-01-18 10:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053697, 278096, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like how you included the shadow in the photo too, that''s a nice touch. I feel like everything is a bit close to the edge of the frame though...</td>', 'I like how you included the shadow in the photo too, that''s a nice touch. I feel like everything is a bit close to the edge of the frame though...', '2006-01-18 10:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053698, 281770, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is lacking a bit in contrast. It seems to be all midtones with very little highlights and shadows. Adjusting the levels to deepen the reds and heighten the yellow in the center and along the rims of the inner petals would make a stronger statement, IMO. The bud at the top of the frame pulls focus from the main subject.</td>', 'This is lacking a bit in contrast. It seems to be all midtones with very little highlights and shadows. Adjusting the levels to deepen the reds and heighten the yellow in the center and along the rims of the inner petals would make a stronger statement, IMO. The bud at the top of the frame pulls focus from the main subject.', '2006-01-18 10:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053699, 279544, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really love the colours in this shot, and the DoF you used. It''s a very well done photo. 9</td>', 'I really love the colours in this shot, and the DoF you used. It''s a very well done photo. 9', '2006-01-18 10:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
