(2053706, 276941, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the branches in front of the river distract a bit, but it looks like you''ve got the hang of the technique to get the river looking nice and smoothe :)</td>', 'I think the branches in front of the river distract a bit, but it looks like you''ve got the hang of the technique to get the river looking nice and smoothe :)', '2006-01-18 10:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053709, 280588, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. It is very nicely lit and the composition is beautiful. The veiwers eye goes right to the baby''s. The black and white was very well done. The subject is perfectly separated from the background. I kind of wish I could see the baby''s feet but that is a nitpick. Beautiful.</td>', 'This is lovely. It is very nicely lit and the composition is beautiful. The veiwers eye goes right to the baby''s. The black and white was very well done. The subject is perfectly separated from the background. I kind of wish I could see the baby''s feet but that is a nitpick. Beautiful.', '2006-01-18 10:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053710, 277184, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like the pastel colours you''ve used here, the pink of the background and shirt with the yellow of the hair go really nicely together.</td>', 'I really like the pastel colours you''ve used here, the pink of the background and shirt with the yellow of the hair go really nicely together.', '2006-01-18 10:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053716, 280965, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait for more that the obvious reason ;)<br/>The lighting is really nice, and the expression is well caught. I do however think there should be a little more breathing space at the top perhaps. Also, the blurred balls in the foreground would look better sharp in my opinion, but still have the background blurred brilliantly as you have done already. 9</td>', 'Very nice portrait for more that the obvious reason ;)The lighting is really nice, and the expression is well caught. I do however think there should be a little more breathing space at the top perhaps. Also, the blurred balls in the foreground would look better sharp in my opinion, but still have the background blurred brilliantly as you have done already. 9', '2006-01-18 10:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053721, 274786, 2780, '<td valign="top">lol really nice capture, hehe. They''ll both cringe when you show this to them when they''re older, hehe :)</td>', 'lol really nice capture, hehe. They''ll both cringe when you show this to them when they''re older, hehe :)', '2006-01-18 10:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
