(2053740, 280021, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice portrait! I love the bright colours, and the overexposure really does work well in this case! Excellent shot.</td>', 'Really nice portrait! I love the bright colours, and the overexposure really does work well in this case! Excellent shot.', '2006-01-18 10:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053741, 281362, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. This grabbed my attention right away. I''m kind of distracted by the object emerging from between the tracks. I kind of wish the snow was more pristine so that the bikes were the only focus. The line of tracks nearest the bikes add interest but the other line is messier and ends up in a sort of blob at the top. I think cropping just beyond the first line of tracks would make a tighter composition, however a different mood would result.</td>', 'Very interesting. This grabbed my attention right away. I''m kind of distracted by the object emerging from between the tracks. I kind of wish the snow was more pristine so that the bikes were the only focus. The line of tracks nearest the bikes add interest but the other line is messier and ends up in a sort of blob at the top. I think cropping just beyond the first line of tracks would make a tighter composition, however a different mood would result.', '2006-01-18 10:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053742, 277676, 27080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  It evokes such emotion...just the right amount of colour.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  It evokes such emotion...just the right amount of colour.', '2006-01-18 10:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
