(2053762, 280921, 7322, '<td valign="top">I think either including more of the yellow bucket or cropping it out altogether (I''m leaning toward the latter) would have made this work better for me. Also the very top could be cropped to eliminatae that piece of wood in the corner. I like the colors and textures of the mops but they could be much more vibrant. On my monitor the colors look a bit washed out. I wonder if you bracketed your exposures? This looks a tad overexposed.</td>', 'I think either including more of the yellow bucket or cropping it out altogether (I''m leaning toward the latter) would have made this work better for me. Also the very top could be cropped to eliminatae that piece of wood in the corner. I like the colors and textures of the mops but they could be much more vibrant. On my monitor the colors look a bit washed out. I wonder if you bracketed your exposures? This looks a tad overexposed.', '2006-01-18 10:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053768, 279195, 7322, '<td valign="top">Way too small! I''m sure you''re tired of reading that by now. I like the composition quite a bit and she has a lovely natural expression. Her eyes do draw the viewer in. Unfortunately, at this size I really can''t evaluate the image quality. Too bad.</td>', 'Way too small! I''m sure you''re tired of reading that by now. I like the composition quite a bit and she has a lovely natural expression. Her eyes do draw the viewer in. Unfortunately, at this size I really can''t evaluate the image quality. Too bad.', '2006-01-18 10:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
