(2054374, 278387, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice closeup.  Like the sharpness and the colors.  It''s a great capture either way, and I''m sure you didn''t have too much time to compose, but what would have improved the image further for me would be if the antlers at the top weren''t cropped off, and maybe even have the legs of the first buck show full (make this a portrait format shot?)  Still nice though.</td>', 'Wow, nice closeup.  Like the sharpness and the colors.  It''s a great capture either way, and I''m sure you didn''t have too much time to compose, but what would have improved the image further for me would be if the antlers at the top weren''t cropped off, and maybe even have the legs of the first buck show full (make this a portrait format shot?)  Still nice though.', '2006-01-18 13:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054387, 280701, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great concept, I love street lanterns that are brightly decorated with flowers.  I think for me, the execution here lets the image down a bit.  What I would''ve tried to change when taking the photo is to have the lamppost straight, the lantern not cropped off at the tome and less clutter in the background at the bottom.  I bet you are getting comments about the blownout sky, but I like the contrasty feeling of the shot.  The reflections in the lantern add to the image, too.</td>', 'Great concept, I love street lanterns that are brightly decorated with flowers.  I think for me, the execution here lets the image down a bit.  What I would''ve tried to change when taking the photo is to have the lamppost straight, the lantern not cropped off at the tome and less clutter in the background at the bottom.  I bet you are getting comments about the blownout sky, but I like the contrasty feeling of the shot.  The reflections in the lantern add to the image, too.', '2006-01-18 13:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
