(2054692, 274971, 21362, '<td valign="top">Nice light. The water is maybe a touch overexposed, but I''d take that over having those details in the stone underexposed. I really like the way the tree is part of the image. The crop on the splash feels a little tight.<br/> <br/>Is this on the Eagle Creek Trail in the Columbia Gorge? You don''t need to answer that, I''ll check back after the challenge is over.<br/> <br/>Nice job.</td>', 'Nice light. The water is maybe a touch overexposed, but I''d take that over having those details in the stone underexposed. I really like the way the tree is part of the image. The crop on the splash feels a little tight. Is this on the Eagle Creek Trail in the Columbia Gorge? You don''t need to answer that, I''ll check back after the challenge is over. Nice job.', '2006-01-18 15:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054693, 280450, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  It is the most artistically complex and sophisticated image in the challenge, and certainly among the most interesting, too.  The scene appears candid, in the sense that nothing was staged for the shot, but the composition and the ordering of elements (including the light) within the photograph is meticulous and masterly.  These are the photographs I love: cerebral, beautiful, complex and demanding, but also apparently effortless ... I can recognise ''em when I see ''em, but I just can''t take ''em myself!  Maybe in 2006?  10.</td>', 'This is wonderful.  It is the most artistically complex and sophisticated image in the challenge, and certainly among the most interesting, too.  The scene appears candid, in the sense that nothing was staged for the shot, but the composition and the ordering of elements (including the light) within the photograph is meticulous and masterly.  These are the photographs I love: cerebral, beautiful, complex and demanding, but also apparently effortless ... I can recognise ''em when I see ''em, but I just can''t take ''em myself!  Maybe in 2006?  10.', '2006-01-18 15:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054695, 280137, 33068, '<td valign="top">It appears to be just a snapshot.</td>', 'It appears to be just a snapshot.', '2006-01-18 15:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
