(2054773, 280721, 27482, '<td valign="top">Whole shot just seems to lack clarity, most likely from poor focus or poor image quality so I found it hard not to give this a relatively low score.</td>', 'Whole shot just seems to lack clarity, most likely from poor focus or poor image quality so I found it hard not to give this a relatively low score.', '2006-01-18 15:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054774, 280375, 47377, '<td valign="top">this my favourite picture in the challenge! well done! 10<br/>I absolutely love it!</td>', 'this my favourite picture in the challenge! well done! 10I absolutely love it!', '2006-01-18 15:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054775, 277033, 24846, '<td valign="top">Like this, would have draped cord towards you...The shadws streaming in have an electric feel. Nice colors</td>', 'Like this, would have draped cord towards you...The shadws streaming in have an electric feel. Nice colors', '2006-01-18 15:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054776, 281914, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen the Canterbury Plains many times, but not quite from this superb viewpoint.  It''s a very fine and thoughtful landscape photograph, because it beautifully captures the odd juxtaposition that exists there of wild, scree-covered alpine slopes and bucolic, ordered pastoral plains.  And the balance you''ve chosen between those two worlds is exactly right ... you''ve included just enough of each.  Finally, the centred horizon and the resultant sky vista is perfect, too.  This image works like a good cocktail ... it tastes better than any of its ingredients alone, and it leaves me wanting another one!  8.</td>', 'I''ve seen the Canterbury Plains many times, but not quite from this superb viewpoint.  It''s a very fine and thoughtful landscape photograph, because it beautifully captures the odd juxtaposition that exists there of wild, scree-covered alpine slopes and bucolic, ordered pastoral plains.  And the balance you''ve chosen between those two worlds is exactly right ... you''ve included just enough of each.  Finally, the centred horizon and the resultant sky vista is perfect, too.  This image works like a good cocktail ... it tastes better than any of its ingredients alone, and it leaves me wanting another one!  8.', '2006-01-18 15:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054779, 280493, 27482, '<td valign="top">Whoa, nice looking girl, I would definately exploit her as a model if she was in my circle of friends, the camera appears to like her.</td>', 'Whoa, nice looking girl, I would definately exploit her as a model if she was in my circle of friends, the camera appears to like her.', '2006-01-18 15:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054781, 277031, 24846, '<td valign="top">So melancholy...</td>', 'So melancholy...', '2006-01-18 15:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054782, 281609, 17033, '<td valign="top">Classic BombDog shot.....encapsulation of a moment and concept</td>', 'Classic BombDog shot.....encapsulation of a moment and concept', '2006-01-18 15:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054783, 275143, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the PP, not totally blown away but this shot but I like it a lot, gave it a 7.</td>', 'Nice job on the PP, not totally blown away but this shot but I like it a lot, gave it a 7.', '2006-01-18 15:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054784, 281609, 24846, '<td valign="top">cute...the splashing makes it</td>', 'cute...the splashing makes it', '2006-01-18 15:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054785, 281896, 47377, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture. I love this. I''ve got some baloon pictures in my portfolio as well so you might want to have a look. don''t think they are quit as good as this though. 10<br/>the only thing that might improve this, is wheter is is possible to have a bit more space on the top and left and right next to the most outer baloons...  but it''s pretty perfect as it is! well done</td>', 'Excellent picture. I love this. I''ve got some baloon pictures in my portfolio as well so you might want to have a look. don''t think they are quit as good as this though. 10the only thing that might improve this, is wheter is is possible to have a bit more space on the top and left and right next to the most outer baloons...  but it''s pretty perfect as it is! well done', '2006-01-18 15:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054790, 279625, 7786, '<td valign="top">too small.</td>', 'too small.', '2006-01-18 15:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054797, 279776, 47377, '<td valign="top">great capture of a great expression 7<br/>I might have give more if it was not for what looks like reflections in the glass that I''m assuming he sits behind! well done though!</td>', 'great capture of a great expression 7I might have give more if it was not for what looks like reflections in the glass that I''m assuming he sits behind! well done though!', '2006-01-18 15:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054798, 281298, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great capture, wonderful colors and dof. Perfect title-9-</td>', 'Great capture, wonderful colors and dof. Perfect title-9-', '2006-01-18 15:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054799, 274673, 17033, '<td valign="top">Stupendous lighting!</td>', 'Stupendous lighting!', '2006-01-18 15:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054805, 278362, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice IR love the symbolism of this well composed image...-9-</td>', 'Nice IR love the symbolism of this well composed image...-9-', '2006-01-18 15:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054808, 278122, 47377, '<td valign="top">great sky. just wondering if you could have gone lower done to have more of the canon in silhouette against the sky. it seems a bit lost in front of the dark background. 5</td>', 'great sky. just wondering if you could have gone lower done to have more of the canon in silhouette against the sky. it seems a bit lost in front of the dark background. 5', '2006-01-18 15:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054811, 281362, 772, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  I''m still trying to figure out exactly why I like it so much.  I think it''s the simplicity of it, even though it could be considered quite complex :)  The point of view is the key here.. great work :) - 10</td>', 'I love this photo.  I''m still trying to figure out exactly why I like it so much.  I think it''s the simplicity of it, even though it could be considered quite complex :)  The point of view is the key here.. great work :) - 10', '2006-01-18 15:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054817, 276713, 17033, '<td valign="top">Great movement yet with excellent clarity at the point where the eye settles. Well done for mastering the technique</td>', 'Great movement yet with excellent clarity at the point where the eye settles. Well done for mastering the technique', '2006-01-18 15:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054833, 280457, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice focus - very crisp image and yet retinas the softness of the mist<br/>Composition plays well into the rule of thirds. The color tones are very natural - not over saturated which makes this all the much nicer.</td>', 'Nice focus - very crisp image and yet retinas the softness of the mistComposition plays well into the rule of thirds. The color tones are very natural - not over saturated which makes this all the much nicer.', '2006-01-18 15:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054835, 277058, 27482, '<td valign="top">I must say what my first thought about this picture was and that was why on earth did the photographer include the wooden railing in the shot?  I would have gotten closer or gotten higher up if I had taken this shot, the wooden railing (in my humble opinion) is just barging into the frame like an burglar at night, pretty unwelcome.  Other than that, a pretty good shot of a waterfall, I would reccomend a slightly longer exposure time next time as it hasn´t got enough motion blur for my taste.  Gave it a 5 as it is now.</td>', 'I must say what my first thought about this picture was and that was why on earth did the photographer include the wooden railing in the shot?  I would have gotten closer or gotten higher up if I had taken this shot, the wooden railing (in my humble opinion) is just barging into the frame like an burglar at night, pretty unwelcome.  Other than that, a pretty good shot of a waterfall, I would reccomend a slightly longer exposure time next time as it hasn´t got enough motion blur for my taste.  Gave it a 5 as it is now.', '2006-01-18 15:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054846, 274693, 37252, '<td valign="top">I like the compositon, and the natural colors. The image seems a little noisy t me though. I wonder what ISO this was shot at.</td>', 'I like the compositon, and the natural colors. The image seems a little noisy t me though. I wonder what ISO this was shot at.', '2006-01-18 15:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054856, 275287, 37252, '<td valign="top">the focus seems to be on the eye to the right - leaves the other eye not as crisp and the nose blurry.</td>', 'the focus seems to be on the eye to the right - leaves the other eye not as crisp and the nose blurry.', '2006-01-18 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054859, 281326, 27482, '<td valign="top">Whole shot seems to lack clarity, either due to poor image quality or lack of good focus.  I like the lower half of the shot but the sky is just horrible and due to that and the poor image quality I gave this a pretty low score.  Like the composition though.</td>', 'Whole shot seems to lack clarity, either due to poor image quality or lack of good focus.  I like the lower half of the shot but the sky is just horrible and due to that and the poor image quality I gave this a pretty low score.  Like the composition though.', '2006-01-18 15:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054861, 274894, 24846, '<td valign="top">Lovely rural study. The purple fowers scattered about and the flow of the fence are neat. The old tractor looks lost in thought. -9-</td>', 'Lovely rural study. The purple fowers scattered about and the flow of the fence are neat. The old tractor looks lost in thought. -9-', '2006-01-18 15:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054864, 277089, 27482, '<td valign="top">Like this a whole lot, enough for an 8 from me.  Lovely use of negative space, great composition.</td>', 'Like this a whole lot, enough for an 8 from me.  Lovely use of negative space, great composition.', '2006-01-18 15:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054870, 281132, 24846, '<td valign="top">Did you have this picked before the singled out challenge. Great image, color, dof</td>', 'Did you have this picked before the singled out challenge. Great image, color, dof', '2006-01-18 15:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054880, 281857, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am a bit torn about the zoom blur, if it wasn´t there this shot would just be good but not really that different from a slew of similar shots I have seen but on the other hand it just gives me a slight sense of vertigo so I just wanna go see the next shot but lovely colours and a memorable entry.  Enough for a 7 from me.</td>', 'I am a bit torn about the zoom blur, if it wasn´t there this shot would just be good but not really that different from a slew of similar shots I have seen but on the other hand it just gives me a slight sense of vertigo so I just wanna go see the next shot but lovely colours and a memorable entry.  Enough for a 7 from me.', '2006-01-18 15:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054884, 276200, 24846, '<td valign="top">Darling subject, colors, perspective...</td>', 'Darling subject, colors, perspective...', '2006-01-18 15:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054892, 274981, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love the expression on the lion, very predatory and yes, majestic is very fitting.  Enough for a 7 from me :D</td>', 'Love the expression on the lion, very predatory and yes, majestic is very fitting.  Enough for a 7 from me :D', '2006-01-18 15:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054900, 276745, 28141, '<td valign="top">Not sure if you''re going for high key or what, but she looks a little washed out.</td>', 'Not sure if you''re going for high key or what, but she looks a little washed out.', '2006-01-18 15:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054904, 274722, 27482, '<td valign="top">Haha, very funny moment and the best part is that it looks like a digital, modern camera.  I gave this a whopping 9, mostly because of the moment but the composition and exposure are pretty nice.</td>', 'Haha, very funny moment and the best part is that it looks like a digital, modern camera.  I gave this a whopping 9, mostly because of the moment but the composition and exposure are pretty nice.', '2006-01-18 15:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054913, 278387, 41521, '<td valign="top">I recognize this one.  Nice processing, really makes them stand out.  ;)  I don''t normally like borders, but this one works.</td>', 'I recognize this one.  Nice processing, really makes them stand out.  ;)  I don''t normally like borders, but this one works.', '2006-01-18 15:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054914, 279178, 28141, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more blue in the other corners.  It feels a little wierd only having sky in the upper right.  Nice color and perspective.</td>', 'Would like to see more blue in the other corners.  It feels a little wierd only having sky in the upper right.  Nice color and perspective.', '2006-01-18 15:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054920, 280799, 27482, '<td valign="top">Haha, love his expression, he knows he is milliseconds from a world of pain.  Great sport shot, even though the contrast is a little strong for my taste.  7 from me.</td>', 'Haha, love his expression, he knows he is milliseconds from a world of pain.  Great sport shot, even though the contrast is a little strong for my taste.  7 from me.', '2006-01-18 16:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054929, 280809, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice post-processing</td>', 'Nice post-processing', '2006-01-18 16:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054930, 276042, 27482, '<td valign="top">The PP sky is a little bit over the top for my taste, just looks unnatural and there is a very visible line along the horizon and around her hair that shows where your lasso tool (or whatever you used) was when dividing the two areas for the editing so if you are going to do something like this (wich I encourage cause it looks promising, just too much this time), take steps to cover up your tracks, even if you have to do it pixel by pixel viewing the shot at 100%<br/> <br/>Everything else is pretty good, I like the composition and "feel" of the picture so even though I hate the sky I gave it a 6.</td>', 'The PP sky is a little bit over the top for my taste, just looks unnatural and there is a very visible line along the horizon and around her hair that shows where your lasso tool (or whatever you used) was when dividing the two areas for the editing so if you are going to do something like this (wich I encourage cause it looks promising, just too much this time), take steps to cover up your tracks, even if you have to do it pixel by pixel viewing the shot at 100% Everything else is pretty good, I like the composition and "feel" of the picture so even though I hate the sky I gave it a 6.', '2006-01-18 16:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054936, 276940, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image. Colors are nice and vivid. Seems flat to me somehow though - I don''t feel the depth here. I have the same problem with a lot of my shots. I think that is what sets apart nice shots like this and those that pop</td>', 'Nice sharp image. Colors are nice and vivid. Seems flat to me somehow though - I don''t feel the depth here. I have the same problem with a lot of my shots. I think that is what sets apart nice shots like this and those that pop', '2006-01-18 16:07:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2054938, 278390, 27482, '<td valign="top">Like it, looks like a lovely spot to visit and would make a great postcard.  Horizon looks a little crooked though but I am not sure, could be my eyes are fooling me there.  7 from me.</td>', 'Like it, looks like a lovely spot to visit and would make a great postcard.  Horizon looks a little crooked though but I am not sure, could be my eyes are fooling me there.  7 from me.', '2006-01-18 16:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054939, 275667, 37252, '<td valign="top">Wow - I love the warm colors. Beautifully composed shot. You have captured the water pefectly for this one. Nice detail in the rocks - sharp!</td>', 'Wow - I love the warm colors. Beautifully composed shot. You have captured the water pefectly for this one. Nice detail in the rocks - sharp!', '2006-01-18 16:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054940, 274768, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent silhouette and composition.  The color pops nicely in this image :) - 10</td>', 'Excellent silhouette and composition.  The color pops nicely in this image :) - 10', '2006-01-18 16:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054946, 275350, 27556, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful location but with the title as such i would have pefered that it be the main focus of this shot, there is too much going on in this shot if that is the subject</td>', 'this is a beautiful location but with the title as such i would have pefered that it be the main focus of this shot, there is too much going on in this shot if that is the subject', '2006-01-18 16:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054947, 280714, 28141, '<td valign="top">Very noisy, which I find distracting.</td>', 'Very noisy, which I find distracting.', '2006-01-18 16:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054948, 278040, 30364, '<td valign="top">My number one choice of my four 10''s in the challenge,  <br/>It has tension and beauty together.  Several bold, unorthodox ideas are combined with just enough convention to reassure any viewer who begins to feel too disoriented.  Such an original and subtly erotic tribute to the subject ... but that''s not all!  All this is done without the inclusion of a single photographic cliche. A beautiful work.  10.5</td>', 'My number one choice of my four 10''s in the challenge,  It has tension and beauty together.  Several bold, unorthodox ideas are combined with just enough convention to reassure any viewer who begins to feel too disoriented.  Such an original and subtly erotic tribute to the subject ... but that''s not all!  All this is done without the inclusion of a single photographic cliche. A beautiful work.  10.5', '2006-01-18 16:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054962, 275218, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting, very mysterious and just right for this image.</td>', 'Love the lighting, very mysterious and just right for this image.', '2006-01-18 16:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054972, 275404, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love it, the snow totally makes this image, otherwise it would just have been pretty ordinary.</td>', 'Love it, the snow totally makes this image, otherwise it would just have been pretty ordinary.', '2006-01-18 16:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054973, 281602, 38234, '<td valign="top">beautiful sky and great silhouette and nice quiet feel, I believe the horizon needs a slight ccw rotation</td>', 'beautiful sky and great silhouette and nice quiet feel, I believe the horizon needs a slight ccw rotation', '2006-01-18 16:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054976, 280416, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, very nice, not quite a 10 but close enough, gave this a 9.  Phenomenal composition and the blown out highlights on the bottom waves don´t even bother me in the least, that just seems fitting for the shot and draws attention to the upper part of the photo with the surfers.  Nice work!</td>', 'Nice, very nice, not quite a 10 but close enough, gave this a 9.  Phenomenal composition and the blown out highlights on the bottom waves don´t even bother me in the least, that just seems fitting for the shot and draws attention to the upper part of the photo with the surfers.  Nice work!', '2006-01-18 16:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054978, 274722, 30364, '<td valign="top">Opportunity for him, but inspiration for you.  Well done.  A very fine documentary photograph, and they never go out of fashion.  8.</td>', 'Opportunity for him, but inspiration for you.  Well done.  A very fine documentary photograph, and they never go out of fashion.  8.', '2006-01-18 16:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054980, 281204, 37252, '<td valign="top">this is kinda too "in your face" and not in focus enough.</td>', 'this is kinda too "in your face" and not in focus enough.', '2006-01-18 16:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054986, 276302, 37252, '<td valign="top">nice gray tones. I like the shine in the cats eye too.</td>', 'nice gray tones. I like the shine in the cats eye too.', '2006-01-18 16:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054999, 282000, 38234, '<td valign="top">perhaps a more artistic presentation of this poingnant dedication would have worked better, something close up and at a differnt angle - I''m sorry to say that as is, this looks like a tourist shot</td>', 'perhaps a more artistic presentation of this poingnant dedication would have worked better, something close up and at a differnt angle - I''m sorry to say that as is, this looks like a tourist shot', '2006-01-18 16:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055003, 281460, 30364, '<td valign="top">An understated landscape, but with the added charm of including a miniature landscape-within-a-landscape in the foreground rock and pools; a clever subtlety that has only recently been brought to my attention as a landscape technique.  For that and several other reasons, this is a very satisfying and "complete" work.  8.</td>', 'An understated landscape, but with the added charm of including a miniature landscape-within-a-landscape in the foreground rock and pools; a clever subtlety that has only recently been brought to my attention as a landscape technique.  For that and several other reasons, this is a very satisfying and "complete" work.  8.', '2006-01-18 16:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055006, 276059, 37252, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot. I really like the textures and lines.</td>', 'beautiful shot. I really like the textures and lines.', '2006-01-18 16:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055009, 276762, 37252, '<td valign="top">aww - she sure looks happy up there in mid-air. I like the sense of depth - good focus on the cutie.</td>', 'aww - she sure looks happy up there in mid-air. I like the sense of depth - good focus on the cutie.', '2006-01-18 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055018, 275086, 772, '<td valign="top">A ten by any other name would be as sweet... 10</td>', 'A ten by any other name would be as sweet... 10', '2006-01-18 16:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055020, 274786, 772, '<td valign="top">Innocence indeed :)  This is almost like a modern day Norman Rockwell piece... This photo would be the best of any portfolio... great work! 10</td>', 'Innocence indeed :)  This is almost like a modern day Norman Rockwell piece... This photo would be the best of any portfolio... great work! 10', '2006-01-18 16:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055021, 279667, 37252, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot - beautiful colors and reflections. Shot at the perfect ime of evening it looks. The old wood piers are sharp - love it.</td>', 'I like this a lot - beautiful colors and reflections. Shot at the perfect ime of evening it looks. The old wood piers are sharp - love it.', '2006-01-18 16:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055026, 281542, 772, '<td valign="top">great charachter portrait... beautiful black and white as well... 10</td>', 'great charachter portrait... beautiful black and white as well... 10', '2006-01-18 16:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055030, 280809, 772, '<td valign="top">Exceptional character portrait... 10</td>', 'Exceptional character portrait... 10', '2006-01-18 16:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055036, 281383, 772, '<td valign="top">Forever :)  They are beautiful even when tattered and torn.  The color here is gorgeous.. 10</td>', 'Forever :)  They are beautiful even when tattered and torn.  The color here is gorgeous.. 10', '2006-01-18 16:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055049, 277388, 42095, '<td valign="top">Eeerrrriiiiieee, I love it!</td>', 'Eeerrrriiiiieee, I love it!', '2006-01-18 16:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055051, 276895, 35994, '<td valign="top">I would''ve cropped the left side a little more, the background is a little distracting. Cute pose he did for you</td>', 'I would''ve cropped the left side a little more, the background is a little distracting. Cute pose he did for you', '2006-01-18 16:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055054, 281836, 42095, '<td valign="top">Love everything about this picture very much!<br/> <br/>Rate: 10</td>', 'Love everything about this picture very much! Rate: 10', '2006-01-18 16:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055057, 274614, 35994, '<td valign="top">Adorabe photo, love the detail in the eyes!</td>', 'Adorabe photo, love the detail in the eyes!', '2006-01-18 16:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055058, 281752, 42095, '<td valign="top">Love it!<br/> <br/>Rate 10</td>', 'Love it! Rate 10', '2006-01-18 16:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055063, 275350, 12268, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot with some great colour contrast between the sky &amp; sand. I imagine you are getting lots of comments about the slant of the horizon with some commenters noticing that the slant was a trade off to have the tower straight. It''s a difficult choice I''m sure, especially if you we on vacation &amp; couldn''t just go back to the spot &amp; reshoot it. Ideally, that is what I would have done. Good luck!</td>', 'This is a nice shot with some great colour contrast between the sky & sand. I imagine you are getting lots of comments about the slant of the horizon with some commenters noticing that the slant was a trade off to have the tower straight. It''s a difficult choice I''m sure, especially if you we on vacation & couldn''t just go back to the spot & reshoot it. Ideally, that is what I would have done. Good luck!', '2006-01-18 16:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055064, 274569, 42095, '<td valign="top">Love it!<br/> <br/>Rate:10</td>', 'Love it! Rate:10', '2006-01-18 16:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055070, 279044, 37252, '<td valign="top">nic emotive shot. The person off in the distance is distracting though - might try removing them</td>', 'nic emotive shot. The person off in the distance is distracting though - might try removing them', '2006-01-18 16:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055073, 281383, 19952, '<td valign="top">It''s rare that I see a flag picture that I actually like, but this one is really exceptional. The lighting sets off the textures really nicely.</td>', 'It''s rare that I see a flag picture that I actually like, but this one is really exceptional. The lighting sets off the textures really nicely.', '2006-01-18 16:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055076, 276533, 37252, '<td valign="top">nice sharp focus. good feeling of depth</td>', 'nice sharp focus. good feeling of depth', '2006-01-18 16:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055080, 277879, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines - I get drawn to the oats and then to the bridge they will paqss under. I like the vibrance of the colors. Well done</td>', 'Nice leading lines - I get drawn to the oats and then to the bridge they will paqss under. I like the vibrance of the colors. Well done', '2006-01-18 16:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055084, 275758, 37252, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. I like the freezing action of the water splash.</td>', 'Great action shot. I like the freezing action of the water splash.', '2006-01-18 16:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
