(2055297, 274592, 5728, '<td valign="top">I remember this girl from your other work, Elsapo. I like the image you have chosen for your best work of 2005, the color tones of the hair fit well to the background. Photographically it comes over with impact. The composition is ideal, I wouldn''t have cropped it any differently. The hair wildly blowing in the lower half of the frame and "cleaner" at the top is also effective. I find however that you have over-processed the eyes a little, the detail is lost in the whites of the eyes and a little unnaturalness has been introduced. And although not to drastic, the aura on the upper lip is just over borderline, I would have reduced that effect only slightly. Otherwise a super photo and one of the better I have seen amongst these 800+ entries!</td>', 'I remember this girl from your other work, Elsapo. I like the image you have chosen for your best work of 2005, the color tones of the hair fit well to the background. Photographically it comes over with impact. The composition is ideal, I wouldn''t have cropped it any differently. The hair wildly blowing in the lower half of the frame and "cleaner" at the top is also effective. I find however that you have over-processed the eyes a little, the detail is lost in the whites of the eyes and a little unnaturalness has been introduced. And although not to drastic, the aura on the upper lip is just over borderline, I would have reduced that effect only slightly. Otherwise a super photo and one of the better I have seen amongst these 800+ entries!', '2006-01-18 17:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
