(2055481, 276521, 14700, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite so far.  One suggestion I have (just a suggestion I''m giving this a 10) would be cloning out some of dead area of the tree with the vibrant green leaves.  However, no matter how intricate of a cloning job you do it would be evident in a large print.... it would have been convincing on the web.  Great job!</td>', 'This is my favorite so far.  One suggestion I have (just a suggestion I''m giving this a 10) would be cloning out some of dead area of the tree with the vibrant green leaves.  However, no matter how intricate of a cloning job you do it would be evident in a large print.... it would have been convincing on the web.  Great job!', '2006-01-18 18:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
