(2055500, 277621, 7628, '<td valign="top">Woah!  Is this real?  What increadible light and colors - all at the moment 4 bucks arrive on the scene!  Nice composition as everything seems to converge toward the bottom center.  I like the out of focus forground - it place the viewer in the middle of this remarkable moment without distracting.</td>', 'Woah!  Is this real?  What increadible light and colors - all at the moment 4 bucks arrive on the scene!  Nice composition as everything seems to converge toward the bottom center.  I like the out of focus forground - it place the viewer in the middle of this remarkable moment without distracting.', '2006-01-18 18:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
