(2055541, 281715, 7628, '<td valign="top">The yellow of the stage lights is fun and puts the viewer in the "concert mood."  Mat''s yellow shirt predominates and draws the eye away from his expressive face - perhaps a little selective burning to add some atmosphere and direct the eyes more?</td>', 'The yellow of the stage lights is fun and puts the viewer in the "concert mood."  Mat''s yellow shirt predominates and draws the eye away from his expressive face - perhaps a little selective burning to add some atmosphere and direct the eyes more?', '2006-01-18 18:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
