(2055545, 274615, 14700, '<td valign="top">I imagine that the original file was beautiful... perhaps a little out of focus.  I have to say you did a terrific job getting an honest emotion in the photo.  She looks intreaging.  I think, in the end, it there is just too much Photoshoping.  I understand you are going for a high-key high-contrast image but there are too many areas of solid black with no detail and white with rough edges.  It has potential to be a terriffic photo.</td>', 'I imagine that the original file was beautiful... perhaps a little out of focus.  I have to say you did a terrific job getting an honest emotion in the photo.  She looks intreaging.  I think, in the end, it there is just too much Photoshoping.  I understand you are going for a high-key high-contrast image but there are too many areas of solid black with no detail and white with rough edges.  It has potential to be a terriffic photo.', '2006-01-18 18:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055554, 274790, 37252, '<td valign="top">real nice frog macro. I like repitles - you really capture nice detial on this little one.</td>', 'real nice frog macro. I like repitles - you really capture nice detial on this little one.', '2006-01-18 18:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055555, 275966, 30392, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot,  it really conveys the feeling of emptiness and loneliness. it''s a shame it isn''t 640 pixels wide, you probably know that by now...</td>', 'This is a great shot,  it really conveys the feeling of emptiness and loneliness. it''s a shame it isn''t 640 pixels wide, you probably know that by now...', '2006-01-18 18:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055558, 279719, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the way his white shirt and her white dress blend, almost making them one person.  They look nice frames against the ocean (is it real?  it seems very flat - perhaps better lighting?)  Your horizon is tilted and there are some odd white space at the left and right edges of the photo.  There are some distracting vertical lines in the sky. Focus isn''t quite sharp.</td>', 'I like the way his white shirt and her white dress blend, almost making them one person.  They look nice frames against the ocean (is it real?  it seems very flat - perhaps better lighting?)  Your horizon is tilted and there are some odd white space at the left and right edges of the photo.  There are some distracting vertical lines in the sky. Focus isn''t quite sharp.', '2006-01-18 18:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055561, 274852, 24613, '<td valign="top">This looks very much like a Christmas card!  Wonderful job! 10</td>', 'This looks very much like a Christmas card!  Wonderful job! 10', '2006-01-18 18:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055562, 277184, 33982, '<td valign="top">over sharpened</td>', 'over sharpened', '2006-01-18 18:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055567, 281955, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the feathers and great colors.  I''d like to see some bottom and left cropped off the gray and green blur pull my eyes away from the bird.  I know you want to watch not to crop the beak too close - perhaps if you tilted the picture a bit clockwise first?</td>', 'Nice detail in the feathers and great colors.  I''d like to see some bottom and left cropped off the gray and green blur pull my eyes away from the bird.  I know you want to watch not to crop the beak too close - perhaps if you tilted the picture a bit clockwise first?', '2006-01-18 18:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055568, 277006, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but would have had a much better impact if you used full size. 7</td>', 'Very nice, but would have had a much better impact if you used full size. 7', '2006-01-18 18:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055571, 281580, 14700, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This would be a nine or ten if he wa showing a little emotion.  You did everything perfect that you could do technically.  I''m ok with the centered composition because the red and white background is what really makes this photo great.  Anyone who complains about your composition hasn''t evaluated you photo enough.  Color is part of composition too.... not just position.  Well done.</td>', 'Wow!  This would be a nine or ten if he wa showing a little emotion.  You did everything perfect that you could do technically.  I''m ok with the centered composition because the red and white background is what really makes this photo great.  Anyone who complains about your composition hasn''t evaluated you photo enough.  Color is part of composition too.... not just position.  Well done.', '2006-01-18 18:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055573, 281317, 30392, '<td valign="top">nice composition and lovely colors. I''m glad you didn''t neatimage the pic to death like so many in this challenge. I like the noise! You might want to fix the horizon though, it could do with a slight counter-clockwise rotation...</td>', 'nice composition and lovely colors. I''m glad you didn''t neatimage the pic to death like so many in this challenge. I like the noise! You might want to fix the horizon though, it could do with a slight counter-clockwise rotation...', '2006-01-18 18:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
