(2055592, 281139, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is a very typical cat pose - a sweet portrait of Buttercup.  The window frame creates a nice diagonal and the reflection gives balance.  It might be a more catchy photo if the reflection were brighter (some burning?) and we''d get to see Buttercup''s face better  which would give more personality to the image.</td>', 'This is a very typical cat pose - a sweet portrait of Buttercup.  The window frame creates a nice diagonal and the reflection gives balance.  It might be a more catchy photo if the reflection were brighter (some burning?) and we''d get to see Buttercup''s face better  which would give more personality to the image.', '2006-01-18 18:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055594, 281730, 33982, '<td valign="top">has a very unworldy feel</td>', 'has a very unworldy feel', '2006-01-18 18:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055595, 274791, 49224, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting on this one spechialy on the mains.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting on this one spechialy on the mains.', '2006-01-18 18:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055599, 279001, 49224, '<td valign="top">perfect catch :D</td>', 'perfect catch :D', '2006-01-18 18:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055601, 278093, 7628, '<td valign="top">The colors and composition of this photo are full of fantasy.  However it is sized so small I can barely see it.  Check to make sure your pictures are 640 pixles in their greatest dimension - no less!</td>', 'The colors and composition of this photo are full of fantasy.  However it is sized so small I can barely see it.  Check to make sure your pictures are 640 pixles in their greatest dimension - no less!', '2006-01-18 18:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055602, 278939, 14700, '<td valign="top">Your colors are very vibrant and they go together well.... but this is pretty out of focus.  I''m not entirely sure what it is.  Perhaps if you zoomed out a little it would give us a context to interpret it with... or a title.  Great color.</td>', 'Your colors are very vibrant and they go together well.... but this is pretty out of focus.  I''m not entirely sure what it is.  Perhaps if you zoomed out a little it would give us a context to interpret it with... or a title.  Great color.', '2006-01-18 18:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055604, 281132, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  Nice DOF - 9</td>', 'Very cool shot!  Nice DOF - 9', '2006-01-18 18:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055605, 274775, 33982, '<td valign="top">the nearly dead tree detracts from the sunset</td>', 'the nearly dead tree detracts from the sunset', '2006-01-18 18:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055609, 279221, 7628, '<td valign="top">What a face!  The depth of focus reall catches and emphasizes the eyes - but the processing 9I''m assuming use neat imaged and blurred a bit?) makes him look a bit like a claymation figure.</td>', 'What a face!  The depth of focus reall catches and emphasizes the eyes - but the processing 9I''m assuming use neat imaged and blurred a bit?) makes him look a bit like a claymation figure.', '2006-01-18 18:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055612, 276302, 7628, '<td valign="top">What a cute kitten profile!  You have captured that intense gaze I like so much.  The contrast is pretty low - not a lot of range in your black to white, and the cut off ears are a bit distracting, wish we could see the wiskers extending down from the cheek too.</td>', 'What a cute kitten profile!  You have captured that intense gaze I like so much.  The contrast is pretty low - not a lot of range in your black to white, and the cut off ears are a bit distracting, wish we could see the wiskers extending down from the cheek too.', '2006-01-18 18:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055613, 274540, 46097, '<td valign="top">lovely photo. I just wish the subject was off center.......still, a strong entry.</td>', 'lovely photo. I just wish the subject was off center.......still, a strong entry.', '2006-01-18 18:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055614, 275391, 14700, '<td valign="top">PERFECT CONTRAST on a difficult subject.  Great detail.  I applaud you on not sharpening the hell out of it.  This is a harder shot to achieve than most people care to notice.  Well done.</td>', 'PERFECT CONTRAST on a difficult subject.  Great detail.  I applaud you on not sharpening the hell out of it.  This is a harder shot to achieve than most people care to notice.  Well done.', '2006-01-18 18:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055617, 281875, 27514, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what I''m looking at. but I do like the picture.</td>', 'I''m not really sure what I''m looking at. but I do like the picture.', '2006-01-18 18:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055618, 275350, 30392, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the exposure is spot one. I''m glad you didn''t use noise reduction, it doesn''t really work with sand! two things I think would improve the shot: straighten the horizon and less sharpening</td>', 'Nice shot, the exposure is spot one. I''m glad you didn''t use noise reduction, it doesn''t really work with sand! two things I think would improve the shot: straighten the horizon and less sharpening', '2006-01-18 18:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
