(2055686, 280729, 7628, '<td valign="top">A nice portrayal of the feeling of loneliness -Noone is there - you are only a shadow - the only color is in the mirror and not real.  I find the bright spots on the left edge and under the arch distracting - I''d clone them out.  The grain is very noticeable, but suits the theme IMO.</td>', 'A nice portrayal of the feeling of loneliness -Noone is there - you are only a shadow - the only color is in the mirror and not real.  I find the bright spots on the left edge and under the arch distracting - I''d clone them out.  The grain is very noticeable, but suits the theme IMO.', '2006-01-18 19:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055687, 281812, 49224, '<td valign="top">lovely use of desaturation to create a focus point</td>', 'lovely use of desaturation to create a focus point', '2006-01-18 19:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055689, 275758, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice catch.  Wish the top and right extreems of the wave/splash weren''t off the edge of the pict - it confines the exuberant action of the surfer.</td>', 'Nice catch.  Wish the top and right extreems of the wave/splash weren''t off the edge of the pict - it confines the exuberant action of the surfer.', '2006-01-18 19:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
