(2056045, 281965, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp on most of the butterfly, but I wish the DoF was wider so we could see the detail on the wing. That''s the best part of a butterfly in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice and sharp on most of the butterfly, but I wish the DoF was wider so we could see the detail on the wing. That''s the best part of a butterfly in my opinion.', '2006-01-18 20:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056047, 279966, 34481, '<td valign="top">Sets such a beautiful mood.  I love it.</td>', 'Sets such a beautiful mood.  I love it.', '2006-01-18 20:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056050, 274540, 26313, '<td valign="top">I love this. The light is amazing, and b&amp;w is a nice choice too. It would be great even without the bird, but the bird really does add to it. Great shot. One of my favourites in the challenge.</td>', 'I love this. The light is amazing, and b&w is a nice choice too. It would be great even without the bird, but the bird really does add to it. Great shot. One of my favourites in the challenge.', '2006-01-18 20:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
