(2056089, 275143, 40797, '<td valign="top">What a neat compostion. I like how you captured this beautiful horse in the upper right hand side of the frame with all the grass below leading up to him. Very pretty!</td>', 'What a neat compostion. I like how you captured this beautiful horse in the upper right hand side of the frame with all the grass below leading up to him. Very pretty!', '2006-01-18 20:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056092, 280870, 93, '<td valign="top">For me, the trees just distract too much instead of adding that interest element you were probably going for.  That looks like a gorgeous sky, but I can''t really see it.  The Conifer on the right just doesn''t belong.</td>', 'For me, the trees just distract too much instead of adding that interest element you were probably going for.  That looks like a gorgeous sky, but I can''t really see it.  The Conifer on the right just doesn''t belong.', '2006-01-18 20:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
