(2056127, 281766, 93, '<td valign="top">I like that you''ve tried to give this photo a little more of a dynamic composition, but the subject matter doesn''t really pull me in.  The harsh lighting does it no favors either, IMO.  This shot, in a softer light.. evening, sunset, early morning.. could really jump, and I''d recommend a tighter crop.</td>', 'I like that you''ve tried to give this photo a little more of a dynamic composition, but the subject matter doesn''t really pull me in.  The harsh lighting does it no favors either, IMO.  This shot, in a softer light.. evening, sunset, early morning.. could really jump, and I''d recommend a tighter crop.', '2006-01-18 20:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056128, 276781, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped about half way down the sky. The top half is mostly just brown and doesn''t really add anything in my opinion.</td>', 'I think I would have cropped about half way down the sky. The top half is mostly just brown and doesn''t really add anything in my opinion.', '2006-01-18 20:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
