(2056146, 276810, 93, '<td valign="top">Not particularily interesting to me.  Technically, it''s ok, but in other areas it''s just a shot of sticks on a beach.  The eyes wander all over, and there''s no real interesting focal point.</td>', 'Not particularily interesting to me.  Technically, it''s ok, but in other areas it''s just a shot of sticks on a beach.  The eyes wander all over, and there''s no real interesting focal point.', '2006-01-18 20:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
