(2056269, 276787, 26313, '<td valign="top">The edges on the second canoe from the front look a little jagged, which is a little curious, as I don''t really see it anywhere else in the image. Nice shot.</td>', 'The edges on the second canoe from the front look a little jagged, which is a little curious, as I don''t really see it anywhere else in the image. Nice shot.', '2006-01-18 21:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056270, 281905, 93, '<td valign="top">Hard to comment uniquely on so many flower phoots.  This one lacks the lighting needed to really stand it out, along with a weak compositional presentation.</td>', 'Hard to comment uniquely on so many flower phoots.  This one lacks the lighting needed to really stand it out, along with a weak compositional presentation.', '2006-01-18 21:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056271, 275932, 47378, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of "good" shots in this competition. This is one of the few "great" shots that really makes me say "wow". 9.</td>', 'There are a lot of "good" shots in this competition. This is one of the few "great" shots that really makes me say "wow". 9.', '2006-01-18 21:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056274, 280287, 93, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but needed a little more color boost to really stand it out. (and contrast.)</td>', 'Interesting, but needed a little more color boost to really stand it out. (and contrast.)', '2006-01-18 21:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056275, 280369, 93, '<td valign="top">A good eye to see this, but I''m not too keen on the processing.</td>', 'A good eye to see this, but I''m not too keen on the processing.', '2006-01-18 21:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056281, 280237, 26313, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and textures, but composition seems off--I want to see more on the right.</td>', 'Nice colours and textures, but composition seems off--I want to see more on the right.', '2006-01-18 21:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056282, 281214, 93, '<td valign="top">Just lacking that interest factor to really stand it out.  It reminds me of a good photo for an encyclopedia, but for DPC, just too static.</td>', 'Just lacking that interest factor to really stand it out.  It reminds me of a good photo for an encyclopedia, but for DPC, just too static.', '2006-01-18 21:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056283, 276752, 93, '<td valign="top">Wonderful B&amp;W processing.  The lines and light/shadow are truly intriguing</td>', 'Wonderful B&W processing.  The lines and light/shadow are truly intriguing', '2006-01-18 21:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056288, 279771, 93, '<td valign="top">Very bold processing which I personally like.  Probably not the best choice for DPC as a whole, but it''s very moody, and the strong contrast lends a lot.  Good going for being gutsy enough to enter.</td>', 'Very bold processing which I personally like.  Probably not the best choice for DPC as a whole, but it''s very moody, and the strong contrast lends a lot.  Good going for being gutsy enough to enter.', '2006-01-18 21:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056289, 281142, 93, '<td valign="top">I like the sea of clouds, but the strong sun detracts.</td>', 'I like the sea of clouds, but the strong sun detracts.', '2006-01-18 21:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056303, 281429, 93, '<td valign="top">very nice, but I''d love to see more light in the snowy areas.</td>', 'very nice, but I''d love to see more light in the snowy areas.', '2006-01-18 21:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056304, 278040, 38032, '<td valign="top">intriguing and artistic</td>', 'intriguing and artistic', '2006-01-18 21:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056307, 277196, 93, '<td valign="top">Selective Desat is a tough choice, and I personally don''t like the usage here.  The B&amp;W conversion of the rest of the photo is flat and needing a little more contrast, and even though they are the only things in color, the flowers just don''t stand out as interesting enough to sell the photo.</td>', 'Selective Desat is a tough choice, and I personally don''t like the usage here.  The B&W conversion of the rest of the photo is flat and needing a little more contrast, and even though they are the only things in color, the flowers just don''t stand out as interesting enough to sell the photo.', '2006-01-18 21:34:31.000000', NULL, 1);
