(2056371, 274847, 38032, '<td valign="top">brilliant --- 8 ... the compostition is the only thing that''s not the coolest photo I''ve ever seen ... other than that ... so cool -sooo huge - the hippo even wants a camera.</td>', 'brilliant --- 8 ... the compostition is the only thing that''s not the coolest photo I''ve ever seen ... other than that ... so cool -sooo huge - the hippo even wants a camera.', '2006-01-18 21:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
