(2056623, 277676, 36528, '<td valign="top">Great image: excellent composition, exposure, subject, lighting, DOF, and colour. Well done. The only drawback to me is the white pin stripe around the border: to me it ''encloses'' the image too much when it is a subject that is so broad and deep. I would have just stuck with the black or none at all. I don''t detract marks for borders though - just a suggestion...</td>', 'Great image: excellent composition, exposure, subject, lighting, DOF, and colour. Well done. The only drawback to me is the white pin stripe around the border: to me it ''encloses'' the image too much when it is a subject that is so broad and deep. I would have just stuck with the black or none at all. I don''t detract marks for borders though - just a suggestion...', '2006-01-18 22:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
