(2056675, 281760, 36528, '<td valign="top">I''m a fan of insect pics, and I sometimes get annoyed at people criticising shallow DOF on macros taken in the natural setting as I know how hard it can be. However, I do think this could have been improved by ensuring the focus extended to the head. Otherwise with the existing picture crop it down to just a detailed study of the wings because you have captured these really well...</td>', 'I''m a fan of insect pics, and I sometimes get annoyed at people criticising shallow DOF on macros taken in the natural setting as I know how hard it can be. However, I do think this could have been improved by ensuring the focus extended to the head. Otherwise with the existing picture crop it down to just a detailed study of the wings because you have captured these really well...', '2006-01-18 22:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056679, 280797, 33400, '<td valign="top">I think your lighting here really sets this apart from other soft portraits in this challenge.You bring out her features, face and body, sharply while leaving her overall image soft.  Nice contrast.</td>', 'I think your lighting here really sets this apart from other soft portraits in this challenge.You bring out her features, face and body, sharply while leaving her overall image soft.  Nice contrast.', '2006-01-18 22:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
