(2056866, 277970, 33400, '<td valign="top">The title says t very well.  I''m not sure the necklace is necessary.  I get that it adds a flavor of intrigue to the shot, I just don''t think it''s needed. Her expression, the back light, and how pretty she is, makes this a great portrait.</td>', 'The title says t very well.  I''m not sure the necklace is necessary.  I get that it adds a flavor of intrigue to the shot, I just don''t think it''s needed. Her expression, the back light, and how pretty she is, makes this a great portrait.', '2006-01-18 23:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
