(2056890, 281344, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like the not-quite-symmetry of this landscape, and the beautiful tonal progression from front to back.  The exposure &amp; processing is great - there''s just enough visible to make it more than a silhouette, but not enough to dilute the essence of the scene with irrelevant details.  It''s perfectly composed, too.  8.</td>', 'I like the not-quite-symmetry of this landscape, and the beautiful tonal progression from front to back.  The exposure & processing is great - there''s just enough visible to make it more than a silhouette, but not enough to dilute the essence of the scene with irrelevant details.  It''s perfectly composed, too.  8.', '2006-01-18 23:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
