(2056933, 277089, 30364, '<td valign="top">Good subject, but also well treated in this bold composition.  It''s the great, burning height of the wall that is the essence of this scene, and establishes the context for the tiny person to be cowering in shelter.  I also like the inclusion of the patches of peeling paint at upper right - so glad you were confident enough to leave them there!  8.</td>', 'Good subject, but also well treated in this bold composition.  It''s the great, burning height of the wall that is the essence of this scene, and establishes the context for the tiny person to be cowering in shelter.  I also like the inclusion of the patches of peeling paint at upper right - so glad you were confident enough to leave them there!  8.', '2006-01-18 23:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
