(2057026, 282008, 30364, '<td valign="top">Two rather similar bicycle still life images in the challenge, and I really can''t separate them in terms of appeal.  They are both terrific, for the same reasons; they each combine a bicycle with a context to establish a line of speculation about location, owner, what happens next, and so forth.  Each bicycle also has some intriguing cargo on board.  And the two images are equally, but differently, photographically accomplished.  Inevitably, the same score from me (so I guess I''ll have to post the same comment to each).  8.</td>', 'Two rather similar bicycle still life images in the challenge, and I really can''t separate them in terms of appeal.  They are both terrific, for the same reasons; they each combine a bicycle with a context to establish a line of speculation about location, owner, what happens next, and so forth.  Each bicycle also has some intriguing cargo on board.  And the two images are equally, but differently, photographically accomplished.  Inevitably, the same score from me (so I guess I''ll have to post the same comment to each).  8.', '2006-01-18 23:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2057030, 279653, 30364, '<td valign="top">Two rather similar bicycle still life images in the challenge, and I really can''t separate them in terms of appeal.  They are both terrific, for the same reasons; they each combine a bicycle with a context to establish a line of speculation about location, owner, what happens next, and so forth.  Each bicycle also has some intriguing cargo on board.  And the two images are equally, but differently, photographically accomplished.  Inevitably, the same score from me (so I guess I''ll have to post the same comment to each).  8.</td>', 'Two rather similar bicycle still life images in the challenge, and I really can''t separate them in terms of appeal.  They are both terrific, for the same reasons; they each combine a bicycle with a context to establish a line of speculation about location, owner, what happens next, and so forth.  Each bicycle also has some intriguing cargo on board.  And the two images are equally, but differently, photographically accomplished.  Inevitably, the same score from me (so I guess I''ll have to post the same comment to each).  8.', '2006-01-18 23:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
