(2057513, 281367, 22046, '<td valign="top">Rarely do I think a tipped aspect works well but here it does. It emphasizes his agility and makes us all more aware of the strength it takes for him to do this.</td>', 'Rarely do I think a tipped aspect works well but here it does. It emphasizes his agility and makes us all more aware of the strength it takes for him to do this.', '2006-01-19 02:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
