(2057527, 277621, 22046, '<td valign="top">My only complaint with this is the forground. I''d crop it more to get rid of the busy out of focus area as much as possible without crowding the deer. From the deer up this photograph is magical. I gave it an 8 for that reason.</td>', 'My only complaint with this is the forground. I''d crop it more to get rid of the busy out of focus area as much as possible without crowding the deer. From the deer up this photograph is magical. I gave it an 8 for that reason.', '2006-01-19 02:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
