(2058291, 274852, 27812, '<td valign="top">Indeed a christmas card, one you should really consider to sell to the highest bidder.<br/>Looking at the pic I am astounded by the sheer beauty you have captured. Then one looks at the technicalities.. all by the book, but secondary once an image like this has been captured. The sharpness, contrasts and light play is great. The surreal serenity is worth remembering forever. Mind you, it is that little purple that caught my eye... and kept it!10</td>', 'Indeed a christmas card, one you should really consider to sell to the highest bidder.Looking at the pic I am astounded by the sheer beauty you have captured. Then one looks at the technicalities.. all by the book, but secondary once an image like this has been captured. The sharpness, contrasts and light play is great. The surreal serenity is worth remembering forever. Mind you, it is that little purple that caught my eye... and kept it!10', '2006-01-19 07:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058299, 281176, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool, the location reminds me of a local waterfall here in Iceland, look at my profile at "svartifoss" and you´ll probably see what I mean.  Anyway, gotta watch those highlights in waterfall shots but otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'Pretty cool, the location reminds me of a local waterfall here in Iceland, look at my profile at "svartifoss" and you´ll probably see what I mean.  Anyway, gotta watch those highlights in waterfall shots but otherwise a nice shot.', '2006-01-19 07:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
