(2059349, 281021, 37252, '<td valign="top">Iinteresting pp here. I like the composition, and the pp to the foliage - but the blue faces strike me as odd.</td>', 'Iinteresting pp here. I like the composition, and the pp to the foliage - but the blue faces strike me as odd.', '2006-01-19 12:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059352, 280833, 37252, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''ve ever seen this type flower before. Very delicate looking. The lighting is most perfect. I keep peering into this flower as it appears that there is a litle green bug in there....makes it interesting.</td>', 'I don''t think I''ve ever seen this type flower before. Very delicate looking. The lighting is most perfect. I keep peering into this flower as it appears that there is a litle green bug in there....makes it interesting.', '2006-01-19 12:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059357, 281212, 37252, '<td valign="top">nice sharp image. I like the B/W - very nice. Also the way the tracks lead my eye to the mountain is pretty cool.</td>', 'nice sharp image. I like the B/W - very nice. Also the way the tracks lead my eye to the mountain is pretty cool.', '2006-01-19 12:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059359, 281483, 37252, '<td valign="top">It''s just amazing how you could catch this bird in flight and have it to in focus. Great job.</td>', 'It''s just amazing how you could catch this bird in flight and have it to in focus. Great job.', '2006-01-19 12:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059362, 281132, 41520, '<td valign="top">The focus point is awesome, nice job</td>', 'The focus point is awesome, nice job', '2006-01-19 12:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059372, 280860, 37252, '<td valign="top">Great focus! What a capture! You even got the exposure down on a shot you had to shoot fast for. A photo worthy of displaying - hope you have this on your wall.</td>', 'Great focus! What a capture! You even got the exposure down on a shot you had to shoot fast for. A photo worthy of displaying - hope you have this on your wall.', '2006-01-19 12:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059373, 281857, 37252, '<td valign="top">nice crisp focus on the front bird - good use of DOF to keep the second softer focused. I''m not real crazy about the added motion blur.</td>', 'nice crisp focus on the front bird - good use of DOF to keep the second softer focused. I''m not real crazy about the added motion blur.', '2006-01-19 12:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059380, 281596, 37252, '<td valign="top">Portrait works well here vs. landscape. The bished are just a bit too dark, might try doing some adjustment to bring out some detail on them. I like the sharpness.</td>', 'Portrait works well here vs. landscape. The bished are just a bit too dark, might try doing some adjustment to bring out some detail on them. I like the sharpness.', '2006-01-19 12:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059383, 281766, 37252, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of this shot. Good exposure also, as even the lighter shades are not blown out by the direct sun light.</td>', 'I like the angle of this shot. Good exposure also, as even the lighter shades are not blown out by the direct sun light.', '2006-01-19 12:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059384, 281751, 27562, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more of your excellent image and less border.  In fact a crop just below the diagonal tree in the upper left hand corner would have made the image more powerful.</td>', 'I would have liked to see more of your excellent image and less border.  In fact a crop just below the diagonal tree in the upper left hand corner would have made the image more powerful.', '2006-01-19 12:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059385, 279793, 37252, '<td valign="top">Pretty bird - vibrant colors  nice strong focus. Good use of DOF</td>', 'Pretty bird - vibrant colors  nice strong focus. Good use of DOF', '2006-01-19 12:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059403, 281627, 37252, '<td valign="top">Happy Place...makes me think of the movie Happy Gilmore. lol<br/>Nice colors over the water.</td>', 'Happy Place...makes me think of the movie Happy Gilmore. lolNice colors over the water.', '2006-01-19 12:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059404, 281176, 37252, '<td valign="top">nice shot of the water coming down. Sure would like to see where it is coming from though</td>', 'nice shot of the water coming down. Sure would like to see where it is coming from though', '2006-01-19 12:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059405, 281057, 37252, '<td valign="top">Good use of soft focus. I like the subdued colors here also</td>', 'Good use of soft focus. I like the subdued colors here also', '2006-01-19 12:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059407, 280588, 37252, '<td valign="top">looks a bit clumsy and the baby looks scare. The lighting however is very good - nice skin tones.</td>', 'looks a bit clumsy and the baby looks scare. The lighting however is very good - nice skin tones.', '2006-01-19 12:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059409, 281004, 37252, '<td valign="top">I like the catch lights in her eyes, and the distant stare...fits right in with your title. Well composed</td>', 'I like the catch lights in her eyes, and the distant stare...fits right in with your title. Well composed', '2006-01-19 12:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059412, 281326, 37252, '<td valign="top">I like that this was shot in portrait position vs. landscape. On the down side the sky is too gray, and the colors too muted. Focus is a bit soft also.</td>', 'I like that this was shot in portrait position vs. landscape. On the down side the sky is too gray, and the colors too muted. Focus is a bit soft also.', '2006-01-19 12:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059413, 274936, 41520, '<td valign="top">It would have been thousands of times better if it were framed better, I don''t like how it is just at the bottom of the pic.  Better placement would have given this photo a much higher score.</td>', 'It would have been thousands of times better if it were framed better, I don''t like how it is just at the bottom of the pic.  Better placement would have given this photo a much higher score.', '2006-01-19 12:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059425, 281609, 42792, '<td valign="top">This is still one of the best candids I''ve seen!  But I don''t think it''s by far the best of your portfolio. :)</td>', 'This is still one of the best candids I''ve seen!  But I don''t think it''s by far the best of your portfolio. :)', '2006-01-19 12:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059438, 281845, 37252, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro - good detail - lighting is very nice</td>', 'Very nice macro - good detail - lighting is very nice', '2006-01-19 12:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059442, 281965, 37252, '<td valign="top">would like to see more of the butterfly in focus - at least the front wing. I like the shallow DOF over the flowers. Nice Bokeh for the background</td>', 'would like to see more of the butterfly in focus - at least the front wing. I like the shallow DOF over the flowers. Nice Bokeh for the background', '2006-01-19 12:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059444, 280903, 37252, '<td valign="top">nice contrast of conditions...serene at the moment, but knowing all that is about to change sets up a good emotive shot</td>', 'nice contrast of conditions...serene at the moment, but knowing all that is about to change sets up a good emotive shot', '2006-01-19 12:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059445, 281338, 37252, '<td valign="top">good use of lines and shadows. the feeling of depth is powerful as well.</td>', 'good use of lines and shadows. the feeling of depth is powerful as well.', '2006-01-19 12:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059447, 276866, 42792, '<td valign="top">Beautiful play of layers, lines and colour in this.  One of the more different ones I''ve seen in this challenge.  The foreground just looks a little blur and over-sharpened at the same time (if that makes sense).  Probably a wee bit too much USM maybe?</td>', 'Beautiful play of layers, lines and colour in this.  One of the more different ones I''ve seen in this challenge.  The foreground just looks a little blur and over-sharpened at the same time (if that makes sense).  Probably a wee bit too much USM maybe?', '2006-01-19 12:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059451, 276000, 37252, '<td valign="top">sweet photo - will make for great memories later.</td>', 'sweet photo - will make for great memories later.', '2006-01-19 12:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059455, 281139, 37252, '<td valign="top">very nice portrait of this kitty - the reflection in the window is just right</td>', 'very nice portrait of this kitty - the reflection in the window is just right', '2006-01-19 12:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059462, 279446, 37252, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job! Love that reflection and the way this is composed. The exposure is very good as there are no blown out areas that I can see.</td>', 'Beautiful job! Love that reflection and the way this is composed. The exposure is very good as there are no blown out areas that I can see.', '2006-01-19 12:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059463, 281896, 17613, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2006-01-19 12:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059464, 274801, 17613, '<td valign="top">1642?? shouldn''t this have been taken in 2005? Your use of available light is excellent, almost a Dutch painting, which I am sure was in your head when you took it. Very beautiful use of colour and lighting.</td>', '1642?? shouldn''t this have been taken in 2005? Your use of available light is excellent, almost a Dutch painting, which I am sure was in your head when you took it. Very beautiful use of colour and lighting.', '2006-01-19 12:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
