(2059494, 281812, 42792, '<td valign="top">Found this to be rather interesting but I think the "wonder" is a little lost at this distance.  Probably not something you could change, just telling it as I see it.  Good luck.</td>', 'Found this to be rather interesting but I think the "wonder" is a little lost at this distance.  Probably not something you could change, just telling it as I see it.  Good luck.', '2006-01-19 12:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
