(2059498, 277561, 37252, '<td valign="top">excellent angle and compositon. Great use of natural light. I hope you have this framed and hanging somewhere - woujld be a waste not to.</td>', 'excellent angle and compositon. Great use of natural light. I hope you have this framed and hanging somewhere - woujld be a waste not to.', '2006-01-19 12:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
