(2059510, 278315, 37252, '<td valign="top">I really like the expression in the eys - beautiful eyes with great catch lights. I feel the crop is too tight along the lower lip</td>', 'I really like the expression in the eys - beautiful eyes with great catch lights. I feel the crop is too tight along the lower lip', '2006-01-19 12:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059511, 274701, 37252, '<td valign="top">Screamin'' Macaw!!! Great shot of a very colorful bird.</td>', 'Screamin'' Macaw!!! Great shot of a very colorful bird.', '2006-01-19 12:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059512, 278785, 40683, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait...One of my top picks...Love the earthy tones and the sweetly expressive moment that you captured.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait...One of my top picks...Love the earthy tones and the sweetly expressive moment that you captured.', '2006-01-19 12:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059514, 281937, 37252, '<td valign="top">The composition is very nice with the sunset right behind the steeple. It does seem a bit dark to me though, and noisy</td>', 'The composition is very nice with the sunset right behind the steeple. It does seem a bit dark to me though, and noisy', '2006-01-19 13:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059520, 278217, 37252, '<td valign="top">would be a real nice b/w portrait if it were not for the distraction of the mirror in front of this man''s face.</td>', 'would be a real nice b/w portrait if it were not for the distraction of the mirror in front of this man''s face.', '2006-01-19 13:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059521, 281767, 37851, '<td valign="top">Great colors and mood.  Very captivating!</td>', 'Great colors and mood.  Very captivating!', '2006-01-19 13:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059525, 277141, 42792, '<td valign="top">The message of the image has some merit.  Some problems I see:<br/>-  you''re shooting right at the sun, so the glare is very harsh<br/>-  it''s too small and looks pixel-y<br/>-  the composition is overly busy (could you have gotten closer and to the side?)<br/>-  the grey tones are overly dominant here (some editing on contrast may have helped)<br/> <br/>Hope this helps.</td>', 'The message of the image has some merit.  Some problems I see:-  you''re shooting right at the sun, so the glare is very harsh-  it''s too small and looks pixel-y-  the composition is overly busy (could you have gotten closer and to the side?)-  the grey tones are overly dominant here (some editing on contrast may have helped) Hope this helps.', '2006-01-19 13:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059526, 280366, 17613, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, missed the quality and composition on the first run through, so bumping up. Well done</td>', 'This is a great shot, missed the quality and composition on the first run through, so bumping up. Well done', '2006-01-19 13:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059528, 275391, 40683, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Way to fill the frame! I wish the eyes had a little more clarity, but still very impressive!</td>', 'Wow!  Way to fill the frame! I wish the eyes had a little more clarity, but still very impressive!', '2006-01-19 13:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059539, 279195, 17613, '<td valign="top">Too small to judge</td>', 'Too small to judge', '2006-01-19 13:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059542, 279691, 40683, '<td valign="top">??? You''ve got to be kidding!</td>', '??? You''ve got to be kidding!', '2006-01-19 13:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059543, 275483, 17613, '<td valign="top">Very little in this image to hold the attention. There is potential but I think you missed it.</td>', 'Very little in this image to hold the attention. There is potential but I think you missed it.', '2006-01-19 13:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059555, 276560, 42792, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and yes they can be real beauties.  (My uncle used to dive to collect them and dry them to make decorative pieces).  Unfortunately, the beauty is lost here and here are the main reasons I see:<br/>-  the composition is not too bad altho'' the center point could have fallen into the vertical third partition on the right<br/>-  but the subject itself looks out of focus overall and this is really the main thing that hurts this image<br/>-  as it''s so dark in itself, perhaps a white background would have worked better to reflect the white spots<br/> <br/>On the side, wondering why you didn''t just leave the colour in?  Altho'' the b&amp;w does play up the pattern...</td>', 'Nice idea and yes they can be real beauties.  (My uncle used to dive to collect them and dry them to make decorative pieces).  Unfortunately, the beauty is lost here and here are the main reasons I see:-  the composition is not too bad altho'' the center point could have fallen into the vertical third partition on the right-  but the subject itself looks out of focus overall and this is really the main thing that hurts this image-  as it''s so dark in itself, perhaps a white background would have worked better to reflect the white spots On the side, wondering why you didn''t just leave the colour in?  Altho'' the b&w does play up the pattern...', '2006-01-19 13:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059588, 281132, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, the one that stands out catches my eye. The dark tones are restful.</td>', 'Nice photo, the one that stands out catches my eye. The dark tones are restful.', '2006-01-19 13:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059617, 274852, 3032, '<td valign="top">Is this a real town? It almost looks like Disneyland like this. :)</td>', 'Is this a real town? It almost looks like Disneyland like this. :)', '2006-01-19 13:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059640, 280366, 3214, '<td valign="top">Perfect shot, can see why it''s your favorite.  10</td>', 'Perfect shot, can see why it''s your favorite.  10', '2006-01-19 13:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059660, 281629, 3214, '<td valign="top">too bad about the shadow--you could mask that background and replace it, lovely model, would like to see more of the shadow-detail in her hair.  If you''re using Photoshop maybe you could recover a little of that?</td>', 'too bad about the shadow--you could mask that background and replace it, lovely model, would like to see more of the shadow-detail in her hair.  If you''re using Photoshop maybe you could recover a little of that?', '2006-01-19 13:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059689, 280577, 93, '<td valign="top">I like that it''s different. The motion blur really works, and the sense of energy is fantastic.  It could use some work in the color/contrast, as it looks a little flat, grey and dull in that. The lion''s fur especially.  A little too much red in areas, where just a little work could have given it the golden hue that would have helped sell.. The greens are also just a little grey and flat.</td>', 'I like that it''s different. The motion blur really works, and the sense of energy is fantastic.  It could use some work in the color/contrast, as it looks a little flat, grey and dull in that. The lion''s fur especially.  A little too much red in areas, where just a little work could have given it the golden hue that would have helped sell.. The greens are also just a little grey and flat.', '2006-01-19 14:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059694, 281767, 93, '<td valign="top">I think you did push the colors just a little much here, but it''s obviously not hurting you too much.  The composition and feeling in this photo is exquisite, and I *love* how the sky looks..  The orange/red fire in the grass isn''t my favorite though.. I liked it a bit better a little more unsaturated :)<br/> <br/>Great entry for the challenge though, sure beats the squirrel. lol</td>', 'I think you did push the colors just a little much here, but it''s obviously not hurting you too much.  The composition and feeling in this photo is exquisite, and I *love* how the sky looks..  The orange/red fire in the grass isn''t my favorite though.. I liked it a bit better a little more unsaturated :) Great entry for the challenge though, sure beats the squirrel. lol', '2006-01-19 14:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059696, 280784, 32854, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful and beautifully simple.</td>', 'Simply beautiful and beautifully simple.', '2006-01-19 14:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059700, 280538, 93, '<td valign="top">an O.K. political statement, but the photo comes off as being a little staged, and not very technically proficient.  The composition is too centered and dull, the neon coloring of the signs is distracting and gaudy, and the grave markers in front are too cut out, and only serve to look out of place (and hard to determine).</td>', 'an O.K. political statement, but the photo comes off as being a little staged, and not very technically proficient.  The composition is too centered and dull, the neon coloring of the signs is distracting and gaudy, and the grave markers in front are too cut out, and only serve to look out of place (and hard to determine).', '2006-01-19 14:06:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2059702, 281912, 93, '<td valign="top">An interesting landscape. The people walking down/up the dune add a human interest, and the background is nicely done.  Just, for me, lacks that little something extra.</td>', 'An interesting landscape. The people walking down/up the dune add a human interest, and the background is nicely done.  Just, for me, lacks that little something extra.', '2006-01-19 14:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059706, 281880, 93, '<td valign="top">A cool candle set-up, but not much else.  The photo lacks a real focal point and sense of any true composition.  Focus isn''t very tight, causing it to look much softer than I''d like.  The crop is also a little too wide.  It gives a sense of hurriedness, and a lack of any real feeling.</td>', 'A cool candle set-up, but not much else.  The photo lacks a real focal point and sense of any true composition.  Focus isn''t very tight, causing it to look much softer than I''d like.  The crop is also a little too wide.  It gives a sense of hurriedness, and a lack of any real feeling.', '2006-01-19 14:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059709, 281217, 93, '<td valign="top">A good attempt on a classic photo, but lacks some of the technical prowess needed to join many others.  Soft focus, artifacting, and a lack of any really good dynamic lighting are all minor flaws that add together.  Keep trying though, this is definitely on the right path.</td>', 'A good attempt on a classic photo, but lacks some of the technical prowess needed to join many others.  Soft focus, artifacting, and a lack of any really good dynamic lighting are all minor flaws that add together.  Keep trying though, this is definitely on the right path.', '2006-01-19 14:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059713, 281179, 93, '<td valign="top">Far too small to be effective, you need to utilize the full 640 pixel limit here to even hope to have a chance of doing well.</td>', 'Far too small to be effective, you need to utilize the full 640 pixel limit here to even hope to have a chance of doing well.', '2006-01-19 14:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059717, 274722, 22543, '<td valign="top">I LOVE it!!!<br/>one of my all time favorites, a 10</td>', 'I LOVE it!!!one of my all time favorites, a 10', '2006-01-19 14:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059718, 281435, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up, but lacking a real punch. It''s a little soft in the feathers, which loses a bit of detail, and the coloring could have been deeper and stronger in the eye and beak, which would have helped immeasurably.</td>', 'Nice close-up, but lacking a real punch. It''s a little soft in the feathers, which loses a bit of detail, and the coloring could have been deeper and stronger in the eye and beak, which would have helped immeasurably.', '2006-01-19 14:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059728, 280506, 93, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, but a little flat and hazy in areas. The lack of clarity on the snowy peak (because of the clouds behind), is also something I don''t care for much.</td>', 'Nicely composed, but a little flat and hazy in areas. The lack of clarity on the snowy peak (because of the clouds behind), is also something I don''t care for much.', '2006-01-19 14:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059732, 280563, 93, '<td valign="top">I remember seeing this in the forums.  A wonderful shot with a great connection between the subjects. Nice capture.</td>', 'I remember seeing this in the forums.  A wonderful shot with a great connection between the subjects. Nice capture.', '2006-01-19 14:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059735, 281453, 93, '<td valign="top">hahaha.. a great expression.  Technically, it could use some improvements, (focus and contrast mostly), but great job grabbing his look.</td>', 'hahaha.. a great expression.  Technically, it could use some improvements, (focus and contrast mostly), but great job grabbing his look.', '2006-01-19 14:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059744, 281964, 93, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of this sort of photo.  Artificially made up models turn me right off.  There are technical issues though, which really hurt this.  She''s too close to the background, resulting in the unflattering shadow.  Skin tones are harsh, focus is off, and I think it''d have been stronger with more of the hair, and less of the body.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of this sort of photo.  Artificially made up models turn me right off.  There are technical issues though, which really hurt this.  She''s too close to the background, resulting in the unflattering shadow.  Skin tones are harsh, focus is off, and I think it''d have been stronger with more of the hair, and less of the body.', '2006-01-19 14:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059753, 280955, 93, '<td valign="top">A pug in a booze glass certainly isn''t your usual photo here.  I have to wonder if the face wasn''t artificially enhanced.. it looks.. odder than usual, even for a pug.  Focus seems a little soft, but lighting is great.</td>', 'A pug in a booze glass certainly isn''t your usual photo here.  I have to wonder if the face wasn''t artificially enhanced.. it looks.. odder than usual, even for a pug.  Focus seems a little soft, but lighting is great.', '2006-01-19 14:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059759, 280457, 93, '<td valign="top">I like that you''ve included the rock in the foreground, gives a little more interest to this photo.  I find it just a tad dark though.</td>', 'I like that you''ve included the rock in the foreground, gives a little more interest to this photo.  I find it just a tad dark though.', '2006-01-19 14:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059763, 280695, 93, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little too harsh here, and the yellow/reddish cast to it could easily be straightened out.  Compositionally it is nice, but the expression seems forced.</td>', 'Lighting is a little too harsh here, and the yellow/reddish cast to it could easily be straightened out.  Compositionally it is nice, but the expression seems forced.', '2006-01-19 14:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059764, 282016, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, would fit well on the sports page.  Nothing hugely spectacular about it though.</td>', 'Nice capture, would fit well on the sports page.  Nothing hugely spectacular about it though.', '2006-01-19 14:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059769, 279812, 93, '<td valign="top">An interesting capture, and I like the processing for the most part.  The OOF horizon line though.. I think it''d have been much better with a full field of depth here.. don''t know that lighting conditions would have allowed it though.</td>', 'An interesting capture, and I like the processing for the most part.  The OOF horizon line though.. I think it''d have been much better with a full field of depth here.. don''t know that lighting conditions would have allowed it though.', '2006-01-19 14:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059773, 282010, 93, '<td valign="top">I''m not too keen on the B&amp;W conversion.. it seems to be on the right track, you have a lot of really nice mid-tones here, but it''s really lacking in the true contrast needed to pop it out..  not enough white whites and black blacks where there should have been.</td>', 'I''m not too keen on the B&W conversion.. it seems to be on the right track, you have a lot of really nice mid-tones here, but it''s really lacking in the true contrast needed to pop it out..  not enough white whites and black blacks where there should have been.', '2006-01-19 14:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059780, 280877, 93, '<td valign="top">Lacking in some contrast in areas, and lacking a true focal point, other than the harsh sun glare.. which works, but if it''s your strongest focal point, all you succeed in is blinding your viewer.</td>', 'Lacking in some contrast in areas, and lacking a true focal point, other than the harsh sun glare.. which works, but if it''s your strongest focal point, all you succeed in is blinding your viewer.', '2006-01-19 14:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059782, 274568, 93, '<td valign="top">A nice photo.  Would like to see a little stronger lighting to set the petals aglow and give the photo a little more jump.</td>', 'A nice photo.  Would like to see a little stronger lighting to set the petals aglow and give the photo a little more jump.', '2006-01-19 14:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059786, 280464, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I personally would have liked it heaps better with a warmer WB.</td>', 'Nice shot but I personally would have liked it heaps better with a warmer WB.', '2006-01-19 14:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059788, 279724, 93, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what you''ve done with the planes, but they look like clip art. The halo around them does this photo no justice at all, and there''s no definition in the planes. I''m sorry, but the whole photo here does look a little "manufactured".</td>', 'I don''t know what you''ve done with the planes, but they look like clip art. The halo around them does this photo no justice at all, and there''s no definition in the planes. I''m sorry, but the whole photo here does look a little "manufactured".', '2006-01-19 14:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
