(2060085, 275621, 93, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos that I think the photographer loves more than the viewer.  One of the hardest things to do is to make something *you* like, into something everyone else will like.  I struggle with that all the time myself.<br/> <br/>For me, this is a very uinteresting photo.  It''s not a subject that pulls me in, it''s not a composition that makes me say, "wow, that''s different", etc.  Of course, I don''t know the reason why you think it''s interesting, but it just doesn''t have the appeal that is needed for people that *don''t* know.</td>', 'This is one of those photos that I think the photographer loves more than the viewer.  One of the hardest things to do is to make something *you* like, into something everyone else will like.  I struggle with that all the time myself. For me, this is a very uinteresting photo.  It''s not a subject that pulls me in, it''s not a composition that makes me say, "wow, that''s different", etc.  Of course, I don''t know the reason why you think it''s interesting, but it just doesn''t have the appeal that is needed for people that *don''t* know.', '2006-01-19 15:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
