(2060095, 279810, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really "bad" but just totally lacks a good punchy contrast if it were to cater to my taste.  If I had shot this I would have put it through a good "s-curve" and brigthened a bit.</td>', 'Not really "bad" but just totally lacks a good punchy contrast if it were to cater to my taste.  If I had shot this I would have put it through a good "s-curve" and brigthened a bit.', '2006-01-19 16:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
