(2060101, 281767, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but the sky just looks really bad and fake, not at all fond of the PP work you did on it.  Shame, as I really like the rest, the grass and house look nice with good, strong colour and good composition.  Gave this a 4, never know what I might have given if the sky had just been dramatic, not this oversaturated, smudgy, blown out mess.</td>', 'Sorry but the sky just looks really bad and fake, not at all fond of the PP work you did on it.  Shame, as I really like the rest, the grass and house look nice with good, strong colour and good composition.  Gave this a 4, never know what I might have given if the sky had just been dramatic, not this oversaturated, smudgy, blown out mess.', '2006-01-19 16:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060102, 281131, 37103, '<td valign="top">This is a really precious photo.  I love the contrast between the girl and the dark walls/floor.  The only thing I am not sure I like is the aspect ratio.  The photo just seems too long narrow.</td>', 'This is a really precious photo.  I love the contrast between the girl and the dark walls/floor.  The only thing I am not sure I like is the aspect ratio.  The photo just seems too long narrow.', '2006-01-19 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060104, 281047, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m in love with this near-abstraction, it''s very much to my taste. You either spent a LOT of time getting the cropping "just so" or you''re an unconscious genius at that stuff; the tension and interplay between the different diagonals and the edges is very fine. Beautiful luminosity.</td>', 'I''m in love with this near-abstraction, it''s very much to my taste. You either spent a LOT of time getting the cropping "just so" or you''re an unconscious genius at that stuff; the tension and interplay between the different diagonals and the edges is very fine. Beautiful luminosity.', '2006-01-19 16:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060106, 279722, 30861, '<td valign="top">This has quite an appealing glow to it. In the main I like it very much. although it seems a bit sacrificed in the dark areas, mainly lower right where I ache for a little more separation. Fine shot!</td>', 'This has quite an appealing glow to it. In the main I like it very much. although it seems a bit sacrificed in the dark areas, mainly lower right where I ache for a little more separation. Fine shot!', '2006-01-19 16:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060107, 277828, 30861, '<td valign="top">This has got imapct of the wazoo! I''m very taken with it, and hope you do well.</td>', 'This has got imapct of the wazoo! I''m very taken with it, and hope you do well.', '2006-01-19 16:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060108, 280788, 27482, '<td valign="top">What a wierd title of a black and white shot, I guess we must just take your word for it huh :D. I like the lighting, think the composition is ok but I must say that I would have liked it better with the stairs more out of focus, they kindof draw my attention away from the girl as it is.   Anyway, nice portrait of a cute little girl, I gave it a 6 as it´s nothing spectacular but pretty nice, above average in the challenge.</td>', 'What a wierd title of a black and white shot, I guess we must just take your word for it huh :D. I like the lighting, think the composition is ok but I must say that I would have liked it better with the stairs more out of focus, they kindof draw my attention away from the girl as it is.   Anyway, nice portrait of a cute little girl, I gave it a 6 as it´s nothing spectacular but pretty nice, above average in the challenge.', '2006-01-19 16:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060110, 275391, 30861, '<td valign="top">At first I thought the tonal range in this was too "down", but the more I look at it the more I like it. I wonder, if you''d used the sponge tool to saturate the eyes a tad more.... Fine image!</td>', 'At first I thought the tonal range in this was too "down", but the more I look at it the more I like it. I wonder, if you''d used the sponge tool to saturate the eyes a tad more.... Fine image!', '2006-01-19 16:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060111, 280454, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, but would just be sooo much nicer if the clouds would have some texture... 6 from me.</td>', 'Nice, but would just be sooo much nicer if the clouds would have some texture... 6 from me.', '2006-01-19 16:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060114, 276545, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is immacualte in all ways except the hot spots on the gal''s forehead in the poster. I think it''s a terrific shot!</td>', 'This is immacualte in all ways except the hot spots on the gal''s forehead in the poster. I think it''s a terrific shot!', '2006-01-19 16:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
