(2060121, 282016, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all, nicely exposed, a little too saturated for my taste but nothing that bothers me.  However, for me, it´s just average so I gave it a 5.  It just lacks some action something to make it go pop, it´s a bit static.  Of course I am comparing this to formula 1 images I see in the papers and maybe that is a little bit harsh...</td>', 'Not bad at all, nicely exposed, a little too saturated for my taste but nothing that bothers me.  However, for me, it´s just average so I gave it a 5.  It just lacks some action something to make it go pop, it´s a bit static.  Of course I am comparing this to formula 1 images I see in the papers and maybe that is a little bit harsh...', '2006-01-19 16:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060124, 274718, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great shot, John.  I really think you''ve captured this man''s very essence and the post production is beautiful.  :)</td>', 'Great shot, John.  I really think you''ve captured this man''s very essence and the post production is beautiful.  :)', '2006-01-19 16:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
