(2060280, 281740, 48954, '<td valign="top">very good. too bad you have that plot of grass at the end, but i like the row of row boats and the reflection of the clouds in the water. I think that perhaps the boat at the bottom of the shot should have been "complete'' as in the second corner should have been visible. This might have grounded it more, but very good pic nevertheless. 8</td>', 'very good. too bad you have that plot of grass at the end, but i like the row of row boats and the reflection of the clouds in the water. I think that perhaps the boat at the bottom of the shot should have been "complete'' as in the second corner should have been visible. This might have grounded it more, but very good pic nevertheless. 8', '2006-01-19 17:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060285, 276866, 48954, '<td valign="top">I really like the layering of colours. Also the fact that the rows of grapes lead your eye to this grey fog. Excellent shot. 8</td>', 'I really like the layering of colours. Also the fact that the rows of grapes lead your eye to this grey fog. Excellent shot. 8', '2006-01-19 17:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
