(2060347, 280507, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like this, it reminds me of something similar I did in a wheat field. Although the grass in the foreground is not oversharpened, I would have prefered an overall softer feel to this image, it is only me, but soft would have worked in well. The harsh shadow on the neck area is also an opinion thing. I like the composition, the toning and the pose. Good image with a few minor technicallities.</td>', 'I like this, it reminds me of something similar I did in a wheat field. Although the grass in the foreground is not oversharpened, I would have prefered an overall softer feel to this image, it is only me, but soft would have worked in well. The harsh shadow on the neck area is also an opinion thing. I like the composition, the toning and the pose. Good image with a few minor technicallities.', '2006-01-19 17:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
