(2060780, 280701, 93, '<td valign="top">A little too contrasty for my tastes. I feel like it is just trying to make a fairly uninteresting photo into something that stands out, but doesn''t exactly work for me.</td>', 'A little too contrasty for my tastes. I feel like it is just trying to make a fairly uninteresting photo into something that stands out, but doesn''t exactly work for me.', '2006-01-19 18:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
