(2060785, 277075, 93, '<td valign="top">woah.. great find here, that drip of amber is prettying cool. (if it''s real). I mean, the photo is validated, but I''m wondering if you maybe usd motor oil or something similar to get this.</td>', 'woah.. great find here, that drip of amber is prettying cool. (if it''s real). I mean, the photo is validated, but I''m wondering if you maybe usd motor oil or something similar to get this.', '2006-01-19 18:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
