(2060793, 275961, 93, '<td valign="top">Someone needs to buy a new swimsuit.. it''s pretty small!  The glow effect works well here.</td>', 'Someone needs to buy a new swimsuit.. it''s pretty small!  The glow effect works well here.', '2006-01-19 18:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060796, 276469, 93, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of the dark and gritty style, but it works for this photo.</td>', 'Not a big fan of the dark and gritty style, but it works for this photo.', '2006-01-19 18:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060797, 280558, 93, '<td valign="top">There are a *lot* of low angle hyper-reality landscapes in this challenge.. wow.</td>', 'There are a *lot* of low angle hyper-reality landscapes in this challenge.. wow.', '2006-01-19 18:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060807, 281955, 93, '<td valign="top">great detail on the feathers, but as a macro, it''s more like something you''d see while practicing. Doesn''t really draw the viewer in, the lighting is a little flat, and the colors too "light", and lacking the deep feeling that would draw them out.</td>', 'great detail on the feathers, but as a macro, it''s more like something you''d see while practicing. Doesn''t really draw the viewer in, the lighting is a little flat, and the colors too "light", and lacking the deep feeling that would draw them out.', '2006-01-19 18:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060808, 279612, 5885, '<td valign="top">Well done and beautiful post-process.</td>', 'Well done and beautiful post-process.', '2006-01-19 18:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060811, 275321, 93, '<td valign="top">I guess I''d have to understand the meaning behind "Pele" for the title.  Not a spectacular landscape, but it gets the bleak feeling across.</td>', 'I guess I''d have to understand the meaning behind "Pele" for the title.  Not a spectacular landscape, but it gets the bleak feeling across.', '2006-01-19 18:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060812, 277958, 5885, '<td valign="top">What an awesome piece of technical perfection!</td>', 'What an awesome piece of technical perfection!', '2006-01-19 18:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060816, 277450, 93, '<td valign="top">Overly patriotic images tend not to do so well here, but it''s very nicely done.</td>', 'Overly patriotic images tend not to do so well here, but it''s very nicely done.', '2006-01-19 19:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060817, 277626, 50680, '<td valign="top">Feel like I''m flying along side<br/>very nice shot zero distractions great focus</td>', 'Feel like I''m flying along sidevery nice shot zero distractions great focus', '2006-01-19 19:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060820, 281859, 37252, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene, but a little too dark in my mind. Maybe if you brought out some highlights in the mountain it would be better</td>', 'Pretty scene, but a little too dark in my mind. Maybe if you brought out some highlights in the mountain it would be better', '2006-01-19 19:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060823, 275979, 93, '<td valign="top">A little flat in the presentation, the overbearing brightness of the setting (or rising) sun takes away a lot from this shot.</td>', 'A little flat in the presentation, the overbearing brightness of the setting (or rising) sun takes away a lot from this shot.', '2006-01-19 19:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060825, 280921, 2780, '<td valign="top">The composition seems a bit busy with the bucket coming in at the bottom. Maybe having just the mops and less other elements would make it a stronger piece.</td>', 'The composition seems a bit busy with the bucket coming in at the bottom. Maybe having just the mops and less other elements would make it a stronger piece.', '2006-01-19 19:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060826, 279178, 93, '<td valign="top">I find that this is just too blown out in too many areas, and the insects on the flower are lost in it.</td>', 'I find that this is just too blown out in too many areas, and the insects on the flower are lost in it.', '2006-01-19 19:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060827, 281298, 5885, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m curious as to whether this is post-process color shifts... or if those lizards are naturally so vibrant. Either way...great capture!</td>', 'Wow, I''m curious as to whether this is post-process color shifts... or if those lizards are naturally so vibrant. Either way...great capture!', '2006-01-19 19:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
