(2060838, 281751, 17937, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Probably doesn''t need the border as big but the photo is great.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very nice.  Probably doesn''t need the border as big but the photo is great.  Nice job.', '2006-01-19 19:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
