(2060863, 280090, 37252, '<td valign="top">this image has so much of interest...the people who look to be floating on a slab of rock out in the water, the angles and lines the rods produce, the crispness of the water, and the beautiful blue sky. I llike the composition here. Very well done.</td>', 'this image has so much of interest...the people who look to be floating on a slab of rock out in the water, the angles and lines the rods produce, the crispness of the water, and the beautiful blue sky. I llike the composition here. Very well done.', '2006-01-19 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
