(2061546, 275330, 10432, '<td valign="top">Sharp focus and colorful subject.  The photo seems too dark &amp; flat.  Try brightening and increasing the contrast.</td>', 'Sharp focus and colorful subject.  The photo seems too dark & flat.  Try brightening and increasing the contrast.', '2006-01-19 21:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
