(2061554, 281582, 29269, '<td valign="top">I thought that it is impossible in this type of challenge, but here is one that does not meet the challenge! It clearly stated 2005 in the description, and this is obviously taken in the 1920s. And don''t tell me that you had a digital camera then! 1 from me. &lt;/fake_comment&gt;<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>Nice choice for b&amp;w, almost would have been better if you''ve chosen perhaps sepia or even added some grain to the image to make it appear older than it is. Another thing to try is to perhaps leave more space on the top, to move the main subject away from the middle. Good luck in the challenge - 7.</td>', 'I thought that it is impossible in this type of challenge, but here is one that does not meet the challenge! It clearly stated 2005 in the description, and this is obviously taken in the 1920s. And don''t tell me that you had a digital camera then! 1 from me. </fake_comment>     Nice choice for b&w, almost would have been better if you''ve chosen perhaps sepia or even added some grain to the image to make it appear older than it is. Another thing to try is to perhaps leave more space on the top, to move the main subject away from the middle. Good luck in the challenge - 7.', '2006-01-19 21:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061556, 279810, 10432, '<td valign="top">Very nice DoF.  I think the beauty of the flower (and photo) would be enhanced with an increase in brightness and contrast.</td>', 'Very nice DoF.  I think the beauty of the flower (and photo) would be enhanced with an increase in brightness and contrast.', '2006-01-19 21:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
