(2062065, 281914, 7743, '<td valign="top">The distant plains are nice and sharp and the colour offers nice contrast to the foreground hill however I feel the foreground hill takes up too much space in the image.  A slight shift to the right and a lower perspective could possibly help.  This would also help move the horizon from the center.  <br/> <br/>There are interesting patterns in the fields as well as in the sky so framing to emphasize either one would work very well.</td>', 'The distant plains are nice and sharp and the colour offers nice contrast to the foreground hill however I feel the foreground hill takes up too much space in the image.  A slight shift to the right and a lower perspective could possibly help.  This would also help move the horizon from the center.   There are interesting patterns in the fields as well as in the sky so framing to emphasize either one would work very well.', '2006-01-19 23:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
