(2062083, 276537, 29269, '<td valign="top">The same rule for shooting nudes applies for maternity shots: have your model undress at least 30'' before the session (s/he can wear a bathrobe or anything that will not leave the marks on the skin). That way you will not end up with these unwanted and distracting marks on the belly.<br/>That said, my wife has been in this stage twice, and I think that I''d pass on asking her to do something like that, and I''d be happy with even 10 min of her time altogether.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'The same rule for shooting nudes applies for maternity shots: have your model undress at least 30'' before the session (s/he can wear a bathrobe or anything that will not leave the marks on the skin). That way you will not end up with these unwanted and distracting marks on the belly.That said, my wife has been in this stage twice, and I think that I''d pass on asking her to do something like that, and I''d be happy with even 10 min of her time altogether.Good luck!', '2006-01-19 23:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
