(2062408, 281383, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna guess that your not getting great scores here because there is a lot of anti-American sentiment going on in the world right now.  I will tell you that as soon as I saw this a little lump popped up in my throat.  Good shot!  A little gritty but I think it fits the image.  Keep it up and don''t let anyone against this great nation insid or abroad bring ya down.<br/>Kudos<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m gonna guess that your not getting great scores here because there is a lot of anti-American sentiment going on in the world right now.  I will tell you that as soon as I saw this a little lump popped up in my throat.  Good shot!  A little gritty but I think it fits the image.  Keep it up and don''t let anyone against this great nation insid or abroad bring ya down.KudosTC', '2006-01-20 01:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
