(2062428, 274927, 9906, '<td valign="top">Heather, is that you?  Nice shot but could use a bit more creative lighting.  Move your main light more to the side to add depth to the shot and this would be tres cool!<br/>TC</td>', 'Heather, is that you?  Nice shot but could use a bit more creative lighting.  Move your main light more to the side to add depth to the shot and this would be tres cool!TC', '2006-01-20 02:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
