(2062446, 281365, 9906, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  The simplicity of it is astounding!  The lines are awesome.  One thing you should try...   Take a color from the top of the shot to use as your inline frame.  It will make the inline dissappear at the top and appear at the bottom.  Very cool effect.<br/>Kudos<br/>TC</td>', 'I really like this.  The simplicity of it is astounding!  The lines are awesome.  One thing you should try...   Take a color from the top of the shot to use as your inline frame.  It will make the inline dissappear at the top and appear at the bottom.  Very cool effect.KudosTC', '2006-01-20 02:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
