(2062910, 274582, 35602, '<td valign="top">This is one hard guy to get.  I know, I have tried.  Nice stop action, but even so it still came out a bit too soft in focus.  The leaf on the bottom seems to really be sharply focused, so <br/>I am trying to figure out why the flowers didn''t come out as sharp.  Maybe a smaller aperture opening would have given the flowers just as much clarity.</td>', 'This is one hard guy to get.  I know, I have tried.  Nice stop action, but even so it still came out a bit too soft in focus.  The leaf on the bottom seems to really be sharply focused, so I am trying to figure out why the flowers didn''t come out as sharp.  Maybe a smaller aperture opening would have given the flowers just as much clarity.', '2006-01-20 08:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
