(2062993, 277966, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the contrast is a bit high here, since you''ve lost some shadow detail, and the clouds are overexposed. I also think you should maybe have done some distortion adjustments in photoshop to get all the buildings straight.</td>', 'I think the contrast is a bit high here, since you''ve lost some shadow detail, and the clouds are overexposed. I also think you should maybe have done some distortion adjustments in photoshop to get all the buildings straight.', '2006-01-20 08:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062998, 277142, 34192, '<td valign="top">beautiful scene but I am thrown by the toning.  Glaciers and mountains always make me think of blue.  I know, my limited imagination.  But I don''t think the toning here works with the scene.  Well seen though.</td>', 'beautiful scene but I am thrown by the toning.  Glaciers and mountains always make me think of blue.  I know, my limited imagination.  But I don''t think the toning here works with the scene.  Well seen though.', '2006-01-20 08:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
