(2063385, 276802, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t generally enjoy car photos but I''m kind of liking this. Probably because it seems more of a study of color and form. I like the way the frame is divided into several triangles---evenn the shadow at the lower left of the frame forms a triangle. I hope this was your intent because it shows a good eye for finding pattern in everyday objects (even an expensive sportscar could be everyday in this respect :D) I fear that in this challenge with 800+ entries you aren''t going to have a lot of voters taking the time to notice this interesting design aspect. Fortunately, a lot of DPCers do enjoy car photos!</td>', 'I don''t generally enjoy car photos but I''m kind of liking this. Probably because it seems more of a study of color and form. I like the way the frame is divided into several triangles---evenn the shadow at the lower left of the frame forms a triangle. I hope this was your intent because it shows a good eye for finding pattern in everyday objects (even an expensive sportscar could be everyday in this respect :D) I fear that in this challenge with 800+ entries you aren''t going to have a lot of voters taking the time to notice this interesting design aspect. Fortunately, a lot of DPCers do enjoy car photos!', '2006-01-20 10:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063387, 281264, 35739, '<td valign="top">Not real sure about the colors here.  I like the look and the idea.</td>', 'Not real sure about the colors here.  I like the look and the idea.', '2006-01-20 10:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063388, 276525, 35739, '<td valign="top">A little too soft for me.</td>', 'A little too soft for me.', '2006-01-20 10:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063389, 280558, 2764, '<td valign="top">Oh my! Ten without a doubt.  Iceland in twilight?   Wonderful how the long exposure has smoothed the moving water and left the ice sharp.  Terrific leading lines, makes me want to go around that corner into the light.  Moon is a special touch. Oh, I hope this gets the high score it deserves and doesnt get marked down because voters have their monitors set too dark.</td>', 'Oh my! Ten without a doubt.  Iceland in twilight?   Wonderful how the long exposure has smoothed the moving water and left the ice sharp.  Terrific leading lines, makes me want to go around that corner into the light.  Moon is a special touch. Oh, I hope this gets the high score it deserves and doesnt get marked down because voters have their monitors set too dark.', '2006-01-20 10:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063392, 281946, 35739, '<td valign="top">Looks alittle washed out.</td>', 'Looks alittle washed out.', '2006-01-20 10:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063393, 277138, 35357, '<td valign="top">Wow, a dolphin?  Great catch.  The exposure is very tough with the sun right there, for sure.  I might have altered the crop to place dolphin at a more focal point.</td>', 'Wow, a dolphin?  Great catch.  The exposure is very tough with the sun right there, for sure.  I might have altered the crop to place dolphin at a more focal point.', '2006-01-20 10:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063394, 280107, 35739, '<td valign="top">I hope my monitor is correct.  The water is extremely too green.  Colors do not looke right to me.  I like the capture however.</td>', 'I hope my monitor is correct.  The water is extremely too green.  Colors do not looke right to me.  I like the capture however.', '2006-01-20 10:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
