(2063397, 274615, 35739, '<td valign="top">Not real sure about the lighting here. I like the model and her expression.</td>', 'Not real sure about the lighting here. I like the model and her expression.', '2006-01-20 10:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063398, 281981, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. It''s a bit contrasty in the area of the rocks (I''d like a bit more detail in the shadow areas) but the blur of the water is quite nice. It seems a bit overly white at the pooling point of the waterfall--almost as if that area had been overly burned in--it has an erased appearance to me. Maybe if this were framed so as to leave some space below this pooling point it wouldn''t appear as odd as it is to me now.</td>', 'Very nice. It''s a bit contrasty in the area of the rocks (I''d like a bit more detail in the shadow areas) but the blur of the water is quite nice. It seems a bit overly white at the pooling point of the waterfall--almost as if that area had been overly burned in--it has an erased appearance to me. Maybe if this were framed so as to leave some space below this pooling point it wouldn''t appear as odd as it is to me now.', '2006-01-20 10:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063399, 280090, 48739, '<td valign="top">those are some Big fishing poles!!</td>', 'those are some Big fishing poles!!', '2006-01-20 10:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063403, 280550, 35357, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully interesting subject and a great smile.  Focus &amp; all that tech stuff looks perfect to me.</td>', 'Wonderfully interesting subject and a great smile.  Focus & all that tech stuff looks perfect to me.', '2006-01-20 10:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063404, 280799, 48739, '<td valign="top">Wipe OU.....t!!!</td>', 'Wipe OU.....t!!!', '2006-01-20 10:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063406, 281744, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is nice but I think I would like it better in color. I don''t really see the purpose of using black and white for this subject. I''d like to see the warm quality of light in this.</td>', 'This is nice but I think I would like it better in color. I don''t really see the purpose of using black and white for this subject. I''d like to see the warm quality of light in this.', '2006-01-20 10:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063409, 280538, 2764, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sentiment, though not the strongest portrayal of it.  And not a very good photograph.  My-son-the-marine has only 16 days left of his four years of service.  It has been a long four years for a Mom.  He has close friends who have died and lost limbs.  I''m so glad that you had the courage to enter this statement.  Unfortunately it is not as clear as it could be.  I was going to comment that the pizza boxes on the right were distracting but then realized they are crosses. The sun glare on the signs is a DPC nono, as is the slight tilt of the horizon.  When the subject is placed in the center like this, it is less interesting than one placed off center.  However, I am going to give you a 10 for guts and for my 21 year old son who survived and his buddies who did not.</td>', 'Wonderful sentiment, though not the strongest portrayal of it.  And not a very good photograph.  My-son-the-marine has only 16 days left of his four years of service.  It has been a long four years for a Mom.  He has close friends who have died and lost limbs.  I''m so glad that you had the courage to enter this statement.  Unfortunately it is not as clear as it could be.  I was going to comment that the pizza boxes on the right were distracting but then realized they are crosses. The sun glare on the signs is a DPC nono, as is the slight tilt of the horizon.  When the subject is placed in the center like this, it is less interesting than one placed off center.  However, I am going to give you a 10 for guts and for my 21 year old son who survived and his buddies who did not.', '2006-01-20 10:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
