(2063625, 280598, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very sweet capture. This past May, in Rhode Island, we experienced the tragic loss of Trixie, a beloved polar bear who lived at Roger Williams Park Zoo since 1989 with her partner Norton. They were the parents of two cubs which now reside at other zoos. I remember watching Trixie mother her cubs from web cam images that originated from her den. Later I took tons of photos of her romping and splashing with them in the pools outside their den. This photo evoked very nice memories for me. Thanks for offering it. <br/>Here is a link to the zoo''s memorial...//www.rogerwilliamsparkzoo.org/what_to_see/north_america/trixie.cfm</td>', 'Very sweet capture. This past May, in Rhode Island, we experienced the tragic loss of Trixie, a beloved polar bear who lived at Roger Williams Park Zoo since 1989 with her partner Norton. They were the parents of two cubs which now reside at other zoos. I remember watching Trixie mother her cubs from web cam images that originated from her den. Later I took tons of photos of her romping and splashing with them in the pools outside their den. This photo evoked very nice memories for me. Thanks for offering it. Here is a link to the zoo''s memorial...//www.rogerwilliamsparkzoo.org/what_to_see/north_america/trixie.cfm', '2006-01-20 10:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063627, 275343, 7291, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Including the reflection of the clouds really completes this picture.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Wow!  Including the reflection of the clouds really completes this picture.  Beautiful.', '2006-01-20 10:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063628, 281042, 29748, '<td valign="top">oh, ah, pretty</td>', 'oh, ah, pretty', '2006-01-20 10:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063630, 274569, 29748, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2006-01-20 10:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063633, 280776, 7291, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  So many lines for your eyes to follow.</td>', 'Excellent composition.  So many lines for your eyes to follow.', '2006-01-20 10:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063635, 280942, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture--gorgeous expression and great color. It''s very natural and simple. I would like to see a bit more light in her eyes. Perhaps a reflector held near her face would have provided more of a catch light in her eyes? Or perhaps a diffused fill flash made by taping a bit of wax paper over the flash (I don''t know how sophisticated your equipment is---this is the sort of thing I have to do).</td>', 'Very nice capture--gorgeous expression and great color. It''s very natural and simple. I would like to see a bit more light in her eyes. Perhaps a reflector held near her face would have provided more of a catch light in her eyes? Or perhaps a diffused fill flash made by taping a bit of wax paper over the flash (I don''t know how sophisticated your equipment is---this is the sort of thing I have to do).', '2006-01-20 10:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063637, 281580, 8759, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF. Too centered. Good Luck</td>', 'Nice DOF. Too centered. Good Luck', '2006-01-20 10:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
