(2063641, 276055, 7291, '<td valign="top">Amazing color and use of available light.</td>', 'Amazing color and use of available light.', '2006-01-20 11:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063642, 278665, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I can see the downy hairs of a newborn on his forehead. I''m  a bit bothered by the cropping at the left of the frame. I realize the idea was to really close in on his face but his chest cropped at this point creates an odd shape that disturbs me.</td>', 'Very nice. I can see the downy hairs of a newborn on his forehead. I''m  a bit bothered by the cropping at the left of the frame. I realize the idea was to really close in on his face but his chest cropped at this point creates an odd shape that disturbs me.', '2006-01-20 11:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063644, 281896, 40683, '<td valign="top">An even better version of a previous ribbon winning shot.  This one improves upon the last with the inclusion of the bird in flight and the wider landscape orientation.  A very serene and pleasing image!</td>', 'An even better version of a previous ribbon winning shot.  This one improves upon the last with the inclusion of the bird in flight and the wider landscape orientation.  A very serene and pleasing image!', '2006-01-20 11:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063646, 281526, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, the detail in this is amazing, Love the colors and use of space. Nicely done.</td>', 'Wow, the detail in this is amazing, Love the colors and use of space. Nicely done.', '2006-01-20 11:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063648, 279639, 7291, '<td valign="top">That object over the girls head is distracting but the picture is still great.</td>', 'That object over the girls head is distracting but the picture is still great.', '2006-01-20 11:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063650, 279454, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very lovely. There is a dreamy, imaginary quality to this in the way the land seems to be floating in the sky.</td>', 'Very lovely. There is a dreamy, imaginary quality to this in the way the land seems to be floating in the sky.', '2006-01-20 11:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063651, 277249, 42638, '<td valign="top">Fantastic detail, good sharp focus. Nicely done</td>', 'Fantastic detail, good sharp focus. Nicely done', '2006-01-20 11:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063653, 280366, 40683, '<td valign="top">Great title...superb lighting...excellent composition...A top pick of mine!</td>', 'Great title...superb lighting...excellent composition...A top pick of mine!', '2006-01-20 11:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063655, 278188, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of available light and the paper makes a convenient reflector as well as being a natural part of the composition. I don''t understand the title but that doesn''t really matter.</td>', 'Very nice use of available light and the paper makes a convenient reflector as well as being a natural part of the composition. I don''t understand the title but that doesn''t really matter.', '2006-01-20 11:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063656, 279776, 7291, '<td valign="top">What an imposing animal.  Good expression.</td>', 'What an imposing animal.  Good expression.', '2006-01-20 11:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063657, 281739, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice environmental portrait. It really conveys a bit of who this man is.</td>', 'Nice environmental portrait. It really conveys a bit of who this man is.', '2006-01-20 11:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063659, 276970, 7291, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.</td>', 'Fantastic.', '2006-01-20 11:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063665, 281529, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this to be a goood subject for a silhouette. I''m guessing you were attracted by the shapes of the nest and the twigs but there seems to be too much going on with the wires and the spot of blue leads my eye to nowhere. I''d like to see the bird clearly. Instead I''m looking at a boring wire structure and an equally boring patch of sky. I reccommend next time, in shooting a subject that forces you to point your camera to the sky, you bracket your exposure because this is a case where your light meter is being fooled by the amount of light coming from the sky (this may be by setting your EV rating to + something or you may have more sophisticated equipment that allows you to do this manually). Of course, you may already know this information and were simply going for the silhouette effect.</td>', 'I don''t find this to be a goood subject for a silhouette. I''m guessing you were attracted by the shapes of the nest and the twigs but there seems to be too much going on with the wires and the spot of blue leads my eye to nowhere. I''d like to see the bird clearly. Instead I''m looking at a boring wire structure and an equally boring patch of sky. I reccommend next time, in shooting a subject that forces you to point your camera to the sky, you bracket your exposure because this is a case where your light meter is being fooled by the amount of light coming from the sky (this may be by setting your EV rating to + something or you may have more sophisticated equipment that allows you to do this manually). Of course, you may already know this information and were simply going for the silhouette effect.', '2006-01-20 11:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063669, 278574, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of his/her expression. Good catch light in the eyes. A problem I have is I feel like I''m seeing more detail in the area behind the chimmp than I am in its hair (fur?).</td>', 'Nice capture of his/her expression. Good catch light in the eyes. A problem I have is I feel like I''m seeing more detail in the area behind the chimmp than I am in its hair (fur?).', '2006-01-20 11:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063670, 281436, 34133, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot</td>', 'Nice macro shot', '2006-01-20 11:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063672, 276617, 7322, '<td valign="top">Didn''t I see this in a recent American commercial? Still, it''s a witty portrait and well done. I like the contrast of the gold frame against the blue sky. I''m guessing by the name of the subect this isn''t American anyway. :D</td>', 'Didn''t I see this in a recent American commercial? Still, it''s a witty portrait and well done. I like the contrast of the gold frame against the blue sky. I''m guessing by the name of the subect this isn''t American anyway. :D', '2006-01-20 11:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063674, 280809, 34133, '<td valign="top">A forever classic, raw and emotional challenging to the viewer</td>', 'A forever classic, raw and emotional challenging to the viewer', '2006-01-20 11:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063675, 275955, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the sunset and I like the trees silhouetted against the sky but I don''t like the expanse of darkness covering half the frame.</td>', 'Nice capture of the sunset and I like the trees silhouetted against the sky but I don''t like the expanse of darkness covering half the frame.', '2006-01-20 11:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063676, 276752, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Evokes a timeless mood.</td>', 'Very nice. Evokes a timeless mood.', '2006-01-20 11:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063680, 281896, 7291, '<td valign="top">Wow!  So much going on here with the lighting hitting the trees just right, te bird ni flight and of course the balloons.  Excellent!  10</td>', 'Wow!  So much going on here with the lighting hitting the trees just right, te bird ni flight and of course the balloons.  Excellent!  10', '2006-01-20 11:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063681, 279966, 7322, '<td valign="top">Is there something about photographing water in the woods that creates this extreme contrastiness in the surrounding rocks and trees? So many of these images seem to have this problem. I like the capture of the water but would like to see more midtone detail in the rocks and at in the tree in the foreground.</td>', 'Is there something about photographing water in the woods that creates this extreme contrastiness in the surrounding rocks and trees? So many of these images seem to have this problem. I like the capture of the water but would like to see more midtone detail in the rocks and at in the tree in the foreground.', '2006-01-20 11:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063683, 277058, 34133, '<td valign="top">The crop at the top is too tight, it would be nice to include the top of the waterfall</td>', 'The crop at the top is too tight, it would be nice to include the top of the waterfall', '2006-01-20 11:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063684, 275343, 34133, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here, and then cast yjavascript: do_vote(9)<br/> 9 our vote...</td>', 'Enter your comment here, and then cast yjavascript: do_vote(9) 9 our vote...', '2006-01-20 11:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063689, 281095, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is very nice but it looks like the boy is covered with glowing leeches. What in the world is that on his coat? This would be such a lovely image if it weren''t for that incredibly distracting detail. I love the blurred motion of the gulls, the pink sky, and the capture of the boy holding out his offering while his dad looks on. I like the path converging in this distance. There is a real sense of place to this image. The boy could be in sharper focus (and there is that matter of his glowing coat). I''m not sure how to vote on this since I like almost everything about the picture but the glowing stuff is really hard to ignore.</td>', 'This is very nice but it looks like the boy is covered with glowing leeches. What in the world is that on his coat? This would be such a lovely image if it weren''t for that incredibly distracting detail. I love the blurred motion of the gulls, the pink sky, and the capture of the boy holding out his offering while his dad looks on. I like the path converging in this distance. There is a real sense of place to this image. The boy could be in sharper focus (and there is that matter of his glowing coat). I''m not sure how to vote on this since I like almost everything about the picture but the glowing stuff is really hard to ignore.', '2006-01-20 11:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063694, 281832, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is refreshing on two levels--it is an unusual landscape and an unusual pet portrait. You have managed to break away from two cliches in one shot. Also, it looks great. Kudos!</td>', 'This is refreshing on two levels--it is an unusual landscape and an unusual pet portrait. You have managed to break away from two cliches in one shot. Also, it looks great. Kudos!', '2006-01-20 11:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063701, 277680, 19095, '<td valign="top">Wow - this looks like a scene from Lords of the rings. Great scenery and well done (10)</td>', 'Wow - this looks like a scene from Lords of the rings. Great scenery and well done (10)', '2006-01-20 11:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063702, 279756, 7322, '<td valign="top">Scary. I think that even though this is meant to disturb, we should still be able to see a catch light in the eyes (think of an evil glint in the eyes). I have a strong aversion to the sight of skin being covered in makeup or paint that dates back to early childhood but this doesn''t repell me as much as this type of effort on DPC usually does. This is a good thing. I like composition and the texture of the peeling makeup.</td>', 'Scary. I think that even though this is meant to disturb, we should still be able to see a catch light in the eyes (think of an evil glint in the eyes). I have a strong aversion to the sight of skin being covered in makeup or paint that dates back to early childhood but this doesn''t repell me as much as this type of effort on DPC usually does. This is a good thing. I like composition and the texture of the peeling makeup.', '2006-01-20 11:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063704, 275237, 35739, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!</td>', 'Nice capture!', '2006-01-20 11:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063705, 281367, 35739, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2006-01-20 11:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063707, 275374, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice family album shot. It is well composed but it verges on snapshot for me. I think the big problem is you didn''t capture a catch light in her eyes.</td>', 'This is a very nice family album shot. It is well composed but it verges on snapshot for me. I think the big problem is you didn''t capture a catch light in her eyes.', '2006-01-20 11:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063710, 276964, 35739, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. Good focus, well done.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. Good focus, well done.', '2006-01-20 11:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063712, 276787, 35739, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.</td>', 'Beautiful image.', '2006-01-20 11:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063713, 275976, 35739, '<td valign="top">Well done, nice colors.</td>', 'Well done, nice colors.', '2006-01-20 11:34:14.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2063714, 274652, 35739, '<td valign="top">Your title fits the image.  Well done!</td>', 'Your title fits the image.  Well done!', '2006-01-20 11:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063715, 279649, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice, different perspective</td>', 'Nice, different perspective', '2006-01-20 11:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063717, 278390, 35739, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and content.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and content.', '2006-01-20 11:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063718, 281896, 35739, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.</td>', 'Beautiful image.', '2006-01-20 11:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063724, 279776, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice expression. I saw a similar one on Steve''s DPOTD not to long ago...-8-</td>', 'Nice expression. I saw a similar one on Steve''s DPOTD not to long ago...-8-', '2006-01-20 11:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063726, 279632, 7322, '<td valign="top">I think a little motion blur would have helped this, especially taking the title into consideration. This appears rather static to me. I''m torn regarding the composition. Part of me likes the expanse of open road ahead of her but part of me wants that motion blur with her leaving the road behind her. The difference is emotional. In this composition, the smallness of her bike, the expanse of open road before her, and the frozen capture of the action, she appears hesitant.The wind blowing her hair is barely discernable and isn''t working hard to convey a sense of motion. If you had waitied until she was further away and used a slower shutter speed to create some blur this would (possibly) have created more of a mood of freedom and the idea that she is ''riding like the wind''. This mood seems more appropriate for a portrait of childhood.</td>', 'I think a little motion blur would have helped this, especially taking the title into consideration. This appears rather static to me. I''m torn regarding the composition. Part of me likes the expanse of open road ahead of her but part of me wants that motion blur with her leaving the road behind her. The difference is emotional. In this composition, the smallness of her bike, the expanse of open road before her, and the frozen capture of the action, she appears hesitant.The wind blowing her hair is barely discernable and isn''t working hard to convey a sense of motion. If you had waitied until she was further away and used a slower shutter speed to create some blur this would (possibly) have created more of a mood of freedom and the idea that she is ''riding like the wind''. This mood seems more appropriate for a portrait of childhood.', '2006-01-20 11:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063729, 276762, 51722, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  The composition gave me a little vertigo!  The baby looks a little yellow to me, and it would have been great if it were a little sharper.  Great concept, fun shot.</td>', 'Interesting image.  The composition gave me a little vertigo!  The baby looks a little yellow to me, and it would have been great if it were a little sharper.  Great concept, fun shot.', '2006-01-20 11:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063731, 279887, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great long exposure, rich colors, nicely composed-8-</td>', 'Great long exposure, rich colors, nicely composed-8-', '2006-01-20 11:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063733, 277932, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the spontaneous capture but I would like to see this bigger. It''s hard to get an idea of the image quality from this size. I don''t like the sepia tone. I''d rather see this in truer black and white.</td>', 'I like the spontaneous capture but I would like to see this bigger. It''s hard to get an idea of the image quality from this size. I don''t like the sepia tone. I''d rather see this in truer black and white.', '2006-01-20 11:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063735, 280137, 24846, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2006-01-20 11:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063737, 281524, 36199, '<td valign="top">Nice sky</td>', 'Nice sky', '2006-01-20 11:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063739, 275323, 35739, '<td valign="top">Not real sure about the border here.  I do like the capture and the look of the horse. Well done.</td>', 'Not real sure about the border here.  I do like the capture and the look of the horse. Well done.', '2006-01-20 11:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063740, 274722, 7322, '<td valign="top">I really like the spontainaity of this shot. The great thing is you haven''t sacrificed image quality to capture it. I love how the monk(?)is just casually taking his photo as if this is something that happens every day.</td>', 'I really like the spontainaity of this shot. The great thing is you haven''t sacrificed image quality to capture it. I love how the monk(?)is just casually taking his photo as if this is something that happens every day.', '2006-01-20 11:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063741, 276894, 36199, '<td valign="top">I like the picture but not the border as it conflicts (especially across the top) with the uneven line if the flowers</td>', 'I like the picture but not the border as it conflicts (especially across the top) with the uneven line if the flowers', '2006-01-20 11:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063742, 278697, 7322, '<td valign="top">Luscious!</td>', 'Luscious!', '2006-01-20 11:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063744, 276289, 36199, '<td valign="top">Like the pattern content of the image</td>', 'Like the pattern content of the image', '2006-01-20 11:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063747, 274810, 36199, '<td valign="top">There is a definite expression there- he doesn''t look amused!</td>', 'There is a definite expression there- he doesn''t look amused!', '2006-01-20 11:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063753, 275323, 36199, '<td valign="top">Looks like a clip from a film- beautiful. <br/>Lots of atmosphere and very well produced</td>', 'Looks like a clip from a film- beautiful. Lots of atmosphere and very well produced', '2006-01-20 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063754, 280504, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the image quality is lovely. If it hadn''t been for the title I would not have realized there was a person in the shot. He is just to small to make any sort of impact in the composition. To me, even knowing he is there, he just looks like an rock. It almost would have been better to clone him out of the shot, IMO.</td>', 'I like the composition and the image quality is lovely. If it hadn''t been for the title I would not have realized there was a person in the shot. He is just to small to make any sort of impact in the composition. To me, even knowing he is there, he just looks like an rock. It almost would have been better to clone him out of the shot, IMO.', '2006-01-20 11:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
