(2063794, 275976, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice sunset. It surpasses the ho-hum effect of ''not another sunset shot''. I think that is due to the subtle gradation of color in the sun and sky, the converging lines of the bridge and the strong verticals of the towering forms (don''t really know what they are). Really excellent work.</td>', 'Very nice sunset. It surpasses the ho-hum effect of ''not another sunset shot''. I think that is due to the subtle gradation of color in the sun and sky, the converging lines of the bridge and the strong verticals of the towering forms (don''t really know what they are). Really excellent work.', '2006-01-20 12:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
