(2064197, 280112, 772, '<td valign="top">I''ll never understand why people do this.  Selective desaturation works well, IMO, when it focuses the viewer''s attention on the subject.  This one pulls me away from the subject to look for absolutely nothing in the leftover colors of the background.</td>', 'I''ll never understand why people do this.  Selective desaturation works well, IMO, when it focuses the viewer''s attention on the subject.  This one pulls me away from the subject to look for absolutely nothing in the leftover colors of the background.', '2006-01-20 14:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
