(2064214, 279612, 24486, '<td valign="top">I''m trying really hard to fault this but it''s just not working. I bet this is one of the most looked at photographs in the challenge &amp; I can see why. This is excellant.</td>', 'I''m trying really hard to fault this but it''s just not working. I bet this is one of the most looked at photographs in the challenge & I can see why. This is excellant.', '2006-01-20 14:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
