(2064226, 275321, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great photo, wonderful tones and contrast.  The roots really stand out nicely from the dark ground and add a lot of character.  Well done!</td>', 'Great photo, wonderful tones and contrast.  The roots really stand out nicely from the dark ground and add a lot of character.  Well done!', '2006-01-20 14:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064228, 278859, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. I like your use of shadows to creat a somber expression. Dark background shows off the subject very well. This is among my top picks. That being said I am troubled by the border. To me it is an awkward thickness. It reminds me of a National Geographic border but it would need to be thicker to complete the metaphore. Or it ought to be thinner so as not to over power the photo. The border helps, but it could have helped more.</td>', 'Very nice image. I like your use of shadows to creat a somber expression. Dark background shows off the subject very well. This is among my top picks. That being said I am troubled by the border. To me it is an awkward thickness. It reminds me of a National Geographic border but it would need to be thicker to complete the metaphore. Or it ought to be thinner so as not to over power the photo. The border helps, but it could have helped more.', '2006-01-20 14:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064231, 275086, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very humurous photo.  The composition is very good and the dog stands out well from the background.  I think a little more DOF would be good, to get the snout as sharp as the eyes.  I also like the choice of border.  Well done!</td>', 'Very humurous photo.  The composition is very good and the dog stands out well from the background.  I think a little more DOF would be good, to get the snout as sharp as the eyes.  I also like the choice of border.  Well done!', '2006-01-20 14:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064233, 281362, 31443, '<td valign="top">Now here is a different take on simple subject, love it!</td>', 'Now here is a different take on simple subject, love it!', '2006-01-20 14:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064235, 279330, 48739, '<td valign="top">I think i lOve this picture!!! lol might need a Print.....</td>', 'I think i lOve this picture!!! lol might need a Print.....', '2006-01-20 14:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064237, 278871, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. I have seen many like it over the years and I''m always appreciative when they are well done. You''ve gone a step beyond by showing the photographers. At this site and for this audience, I believe it was a brilliant compositional move. Firstly it lends a sense of scale to the photo which is rarely done. Secondly, it adds some life to the photo. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Wonderful image. I have seen many like it over the years and I''m always appreciative when they are well done. You''ve gone a step beyond by showing the photographers. At this site and for this audience, I believe it was a brilliant compositional move. Firstly it lends a sense of scale to the photo which is rarely done. Secondly, it adds some life to the photo. Among my top picks.', '2006-01-20 14:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064240, 281807, 24486, '<td valign="top">This is the sort of photograph that gets published in National Geographic.</td>', 'This is the sort of photograph that gets published in National Geographic.', '2006-01-20 14:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064246, 274595, 18197, '<td valign="top">The detail in your photo is exceptional. The DOF is virtually perfect. Colors are vibrant. Composition is quite good. But all that aside, it makes me feel good. Thanks. Well done. Among my top picks.</td>', 'The detail in your photo is exceptional. The DOF is virtually perfect. Colors are vibrant. Composition is quite good. But all that aside, it makes me feel good. Thanks. Well done. Among my top picks.', '2006-01-20 14:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064248, 277667, 16046, '<td valign="top">Nice, love this kind of light, well done</td>', 'Nice, love this kind of light, well done', '2006-01-20 14:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064250, 281716, 16046, '<td valign="top">Super job with the light and focus.</td>', 'Super job with the light and focus.', '2006-01-20 14:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064252, 276866, 16046, '<td valign="top">Well done, well done</td>', 'Well done, well done', '2006-01-20 14:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064254, 276017, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful sunset.  Very interesting sky and I like how you waited until the sun was almost behind the clouds, but not quite.  Compositionally the photo is a little dull, as if you might be relying too much on the sunset itself to make the photo.</td>', 'Very beautiful sunset.  Very interesting sky and I like how you waited until the sun was almost behind the clouds, but not quite.  Compositionally the photo is a little dull, as if you might be relying too much on the sunset itself to make the photo.', '2006-01-20 14:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064256, 275197, 32997, '<td valign="top">really beautiful...love the highlights and textures on the cliffs...great composition...</td>', 'really beautiful...love the highlights and textures on the cliffs...great composition...', '2006-01-20 14:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064262, 278837, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am not normally a fan of B&amp;W. (If God intended we shoot in B&amp;W, He wouldn''t have invented Kodachrome!) But in this case, the B&amp;W was a superb choice. The framing of the scene with branches overhead and the dark foreground is magnificent. There is an interesting juxtaposition of emotion going on here ... the dark framing elements are ominous, but the lighter distant subject is peaceful, pastoral even. Makes for an interesting photo I would return to often, and look at longer. Focus and DOF are terrific. Museum quality. Among my top picks.</td>', 'I am not normally a fan of B&W. (If God intended we shoot in B&W, He wouldn''t have invented Kodachrome!) But in this case, the B&W was a superb choice. The framing of the scene with branches overhead and the dark foreground is magnificent. There is an interesting juxtaposition of emotion going on here ... the dark framing elements are ominous, but the lighter distant subject is peaceful, pastoral even. Makes for an interesting photo I would return to often, and look at longer. Focus and DOF are terrific. Museum quality. Among my top picks.', '2006-01-20 14:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064265, 275479, 32997, '<td valign="top">lonely and bittersweet..wonderful work, great processing choices...</td>', 'lonely and bittersweet..wonderful work, great processing choices...', '2006-01-20 14:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064266, 274963, 208, '<td valign="top">Excellent diagonals on the wall. They help the model give this photo motion that standard horizontals would have killed.</td>', 'Excellent diagonals on the wall. They help the model give this photo motion that standard horizontals would have killed.', '2006-01-20 14:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064270, 275196, 50680, '<td valign="top">I really like it - Well done</td>', 'I really like it - Well done', '2006-01-20 14:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064272, 277680, 48739, '<td valign="top">Very Awesome</td>', 'Very Awesome', '2006-01-20 14:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064274, 281004, 2764, '<td valign="top">Supurb black and white conversion - want to teach me how?  Beautiful model, pensive gaze, perfect focus.  I wish that her other eye was visible and not blocked by her nose.  Does she love the portrait??  I like all the diagonals that make my eye crisscross back and forth, keeps me entralled with the image.</td>', 'Supurb black and white conversion - want to teach me how?  Beautiful model, pensive gaze, perfect focus.  I wish that her other eye was visible and not blocked by her nose.  Does she love the portrait??  I like all the diagonals that make my eye crisscross back and forth, keeps me entralled with the image.', '2006-01-20 14:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064279, 274592, 7291, '<td valign="top">I know I''ve see this girl before here on DPC.  I just can''t remember where.  What a beautilful face and great lighting.</td>', 'I know I''ve see this girl before here on DPC.  I just can''t remember where.  What a beautilful face and great lighting.', '2006-01-20 14:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064281, 279612, 51616, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is quite amazing, the contrast is fantasitc, i love it<br/> <br/>dunno how voting goes but its great, keep up the good work</td>', 'I think this photo is quite amazing, the contrast is fantasitc, i love it dunno how voting goes but its great, keep up the good work', '2006-01-20 14:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
