(2064378, 280507, 208, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see her face, but this is a beautiful picture.</td>', 'I''d like to see her face, but this is a beautiful picture.', '2006-01-20 15:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064380, 277057, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective you''ve achieved on this vibrant city. You''ve done a very good job capturing the energy of Melbourne. Well done and among my top picks. I think I would like it even better if it were a bit bigger. The detail might not have held up, but if it remained sharp at 640 x 422, I would have liked it even beter.</td>', 'I like the perspective you''ve achieved on this vibrant city. You''ve done a very good job capturing the energy of Melbourne. Well done and among my top picks. I think I would like it even better if it were a bit bigger. The detail might not have held up, but if it remained sharp at 640 x 422, I would have liked it even beter.', '2006-01-20 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064381, 280517, 772, '<td valign="top">Cute cat and excellent shot :) - 10</td>', 'Cute cat and excellent shot :) - 10', '2006-01-20 15:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064384, 277879, 7291, '<td valign="top">That''s nice.  But how do you get in those things?  They''re too far away from the steps and too far down from the windows.</td>', 'That''s nice.  But how do you get in those things?  They''re too far away from the steps and too far down from the windows.', '2006-01-20 15:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
