(2064388, 274709, 38234, '<td valign="top">a magical feel to this, the only thing I can think of that would have made this even more perfect was if the bush on the left frame wasn''t there - great shot regardless</td>', 'a magical feel to this, the only thing I can think of that would have made this even more perfect was if the bush on the left frame wasn''t there - great shot regardless', '2006-01-20 15:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
