(2064936, 276753, 93, '<td valign="top">A nice attempt at saving an overexposed photo.  Good action, but just too many technical issues bring this down in my book.</td>', 'A nice attempt at saving an overexposed photo.  Good action, but just too many technical issues bring this down in my book.', '2006-01-20 17:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064939, 281176, 93, '<td valign="top">While I appreciate that you tried to show the sense of scale, I''m thinking you just got a little too far from your subjects.  The blow-out of the water is a little distracting as well.</td>', 'While I appreciate that you tried to show the sense of scale, I''m thinking you just got a little too far from your subjects.  The blow-out of the water is a little distracting as well.', '2006-01-20 17:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064941, 279012, 17507, '<td valign="top">aren''t all the dead trees around yellowstone freaky? i was really bothered by all the wreckage left from the forest fire.<br/> <br/>you did a good job capturing those skeletal things - the dark sky is perfect for the backdrop.</td>', 'aren''t all the dead trees around yellowstone freaky? i was really bothered by all the wreckage left from the forest fire. you did a good job capturing those skeletal things - the dark sky is perfect for the backdrop.', '2006-01-20 17:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064942, 276840, 93, '<td valign="top">For me, the colors in this photo are just fighting each other too much, and you *totally* lose the mid-ground in shadow.</td>', 'For me, the colors in this photo are just fighting each other too much, and you *totally* lose the mid-ground in shadow.', '2006-01-20 17:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064943, 280507, 93, '<td valign="top">A fun and whimsical shot.. love the processing too. I''m not a huge fan of overly "yellow" sepias, but this really works.  Your tonal range is fantastic.</td>', 'A fun and whimsical shot.. love the processing too. I''m not a huge fan of overly "yellow" sepias, but this really works.  Your tonal range is fantastic.', '2006-01-20 17:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064944, 280582, 93, '<td valign="top">From experience, I know how hard it is to make a photo with fog interesting.. you''ve done a good job combining the elements here.  It probably lacks the "wow" factor for most people, but I appreciate that what you''ve been able to do here.</td>', 'From experience, I know how hard it is to make a photo with fog interesting.. you''ve done a good job combining the elements here.  It probably lacks the "wow" factor for most people, but I appreciate that what you''ve been able to do here.', '2006-01-20 17:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064946, 281454, 93, '<td valign="top">A little over-exposed in areas, and the focus is a bit soft, but this is a beautiful area.</td>', 'A little over-exposed in areas, and the focus is a bit soft, but this is a beautiful area.', '2006-01-20 17:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064947, 281730, 31794, '<td valign="top">great shot, composition, colors, sharpness and details are exellent, the skies look a bit fake, too much dodge/burn maby..</td>', 'great shot, composition, colors, sharpness and details are exellent, the skies look a bit fake, too much dodge/burn maby..', '2006-01-20 17:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064949, 281315, 16046, '<td valign="top">Great B/W, good dodge an burn job</td>', 'Great B/W, good dodge an burn job', '2006-01-20 17:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064950, 276866, 93, '<td valign="top">I honestly don''t know if it''s processing or just seriously weird environmental stuff going on in the far background, but it''s eerie.. and I don''t know if I like it..</td>', 'I honestly don''t know if it''s processing or just seriously weird environmental stuff going on in the far background, but it''s eerie.. and I don''t know if I like it..', '2006-01-20 17:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064951, 280963, 93, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look much like joy to me.. more like pain, or discomfort, or bad acting :)</td>', 'Doesn''t look much like joy to me.. more like pain, or discomfort, or bad acting :)', '2006-01-20 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064953, 275371, 93, '<td valign="top">Yikes.. the water can''t *really* be that color can it?</td>', 'Yikes.. the water can''t *really* be that color can it?', '2006-01-20 17:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064955, 275360, 93, '<td valign="top">That one blade of grass bugs the heck out of me!</td>', 'That one blade of grass bugs the heck out of me!', '2006-01-20 17:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064956, 276970, 16046, '<td valign="top">Bravo, viva la france</td>', 'Bravo, viva la france', '2006-01-20 17:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064957, 281758, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I don´t particularly like or dislike the sky though, it´s sort of "blah" as it is, couldn´t you have done some more with it, either by using a polarizer or some post processing.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice shot, I don´t particularly like or dislike the sky though, it´s sort of "blah" as it is, couldn´t you have done some more with it, either by using a polarizer or some post processing.  Nice composition.', '2006-01-20 17:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064959, 281983, 16046, '<td valign="top">brilliant color and focus</td>', 'brilliant color and focus', '2006-01-20 17:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064960, 274768, 26475, '<td valign="top">It''s a good image, but I would have moved the camera to the right so that the sun was hidden behind the cross. The Cross would then fracture the sun and it would appear as if the sun''s glow was emenating from the cross itself as Jesus'' light.</td>', 'It''s a good image, but I would have moved the camera to the right so that the sun was hidden behind the cross. The Cross would then fracture the sun and it would appear as if the sun''s glow was emenating from the cross itself as Jesus'' light.', '2006-01-20 17:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064961, 278365, 93, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cool shot.. I like the orange light reflections.</td>', 'This is a pretty cool shot.. I like the orange light reflections.', '2006-01-20 17:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064963, 275452, 93, '<td valign="top">A lot of lions in this challenge.. I don''t know that I like looking up this one''s nostrils... I might see the last person he ate in there.</td>', 'A lot of lions in this challenge.. I don''t know that I like looking up this one''s nostrils... I might see the last person he ate in there.', '2006-01-20 17:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064964, 276549, 16046, '<td valign="top">Wow, will be in the top 10 for sure. Well done.10</td>', 'Wow, will be in the top 10 for sure. Well done.10', '2006-01-20 17:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064967, 275337, 93, '<td valign="top">A pretty cool and colorful shot.. I can imagine it''s difficult shooting stage performances.</td>', 'A pretty cool and colorful shot.. I can imagine it''s difficult shooting stage performances.', '2006-01-20 17:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064969, 275955, 93, '<td valign="top">With so many sunset shots, you really need something to stand out to be noticed, and this, unfortunately, probably doesn''t stand out that much.</td>', 'With so many sunset shots, you really need something to stand out to be noticed, and this, unfortunately, probably doesn''t stand out that much.', '2006-01-20 17:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064972, 281095, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice love pretty much everything about it except for the reflections of light on the little boy.  In particular I love the slight motion of the birds, a very nice capture.  Enough for an 8 from me, nice work :)</td>', 'Nice love pretty much everything about it except for the reflections of light on the little boy.  In particular I love the slight motion of the birds, a very nice capture.  Enough for an 8 from me, nice work :)', '2006-01-20 17:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064973, 276315, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice eyes on yourself to get this.  I wish the bottom was different though.. busy and distracting.  Not much you can do about it though.</td>', 'Nice eyes on yourself to get this.  I wish the bottom was different though.. busy and distracting.  Not much you can do about it though.', '2006-01-20 17:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064974, 276204, 93, '<td valign="top">Another photo that looks like Nuclear Holocausts just happened in the landscape.  FEAR THE NUCLEAR!</td>', 'Another photo that looks like Nuclear Holocausts just happened in the landscape.  FEAR THE NUCLEAR!', '2006-01-20 17:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064975, 281813, 36470, '<td valign="top">I think an off-center composition would have been awesome for this shot.  Love the pose and the location.</td>', 'I think an off-center composition would have been awesome for this shot.  Love the pose and the location.', '2006-01-20 17:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064976, 276200, 93, '<td valign="top">Awwwww..  Very sweet.  Slightly oversaturated for my tastes.. I think maybe a nice semi-desat would have worked better?</td>', 'Awwwww..  Very sweet.  Slightly oversaturated for my tastes.. I think maybe a nice semi-desat would have worked better?', '2006-01-20 17:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064977, 274931, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Color, composition, focus, DOF combine to rank it among my top picks and certainly the best of its genre. If the DOF were slightly deeper, I might have liked it even more ... but then I''d have to give it an 11.</td>', 'Very nice image. Color, composition, focus, DOF combine to rank it among my top picks and certainly the best of its genre. If the DOF were slightly deeper, I might have liked it even more ... but then I''d have to give it an 11.', '2006-01-20 17:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064979, 279896, 93, '<td valign="top">An o.k. photo. I don''t like the distractions on the right. The bird there was a good capture.  I see banding in the sky/clouds too.</td>', 'An o.k. photo. I don''t like the distractions on the right. The bird there was a good capture.  I see banding in the sky/clouds too.', '2006-01-20 17:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064981, 279729, 93, '<td valign="top">Pretty little girl, but the lighting is very unflattering.</td>', 'Pretty little girl, but the lighting is very unflattering.', '2006-01-20 17:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064982, 278072, 93, '<td valign="top">Using the full 640 pixel limit is *highly* recommended.</td>', 'Using the full 640 pixel limit is *highly* recommended.', '2006-01-20 17:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064983, 277095, 93, '<td valign="top">The curving shoreline gives the optical illusion that this photo is tilted.. crazy!  Nice sky.</td>', 'The curving shoreline gives the optical illusion that this photo is tilted.. crazy!  Nice sky.', '2006-01-20 17:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064984, 276052, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I have to say that I STRONGLY dislike the eyes, they don´t even remind me of eyes anymore but like someone put tiny little CD´s over her irises.  I still gave this a 6 as the composition and rest of the shot are pretty good.</td>', 'Sorry but I have to say that I STRONGLY dislike the eyes, they don´t even remind me of eyes anymore but like someone put tiny little CD´s over her irises.  I still gave this a 6 as the composition and rest of the shot are pretty good.', '2006-01-20 17:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064985, 281896, 36470, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I love the translucency of the balloons.</td>', 'Very cool.  I love the translucency of the balloons.', '2006-01-20 17:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064987, 280786, 93, '<td valign="top">Slightly out of focus, and a less than inspiring background.</td>', 'Slightly out of focus, and a less than inspiring background.', '2006-01-20 17:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064989, 276533, 93, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of areas on the Shuswap here in B.C.  An O.K. photo, but is really busy, and lacks a really good focal point.</td>', 'Reminds me of areas on the Shuswap here in B.C.  An O.K. photo, but is really busy, and lacks a really good focal point.', '2006-01-20 17:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064990, 278462, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a dramatic image which conveys a couple different notions of strength to me. The violent but transient strength of a storm. The more permanent but passive strength of a structure. And the neat part, what will happen when the unstoppable force meets the immovable object? I love that the structure and the storm seem to be leaning towards each other. Great photo. Among my top picks.</td>', 'This is a dramatic image which conveys a couple different notions of strength to me. The violent but transient strength of a storm. The more permanent but passive strength of a structure. And the neat part, what will happen when the unstoppable force meets the immovable object? I love that the structure and the storm seem to be leaning towards each other. Great photo. Among my top picks.', '2006-01-20 17:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064992, 281212, 93, '<td valign="top">Darn skiiers! Ruining perfectly good pristine mountain landscapes.</td>', 'Darn skiiers! Ruining perfectly good pristine mountain landscapes.', '2006-01-20 17:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064993, 276032, 27482, '<td valign="top">A little too much red/yellow for my taste, I think I would have preferred it if it were toned down a little bit but still a good shot, think it´s above average in the challenge and gave it a 6.</td>', 'A little too much red/yellow for my taste, I think I would have preferred it if it were toned down a little bit but still a good shot, think it´s above average in the challenge and gave it a 6.', '2006-01-20 17:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064994, 280585, 9387, '<td valign="top">To me this photo drew me in on the thumbnail and while I like it a lot there seems to be something else that could be done to it to give it a little punch.  I do like it very much though but I just couldn''t give it a ten.  So a nine will have to do.</td>', 'To me this photo drew me in on the thumbnail and while I like it a lot there seems to be something else that could be done to it to give it a little punch.  I do like it very much though but I just couldn''t give it a ten.  So a nine will have to do.', '2006-01-20 17:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064996, 276745, 36470, '<td valign="top">Great eyes, expression, pose, and lighting.  Not a fan of the crop, however.  Cropping the top down to right abover her ear would help draw the attention to her eyes.  That or show some more torso.  Wow, the eyes..LOL</td>', 'Great eyes, expression, pose, and lighting.  Not a fan of the crop, however.  Cropping the top down to right abover her ear would help draw the attention to her eyes.  That or show some more torso.  Wow, the eyes..LOL', '2006-01-20 17:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064997, 280481, 93, '<td valign="top">If your intention was to turn day to night, it''s not entirely effective.</td>', 'If your intention was to turn day to night, it''s not entirely effective.', '2006-01-20 17:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065000, 278390, 93, '<td valign="top">A great dramatic sky, but the focus on the fore and mid-ground is very soft.</td>', 'A great dramatic sky, but the focus on the fore and mid-ground is very soft.', '2006-01-20 17:20:49.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2065001, 277249, 9387, '<td valign="top">This is great.</td>', 'This is great.', '2006-01-20 17:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065003, 281047, 36470, '<td valign="top">Great work making art out of trash.</td>', 'Great work making art out of trash.', '2006-01-20 17:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065004, 278309, 93, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  A few technical issues.. focus isn''t entirely sharp, a little too dark in areas.. but a fun photo nonetheless.</td>', 'Very creative!  A few technical issues.. focus isn''t entirely sharp, a little too dark in areas.. but a fun photo nonetheless.', '2006-01-20 17:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065005, 281221, 9387, '<td valign="top">I like this photo because of the moon in the ferris wheel.</td>', 'I like this photo because of the moon in the ferris wheel.', '2006-01-20 17:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065006, 278093, 18197, '<td valign="top">Normally I would have given this photo a 1 simply because it is so small that I can''t see any detail clearly. Instead I have ranked it among my top picks because of how well it conveys the atmosphere of the location. Well done ... but imagine how much better it might be larger ... assuming the detail would stand up at 640 x 480.</td>', 'Normally I would have given this photo a 1 simply because it is so small that I can''t see any detail clearly. Instead I have ranked it among my top picks because of how well it conveys the atmosphere of the location. Well done ... but imagine how much better it might be larger ... assuming the detail would stand up at 640 x 480.', '2006-01-20 17:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065007, 277966, 93, '<td valign="top">Not enough emphasis on the subject in your title, and the shot just comes across as being extremely busy.</td>', 'Not enough emphasis on the subject in your title, and the shot just comes across as being extremely busy.', '2006-01-20 17:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065009, 275288, 9387, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2006-01-20 17:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065013, 281529, 93, '<td valign="top">Way, way too dark. You would have benefitted greatly from taking this photo at another angle, (if possible), or having some sort of fill-flash.</td>', 'Way, way too dark. You would have benefitted greatly from taking this photo at another angle, (if possible), or having some sort of fill-flash.', '2006-01-20 17:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065016, 276957, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice work with the PP, looks good and natural and I love the contrast.</td>', 'Nice work with the PP, looks good and natural and I love the contrast.', '2006-01-20 17:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065017, 281602, 31794, '<td valign="top">great timing, too bad the horizon is tilting, composition is good, and this is an interesting image, but tilting horizons really destroys images.</td>', 'great timing, too bad the horizon is tilting, composition is good, and this is an interesting image, but tilting horizons really destroys images.', '2006-01-20 17:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065019, 280107, 93, '<td valign="top">eeww.  That''s a lot of algae.  That looks like quite a large bear too.  Focus is soft and the ligthing isn''t the greatest, which hurt this photo.</td>', 'eeww.  That''s a lot of algae.  That looks like quite a large bear too.  Focus is soft and the ligthing isn''t the greatest, which hurt this photo.', '2006-01-20 17:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065020, 281826, 9387, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this photo.  The red is saturated just enough and the colors leap out at you without being overbearing.</td>', 'I absolutely love this photo.  The red is saturated just enough and the colors leap out at you without being overbearing.', '2006-01-20 17:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065022, 277202, 93, '<td valign="top">Lacks a little bit of contrast in areas, and I''m not sure I like the vantage point, personally. The foreground is a little too busy.</td>', 'Lacks a little bit of contrast in areas, and I''m not sure I like the vantage point, personally. The foreground is a little too busy.', '2006-01-20 17:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065023, 274844, 40683, '<td valign="top">Love the pop of green in the foreground against the soft,misty background tones...restful, serene, a pleasure to look at.  One little nit pick - I may have cloned out the tallest twig to the right as it bisects the dock in a way that''s a little distracting.  A very lovely image...good luck!</td>', 'Love the pop of green in the foreground against the soft,misty background tones...restful, serene, a pleasure to look at.  One little nit pick - I may have cloned out the tallest twig to the right as it bisects the dock in a way that''s a little distracting.  A very lovely image...good luck!', '2006-01-20 17:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065024, 275842, 93, '<td valign="top">Looks oversharpened, and overexposed in the sky/clouds. The harsh light change isn''t my favorite either.</td>', 'Looks oversharpened, and overexposed in the sky/clouds. The harsh light change isn''t my favorite either.', '2006-01-20 17:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065025, 281751, 93, '<td valign="top">Lacks a certain panache to really stand it out.. whether it''s color, or light issues, or both, is something I''m still trying to figure out.</td>', 'Lacks a certain panache to really stand it out.. whether it''s color, or light issues, or both, is something I''m still trying to figure out.', '2006-01-20 17:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065028, 278871, 93, '<td valign="top">Yah, this place is *way* over-shot.  Having a bunch of photographers in the photo is creative though.</td>', 'Yah, this place is *way* over-shot.  Having a bunch of photographers in the photo is creative though.', '2006-01-20 17:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065029, 276714, 31794, '<td valign="top">this looks just like a postcard.. if someone was sitting in the chair the image would be a lot more interresting, composition and colorrange is good, the skies are too brown, but over all a nice image</td>', 'this looks just like a postcard.. if someone was sitting in the chair the image would be a lot more interresting, composition and colorrange is good, the skies are too brown, but over all a nice image', '2006-01-20 17:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065030, 274550, 18197, '<td valign="top">Yours is a photo that started just above the middle of the pack in my voting. But each time I looked at it, I appreciated more the simplicity of line, the strength of the foregound/background composition, the composition, the lighting ... and what the photo left to the imagination. By the end of the day, it is among my top picks. Well done! If it were me, I might have cropped out the bottom 5-10 pixels to further strengthen what''s left to the imagination.</td>', 'Yours is a photo that started just above the middle of the pack in my voting. But each time I looked at it, I appreciated more the simplicity of line, the strength of the foregound/background composition, the composition, the lighting ... and what the photo left to the imagination. By the end of the day, it is among my top picks. Well done! If it were me, I might have cropped out the bottom 5-10 pixels to further strengthen what''s left to the imagination.', '2006-01-20 17:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065031, 281893, 93, '<td valign="top">A nice landscape, but nothing that reaches out to grab you, particularily.</td>', 'A nice landscape, but nothing that reaches out to grab you, particularily.', '2006-01-20 17:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065035, 280419, 93, '<td valign="top">Interesting attempt at a night-time silhouette, but it just seems a little too busy and lacks the real focal point.</td>', 'Interesting attempt at a night-time silhouette, but it just seems a little too busy and lacks the real focal point.', '2006-01-20 17:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065036, 281505, 9387, '<td valign="top">Dam I wish I was there right now!</td>', 'Dam I wish I was there right now!', '2006-01-20 17:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065037, 280226, 31794, '<td valign="top">this is a cool image, would have done well in the surreal challenge, the zoom works well in this image and the single color makes this a very cool shot.</td>', 'this is a cool image, would have done well in the surreal challenge, the zoom works well in this image and the single color makes this a very cool shot.', '2006-01-20 17:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065038, 274801, 93, '<td valign="top">They had backgammon in 1642? CoOOOoool.</td>', 'They had backgammon in 1642? CoOOOoool.', '2006-01-20 17:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065040, 275943, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''m normally not a big "cute baby picture" fan, but I''ll make an exception here because this is so well done. Congratulations on a great capture. Among my top picks.</td>', 'I''m normally not a big "cute baby picture" fan, but I''ll make an exception here because this is so well done. Congratulations on a great capture. Among my top picks.', '2006-01-20 17:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065043, 280464, 93, '<td valign="top">Interestingly enough, the cyan cast here *really* works well... some really nice lighting going on on that barn.  One of the few barn landscapes I can say I actually kind of like.</td>', 'Interestingly enough, the cyan cast here *really* works well... some really nice lighting going on on that barn.  One of the few barn landscapes I can say I actually kind of like.', '2006-01-20 17:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065044, 280784, 50466, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2006-01-20 17:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065045, 280749, 93, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a cardinal.  You''ve controlled the strong sunlight really well.</td>', 'Great capture of a cardinal.  You''ve controlled the strong sunlight really well.', '2006-01-20 17:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065046, 276059, 50466, '<td valign="top">yet another gorgeous landscape...8</td>', 'yet another gorgeous landscape...8', '2006-01-20 17:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065047, 281845, 93, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more dramatic lighting here.</td>', 'Needs a little more dramatic lighting here.', '2006-01-20 17:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065048, 274673, 50466, '<td valign="top">very nice, really gives you a scale of size....9</td>', 'very nice, really gives you a scale of size....9', '2006-01-20 17:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065049, 278828, 93, '<td valign="top">crazy! That''s a heck of an outfit.</td>', 'crazy! That''s a heck of an outfit.', '2006-01-20 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
