(2065729, 278434, 34069, '<td valign="top">I think the book in the foreground is too bright - maybe better to turn it away from the sun a bit more and use shallower DOF to deemphasize it.  Also, for me at least, the tilted horizon is very un-relaxing.  I like the concept, though.</td>', 'I think the book in the foreground is too bright - maybe better to turn it away from the sun a bit more and use shallower DOF to deemphasize it.  Also, for me at least, the tilted horizon is very un-relaxing.  I like the concept, though.', '2006-01-20 21:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065732, 275483, 34069, '<td valign="top">I like the scene but the tilted horizon bothers me.  Also there''s a wee bit of posterization in the pink sky.</td>', 'I like the scene but the tilted horizon bothers me.  Also there''s a wee bit of posterization in the pink sky.', '2006-01-20 21:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
