(2066577, 276781, 10867, '<td valign="top">The sky is extremely impressive.  However, the relative lack of clarity and sharpness in the land part of the image and the lack of real distinction in the silhouettes is problematic.</td>', 'The sky is extremely impressive.  However, the relative lack of clarity and sharpness in the land part of the image and the lack of real distinction in the silhouettes is problematic.', '2006-01-21 01:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
