(2066675, 280588, 18932, '<td valign="top">Very evocative. Masterful use of b/w, and sharp as a blade, forget a tack! The only downside is the slightly odd expression on the baby''s face, but this is one of those timeless images nonetheless. 8/10</td>', 'Very evocative. Masterful use of b/w, and sharp as a blade, forget a tack! The only downside is the slightly odd expression on the baby''s face, but this is one of those timeless images nonetheless. 8/10', '2006-01-21 02:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
