(2066695, 280263, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome soft focus, but the back two girls look out of focus.  A tad more dof and this would be one of my highest scores ever given out.  Like this it''s a damn good shot!  Great emotion.  Great capture.  Great composition.  Kudos<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome soft focus, but the back two girls look out of focus.  A tad more dof and this would be one of my highest scores ever given out.  Like this it''s a damn good shot!  Great emotion.  Great capture.  Great composition.  KudosTC', '2006-01-21 02:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
