(2066703, 281731, 9906, '<td valign="top">640 by whatever does not do this justice.  You need to take that into consideration when entering here.  I''ve had awesome shots that just didn''t work in this media bomb and was depressed about it. I would love to see the full size work up of this shot someday!<br/>TC</td>', '640 by whatever does not do this justice.  You need to take that into consideration when entering here.  I''ve had awesome shots that just didn''t work in this media bomb and was depressed about it. I would love to see the full size work up of this shot someday!TC', '2006-01-21 02:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
