(2066748, 281988, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice leading line with the path however I think the image is underexposed.  The snow looks a bit too grey.  Snow will fool the cameras meter so you need to dial in some exposure compensation.  For this amount of white in the picture you could probably get away with +1 to +1.5.</td>', 'Nice leading line with the path however I think the image is underexposed.  The snow looks a bit too grey.  Snow will fool the cameras meter so you need to dial in some exposure compensation.  For this amount of white in the picture you could probably get away with +1 to +1.5.', '2006-01-21 03:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
