(2067086, 281959, 2764, '<td valign="top">Oh, Im glad i came back to this several times before commenting.  I thought it was a ceramic bowl on a refective surface  ans was confused by the shape of the reflection.  Now I think it is a jar top and the lower part is part of the glass jar?  We literal minded folks get upset when we can''t identify things.  I hope there are not as many literal voters who get hung up on "what is it?" because this is a lovely image whatever it is.  There is a softness and a stoniness to it.  The shadow part almost looks like a human neck (drat, there I go again, turning it into a bust with a pillbox hat).</td>', 'Oh, Im glad i came back to this several times before commenting.  I thought it was a ceramic bowl on a refective surface  ans was confused by the shape of the reflection.  Now I think it is a jar top and the lower part is part of the glass jar?  We literal minded folks get upset when we can''t identify things.  I hope there are not as many literal voters who get hung up on "what is it?" because this is a lovely image whatever it is.  There is a softness and a stoniness to it.  The shadow part almost looks like a human neck (drat, there I go again, turning it into a bust with a pillbox hat).', '2006-01-21 09:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
