(2068014, 279614, 36981, '<td valign="top">I love high contrast images, and this is no exception.  It''s very well done, with interesting lighting.  I would have liked her lips to be a little stronger though; their almost "absence" draws my attention and makes it hard to pay attention to the rest of the image.</td>', 'I love high contrast images, and this is no exception.  It''s very well done, with interesting lighting.  I would have liked her lips to be a little stronger though; their almost "absence" draws my attention and makes it hard to pay attention to the rest of the image.', '2006-01-21 14:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2068015, 276469, 39664, '<td valign="top">There could be better angles and body positions to make this shot flatter this girl.  I hope this doesn''t come across as harsh but the beautiful colors and textures of the wood and vines would probably made for a better photograph without the girl.</td>', 'There could be better angles and body positions to make this shot flatter this girl.  I hope this doesn''t come across as harsh but the beautiful colors and textures of the wood and vines would probably made for a better photograph without the girl.', '2006-01-21 14:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
