(2068164, 276894, 18932, '<td valign="top">First of all I HATE BORDERS. Now that we''ve got that out of the way, I like this. The b/w helps, if you asked them to stand there I would have got the left hand boy to move closer to the girl and away from the post which I think would help a bit. This photo adds to my if you''re going to have a look-out, why ruin the outlook file - the wires are not helpful either. Despite the negatives, I''m still going to give this 7/10 because I like the feeling you''ve captured here.</td>', 'First of all I HATE BORDERS. Now that we''ve got that out of the way, I like this. The b/w helps, if you asked them to stand there I would have got the left hand boy to move closer to the girl and away from the post which I think would help a bit. This photo adds to my if you''re going to have a look-out, why ruin the outlook file - the wires are not helpful either. Despite the negatives, I''m still going to give this 7/10 because I like the feeling you''ve captured here.', '2006-01-21 15:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
