(2068181, 277181, 27482, '<td valign="top">There is just something a little bit "off" about the composition that I don´t like, can´t put my finger on it but I think it´s a mixture of the subjects placement, the DOF and the angle it´s shot at but everything else is top notch, especially the lighting.  Gave this a 7 in the end, nice work.</td>', 'There is just something a little bit "off" about the composition that I don´t like, can´t put my finger on it but I think it´s a mixture of the subjects placement, the DOF and the angle it´s shot at but everything else is top notch, especially the lighting.  Gave this a 7 in the end, nice work.', '2006-01-21 16:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
