(2068212, 280712, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lovely black and whit tones. Like how the white oval draws creates an area of interest and brings the eye in to it. Is there a bird flying across the water?</td>', 'Lovely black and whit tones. Like how the white oval draws creates an area of interest and brings the eye in to it. Is there a bird flying across the water?', '2006-01-21 16:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2068213, 281894, 93, '<td valign="top">Quite a nice, and slightly different infrared shot..  Usually people try and get as much foliage in a shot as possible without really worrying too much about composition or content, but you''ve done a nice job making this very "industrial gothic". Nice job.</td>', 'Quite a nice, and slightly different infrared shot..  Usually people try and get as much foliage in a shot as possible without really worrying too much about composition or content, but you''ve done a nice job making this very "industrial gothic". Nice job.', '2006-01-21 16:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2068214, 276619, 13728, '<td valign="top">I have shot a lot of baseball and getting the bat on the ball is VERY hard to do.  I did it once this past summer.  I was so excited.  They were college players too so the ball was coming very fast.  It is cool how you caputred the the compression of the ball.  Judging by where it was on the bat, I bet he hit it foul...or maybe a bunt?  Nice job, I am a sucker for baseball shots</td>', 'I have shot a lot of baseball and getting the bat on the ball is VERY hard to do.  I did it once this past summer.  I was so excited.  They were college players too so the ball was coming very fast.  It is cool how you caputred the the compression of the ball.  Judging by where it was on the bat, I bet he hit it foul...or maybe a bunt?  Nice job, I am a sucker for baseball shots', '2006-01-21 16:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2068215, 281846, 93, '<td valign="top">A nice concept, but I''m not thrilled about the processing.  The over-exposure and high-contrast doesn''t really work for me in this case, and the smaller image doesn''t help.</td>', 'A nice concept, but I''m not thrilled about the processing.  The over-exposure and high-contrast doesn''t really work for me in this case, and the smaller image doesn''t help.', '2006-01-21 16:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2068216, 279850, 13728, '<td valign="top">Nice.  He must have been angered!</td>', 'Nice.  He must have been angered!', '2006-01-21 16:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2068217, 281758, 93, '<td valign="top">nice minimalism.  What I''d have done different is put a filter or gradient on the sky to darken it a little bit, and give it a stronger presence.</td>', 'nice minimalism.  What I''d have done different is put a filter or gradient on the sky to darken it a little bit, and give it a stronger presence.', '2006-01-21 16:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2068219, 275299, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice close up. Seems a little low contrast, but that''s probably because the whites are so bright. The edge on the upper right bothers me, maybe at a little higher angle, that could have been avoided. I like that cat''s look though, he/she has deep eyes.</td>', 'Nice close up. Seems a little low contrast, but that''s probably because the whites are so bright. The edge on the upper right bothers me, maybe at a little higher angle, that could have been avoided. I like that cat''s look though, he/she has deep eyes.', '2006-01-21 16:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2068221, 281915, 93, '<td valign="top">oversaturated and over smoothed for my tastes, but a nonetheless precious capture of a sweet and beautiful moment.</td>', 'oversaturated and over smoothed for my tastes, but a nonetheless precious capture of a sweet and beautiful moment.', '2006-01-21 16:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
