(2068232, 274678, 93, '<td valign="top">I personally really like "sunshine after a snowstorm" photos, the light is just fantastic, and things really jump out.  Not the strongest composition here though, as the foreground clutter removes a lot from any strong focal point.. if we could have seen more down that road/gully/clear-cut there..</td>', 'I personally really like "sunshine after a snowstorm" photos, the light is just fantastic, and things really jump out.  Not the strongest composition here though, as the foreground clutter removes a lot from any strong focal point.. if we could have seen more down that road/gully/clear-cut there..', '2006-01-21 16:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
