(2068242, 281511, 93, '<td valign="top">A little static and uninteresting. You don''t really have a great focal point (the stump notwithstanding), colors and lighting are a little dull, and I don''t really feel "paradise" so much.</td>', 'A little static and uninteresting. You don''t really have a great focal point (the stump notwithstanding), colors and lighting are a little dull, and I don''t really feel "paradise" so much.', '2006-01-21 16:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
