(2068248, 274931, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice maco with some good color.  I''m not sure that this amount of shallow DOF works as well as having more of the stamens (or whatever), but I like it as is too.</td>', 'Nice maco with some good color.  I''m not sure that this amount of shallow DOF works as well as having more of the stamens (or whatever), but I like it as is too.', '2006-01-21 16:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2068251, 276941, 93, '<td valign="top">With a better vantage point and stronger composition (always try to work with leading lines in a landscape), you might have had something here.  This isn''t a bad photo, but it''s just not very interesting either.</td>', 'With a better vantage point and stronger composition (always try to work with leading lines in a landscape), you might have had something here.  This isn''t a bad photo, but it''s just not very interesting either.', '2006-01-21 16:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2068256, 274611, 6405, '<td valign="top">Excellent framing,favorite and 10</td>', 'Excellent framing,favorite and 10', '2006-01-21 16:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2068257, 279674, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shoot. Like how tight the focus is - that the edge of the leaf is out of focus. I think the center enhances this image. On a more symbolical level, this image could be compared to life - we all begin at the leaf. Innocence, childhood, happiness (well, hopefully), but then we set out on the journey of life. And the journey of life is like this image, we usually don''t know where it''s going, because it circles round and goes up and down, but somepoint in our lives we must choose either to believe in Jesus Christ, or not. The road down to hell is smooth and straight, without many twists, and easy to walk down. But the road to heaven is right, but hard to follow because it is against our human nature. It leads up into the light, and into eternal life. And we can see this lady bug as ourselves, making this journey. That''s what I get out of it, so thanks for sharing =), and God bless your final outcome.</td>', 'Nice macro shoot. Like how tight the focus is - that the edge of the leaf is out of focus. I think the center enhances this image. On a more symbolical level, this image could be compared to life - we all begin at the leaf. Innocence, childhood, happiness (well, hopefully), but then we set out on the journey of life. And the journey of life is like this image, we usually don''t know where it''s going, because it circles round and goes up and down, but somepoint in our lives we must choose either to believe in Jesus Christ, or not. The road down to hell is smooth and straight, without many twists, and easy to walk down. But the road to heaven is right, but hard to follow because it is against our human nature. It leads up into the light, and into eternal life. And we can see this lady bug as ourselves, making this journey. That''s what I get out of it, so thanks for sharing =), and God bless your final outcome.', '2006-01-21 16:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2068260, 274678, 9668, '<td valign="top">Ice forest, like how this image shows multiple layers.</td>', 'Ice forest, like how this image shows multiple layers.', '2006-01-21 16:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2068262, 280500, 9668, '<td valign="top">The lighting is good, and the flower is beautiful, but it doesn''t speak to me that much.</td>', 'The lighting is good, and the flower is beautiful, but it doesn''t speak to me that much.', '2006-01-21 16:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
