(2069583, 281865, 10867, '<td valign="top">The red object near the top left should be cloned out, I think. I draws the eye toward it and away from your main subject.  Nice colours on the bird and good catchlight in the eye.</td>', 'The red object near the top left should be cloned out, I think. I draws the eye toward it and away from your main subject.  Nice colours on the bird and good catchlight in the eye.', '2006-01-22 00:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069585, 281935, 10867, '<td valign="top">I wish the tower weren''t quite so central.</td>', 'I wish the tower weren''t quite so central.', '2006-01-22 00:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069586, 281894, 10867, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-01-22 00:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069594, 275299, 10867, '<td valign="top">The kitten is darling, but a tad overexposed.  The background, unfortunately, is definitely problematic.</td>', 'The kitten is darling, but a tad overexposed.  The background, unfortunately, is definitely problematic.', '2006-01-22 00:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069598, 278286, 10867, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, but the image doesn''t seem to have a real centre of interest.  Also, I would suggest cropping the foreground by about half.  The reflections in the front part of the foreground don''t really supply enough interest to justify the amount of space they occupy in the frame.</td>', 'Lovely colours, but the image doesn''t seem to have a real centre of interest.  Also, I would suggest cropping the foreground by about half.  The reflections in the front part of the foreground don''t really supply enough interest to justify the amount of space they occupy in the frame.', '2006-01-22 00:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069606, 281338, 10867, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones and textures.  I find the fact that the horizon is at the centre of the image a bit bothersome, though.  Still, a very good image.</td>', 'Wonderful tones and textures.  I find the fact that the horizon is at the centre of the image a bit bothersome, though.  Still, a very good image.', '2006-01-22 00:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069607, 276602, 37252, '<td valign="top">very nice - love the b/w and the depth this offers. The cross makes this an emotive shot - at least for me. It''s simple, yet sepaks volumes</td>', 'very nice - love the b/w and the depth this offers. The cross makes this an emotive shot - at least for me. It''s simple, yet sepaks volumes', '2006-01-22 00:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069609, 275974, 10867, '<td valign="top">The bird is beautifully shot, but too central.  Also, I would suggest cropping about 1 1/2 inches down from the top to balance the image better.  Wonderful pure white and great detail on the bird!</td>', 'The bird is beautifully shot, but too central.  Also, I would suggest cropping about 1 1/2 inches down from the top to balance the image better.  Wonderful pure white and great detail on the bird!', '2006-01-22 00:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069616, 281362, 25773, '<td valign="top">Cool! It really gives something out of ordinary.</td>', 'Cool! It really gives something out of ordinary.', '2006-01-22 00:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069626, 275932, 25773, '<td valign="top">Wow! It really demonstrates how fast these little fellows move their wings: you got the motion blur on the wings but not on the s**t...</td>', 'Wow! It really demonstrates how fast these little fellows move their wings: you got the motion blur on the wings but not on the s**t...', '2006-01-22 00:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069627, 281731, 37252, '<td valign="top">love the curves, the shadows, the lines. Nice shot.</td>', 'love the curves, the shadows, the lines. Nice shot.', '2006-01-22 00:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069665, 278666, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very cute! Nice expression, good clear focus. Love the softness around his face.</td>', 'Very cute! Nice expression, good clear focus. Love the softness around his face.', '2006-01-22 00:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069666, 274768, 42638, '<td valign="top">Fantastic color in this one. The cross is fantastic.</td>', 'Fantastic color in this one. The cross is fantastic.', '2006-01-22 00:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069667, 275248, 42638, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rich colors, Love the details and how the eye almost matches the background. Nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful rich colors, Love the details and how the eye almost matches the background. Nicely done.', '2006-01-22 00:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069669, 276866, 42638, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, Love the lines of dark green and the grasses up front. Nice composition.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, Love the lines of dark green and the grasses up front. Nice composition.', '2006-01-22 00:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069681, 280112, 7628, '<td valign="top">I love the moment you captured here - lots of personality.  I wish you had gone for black and white or two-tone  - the desaturation of all but the green gives the green too much attention - when all attention should be on that shining face.  I''d even darken the green before converting to gray scale - the white flowers would pop out a little more and the child''s face would be like another flower in the grass.</td>', 'I love the moment you captured here - lots of personality.  I wish you had gone for black and white or two-tone  - the desaturation of all but the green gives the green too much attention - when all attention should be on that shining face.  I''d even darken the green before converting to gray scale - the white flowers would pop out a little more and the child''s face would be like another flower in the grass.', '2006-01-22 00:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069697, 281767, 42638, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo, Love the colors and the house add character to the field. Great sky shot.</td>', 'Stunning photo, Love the colors and the house add character to the field. Great sky shot.', '2006-01-22 01:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069699, 277667, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, Very sharp color here. Beautiful.</td>', 'Wow, Very sharp color here. Beautiful.', '2006-01-22 01:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069700, 276970, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice, Love the darkness and the texture of the rocks.</td>', 'Very nice, Love the darkness and the texture of the rocks.', '2006-01-22 01:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069701, 280375, 42638, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, nice capture. Love the colors.</td>', 'Beautiful, nice capture. Love the colors.', '2006-01-22 01:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
