(2069809, 281836, 47483, '<td valign="top">very good composition. Its really good to see good compositions, i am sick of seeing flower with shallow DOF shot with 1.4 lense wining ribbons. Hope this photo scores high, since if it scores high people will at least think about putting effort on composition than shooting something stunning but shit on composition part (like shooting flowers with shallow DOFs).</td>', 'very good composition. Its really good to see good compositions, i am sick of seeing flower with shallow DOF shot with 1.4 lense wining ribbons. Hope this photo scores high, since if it scores high people will at least think about putting effort on composition than shooting something stunning but shit on composition part (like shooting flowers with shallow DOFs).', '2006-01-22 02:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
