(2070158, 277058, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice picture. The only criticism I have is that the fence in the forground takes away from the feeling that you are deep in an uncharted forest. It makes it look more like a well travelled tourist attraction that is often photographed.</td>', 'This is a very nice picture. The only criticism I have is that the fence in the forground takes away from the feeling that you are deep in an uncharted forest. It makes it look more like a well travelled tourist attraction that is often photographed.', '2006-01-22 07:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070162, 276781, 3306, '<td valign="top">You have captured an interesting scene with the subject of your picture seemingly the clouds. The lack of detail and sharpness in the land takes away from the rest of the picture. I have taken pictures like this myself and it is a very difficult one to get due to the differences in lighting conditions. Filters can help.</td>', 'You have captured an interesting scene with the subject of your picture seemingly the clouds. The lack of detail and sharpness in the land takes away from the rest of the picture. I have taken pictures like this myself and it is a very difficult one to get due to the differences in lighting conditions. Filters can help.', '2006-01-22 07:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070163, 274858, 14448, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this, with the limited palette of tones and hues.  Nice evocation of mood.  Subject is uncertain -- my eye is drawn to the bright sun, but compositionally the ducks want to be the subject.  Slightly oversharpened? .. haloes evident? 6</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this, with the limited palette of tones and hues.  Nice evocation of mood.  Subject is uncertain -- my eye is drawn to the bright sun, but compositionally the ducks want to be the subject.  Slightly oversharpened? .. haloes evident? 6', '2006-01-22 07:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070165, 281469, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely composed picture. I like that the focus appears to be on the eyes. Maybe a little more contrast would help to bring out some of the color and give the picture a little more "pop".</td>', 'This is a nicely composed picture. I like that the focus appears to be on the eyes. Maybe a little more contrast would help to bring out some of the color and give the picture a little more "pop".', '2006-01-22 08:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
