(2070313, 275371, 37334, '<td valign="top">I saw on Discovery that one ''talent'' we westerners or richer nations don''t have is the ability to squat for long periods of time. Apparantly it''s good for us, especially when it comes to ablutions:))<br/>This is a nice study of a different culture. The way the person is dressed is fascinating - that shirt does not go with that skirt/trousers. Those socks- odd socks and differently patterned scarfs...all to hide from the sun? Which most of us pay through the nose to enjoy for a couple of weeks a year? Held my attention, as you can tell:))</td>', 'I saw on Discovery that one ''talent'' we westerners or richer nations don''t have is the ability to squat for long periods of time. Apparantly it''s good for us, especially when it comes to ablutions:))This is a nice study of a different culture. The way the person is dressed is fascinating - that shirt does not go with that skirt/trousers. Those socks- odd socks and differently patterned scarfs...all to hide from the sun? Which most of us pay through the nose to enjoy for a couple of weeks a year? Held my attention, as you can tell:))', '2006-01-22 10:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
