(2070702, 280375, 14837, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!</td>', 'AWESOME!', '2006-01-22 12:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070703, 277031, 24212, '<td valign="top">A lovely expression captured here and wonderful framing. I, myself, would prefer to see the mid-tones a touch darker, as it looks a little ''washed out'' to my eyes. The lighting conditions look to have been a little harsh when you took this. You did a wonderful job to get such a balanced exposure.</td>', 'A lovely expression captured here and wonderful framing. I, myself, would prefer to see the mid-tones a touch darker, as it looks a little ''washed out'' to my eyes. The lighting conditions look to have been a little harsh when you took this. You did a wonderful job to get such a balanced exposure.', '2006-01-22 12:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070704, 280039, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, this looks a little too tightly cropped and the lighting may perhaps be a touch too harsh.</td>', 'To me, this looks a little too tightly cropped and the lighting may perhaps be a touch too harsh.', '2006-01-22 12:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070705, 275309, 17134, '<td valign="top">Please remove the sky.. way to distracting for the eye (such a serene scene)</td>', 'Please remove the sky.. way to distracting for the eye (such a serene scene)', '2006-01-22 12:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070709, 276549, 32966, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait, great light.</td>', 'Excellent portrait, great light.', '2006-01-22 12:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070710, 274611, 32966, '<td valign="top">Excellent framing!  The colours and city lights are perfectly balanced.  Very pretty and striking.</td>', 'Excellent framing!  The colours and city lights are perfectly balanced.  Very pretty and striking.', '2006-01-22 12:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070712, 278133, 32966, '<td valign="top">Heheh one of them is bored silly.  Great capture, makes me smile.</td>', 'Heheh one of them is bored silly.  Great capture, makes me smile.', '2006-01-22 12:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070721, 274852, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, the very simple line of the far kerb and the tyre marks in the road lead one in and the clarity is great. The sense of  atmospheric perspective is something that I particularly like. As this picture was loading in my browser, the first part I could see was the very top, just a few branches and some sky, so I wasn''t expecting much. When the whole picture had loaded, I was taken aback at the subtlety of the colours, the great capture of the lights and the sense of peacefulness. A lovely shot indeed. The only thing that I might consider changing would be the bench in the lower left. I feel that perhaps it ''chops off'' the corner there by appearing as a dark patch.</td>', 'To me, the very simple line of the far kerb and the tyre marks in the road lead one in and the clarity is great. The sense of  atmospheric perspective is something that I particularly like. As this picture was loading in my browser, the first part I could see was the very top, just a few branches and some sky, so I wasn''t expecting much. When the whole picture had loaded, I was taken aback at the subtlety of the colours, the great capture of the lights and the sense of peacefulness. A lovely shot indeed. The only thing that I might consider changing would be the bench in the lower left. I feel that perhaps it ''chops off'' the corner there by appearing as a dark patch.', '2006-01-22 12:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070722, 277379, 32966, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shape and lighting, a clean simple shot.  Very very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful shape and lighting, a clean simple shot.  Very very nice.', '2006-01-22 12:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070724, 274847, 32966, '<td valign="top">This looks just like National Geographic!  Superb work.</td>', 'This looks just like National Geographic!  Superb work.', '2006-01-22 12:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070726, 276545, 24212, '<td valign="top">A great candid shot. I love the bursting colour and the way that the (large) eyes seem to be staring at the lady passing by.</td>', 'A great candid shot. I love the bursting colour and the way that the (large) eyes seem to be staring at the lady passing by.', '2006-01-22 12:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070727, 277057, 32966, '<td valign="top">Great night cityscape!</td>', 'Great night cityscape!', '2006-01-22 12:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070730, 276206, 32966, '<td valign="top">Good textures and colours.</td>', 'Good textures and colours.', '2006-01-22 12:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070732, 281542, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great detail in the face. The chest and shoulder look a great deal softer. Either this was taken at a large aperture or a bit of blur was applied. I feel that this seems to make the head ''float'' above the body and would prefer to see the chest area a little sharper. Still a good photo, though.</td>', 'Great detail in the face. The chest and shoulder look a great deal softer. Either this was taken at a large aperture or a bit of blur was applied. I feel that this seems to make the head ''float'' above the body and would prefer to see the chest area a little sharper. Still a good photo, though.', '2006-01-22 12:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070733, 281896, 32966, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2006-01-22 12:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070738, 278309, 32966, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2006-01-22 12:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070740, 281731, 32966, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  I can''t even think of a comment, it''s just that beautiful.</td>', 'Stunning.  I can''t even think of a comment, it''s just that beautiful.', '2006-01-22 12:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070744, 277530, 43738, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2006-01-22 12:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070745, 278826, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective on this shot and the wonderful lighting in the puddle, although I feel that it could do with a slight anti-clockwise rotation, as it doesn''t look quite straight.</td>', 'I like the perspective on this shot and the wonderful lighting in the puddle, although I feel that it could do with a slight anti-clockwise rotation, as it doesn''t look quite straight.', '2006-01-22 12:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070746, 276017, 43738, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.</td>', 'This is very nice.', '2006-01-22 12:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070749, 274640, 43738, '<td valign="top">Love the eyes.</td>', 'Love the eyes.', '2006-01-22 12:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070753, 275065, 43738, '<td valign="top">Lovely cat eyes.</td>', 'Lovely cat eyes.', '2006-01-22 12:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070755, 277379, 43738, '<td valign="top">Great pic, worth putting in print.</td>', 'Great pic, worth putting in print.', '2006-01-22 12:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070757, 278665, 43738, '<td valign="top">He is very handsome.</td>', 'He is very handsome.', '2006-01-22 12:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070758, 275826, 24212, '<td valign="top">Although the lighting and detail are wonderful, I don''t know their story and cannot get it from the title, so feel a little unconnected to it all, even though the little one looks so sad.</td>', 'Although the lighting and detail are wonderful, I don''t know their story and cannot get it from the title, so feel a little unconnected to it all, even though the little one looks so sad.', '2006-01-22 12:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070760, 280521, 38234, '<td valign="top">glorious image, I lvoe the depth, beautiful colour and wonderful warm light</td>', 'glorious image, I lvoe the depth, beautiful colour and wonderful warm light', '2006-01-22 12:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070761, 281631, 43738, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but would have liked it better if it were not so green. Just my opinion. Still gave you a great vote.</td>', 'Nice concept, but would have liked it better if it were not so green. Just my opinion. Still gave you a great vote.', '2006-01-22 12:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070762, 281099, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the viewpoint chosen, although the land looks to be a little oversharpened and harsh.</td>', 'I like the viewpoint chosen, although the land looks to be a little oversharpened and harsh.', '2006-01-22 12:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
