(2070871, 274847, 30896, '<td valign="top">That''s not fair, I can never get a scene like this in the Prague Zoo ;-)<br/> <br/>Great atmosphere and light, painting-like yet natural, interesting composition, fascinating situation... 10</td>', 'That''s not fair, I can never get a scene like this in the Prague Zoo ;-) Great atmosphere and light, painting-like yet natural, interesting composition, fascinating situation... 10', '2006-01-22 13:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070873, 281616, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, the finger at the bottom being in soft focus is more of a distraction than anything else.</td>', 'To me, the finger at the bottom being in soft focus is more of a distraction than anything else.', '2006-01-22 13:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070876, 278093, 45754, '<td valign="top">the image is too small to see. I sure wish I could see it better</td>', 'the image is too small to see. I sure wish I could see it better', '2006-01-22 13:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070878, 276957, 45754, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting. Great subject.</td>', 'Excellent lighting. Great subject.', '2006-01-22 13:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070879, 278876, 24212, '<td valign="top">If anything, I would like to see this without the tree to the immediate left of the lighthouse, as I feel that it mars the composition somewhat. A bit too much to ask for, I know.</td>', 'If anything, I would like to see this without the tree to the immediate left of the lighthouse, as I feel that it mars the composition somewhat. A bit too much to ask for, I know.', '2006-01-22 13:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070882, 281131, 45754, '<td valign="top">Love it! 8</td>', 'Love it! 8', '2006-01-22 13:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070883, 274550, 24212, '<td valign="top">Brilliant lighting and a strong leading line make this low-key picture really worth spending some time looking at.</td>', 'Brilliant lighting and a strong leading line make this low-key picture really worth spending some time looking at.', '2006-01-22 13:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070888, 279639, 40683, '<td valign="top">Beautiful black and white tones!  I''m assuming that the object in the upper left corner is a hand holding a glass (hence the title?).  This is not readily apparent though, and therefore serves as more of a distraction than an enhancement.  My eye gets pulled away from the main image to ponder the floating object.  That being said, the image of the child is just beautiful and you achieved an exceptional tonal range throughout!</td>', 'Beautiful black and white tones!  I''m assuming that the object in the upper left corner is a hand holding a glass (hence the title?).  This is not readily apparent though, and therefore serves as more of a distraction than an enhancement.  My eye gets pulled away from the main image to ponder the floating object.  That being said, the image of the child is just beautiful and you achieved an exceptional tonal range throughout!', '2006-01-22 13:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070892, 277237, 24212, '<td valign="top">The hair is wonderfully lit and it is this that sets the whole thing off. Great soft focus in the rest of the shot, but eyes still sharp. I like the facial expression as well.</td>', 'The hair is wonderfully lit and it is this that sets the whole thing off. Great soft focus in the rest of the shot, but eyes still sharp. I like the facial expression as well.', '2006-01-22 13:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070897, 274894, 40683, '<td valign="top">Nice composition!  Beautifully muted tones!</td>', 'Nice composition!  Beautifully muted tones!', '2006-01-22 13:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070898, 280652, 25921, '<td valign="top">Bigger!!  Have a feeling this is a terrific shot, but at this small size I just can''t tell.</td>', 'Bigger!!  Have a feeling this is a terrific shot, but at this small size I just can''t tell.', '2006-01-22 13:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070900, 281476, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great, clear shot of the duck, although her (I''m sure it''s a female moorhen, although I could be wrong) reflection is somewhat cut off and the second duck at the top intrudes into the shot. The surface of the water is wonderfully capured.</td>', 'Great, clear shot of the duck, although her (I''m sure it''s a female moorhen, although I could be wrong) reflection is somewhat cut off and the second duck at the top intrudes into the shot. The surface of the water is wonderfully capured.', '2006-01-22 13:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070901, 278837, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing image! Simply beautiful! Great use of shadow and light!9</td>', 'This is an amazing image! Simply beautiful! Great use of shadow and light!9', '2006-01-22 13:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070902, 278700, 46468, '<td valign="top">Great shot of an extremely fast moth. Love that you actually caught him/her in the act of drinking. Crisp focus on the head, would have loved stop action on the wings but they move so quickly it would be very difficult, I know as I have taken a few of this type moth. Well done and good luck</td>', 'Great shot of an extremely fast moth. Love that you actually caught him/her in the act of drinking. Crisp focus on the head, would have loved stop action on the wings but they move so quickly it would be very difficult, I know as I have taken a few of this type moth. Well done and good luck', '2006-01-22 13:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070907, 275323, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that the top of the gun being cut off leaves the rest of the image a little short. To me, it seems as though the composition was a little hastil arranged.</td>', 'I feel that the top of the gun being cut off leaves the rest of the image a little short. To me, it seems as though the composition was a little hastil arranged.', '2006-01-22 13:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070912, 281217, 45754, '<td valign="top">Delicately beautiful!</td>', 'Delicately beautiful!', '2006-01-22 13:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070915, 278877, 24212, '<td valign="top">A great sense of perspective and scale, although I feel that the snow appears a little oversharpened and could do with a touch of local contrast enhancement.</td>', 'A great sense of perspective and scale, although I feel that the snow appears a little oversharpened and could do with a touch of local contrast enhancement.', '2006-01-22 13:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
