(2070995, 281476, 46468, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture, great focus, I feel like I can see every individual feather seperately, love the reflection, only thing I would have preferred is to see the top of the head in the reflection too. Well done</td>', 'Fantastic capture, great focus, I feel like I can see every individual feather seperately, love the reflection, only thing I would have preferred is to see the top of the head in the reflection too. Well done', '2006-01-22 13:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
