(2070998, 281090, 46468, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DOF, it really adds to this photo. The subject has an intense look to him, which leads me as the viewer wanting to know the rest of the story; what is he looking at? is it something good or bad? And IMO that is a good thing, you are making the viewer get involved. Only slight detraction to the image is the intensity of the lights on the tree and that is minor. Well done.</td>', 'I like the shallow DOF, it really adds to this photo. The subject has an intense look to him, which leads me as the viewer wanting to know the rest of the story; what is he looking at? is it something good or bad? And IMO that is a good thing, you are making the viewer get involved. Only slight detraction to the image is the intensity of the lights on the tree and that is minor. Well done.', '2006-01-22 13:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
