(2071134, 280809, 93, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft, but I like the lighting.  Nice and bold, without being too harsh or overbearing.  Not the greatest expression IMO, and the light may have contributed to more squinting than intended.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft, but I like the lighting.  Nice and bold, without being too harsh or overbearing.  Not the greatest expression IMO, and the light may have contributed to more squinting than intended.', '2006-01-22 14:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
