(2071137, 275968, 93, '<td valign="top">Just slightly over-exposed in the snow, but nicely done for this sort of photo, which can be near impossible to expose correctly for.  I don''t know if the eye is like that naturally, but it jumps out at you a little too strangely.  I might have toned it down some.  Great detail and texture in the hide.</td>', 'Just slightly over-exposed in the snow, but nicely done for this sort of photo, which can be near impossible to expose correctly for.  I don''t know if the eye is like that naturally, but it jumps out at you a little too strangely.  I might have toned it down some.  Great detail and texture in the hide.', '2006-01-22 14:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071138, 276762, 46468, '<td valign="top">Really great expression-well done</td>', 'Really great expression-well done', '2006-01-22 14:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071139, 281242, 93, '<td valign="top">Quite funny, but really soft on the focus, and has a less than inspiring composition. I''d have tried to get a different angle, but sometimes you just don''t have the opportunity..  perhaps different processing than the "as is" you''ve presented here?</td>', 'Quite funny, but really soft on the focus, and has a less than inspiring composition. I''d have tried to get a different angle, but sometimes you just don''t have the opportunity..  perhaps different processing than the "as is" you''ve presented here?', '2006-01-22 14:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071140, 279787, 93, '<td valign="top">Just not enough focus on the growing plant, IMO.. it seems to get lost in the over-all presentation.</td>', 'Just not enough focus on the growing plant, IMO.. it seems to get lost in the over-all presentation.', '2006-01-22 14:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071141, 280499, 46468, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, good focus, and complimentery background-well done</td>', 'Nice DOF, good focus, and complimentery background-well done', '2006-01-22 14:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071144, 277162, 93, '<td valign="top">I think this would have benefitted from a much wider angle, but failing the actually ability to have that, it''s a fairly decent photo.  A lack of any one strong focal point or overly interesting viewpoint is the main detraction.</td>', 'I think this would have benefitted from a much wider angle, but failing the actually ability to have that, it''s a fairly decent photo.  A lack of any one strong focal point or overly interesting viewpoint is the main detraction.', '2006-01-22 14:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071146, 276521, 93, '<td valign="top">I''m a little torn with this.. on one hand, I like what you''ve seen and are saying, but the desat seems to be just a little strong for me.. and I don''t really like the lay-out of the gravestones..  If you''d found an angle where the stones were angled to lead into the tree, it could have been a much stronger compostion.</td>', 'I''m a little torn with this.. on one hand, I like what you''ve seen and are saying, but the desat seems to be just a little strong for me.. and I don''t really like the lay-out of the gravestones..  If you''d found an angle where the stones were angled to lead into the tree, it could have been a much stronger compostion.', '2006-01-22 14:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071150, 280833, 46468, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, the outer petals look so thin and delicate which is a sharp contrast to the thorns of the cactus. Love the fly inside the bloom-well done</td>', 'Nice focus, the outer petals look so thin and delicate which is a sharp contrast to the thorns of the cactus. Love the fly inside the bloom-well done', '2006-01-22 14:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071153, 277435, 93, '<td valign="top">Contrast and focus are just a little too soft for this to really work.  A more diffused light source, with a stronger fall-off would have really helped. By this, I mean getting it to become darker, faster, the deeper into the photo we go.</td>', 'Contrast and focus are just a little too soft for this to really work.  A more diffused light source, with a stronger fall-off would have really helped. By this, I mean getting it to become darker, faster, the deeper into the photo we go.', '2006-01-22 14:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071155, 275374, 46468, '<td valign="top">fantastic capture, wonderful expression, nice DOF and good lighting-well done</td>', 'fantastic capture, wonderful expression, nice DOF and good lighting-well done', '2006-01-22 14:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071158, 274777, 93, '<td valign="top">You really need to utilize the full 640 pixel limit on this site to do well. No matter what your subject or how great a photo, people just do not tolerate small image size entries here.</td>', 'You really need to utilize the full 640 pixel limit on this site to do well. No matter what your subject or how great a photo, people just do not tolerate small image size entries here.', '2006-01-22 14:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071160, 277182, 93, '<td valign="top">This really does leap out and smack you in the face with the brightness.  Not too fond of the coloring myself, natural or not, and the surfer tends to get a little lost.</td>', 'This really does leap out and smack you in the face with the brightness.  Not too fond of the coloring myself, natural or not, and the surfer tends to get a little lost.', '2006-01-22 14:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071164, 275508, 46468, '<td valign="top">This looks like a photo on a puzzle box-well done</td>', 'This looks like a photo on a puzzle box-well done', '2006-01-22 14:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071165, 281836, 93, '<td valign="top">Processing is good for this type of photo.  This is one photo that really suffers from the 640 pixel limit, as your composition is great, but it leaves the model just a little too small.  You could compensate by cropping in closer, but it hurts the comp that way too.<br/> <br/>Great tones in the dress and skin, but the wall and far back wall are maybe just a little too heavily worked? Something seems odd there anyway.. loss of texture.. a little too dark/light in areas. Not horribly so, but it''s something that distracts me from the model for some reason.</td>', 'Processing is good for this type of photo.  This is one photo that really suffers from the 640 pixel limit, as your composition is great, but it leaves the model just a little too small.  You could compensate by cropping in closer, but it hurts the comp that way too. Great tones in the dress and skin, but the wall and far back wall are maybe just a little too heavily worked? Something seems odd there anyway.. loss of texture.. a little too dark/light in areas. Not horribly so, but it''s something that distracts me from the model for some reason.', '2006-01-22 14:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071172, 279903, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice line work here.  The darkish ''grungy'' (not to be confused with \"grunge\" style), coloring is definitely different.  I''m not entirely keen on it, but it works here.  The fibrous parts of the leaf almost look alive.. like capillaries.  Which, by your title, is probably what you were going for.</td>', 'Nice line work here.  The darkish ''grungy'' (not to be confused with \"grunge\" style), coloring is definitely different.  I''m not entirely keen on it, but it works here.  The fibrous parts of the leaf almost look alive.. like capillaries.  Which, by your title, is probably what you were going for.', '2006-01-22 14:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071176, 274784, 93, '<td valign="top">I was going to say that it''s a little too dark in the foreground, but maybe that works..  It''s kind of confusing though.  Like, does this photo want to be a silhouette, or do we want detail in the landscpe, or is it trying to be both? I don''t know! :)</td>', 'I was going to say that it''s a little too dark in the foreground, but maybe that works..  It''s kind of confusing though.  Like, does this photo want to be a silhouette, or do we want detail in the landscpe, or is it trying to be both? I don''t know! :)', '2006-01-22 14:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071177, 281937, 93, '<td valign="top">Good work getting light and detail in the church with the sunset in back.  A little noisy, which is probably hurting you somewhat. People tend to go ape over the absolute smooth in sunset shots.</td>', 'Good work getting light and detail in the church with the sunset in back.  A little noisy, which is probably hurting you somewhat. People tend to go ape over the absolute smooth in sunset shots.', '2006-01-22 14:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071179, 274894, 6405, '<td valign="top">I would place the camera in the level of the tractor or the flowers,avoiding the vires .Photos taken from 5-6 feet high are not scored good.</td>', 'I would place the camera in the level of the tractor or the flowers,avoiding the vires .Photos taken from 5-6 feet high are not scored good.', '2006-01-22 14:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071183, 274718, 93, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how many have said it, but your focus really grabbed his chin here, and left the eyes rather soft.  Not sure I like that effect.  I can see the photographer in them though. Sort of makes it look like he''s turning into a snake :)</td>', 'I don''t know how many have said it, but your focus really grabbed his chin here, and left the eyes rather soft.  Not sure I like that effect.  I can see the photographer in them though. Sort of makes it look like he''s turning into a snake :)', '2006-01-22 14:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071186, 276525, 6405, '<td valign="top">Photo is blur.low light and unnatural skin colors ! 1</td>', 'Photo is blur.low light and unnatural skin colors ! 1', '2006-01-22 14:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071187, 274769, 93, '<td valign="top">King.. Huh? <br/> <br/>I assume it''s an ad for King Kong on the poster you can barely see?<br/> <br/>Nice study in light, not the greatest title IMO</td>', 'King.. Huh?  I assume it''s an ad for King Kong on the poster you can barely see? Nice study in light, not the greatest title IMO', '2006-01-22 14:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071192, 276017, 6405, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene,little on the dark side and low on foreground details .7</td>', 'Very nice scene,little on the dark side and low on foreground details .7', '2006-01-22 14:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071195, 278766, 6405, '<td valign="top">Great detail,amd nice frame for the lighthouse 8</td>', 'Great detail,amd nice frame for the lighthouse 8', '2006-01-22 14:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071196, 277445, 93, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the processing here at all. It says, "I''m not happy with the photo, so I''ll mess it up and try to go for ''wow, that''s crazy'' votes." to me.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Not a fan of the processing here at all. It says, "I''m not happy with the photo, so I''ll mess it up and try to go for ''wow, that''s crazy'' votes." to me.   ', '2006-01-22 14:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071198, 281476, 93, '<td valign="top">Great textures on the duck, nice light play in the water.. but that other duck being there completely throws the photo off.</td>', 'Great textures on the duck, nice light play in the water.. but that other duck being there completely throws the photo off.', '2006-01-22 14:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071200, 276964, 93, '<td valign="top">He''s doing a pretty good job too.  You had to go and ruin it by standing him out against the background! ;)</td>', 'He''s doing a pretty good job too.  You had to go and ruin it by standing him out against the background! ;)', '2006-01-22 14:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071201, 280963, 6405, '<td valign="top">Does not belong in challenge IMHO,1</td>', 'Does not belong in challenge IMHO,1', '2006-01-22 14:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071203, 275355, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your composition. To me, the foreground seems a bit too saturated compared to the dull softness of the background hills. I do like the play of sunlight on the rolling green hillside.</td>', 'I like your composition. To me, the foreground seems a bit too saturated compared to the dull softness of the background hills. I do like the play of sunlight on the rolling green hillside.', '2006-01-22 14:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071206, 276086, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice subject,need more foreground,8</td>', 'Nice subject,need more foreground,8', '2006-01-22 14:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071209, 279903, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow - very cool macro. Such great texture and patterns. I like the way it''s lighted.</td>', 'Wow - very cool macro. Such great texture and patterns. I like the way it''s lighted.', '2006-01-22 14:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071210, 276042, 93, '<td valign="top">The unnatural looking color of the sky is the one thing I don''t like about this photo.  It just rips you away from the scene and the action, and that''s not a good thing.. because it''s a sweet and fun moment in itself.</td>', 'The unnatural looking color of the sky is the one thing I don''t like about this photo.  It just rips you away from the scene and the action, and that''s not a good thing.. because it''s a sweet and fun moment in itself.', '2006-01-22 14:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071212, 275323, 6405, '<td valign="top">Those folks are very German looking,but nice photo.</td>', 'Those folks are very German looking,but nice photo.', '2006-01-22 14:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071217, 280493, 93, '<td valign="top">This looks to have been smoothed so much that the grass has lost all texture completely, and rockets this shot into the land of make-believe.  It''s an interesting take on a portrait, but the processing leaves me flat.</td>', 'This looks to have been smoothed so much that the grass has lost all texture completely, and rockets this shot into the land of make-believe.  It''s an interesting take on a portrait, but the processing leaves me flat.', '2006-01-22 15:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071219, 281612, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice foggy shot,8</td>', 'Nice foggy shot,8', '2006-01-22 15:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071220, 276219, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice shot from above.  Something about it I don''t like though.. perhaps the overal tonage.. a little bright/cyan kind of. I don''t really know.</td>', 'Nice shot from above.  Something about it I don''t like though.. perhaps the overal tonage.. a little bright/cyan kind of. I don''t really know.', '2006-01-22 15:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071221, 281905, 6405, '<td valign="top">Bad lighting and boring subject 4</td>', 'Bad lighting and boring subject 4', '2006-01-22 15:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071224, 281846, 41675, '<td valign="top">After studying your photo for a few moments, I get a sense of "seeing the light" after death. Intersting. I think the whites are a bit overdone, and the crosshatching has made this more of an illustration now rather than a photo, but if I "get it" I do like your concept and creativity.</td>', 'After studying your photo for a few moments, I get a sense of "seeing the light" after death. Intersting. I think the whites are a bit overdone, and the crosshatching has made this more of an illustration now rather than a photo, but if I "get it" I do like your concept and creativity.', '2006-01-22 15:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071226, 281264, 6405, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject,but photo is overprocessed.</td>', 'Beautiful subject,but photo is overprocessed.', '2006-01-22 15:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071228, 280110, 93, '<td valign="top">A pretty good composition here, but the B&amp;W lacks a certain focus and contrast that''d stand it out more.  Lighting is ok, but there is a little too much shadow in the eyes and upper face, and the tonal range is too much in the mid-tones, with not enough whites and blacks complementing.</td>', 'A pretty good composition here, but the B&W lacks a certain focus and contrast that''d stand it out more.  Lighting is ok, but there is a little too much shadow in the eyes and upper face, and the tonal range is too much in the mid-tones, with not enough whites and blacks complementing.', '2006-01-22 15:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071229, 279776, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice poker face 8</td>', 'Nice poker face 8', '2006-01-22 15:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071231, 281878, 93, '<td valign="top">A very artsy and bold presentation.  Not very DPC friendly, but it''s a great shot in a very distinct visual style.</td>', 'A very artsy and bold presentation.  Not very DPC friendly, but it''s a great shot in a very distinct visual style.', '2006-01-22 15:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071232, 274981, 6405, '<td valign="top">Lion says hallo ! 10</td>', 'Lion says hallo ! 10', '2006-01-22 15:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071234, 281225, 93, '<td valign="top">Had to look for a minute before I could see what the title was representing.<br/> <br/>Lighting is a little harsh, and your focus and sharpness seem a little soft. The dwellings carved in the cliff face are also just a little too hidden.</td>', 'Had to look for a minute before I could see what the title was representing. Lighting is a little harsh, and your focus and sharpness seem a little soft. The dwellings carved in the cliff face are also just a little too hidden.', '2006-01-22 15:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071235, 274734, 6405, '<td valign="top">too much light on the bug 6</td>', 'too much light on the bug 6', '2006-01-22 15:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071236, 274729, 41675, '<td valign="top">It''s just me, but I''m not a fan of overly dark/black photos. On the other hand, the texture of the ground and blackness of the sky makes it look as if this guy is sunbathing on the moon or some other planet.</td>', 'It''s just me, but I''m not a fan of overly dark/black photos. On the other hand, the texture of the ground and blackness of the sky makes it look as if this guy is sunbathing on the moon or some other planet.', '2006-01-22 15:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071238, 277571, 93, '<td valign="top">There looks to be a small amount of camera shake in this photo.. noticeable especially near the edges and in her clothing.  Lighting is unflattering, and the use of smoothing has kind of enhanced the "shake" feeling.</td>', 'There looks to be a small amount of camera shake in this photo.. noticeable especially near the edges and in her clothing.  Lighting is unflattering, and the use of smoothing has kind of enhanced the "shake" feeling.', '2006-01-22 15:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071240, 280416, 93, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed in the forground surf, which pulls your eyes away from the surfers.  Those, however, are nice, and I like the action.</td>', 'A little overexposed in the forground surf, which pulls your eyes away from the surfers.  Those, however, are nice, and I like the action.', '2006-01-22 15:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071241, 280366, 6405, '<td valign="top">will be much better if the subject looks at the light,(it is alltrady staged shot):-)</td>', 'will be much better if the subject looks at the light,(it is alltrady staged shot):-)', '2006-01-22 15:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071242, 281609, 93, '<td valign="top">Hahaha.. nice.  A good, funny photo which is nicely taken.</td>', 'Hahaha.. nice.  A good, funny photo which is nicely taken.', '2006-01-22 15:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071246, 279614, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but the whites seem overblown to me.</td>', 'I like the composition but the whites seem overblown to me.', '2006-01-22 15:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071247, 275222, 6405, '<td valign="top">He got rope sticking out from his nose.</td>', 'He got rope sticking out from his nose.', '2006-01-22 15:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071248, 274688, 93, '<td valign="top">I think I''d have waited for a slightly different time of day.. The harsh lighting where the man is sitting off-balances the photo and does more against it than for it, IMO.  It''s a nice study on lines and symmetry, but a softer more flattering light, (later in the day, sunset light, softer evening light.. something), would have worked much better.</td>', 'I think I''d have waited for a slightly different time of day.. The harsh lighting where the man is sitting off-balances the photo and does more against it than for it, IMO.  It''s a nice study on lines and symmetry, but a softer more flattering light, (later in the day, sunset light, softer evening light.. something), would have worked much better.', '2006-01-22 15:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071250, 277143, 6405, '<td valign="top">Aperture too wide and subject is centered.6</td>', 'Aperture too wide and subject is centered.6', '2006-01-22 15:10:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2071251, 279985, 93, '<td valign="top">I have to wonder what the background was like before levelling it out.  There are chromatic abberations along the lines of the tiger, but the tiger itself is pretty cool.  Looks sort of like he''s coughing out some kind of "hairball", which I suppose was intentional?  If not, still pretty funny..</td>', 'I have to wonder what the background was like before levelling it out.  There are chromatic abberations along the lines of the tiger, but the tiger itself is pretty cool.  Looks sort of like he''s coughing out some kind of "hairball", which I suppose was intentional?  If not, still pretty funny..', '2006-01-22 15:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071253, 275691, 93, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t like the strong oversaturation. and contrasty nature of this photo.</td>', 'I personally don''t like the strong oversaturation. and contrasty nature of this photo.', '2006-01-22 15:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071258, 277530, 6597, '<td valign="top">good constrast</td>', 'good constrast', '2006-01-22 15:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071259, 279118, 93, '<td valign="top">It seems to me like this photo needed some major cropping, as it is full of noise and artifacting.  The moment itself is precious and tender, but I can guarantee it''s suffering because of the technical nature.  Time to put some money away for that long zoom. hehe.</td>', 'It seems to me like this photo needed some major cropping, as it is full of noise and artifacting.  The moment itself is precious and tender, but I can guarantee it''s suffering because of the technical nature.  Time to put some money away for that long zoom. hehe.', '2006-01-22 15:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071261, 280928, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  A little strong on the colors and saturation for my tastes, especially in the background.  Like the composition  you''ve chosen though.</td>', 'Nice macro.  A little strong on the colors and saturation for my tastes, especially in the background.  Like the composition  you''ve chosen though.', '2006-01-22 15:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071262, 281524, 6405, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones and nice subject.</td>', 'Beautiful tones and nice subject.', '2006-01-22 15:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071263, 281896, 6405, '<td valign="top">WOW,great shot 10</td>', 'WOW,great shot 10', '2006-01-22 15:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071265, 280443, 93, '<td valign="top">Good use of minimalism.  You''ve gotten the kayaker to really stand out, and it''s a very creative angle.. (On a bridge?).</td>', 'Good use of minimalism.  You''ve gotten the kayaker to really stand out, and it''s a very creative angle.. (On a bridge?).', '2006-01-22 15:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071267, 276537, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and B&amp;W work here.  I love the light fall-off.  Focus is a little soft though.</td>', 'Nice lighting and B&W work here.  I love the light fall-off.  Focus is a little soft though.', '2006-01-22 15:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071269, 278863, 93, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little harsh, and there seems to be a yellowish cast in the shadows that softens the contrast a little too much.  IMO, the crop is just a little bit too tight as well.</td>', 'Lighting is a little harsh, and there seems to be a yellowish cast in the shadows that softens the contrast a little too much.  IMO, the crop is just a little bit too tight as well.', '2006-01-22 15:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071271, 274555, 93, '<td valign="top">Dude.. get out of my face!  This doesn''t look like a Love Dove ;)<br/> <br/>Great textures.</td>', 'Dude.. get out of my face!  This doesn''t look like a Love Dove ;) Great textures.', '2006-01-22 15:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071273, 281933, 93, '<td valign="top">For me, the lack of tonal range in the building itself hurts this photo.  Nice composition, but just lacks any real punch.</td>', 'For me, the lack of tonal range in the building itself hurts this photo.  Nice composition, but just lacks any real punch.', '2006-01-22 15:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071275, 281742, 93, '<td valign="top">Great B&amp;W, and beautiful expression.  Eyes are gorgeous.  I think a *touch* more texture in the skin would have been slightly more appealing, but that''s only for me personally.  I know how this site is.</td>', 'Great B&W, and beautiful expression.  Eyes are gorgeous.  I think a *touch* more texture in the skin would have been slightly more appealing, but that''s only for me personally.  I know how this site is.', '2006-01-22 15:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071277, 279625, 93, '<td valign="top">Too small.  You really need to utilize the full 640 pixel limit on DPC.</td>', 'Too small.  You really need to utilize the full 640 pixel limit on DPC.', '2006-01-22 15:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071282, 276649, 93, '<td valign="top">An OK landscape, but marred by a lack of sharpness, and is just a *touch* too dark.</td>', 'An OK landscape, but marred by a lack of sharpness, and is just a *touch* too dark.', '2006-01-22 15:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071285, 279532, 93, '<td valign="top">A good action opportunity, but is hurt by the distracting and busy background.  Isolating your subjects in a photo like this is really key.</td>', 'A good action opportunity, but is hurt by the distracting and busy background.  Isolating your subjects in a photo like this is really key.', '2006-01-22 15:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071288, 281740, 24486, '<td valign="top">Nice! The reflection in the water really makes the shot.</td>', 'Nice! The reflection in the water really makes the shot.', '2006-01-22 15:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071290, 281004, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and expression, and the lighting is pretty good.  She tends to blend a little with the background, especially in her hair, and the sharpness is a little soft.</td>', 'Nice composition and expression, and the lighting is pretty good.  She tends to blend a little with the background, especially in her hair, and the sharpness is a little soft.', '2006-01-22 15:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071294, 277758, 24486, '<td valign="top">Pun unintended but that is a really cool effect.</td>', 'Pun unintended but that is a really cool effect.', '2006-01-22 15:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071300, 274790, 6597, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2006-01-22 15:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071301, 279372, 24486, '<td valign="top">Pricless. This would probably make a good print.</td>', 'Pricless. This would probably make a good print.', '2006-01-22 15:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
