(2071366, 281057, 22459, '<td valign="top">Its great to see a High key effect used to enhance the image and compliment it so well. Congratulations on a beautiful image.</td>', 'Its great to see a High key effect used to enhance the image and compliment it so well. Congratulations on a beautiful image.', '2006-01-22 15:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071368, 279755, 93, '<td valign="top">A bit of a cyan cast in the whites here.  A little work with color balance would help.</td>', 'A bit of a cyan cast in the whites here.  A little work with color balance would help.', '2006-01-22 15:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071370, 280039, 93, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title.. sorry.<br/> <br/>Lacks sharpness, which is key for portraiture.</td>', 'I don''t get the title.. sorry. Lacks sharpness, which is key for portraiture.', '2006-01-22 15:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071374, 281606, 93, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Gritty, grungy, and well presented for the subject matter.  Nice composition too.. but you should have had the model clean his fingernails. *big grin*</td>', 'Nicely done. Gritty, grungy, and well presented for the subject matter.  Nice composition too.. but you should have had the model clean his fingernails. *big grin*', '2006-01-22 15:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071376, 279655, 93, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool concert shot.  Tell the guitarist that I don''t like his beard trimming work.  That''s gotta go.</td>', 'Pretty cool concert shot.  Tell the guitarist that I don''t like his beard trimming work.  That''s gotta go.', '2006-01-22 15:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071380, 281812, 93, '<td valign="top">I just don''t like the selective desat work here. It''s too strong and in your face.   I understand the reasoning for it, but it''d have worked a lot better with the surrounding scene left still slightly colorized.</td>', 'I just don''t like the selective desat work here. It''s too strong and in your face.   I understand the reasoning for it, but it''d have worked a lot better with the surrounding scene left still slightly colorized.', '2006-01-22 15:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071384, 280112, 93, '<td valign="top">Not often you see a reverse desat like this.  Interesting choice, but not exactly sure why it was chosen.  The photo itself doesn''t really tell this story either.</td>', 'Not often you see a reverse desat like this.  Interesting choice, but not exactly sure why it was chosen.  The photo itself doesn''t really tell this story either.', '2006-01-22 15:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071385, 275391, 22459, '<td valign="top">Great capture ! You have used the available lighting to your advantage, well done 10</td>', 'Great capture ! You have used the available lighting to your advantage, well done 10', '2006-01-22 15:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071386, 276534, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset. The sun-rays add an element to this that lifts it over over more static sunsets I''ve seen.</td>', 'Nice sunset. The sun-rays add an element to this that lifts it over over more static sunsets I''ve seen.', '2006-01-22 15:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071392, 280375, 93, '<td valign="top">Great lighting capture.  We don''t get enough storms in our neck of the woods for it to be possible to capture anything like this, and when we do, the strikes are hidden by mountains.<br/> <br/>I''d love to go to the midwest sometime (or Alberta), and capture some though.</td>', 'Great lighting capture.  We don''t get enough storms in our neck of the woods for it to be possible to capture anything like this, and when we do, the strikes are hidden by mountains. I''d love to go to the midwest sometime (or Alberta), and capture some though.', '2006-01-22 15:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071394, 275478, 37719, '<td valign="top">So glad you entered this shot!  This is amazing in every way.  The processing is perfect and the composition couldn''t be better.  The expression says so much.  The whole mood in this shot is very well set.  Very emotive, strong and powerful!  Extremely well done!  A perfect 10 from me!</td>', 'So glad you entered this shot!  This is amazing in every way.  The processing is perfect and the composition couldn''t be better.  The expression says so much.  The whole mood in this shot is very well set.  Very emotive, strong and powerful!  Extremely well done!  A perfect 10 from me!', '2006-01-22 15:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071396, 281554, 93, '<td valign="top">Not a horrible landscape, but it is certainly lacking something to really make it shine.  The saturation of the colors is a little strong IMO as well.</td>', 'Not a horrible landscape, but it is certainly lacking something to really make it shine.  The saturation of the colors is a little strong IMO as well.', '2006-01-22 15:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071400, 278007, 93, '<td valign="top">I''m not big on the shadow across the cat''s face, personally.  It doesn''t add any real element as presented.. perhaps if it was halfway across, and deeper..</td>', 'I''m not big on the shadow across the cat''s face, personally.  It doesn''t add any real element as presented.. perhaps if it was halfway across, and deeper..', '2006-01-22 15:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071403, 281740, 93, '<td valign="top">Some strong processing, but it seems to work for this shot.</td>', 'Some strong processing, but it seems to work for this shot.', '2006-01-22 15:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071411, 274971, 93, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, with one exception.  The light on the falls is just a little too bright.  You lose definition there, and it looks more like a giant streak of eraser brush on white canvas than water-flow.</td>', 'Nicely done, with one exception.  The light on the falls is just a little too bright.  You lose definition there, and it looks more like a giant streak of eraser brush on white canvas than water-flow.', '2006-01-22 15:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071412, 278837, 93, '<td valign="top">A little *too* contrasty for my tastes here.. it''s a great vantage point, but I just don''t like the presentation, personally.</td>', 'A little *too* contrasty for my tastes here.. it''s a great vantage point, but I just don''t like the presentation, personally.', '2006-01-22 15:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071416, 274775, 93, '<td valign="top">A decent sunset, but nothing that I would say puts it above the pack.  I like the tree, but the foreground silhouettes are just a little busy.</td>', 'A decent sunset, but nothing that I would say puts it above the pack.  I like the tree, but the foreground silhouettes are just a little busy.', '2006-01-22 15:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071422, 281614, 93, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of shallow DOF, but the focal point is a little unstable.  Hard to really grab on to with the eyes, and the effect is that the whole photo seems to just be OOF.</td>', 'Interesting use of shallow DOF, but the focal point is a little unstable.  Hard to really grab on to with the eyes, and the effect is that the whole photo seems to just be OOF.', '2006-01-22 15:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071424, 275251, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and light play here.  Would probably look much better as a larger photo.</td>', 'Nice lines and light play here.  Would probably look much better as a larger photo.', '2006-01-22 15:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071428, 275086, 93, '<td valign="top">Good focus and a very funny photo.  I actually like the border you used, and that''s rare.  The problem is with the flash lighting.. if you could have diffused it more, it''d have been a much, much stronger photo.</td>', 'Good focus and a very funny photo.  I actually like the border you used, and that''s rare.  The problem is with the flash lighting.. if you could have diffused it more, it''d have been a much, much stronger photo.', '2006-01-22 15:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071429, 275903, 93, '<td valign="top">The reds seem to have been clipped a little.  They lack texture and definition. The background is also very, very busy.</td>', 'The reds seem to have been clipped a little.  They lack texture and definition. The background is also very, very busy.', '2006-01-22 15:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071431, 275976, 93, '<td valign="top">Looks a little oversharpened to me, with sharpness halos on the spires.  Nice grab though, very "industry meets nature"</td>', 'Looks a little oversharpened to me, with sharpness halos on the spires.  Nice grab though, very "industry meets nature"', '2006-01-22 15:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071433, 274722, 93, '<td valign="top">LOL.. I love it.  Hey.. It''s a deer!</td>', 'LOL.. I love it.  Hey.. It''s a deer!', '2006-01-22 15:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071435, 274987, 93, '<td valign="top">A little too dark, and the composition is too tight.</td>', 'A little too dark, and the composition is too tight.', '2006-01-22 15:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
