(2071441, 280270, 93, '<td valign="top">A little oversharp on the gull to my eyes, there seems to be a bit of a halo on it (maybe some dodging there too? I dunno).  Looks like a fun place to be.. and warm.</td>', 'A little oversharp on the gull to my eyes, there seems to be a bit of a halo on it (maybe some dodging there too? I dunno).  Looks like a fun place to be.. and warm.', '2006-01-22 15:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
