(2071455, 279566, 93, '<td valign="top">I personally think this would have been a stronger photo if you had gotten in closer for the shoot, and isolated the hands doing the work mre.  The business of the rest of the photo distracts from your subject, and the high contrast (with too much of the window showing), does it no real favors.</td>', 'I personally think this would have been a stronger photo if you had gotten in closer for the shoot, and isolated the hands doing the work mre.  The business of the rest of the photo distracts from your subject, and the high contrast (with too much of the window showing), does it no real favors.', '2006-01-22 16:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071456, 281616, 93, '<td valign="top">Is this a prediction of where you''ll place?  Seems a bit high :)<br/> <br/>The high contrast, noisy aspect probably isn''t appealing to many voters.</td>', 'Is this a prediction of where you''ll place?  Seems a bit high :) The high contrast, noisy aspect probably isn''t appealing to many voters.', '2006-01-22 16:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071459, 274735, 93, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you went with sepia toning here.. but it''s different. I like the textures, and nice lighting.  The upper corners seem to be a bit of an over-dodge/burn kind of feeling.</td>', 'Not sure why you went with sepia toning here.. but it''s different. I like the textures, and nice lighting.  The upper corners seem to be a bit of an over-dodge/burn kind of feeling.', '2006-01-22 16:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
