(2071476, 281131, 93, '<td valign="top">Aww, she looks so shy.  I like the choice of crop here, but because of the 640 limit, it suffers a little bit.  This must look really really good larger. Such a cutie.</td>', 'Aww, she looks so shy.  I like the choice of crop here, but because of the 640 limit, it suffers a little bit.  This must look really really good larger. Such a cutie.', '2006-01-22 16:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
