(2071799, 277966, 37252, '<td valign="top">sky is over-exposed. Horizon is tilted. Buildings look as if they are leaing backwards.  I think if you corrected the angles this would be a much better image</td>', 'sky is over-exposed. Horizon is tilted. Buildings look as if they are leaing backwards.  I think if you corrected the angles this would be a much better image', '2006-01-22 18:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071800, 279118, 24486, '<td valign="top">There is nothing quite as strong as the bond between mother &amp; child &amp; I think you have captured that perfectly here.</td>', 'There is nothing quite as strong as the bond between mother & child & I think you have captured that perfectly here.', '2006-01-22 18:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071811, 279057, 37252, '<td valign="top">I love horse racing. This horse has got the best expression - and that tongue!! lol <br/>Focus is tack sharp. Colors vibrant yet not over saturated. Composition is strong. Great shooting!</td>', 'I love horse racing. This horse has got the best expression - and that tongue!! lol Focus is tack sharp. Colors vibrant yet not over saturated. Composition is strong. Great shooting!', '2006-01-22 18:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071815, 274611, 37252, '<td valign="top">Great shot - a natural trytich!  Good eye for composition</td>', 'Great shot - a natural trytich!  Good eye for composition', '2006-01-22 18:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071817, 279644, 24486, '<td valign="top">A refreshingly different photograph. That looks really cold.</td>', 'A refreshingly different photograph. That looks really cold.', '2006-01-22 18:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071819, 280276, 2764, '<td valign="top">I dont understand why the tilt and the desaturated background add to the image of the bee and the flower.  Is it to emphasize the pointy leaves?  Or make the blue of the flower stand out more?  TO make it look dead?  Windblown?</td>', 'I dont understand why the tilt and the desaturated background add to the image of the bee and the flower.  Is it to emphasize the pointy leaves?  Or make the blue of the flower stand out more?  TO make it look dead?  Windblown?', '2006-01-22 18:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071821, 280112, 37252, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of desat. I like that you kept the colors muted. The bit of noise adds to this image.</td>', 'Interesting choice of desat. I like that you kept the colors muted. The bit of noise adds to this image.', '2006-01-22 18:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071822, 281554, 33400, '<td valign="top">The fog sets this apart from all the other "best of" landsacapes.<br/>Nice job.</td>', 'The fog sets this apart from all the other "best of" landsacapes.Nice job.', '2006-01-22 18:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071825, 275968, 37252, '<td valign="top">Beautiful horse! Nice sharp capture.</td>', 'Beautiful horse! Nice sharp capture.', '2006-01-22 18:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071831, 281935, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. Sharp focus. As for the composition, I think I may have stepped to the left more, placing the guard tower along the right side of the image and showing more of the land/sea scape to the left.</td>', 'Nice colors. Sharp focus. As for the composition, I think I may have stepped to the left more, placing the guard tower along the right side of the image and showing more of the land/sea scape to the left.', '2006-01-22 18:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071835, 280265, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice image but too yellow for my liking.</td>', 'Nice image but too yellow for my liking.', '2006-01-22 18:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071837, 277058, 2764, '<td valign="top">I see the plan - you post a gorgeous tropical spot in the dead of winter for the half of the world that has most of the voters and we all say AHHHHH, I want to be there and give you a high score?  Worked for me.  This is lovely!  That alluring hike up stream is almost irresistable.  Excellent use of composition to draw the viewer in.  Did you have to put in the railing to remind us to stay on the path?  Is that supposed to be my reality check that there are boundaries and responsibilities even in paradise?</td>', 'I see the plan - you post a gorgeous tropical spot in the dead of winter for the half of the world that has most of the voters and we all say AHHHHH, I want to be there and give you a high score?  Worked for me.  This is lovely!  That alluring hike up stream is almost irresistable.  Excellent use of composition to draw the viewer in.  Did you have to put in the railing to remind us to stay on the path?  Is that supposed to be my reality check that there are boundaries and responsibilities even in paradise?', '2006-01-22 18:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071839, 276011, 37252, '<td valign="top">I like the angle this is shot at - just not the tight crop on the bottom.</td>', 'I like the angle this is shot at - just not the tight crop on the bottom.', '2006-01-22 18:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071842, 274863, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - love the mist and the empty bench sitting under the tree. nice strong composition</td>', 'Nice shot - love the mist and the empty bench sitting under the tree. nice strong composition', '2006-01-22 18:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071845, 280499, 37252, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shades of purples and blues. Lovely picture.</td>', 'Beautiful shades of purples and blues. Lovely picture.', '2006-01-22 18:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071850, 280366, 37252, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. The composition, the color tones, the ray coming in through the window, the story that is told by the composure of the person. Excellent shot you have every right to be proud of. [10]</td>', 'I love this shot. The composition, the color tones, the ray coming in through the window, the story that is told by the composure of the person. Excellent shot you have every right to be proud of. [10]', '2006-01-22 18:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071853, 276017, 37252, '<td valign="top">This has got to be one of the most beautiful sunsets I have seen! The colors in the sky are magnificent ,as is the reflection across the water.</td>', 'This has got to be one of the most beautiful sunsets I have seen! The colors in the sky are magnificent ,as is the reflection across the water.', '2006-01-22 18:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071854, 277676, 37252, '<td valign="top">Wow - A true masterpiece - one of my favorites in the challenge at this point. Surely this will place near the top!  [10] from me</td>', 'Wow - A true masterpiece - one of my favorites in the challenge at this point. Surely this will place near the top!  [10] from me', '2006-01-22 18:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071855, 277432, 37252, '<td valign="top">Awesome macro! This is the cutest little bug. Great details in both the bug and the front leaf. The DOF is perfect for this shot. I love the vibrant colors.</td>', 'Awesome macro! This is the cutest little bug. Great details in both the bug and the front leaf. The DOF is perfect for this shot. I love the vibrant colors.', '2006-01-22 18:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071856, 281730, 37252, '<td valign="top">wow - a Masterpiece! I love the sharpness overall - only seems too sharp in the one wave upper right. Great water action! The textures on the ground are outstanding. Nice rich color tones. I like that the shadows fall in front of the people. Had the sun been in front of them they would have not had the nice shadows providing even more texture and contrast.</td>', 'wow - a Masterpiece! I love the sharpness overall - only seems too sharp in the one wave upper right. Great water action! The textures on the ground are outstanding. Nice rich color tones. I like that the shadows fall in front of the people. Had the sun been in front of them they would have not had the nice shadows providing even more texture and contrast.', '2006-01-22 18:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071858, 275391, 37252, '<td valign="top">Great crop - just looking into the gorgeous light brown eyes and seeing his/her smile puts a smile on my own face. Excellent detail here - exposure level right on. Nice sharp focus. Bumping to a [10]</td>', 'Great crop - just looking into the gorgeous light brown eyes and seeing his/her smile puts a smile on my own face. Excellent detail here - exposure level right on. Nice sharp focus. Bumping to a [10]', '2006-01-22 18:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071861, 275238, 33400, '<td valign="top">I think your choice of grain here was perfect.  This is a very intriguing shot that just cries out for explanantion.  Excellent job.</td>', 'I think your choice of grain here was perfect.  This is a very intriguing shot that just cries out for explanantion.  Excellent job.', '2006-01-22 18:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071865, 281937, 24642, '<td valign="top">Noce mood and colors</td>', 'Noce mood and colors', '2006-01-22 18:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
