(2071910, 276040, 25553, '<td valign="top">this picture is amazing. i really like the fact that the eyes a hidden behind his scratched glasses. im usually opposed to not seeing the eyes but it seems in character here. also his clothing really adds to his character as does the background. great job!!</td>', 'this picture is amazing. i really like the fact that the eyes a hidden behind his scratched glasses. im usually opposed to not seeing the eyes but it seems in character here. also his clothing really adds to his character as does the background. great job!!', '2006-01-22 19:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
