(2071948, 278337, 46468, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, however since the picture is so small I am unable to see enough detail to tell if the focus is sharp or not. <br/>"File Size: No larger than 150 KB (153,600 bytes). Dimension: No dimension may be shorter than 160 pixels or longer than 640 pixels." You should try to have your challenge entries as close to the maximum allowed; Your dimensions are 20,139 bytes and 450 x 298 pixels. If you have received low scores it is probably due more to the size of the picture then to the content.</td>', 'Nice composition, however since the picture is so small I am unable to see enough detail to tell if the focus is sharp or not. "File Size: No larger than 150 KB (153,600 bytes). Dimension: No dimension may be shorter than 160 pixels or longer than 640 pixels." You should try to have your challenge entries as close to the maximum allowed; Your dimensions are 20,139 bytes and 450 x 298 pixels. If you have received low scores it is probably due more to the size of the picture then to the content.', '2006-01-22 19:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
