(2071974, 274718, 25890, '<td valign="top">The tight, clean composition, perfect exposure, spot on focus and unembellished post-processing without any gimmicks or visual interference bring out and emphasize the individuality of this gentleman and let the viewer not only catch a glimpse of his character but also almost literally hear him tell his stories. Simply excellent!</td>', 'The tight, clean composition, perfect exposure, spot on focus and unembellished post-processing without any gimmicks or visual interference bring out and emphasize the individuality of this gentleman and let the viewer not only catch a glimpse of his character but also almost literally hear him tell his stories. Simply excellent!', '2006-01-22 19:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2071978, 281846, 46468, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, well titled, however the blown highlights really distract from the image. Also the picture is too small which makes it reall hard to see a great amount of detail. You should try to have your challenge entries as close to the maximum allowed size as possible -- "File Size: No larger than 150 KB (153,600 bytes). Dimension: No dimension may be shorter than 160 pixels or longer than 640 pixels."-- your dimensioins are 128,826 bytes and 325 x 431 pixels.</td>', 'Nice concept, well titled, however the blown highlights really distract from the image. Also the picture is too small which makes it reall hard to see a great amount of detail. You should try to have your challenge entries as close to the maximum allowed size as possible -- "File Size: No larger than 150 KB (153,600 bytes). Dimension: No dimension may be shorter than 160 pixels or longer than 640 pixels."-- your dimensioins are 128,826 bytes and 325 x 431 pixels.', '2006-01-22 19:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
