(2073160, 281476, 51359, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, lovely and sharp, shame all of his head wasn''t in the reflection.</td>', 'Beautiful image, lovely and sharp, shame all of his head wasn''t in the reflection.', '2006-01-23 01:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073213, 281878, 37252, '<td valign="top">too dark for my personal liking, but good pp for this style image.</td>', 'too dark for my personal liking, but good pp for this style image.', '2006-01-23 01:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073224, 278871, 4767, '<td valign="top">And all THOSE folks have shots of YOU in the background, LOL...  Nice exposure, wonderful scene. Breathtaking beauty in Antelope Canyon.</td>', 'And all THOSE folks have shots of YOU in the background, LOL...  Nice exposure, wonderful scene. Breathtaking beauty in Antelope Canyon.', '2006-01-23 01:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073227, 277089, 4767, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary use of negative space!</td>', 'Extraordinary use of negative space!', '2006-01-23 01:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073229, 275143, 4767, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  (Is this that famous ''horse of a different color'' we hear so much about?) wonderfully evocative image.</td>', 'Beautifully done.  (Is this that famous ''horse of a different color'' we hear so much about?) wonderfully evocative image.', '2006-01-23 01:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073235, 281435, 4767, '<td valign="top">WHOOOO- weee!  NICE shot! sharp shaerp sharp, and well done! 9</td>', 'WHOOOO- weee!  NICE shot! sharp shaerp sharp, and well done! 9', '2006-01-23 01:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073240, 281404, 4767, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of a beautiful child.</td>', 'Beautiful shot of a beautiful child.', '2006-01-23 01:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073296, 275086, 50935, '<td valign="top">Funny! He really looks like my professor.</td>', 'Funny! He really looks like my professor.', '2006-01-23 03:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073298, 275197, 50935, '<td valign="top">Great Picture</td>', 'Great Picture', '2006-01-23 03:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073303, 278877, 37252, '<td valign="top">Good time of day for this shot - the lighting and shadows create a nice feeling of textures. Nice sharp image - although you may have gone just a bit hard with the USM as the mountain edges against the sky have some haloing.</td>', 'Good time of day for this shot - the lighting and shadows create a nice feeling of textures. Nice sharp image - although you may have gone just a bit hard with the USM as the mountain edges against the sky have some haloing.', '2006-01-23 03:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073306, 281716, 37252, '<td valign="top">Great DOF. The composition is strong. The catch lights in the cats eyes really set off the gaze.</td>', 'Great DOF. The composition is strong. The catch lights in the cats eyes really set off the gaze.', '2006-01-23 03:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073311, 281616, 37252, '<td valign="top">the lighting here seems all wrong - it is mauch too harsh. I don''t really get the meaning behind this image - not even with the title. Actually the just makes me get it even less.</td>', 'the lighting here seems all wrong - it is mauch too harsh. I don''t really get the meaning behind this image - not even with the title. Actually the just makes me get it even less.', '2006-01-23 03:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073315, 281892, 37252, '<td valign="top">I really cannot tell what is supposed to be swimming here. The image is just a blur to me - even the ledge in the background. Lookms like the colors would have been nice if not so blurry and noisy. Try using a tripod and timer if necessary.</td>', 'I really cannot tell what is supposed to be swimming here. The image is just a blur to me - even the ledge in the background. Lookms like the colors would have been nice if not so blurry and noisy. Try using a tripod and timer if necessary.', '2006-01-23 03:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073316, 277650, 37252, '<td valign="top">Serious lack of focus on this one. I''m not that wild about the red either.</td>', 'Serious lack of focus on this one. I''m not that wild about the red either.', '2006-01-23 03:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073318, 278939, 37252, '<td valign="top">The image is seriously out of focus.</td>', 'The image is seriously out of focus.', '2006-01-23 03:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073460, 276040, 42792, '<td valign="top">Bumping this up.  Seems like it has an interesting story behind it. : )  So despite the cropped off head and one half of his face is in shadow, I find that these imperfections make part of the whole "story", along with his funny glasses and the state they''re in.  The choice of b&amp;w fits in perfectly. This is a photo that grows on you, at least in my case.  Good luck!<br/> <br/>Like I said, this photo grows on you.  Bumping up again - 10!</td>', 'Bumping this up.  Seems like it has an interesting story behind it. : )  So despite the cropped off head and one half of his face is in shadow, I find that these imperfections make part of the whole "story", along with his funny glasses and the state they''re in.  The choice of b&w fits in perfectly. This is a photo that grows on you, at least in my case.  Good luck! Like I said, this photo grows on you.  Bumping up again - 10!', '2006-01-23 05:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073463, 280226, 42792, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and the synergy of title with image gives it that little extra. 7</td>', 'Nice idea and the synergy of title with image gives it that little extra. 7', '2006-01-23 05:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073468, 281562, 42792, '<td valign="top">Like the PoV.  7.</td>', 'Like the PoV.  7.', '2006-01-23 05:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073469, 279644, 42792, '<td valign="top">8 - has a photodocumentary feel to it.  As such, a caption to that effect would have been more impactful.</td>', '8 - has a photodocumentary feel to it.  As such, a caption to that effect would have been more impactful.', '2006-01-23 06:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073470, 275237, 42792, '<td valign="top">A magical moment captured!  This photo speaks volumes.  B&amp;W is a good choice.  Just seems a wee bit dark.  Bumping up. 9</td>', 'A magical moment captured!  This photo speaks volumes.  B&W is a good choice.  Just seems a wee bit dark.  Bumping up. 9', '2006-01-23 06:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073472, 275320, 42792, '<td valign="top">If I''m not mistaken, another very similar shot was already a ribbon winner?!!  That''s still a better photo.</td>', 'If I''m not mistaken, another very similar shot was already a ribbon winner?!!  That''s still a better photo.', '2006-01-23 06:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073474, 276545, 42792, '<td valign="top">Cool juxtaposition! 7</td>', 'Cool juxtaposition! 7', '2006-01-23 06:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073481, 275667, 42792, '<td valign="top">Nice tones but lost out on details in the rock mass.</td>', 'Nice tones but lost out on details in the rock mass.', '2006-01-23 06:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073483, 277680, 42792, '<td valign="top">a nice "winter wonderland" feel to it.</td>', 'a nice "winter wonderland" feel to it.', '2006-01-23 06:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073489, 277089, 42792, '<td valign="top">This is one of personal favourites and making the colours pop out more was definitely a good idea for this challenge.  Did you sharpened it ''coz compared to your original, it seems a little rough on the outline and edges?</td>', 'This is one of personal favourites and making the colours pop out more was definitely a good idea for this challenge.  Did you sharpened it ''coz compared to your original, it seems a little rough on the outline and edges?', '2006-01-23 06:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073508, 274768, 42792, '<td valign="top">Nice clean silhouette and composition.  The colours of the sky blend very well. Not sure about the title tho'' but then, I don''t vote on title :)</td>', 'Nice clean silhouette and composition.  The colours of the sky blend very well. Not sure about the title tho'' but then, I don''t vote on title :)', '2006-01-23 06:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073519, 278766, 42792, '<td valign="top">A different PoV and why not!</td>', 'A different PoV and why not!', '2006-01-23 06:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073520, 274615, 17033, '<td valign="top">Best portrait voted on so far: organic, relaxed feel to it</td>', 'Best portrait voted on so far: organic, relaxed feel to it', '2006-01-23 06:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073521, 275232, 17033, '<td valign="top">Not sure this scene evokes tranquility in me...too much decay</td>', 'Not sure this scene evokes tranquility in me...too much decay', '2006-01-23 06:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073523, 276957, 42792, '<td valign="top">Nice hues and a classically interesting subject.  But it looks a little over-processed which doesn''t seem necessary.</td>', 'Nice hues and a classically interesting subject.  But it looks a little over-processed which doesn''t seem necessary.', '2006-01-23 06:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073525, 280582, 17033, '<td valign="top">I like the ''notes on a stave'' feel to this. Good composition</td>', 'I like the ''notes on a stave'' feel to this. Good composition', '2006-01-23 06:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073527, 275945, 17033, '<td valign="top">Not just another dull guitar shot..well done for finding something new</td>', 'Not just another dull guitar shot..well done for finding something new', '2006-01-23 06:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073528, 279544, 17033, '<td valign="top">Excellent colour and composition</td>', 'Excellent colour and composition', '2006-01-23 06:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073529, 274775, 42792, '<td valign="top">Pretty sunset colours but the silhouette mix of tree, branch, grass and bushes is a little too busy IMO.</td>', 'Pretty sunset colours but the silhouette mix of tree, branch, grass and bushes is a little too busy IMO.', '2006-01-23 06:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073532, 278952, 17033, '<td valign="top">detail on stack looks a little too rescued but nice shot at good time of day</td>', 'detail on stack looks a little too rescued but nice shot at good time of day', '2006-01-23 06:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073538, 275259, 42792, '<td valign="top">There is a nice contemporary feel to this.  Pity it seems a little OOF.</td>', 'There is a nice contemporary feel to this.  Pity it seems a little OOF.', '2006-01-23 06:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073539, 279649, 42792, '<td valign="top">I like the use of DoF here and the fact that it just doesn''t bank on being a pretty picture.  What hurts it IMO are the gray tones which seem rather flat while the whites have way too much highlights.</td>', 'I like the use of DoF here and the fact that it just doesn''t bank on being a pretty picture.  What hurts it IMO are the gray tones which seem rather flat while the whites have way too much highlights.', '2006-01-23 06:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073545, 280507, 30364, '<td valign="top">A remarkably beautiful, lyrical image.  Pretty girl cavorting through long grass ... 19 people out of 20 (me included) would have produced a ghastly cliche with that set-up.  You didn''t, which indicates how good this photograph actually is.  8.</td>', 'A remarkably beautiful, lyrical image.  Pretty girl cavorting through long grass ... 19 people out of 20 (me included) would have produced a ghastly cliche with that set-up.  You didn''t, which indicates how good this photograph actually is.  8.', '2006-01-23 06:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073546, 279839, 17033, '<td valign="top">...as in Vancouver Island? Excellent shot with dtrong fore- and background features</td>', '...as in Vancouver Island? Excellent shot with dtrong fore- and background features', '2006-01-23 06:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073572, 276522, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very fine, evocative image.  It takes both vision and courage to see and capture the emotional potential of what is on the face of it a prosaic collection of commonplace objects.  The handling of the light is perfect, and everything else - composition, exposure and processing - flows from there.  8.</td>', 'Very fine, evocative image.  It takes both vision and courage to see and capture the emotional potential of what is on the face of it a prosaic collection of commonplace objects.  The handling of the light is perfect, and everything else - composition, exposure and processing - flows from there.  8.', '2006-01-23 07:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073574, 275478, 17033, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''242367'', strrpos(''242367'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="242367"/> <br/> <br/>Rather than making you stand out as in this image, your challenege entry almost blends you with the background and works better in my opinion. It accentuates the emotional impact</td>', '  Rather than making you stand out as in this image, your challenege entry almost blends you with the background and works better in my opinion. It accentuates the emotional impact', '2006-01-23 07:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073579, 279809, 30364, '<td valign="top">Sparkling good casual portrait.  The sweet little feminine smiles are a wonderful surprise on a couple of guys who dig tunnels for a living!  But this photograph has more than novelty value; it has genuine charm.  Very fine work.  8.</td>', 'Sparkling good casual portrait.  The sweet little feminine smiles are a wonderful surprise on a couple of guys who dig tunnels for a living!  But this photograph has more than novelty value; it has genuine charm.  Very fine work.  8.', '2006-01-23 07:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
