(2076284, 275943, 46468, '<td valign="top">You have captured absolute JOY, well done. The focus is clear, could have been just a touch tighter on the eyes, but still good. The lighting is pleasing (a fill flash may have added a little more definition to the face and brought out the eyes that touch more) But overall an attractive image that captures a beautiful memory-good luck</td>', 'You have captured absolute JOY, well done. The focus is clear, could have been just a touch tighter on the eyes, but still good. The lighting is pleasing (a fill flash may have added a little more definition to the face and brought out the eyes that touch more) But overall an attractive image that captures a beautiful memory-good luck', '2006-01-23 22:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
