(2076448, 279916, 15407, '<td valign="top">The lack of noise, the perfect gradient of the waining light "dawn/dusk" make this a sleeper shot.  Photographic skills &amp; post processing are combined here in a photo that is exquistely well done ... additionaly the lack of over sharpening for detail on the branches exhibit a restraint that pays benefit by not being over processed. My only complaint (9 instead of 10) is that I prefer color to black and white.</td>', 'The lack of noise, the perfect gradient of the waining light "dawn/dusk" make this a sleeper shot.  Photographic skills & post processing are combined here in a photo that is exquistely well done ... additionaly the lack of over sharpening for detail on the branches exhibit a restraint that pays benefit by not being over processed. My only complaint (9 instead of 10) is that I prefer color to black and white.', '2006-01-23 23:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076484, 281534, 40718, '<td valign="top">This would do so much better on a large canvas.  It was ultimately why I didn''t enter a cityscape for my 2005 entry.  Still, the sky and water transfer very well. 8</td>', 'This would do so much better on a large canvas.  It was ultimately why I didn''t enter a cityscape for my 2005 entry.  Still, the sky and water transfer very well. 8', '2006-01-23 23:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
