(2076498, 276714, 40718, '<td valign="top">The post processing is incredible on this one.  I absolutely love it (but I''m a person who doesn''t mind a heavy hand in such things).  Only my second 10 (on 455 so far).</td>', 'The post processing is incredible on this one.  I absolutely love it (but I''m a person who doesn''t mind a heavy hand in such things).  Only my second 10 (on 455 so far).', '2006-01-23 23:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
