(2076581, 281731, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very, very cool. I like how you''ve made this interesting abstract out of the natural formation. I like the warm, inviting colors and shapes. And there is a great play of light and shallow. Nice job on the exposure, I like how there is still some discernable detail in the shadows. Great shot!</td>', 'Very, very cool. I like how you''ve made this interesting abstract out of the natural formation. I like the warm, inviting colors and shapes. And there is a great play of light and shallow. Nice job on the exposure, I like how there is still some discernable detail in the shadows. Great shot!', '2006-01-24 00:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076622, 282016, 15511, '<td valign="top">Congrats on getting such a sharp image at speed. This is a fine motorsports picture. Did you get an autograph on this one?</td>', 'Congrats on getting such a sharp image at speed. This is a fine motorsports picture. Did you get an autograph on this one?', '2006-01-24 00:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
