(2076994, 277758, 50440, '<td valign="top">I appreciate this image and particularly like the contrast between the ice  and the fast moving river or stream.  It is rare these days to get ice formations where I live, so any time there is a hard frost, this is the type of image I go looking for in local rivers on Dartmoor.</td>', 'I appreciate this image and particularly like the contrast between the ice  and the fast moving river or stream.  It is rare these days to get ice formations where I live, so any time there is a hard frost, this is the type of image I go looking for in local rivers on Dartmoor.', '2006-01-24 03:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2077008, 275248, 50440, '<td valign="top">I like this one for its detail of the head. it has been cropped about right and the detail in the feathers is excellent, the beady eye and shape of beak give the otherwise peaceful bird a slightly menacing look.</td>', 'I like this one for its detail of the head. it has been cropped about right and the detail in the feathers is excellent, the beady eye and shape of beak give the otherwise peaceful bird a slightly menacing look.', '2006-01-24 04:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
