(2077078, 279601, 2170, '<td valign="top">i like the photo, but it seems to have been overly sharpened for my tastes.  i think the rainbow lends itself to more of a "soft edged" feel and i don''t get that here.</td>', 'i like the photo, but it seems to have been overly sharpened for my tastes.  i think the rainbow lends itself to more of a "soft edged" feel and i don''t get that here.', '2006-01-24 05:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
