(2077435, 275008, 2170, '<td valign="top">good angle.  too bad it''s clipped on the top.  i''d like to see the wheel pushed more out of the frame so that it doesn''t take up the whole shot.</td>', 'good angle.  too bad it''s clipped on the top.  i''d like to see the wheel pushed more out of the frame so that it doesn''t take up the whole shot.', '2006-01-24 09:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
