(2077456, 274652, 29377, '<td valign="top">Very nice --- the shoes, the socks, the jacket, her expression. I''d like to see her mouth and it may be dodged a bit heavily along the left side of her face, but that''s just being picky. The clouds and the light give an eerie sense of foreboding... almost a Wizard of Oz feel.</td>', 'Very nice --- the shoes, the socks, the jacket, her expression. I''d like to see her mouth and it may be dodged a bit heavily along the left side of her face, but that''s just being picky. The clouds and the light give an eerie sense of foreboding... almost a Wizard of Oz feel.', '2006-01-24 09:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2077458, 281854, 2170, '<td valign="top">great focus on the eye and nice bokeh in the background.</td>', 'great focus on the eye and nice bokeh in the background.', '2006-01-24 09:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
