(2081047, 281367, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Technically very good. Great dof. Great exposure. Good interest factor. I often see people use the ''skewed'' angle just for the sake of being artistic or something. In this case, I feel it actually works for this image. It seems to accentuate the wild activity and adds interest to the shot, and helps makes this image stand out among many well done action shots. Awesome photo, well done!</td>', 'Very cool. Technically very good. Great dof. Great exposure. Good interest factor. I often see people use the ''skewed'' angle just for the sake of being artistic or something. In this case, I feel it actually works for this image. It seems to accentuate the wild activity and adds interest to the shot, and helps makes this image stand out among many well done action shots. Awesome photo, well done!', '2006-01-25 03:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
