(2082584, 277431, 23913, '<td valign="top">looks like the backround was once there and was taken away...its an odd blend the really white and the stark black.<br/> <br/>if it were me i would have put her almost out of the frame 2 the left, so about half her body was in and you could see her stare across the black, it would be very striking that way. try a crop and then enlarge the canvis using black to that side...see how it looks. i don''t know might not work at all, but to me center subject framing has is place and this doesn''t hit it. very great capture tho. GL</td>', 'looks like the backround was once there and was taken away...its an odd blend the really white and the stark black. if it were me i would have put her almost out of the frame 2 the left, so about half her body was in and you could see her stare across the black, it would be very striking that way. try a crop and then enlarge the canvis using black to that side...see how it looks. i don''t know might not work at all, but to me center subject framing has is place and this doesn''t hit it. very great capture tho. GL', '2006-01-25 11:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
