(2084963, 280483, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouette and the composition but the light blue in the sky is distracting for me. Personally, I''d prefer this as a b/w image or just leave the flag in color. Also the clouds look like they might benefit from a curves adjustment (or dodge/burn) to bring out more contrast.</td>', 'I like the silhouette and the composition but the light blue in the sky is distracting for me. Personally, I''d prefer this as a b/w image or just leave the flag in color. Also the clouds look like they might benefit from a curves adjustment (or dodge/burn) to bring out more contrast.', '2006-01-25 21:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
