(2085018, 278876, 44996, '<td valign="top">beautiful. I love the pure white of the light. Which great lake are you on the shore of? Cheers from the west side of Superior. (well, somewhat near the west side...)</td>', 'beautiful. I love the pure white of the light. Which great lake are you on the shore of? Cheers from the west side of Superior. (well, somewhat near the west side...)', '2006-01-25 22:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085028, 282006, 44996, '<td valign="top">wow. This is such a beautiful image. Perhaps next time adding some more negative space would have improved this type of photo, but bird don''t exactly sit around and model. : ) Nice work.</td>', 'wow. This is such a beautiful image. Perhaps next time adding some more negative space would have improved this type of photo, but bird don''t exactly sit around and model. : ) Nice work.', '2006-01-25 22:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085034, 281716, 50641, '<td valign="top">Wonderful... the shallow focus, the clarity of the face... and what an incredible look you''ve captured. This is not just another wildlife shot.  10 and faved.<br/> <br/>p.s. please tell me he''s not stuffed.</td>', 'Wonderful... the shallow focus, the clarity of the face... and what an incredible look you''ve captured. This is not just another wildlife shot.  10 and faved. p.s. please tell me he''s not stuffed.', '2006-01-25 22:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085040, 278785, 44996, '<td valign="top">what a wonderful image. The expression of the girl has so much emotion, it brings out a smile.</td>', 'what a wonderful image. The expression of the girl has so much emotion, it brings out a smile.', '2006-01-25 22:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085050, 275223, 44996, '<td valign="top">I stood on this very bridge in June... I miss Germany. The quality of this image is outstanding and the colors are perfect. I would love to know how you edited this. Tschuss.</td>', 'I stood on this very bridge in June... I miss Germany. The quality of this image is outstanding and the colors are perfect. I would love to know how you edited this. Tschuss.', '2006-01-25 22:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
