(2085063, 280375, 44996, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I love the intensity of it.</td>', 'Great capture. I love the intensity of it.', '2006-01-25 22:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085065, 280550, 44996, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Simply wonderful.</td>', 'Wonderful. Simply wonderful.', '2006-01-25 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085084, 277142, 44996, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for anything Kiwi. This photo is absolutely wonderful and It makes me want to hop a flight to NZ. : )</td>', 'I am a sucker for anything Kiwi. This photo is absolutely wonderful and It makes me want to hop a flight to NZ. : )', '2006-01-25 22:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085089, 281616, 41522, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I wasn''t seeing what this was and until I asked my wife, I couldn''t tell what it was.  I feel that the lighting is too harsh and the subject is too difficult to understand.  I hope you understand what I''m trying to say.  JMO</td>', 'Sorry, I wasn''t seeing what this was and until I asked my wife, I couldn''t tell what it was.  I feel that the lighting is too harsh and the subject is too difficult to understand.  I hope you understand what I''m trying to say.  JMO', '2006-01-25 22:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085093, 281626, 44996, '<td valign="top">I love the stopped motion. Phenominal.</td>', 'I love the stopped motion. Phenominal.', '2006-01-25 22:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085115, 281549, 41522, '<td valign="top">I feel this photo could have benefited greatly from a CCW rotation in order to level the horizon.  As the photo is so strongly tied to the horizon, this is a major distraction for me.  The colours and sofnes of the sky are nice.  I''m not sure if a longer exposure would have brough more mood to the water or not.  JMO.</td>', 'I feel this photo could have benefited greatly from a CCW rotation in order to level the horizon.  As the photo is so strongly tied to the horizon, this is a major distraction for me.  The colours and sofnes of the sky are nice.  I''m not sure if a longer exposure would have brough more mood to the water or not.  JMO.', '2006-01-25 22:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085131, 279604, 44996, '<td valign="top">beautiful. I Love the BWCA. This photo makes me want to drive up north tomorow... : )</td>', 'beautiful. I Love the BWCA. This photo makes me want to drive up north tomorow... : )', '2006-01-25 22:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085141, 280010, 41522, '<td valign="top">For me, I would have liked a little sharper image.  Also, the intersection between the centre cactus and the horizon gives this image a staic feel for me.  It sort of prevents my eyes eyes from exploring the whole image.  JMO</td>', 'For me, I would have liked a little sharper image.  Also, the intersection between the centre cactus and the horizon gives this image a staic feel for me.  It sort of prevents my eyes eyes from exploring the whole image.  JMO', '2006-01-25 22:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085187, 280226, 44996, '<td valign="top">I love the motion of this photo. Way to submit something very unique and very well shot.</td>', 'I love the motion of this photo. Way to submit something very unique and very well shot.', '2006-01-25 22:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085214, 275911, 44996, '<td valign="top">hey- I saw a photograph of this building in one of the Photo Mags. Nice job with this image. I love the contrast.</td>', 'hey- I saw a photograph of this building in one of the Photo Mags. Nice job with this image. I love the contrast.', '2006-01-25 22:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
