(2085327, 280858, 13728, '<td valign="top">That is one big little toe.  Cute angle</td>', 'That is one big little toe.  Cute angle', '2006-01-25 23:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085342, 274652, 52061, '<td valign="top">incredible</td>', 'incredible', '2006-01-25 23:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085353, 280797, 25397, '<td valign="top">An all time Alecia classic<br/>The lighting is so pristine, dark one side, light the other... Beautiful. :-)<br/>I really hope this finishes with an awesome score, I''ll try to help with a 10! :-)<br/> <br/>P.S. The title sucks. ;-)<br/>hehehe</td>', 'An all time Alecia classicThe lighting is so pristine, dark one side, light the other... Beautiful. :-)I really hope this finishes with an awesome score, I''ll try to help with a 10! :-) P.S. The title sucks. ;-)hehehe', '2006-01-25 23:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085383, 275391, 13728, '<td valign="top">Great framing of pix.  He makes me laugh.  NIce job</td>', 'Great framing of pix.  He makes me laugh.  NIce job', '2006-01-25 23:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085390, 274894, 10658, '<td valign="top">I might be mistaken, but are those bluebonnets?  The title fits really well.  Lovely shot!  The only thing I might have done differently would have been to crop out a little more of the trees in the background, they seem to detract more than add to the photo.  However, that''s just an opinion, I bet there''s plenty of people who disagree :)</td>', 'I might be mistaken, but are those bluebonnets?  The title fits really well.  Lovely shot!  The only thing I might have done differently would have been to crop out a little more of the trees in the background, they seem to detract more than add to the photo.  However, that''s just an opinion, I bet there''s plenty of people who disagree :)', '2006-01-25 23:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085396, 279931, 51856, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.  It really helps in drawing the focus to the dancers.  I love the color as well.</td>', 'Nice DOF.  It really helps in drawing the focus to the dancers.  I love the color as well.', '2006-01-25 23:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085405, 281852, 51856, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2006-01-25 23:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085410, 280652, 51856, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Reminds me of a morning i experienced one summer in the Sierras.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Reminds me of a morning i experienced one summer in the Sierras.', '2006-01-25 23:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085420, 275508, 13728, '<td valign="top">I was there this fall.  You got a better caputre than I did that day.  Did you go to bridge day?</td>', 'I was there this fall.  You got a better caputre than I did that day.  Did you go to bridge day?', '2006-01-25 23:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085423, 279966, 51856, '<td valign="top">Lovely shutter effect with the water.  You preserved the sharpness of the surrounding rocks and trees very well.</td>', 'Lovely shutter effect with the water.  You preserved the sharpness of the surrounding rocks and trees very well.', '2006-01-25 23:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085430, 281933, 13728, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more contrast in your black and white.  Nice clouds and compostion tho</td>', 'I would have liked to see more contrast in your black and white.  Nice clouds and compostion tho', '2006-01-25 23:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085436, 275248, 13728, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is one tough looking bill.  Are those teeth in there.  I wouldn''t want to get him mad!</td>', 'Wow, that is one tough looking bill.  Are those teeth in there.  I wouldn''t want to get him mad!', '2006-01-25 23:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085451, 280136, 13728, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and use of shallow dof.  I love the way my eye goes around right to the bug.  Well done</td>', 'Very nice composition and use of shallow dof.  I love the way my eye goes around right to the bug.  Well done', '2006-01-25 23:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085483, 274550, 13728, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting and composition.  Ver simply sensual.  nicely done</td>', 'very nice lighting and composition.  Ver simply sensual.  nicely done', '2006-01-25 23:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085486, 280955, 13728, '<td valign="top">he doesn''t look happy to be there.  Very funny shot</td>', 'he doesn''t look happy to be there.  Very funny shot', '2006-01-25 23:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085496, 278093, 13728, '<td valign="top">This looks like an amazing picture, that I am sure will suffer dearly because of the small size.  It is so hard to see.  Too bad, because it looks really nice</td>', 'This looks like an amazing picture, that I am sure will suffer dearly because of the small size.  It is so hard to see.  Too bad, because it looks really nice', '2006-01-25 23:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085498, 274680, 13728, '<td valign="top">I really love this picture.  one of my favorites in a group of so much good stuff.  How did  you ever find this car.  Good luck in this challenge</td>', 'I really love this picture.  one of my favorites in a group of so much good stuff.  How did  you ever find this car.  Good luck in this challenge', '2006-01-25 23:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085558, 274557, 41522, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a very interesting pose and expression nut the unfocused approach is very distracting for me.  I think this might have been much improved with a sharper image and maybe some photoshop processing to add to the expression captured.  Maybe the Grunge action.  JMO.</td>', 'You''ve got a very interesting pose and expression nut the unfocused approach is very distracting for me.  I think this might have been much improved with a sharper image and maybe some photoshop processing to add to the expression captured.  Maybe the Grunge action.  JMO.', '2006-01-25 23:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085561, 277099, 41522, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen the pre-processed photo.  It looks like a nice place.  For me, this image is more of a Digital Art piece than a photo.  JMO.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen the pre-processed photo.  It looks like a nice place.  For me, this image is more of a Digital Art piece than a photo.  JMO.', '2006-01-25 23:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085566, 279625, 41522, '<td valign="top">The photo has a very bright hot spot on th bottom right that I find to be very distracting.  I''m not sure of the weather conditions this was taken in, but if it wasn''t an overcast day, you might find that helpful in reducing the brightness, allowing you to take a long shutter without getting a hot spot.  JMO.</td>', 'The photo has a very bright hot spot on th bottom right that I find to be very distracting.  I''m not sure of the weather conditions this was taken in, but if it wasn''t an overcast day, you might find that helpful in reducing the brightness, allowing you to take a long shutter without getting a hot spot.  JMO.', '2006-01-25 23:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085570, 278337, 41522, '<td valign="top">You''ve picked a very nice subject with these orchids.  I really wish the focu ere sharper and the image were a little larger.  JMO.</td>', 'You''ve picked a very nice subject with these orchids.  I really wish the focu ere sharper and the image were a little larger.  JMO.', '2006-01-25 23:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085575, 280701, 41522, '<td valign="top">The processing has made the colours look too harsh for my liking.  The details of the image seem to be lost with the procesing that took place.  JMO.</td>', 'The processing has made the colours look too harsh for my liking.  The details of the image seem to be lost with the procesing that took place.  JMO.', '2006-01-25 23:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085579, 279178, 41522, '<td valign="top">I like the low perspective of this shot but I feel that the sky is too bright and distracting.  Perhaps a tighter view to reduce the amount of sky migh have helped.  JMO</td>', 'I like the low perspective of this shot but I feel that the sky is too bright and distracting.  Perhaps a tighter view to reduce the amount of sky migh have helped.  JMO', '2006-01-25 23:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085606, 281905, 41522, '<td valign="top">For me, this image is a touch on the dark side and I''m wishing that the DOF had been a bit greater.  The focused bud is obscured by a backgrounded flower that is not in focus and for me, this makes the focused portion of the image hard to find.  I think I would have preferred a more simplified view of the flowers.  JMO</td>', 'For me, this image is a touch on the dark side and I''m wishing that the DOF had been a bit greater.  The focused bud is obscured by a backgrounded flower that is not in focus and for me, this makes the focused portion of the image hard to find.  I think I would have preferred a more simplified view of the flowers.  JMO', '2006-01-26 00:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085616, 281930, 41522, '<td valign="top">Theselittle guys are very cool and I hope to be able to photograph one someday.  I''m not sure if this image is suffering from digital noise or a lack of focus, bu the image looks to me to be in need of more sharpness. and perhaps some better lighting.  JMO.</td>', 'Theselittle guys are very cool and I hope to be able to photograph one someday.  I''m not sure if this image is suffering from digital noise or a lack of focus, bu the image looks to me to be in need of more sharpness. and perhaps some better lighting.  JMO.', '2006-01-26 00:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085625, 281529, 41522, '<td valign="top">Th exposure on the bird is too dark for me to appreciate the bird.  Because of the lack of lighting on the bird, I find my eye is andering around the photo for something to settle on.  JMO.</td>', 'Th exposure on the bird is too dark for me to appreciate the bird.  Because of the lack of lighting on the bird, I find my eye is andering around the photo for something to settle on.  JMO.', '2006-01-26 00:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085639, 274592, 41522, '<td valign="top">Abeauifulshot.  Nice, crisp focus on the eyes.  Soft skin with good tones.  Th long hair looks great and I''m happy o see none of the the hair is going across her face.  Well done!!</td>', 'Abeauifulshot.  Nice, crisp focus on the eyes.  Soft skin with good tones.  Th long hair looks great and I''m happy o see none of the the hair is going across her face.  Well done!!', '2006-01-26 00:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085642, 281626, 41522, '<td valign="top">A greatshot.  Nice timing on getting sunlight for your subject and a great sky for a backdrop.  Nicely composed.  Goo work.</td>', 'A greatshot.  Nice timing on getting sunlight for your subject and a great sky for a backdrop.  Nicely composed.  Goo work.', '2006-01-26 00:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085649, 276052, 41522, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  The stong off-centre view makes for an interesting composition.  The selective desat. does a really god job to attract the eye to her face.  Not sure if this would have been as good without the slective desat.  Good work.</td>', 'I really like this.  The stong off-centre view makes for an interesting composition.  The selective desat. does a really god job to attract the eye to her face.  Not sure if this would have been as good without the slective desat.  Good work.', '2006-01-26 00:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
