(2085886, 280721, 29269, '<td valign="top">Hmm, nice photo but-<br/>You titled it ''reflection'' and the primary object (that tower) is not reflected in the water. You have a couple of reflections of the rocks in the water, and a few clouds. The tower is in the middle of the composition, but yet uninteresting and taking way too little space to be analyzed deeper. Same goes for the tractor. Average.</td>', 'Hmm, nice photo but-You titled it ''reflection'' and the primary object (that tower) is not reflected in the water. You have a couple of reflections of the rocks in the water, and a few clouds. The tower is in the middle of the composition, but yet uninteresting and taking way too little space to be analyzed deeper. Same goes for the tractor. Average.', '2006-01-26 01:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085894, 279525, 29269, '<td valign="top">I don''t think that vignetting effect added to this otherwise very nice photo. I''ll ignore the corners and score it high for what the out-of-camera must have looked like.</td>', 'I don''t think that vignetting effect added to this otherwise very nice photo. I''ll ignore the corners and score it high for what the out-of-camera must have looked like.', '2006-01-26 01:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
