(2086875, 275974, 38032, '<td valign="top">People at dpc like to say that centered images are not as good as images that are using the rule of thirds - this is arguable in theory and on this photo ...  I''m not really sure - but i think this might be both -  if cropped just a smidge tighter  - the lighting is great and the bird and tailfeathers are interesting and detailed  -- I''ve found these birds to be quite cooperative in photos :)   7</td>', 'People at dpc like to say that centered images are not as good as images that are using the rule of thirds - this is arguable in theory and on this photo ...  I''m not really sure - but i think this might be both -  if cropped just a smidge tighter  - the lighting is great and the bird and tailfeathers are interesting and detailed  -- I''ve found these birds to be quite cooperative in photos :)   7', '2006-01-26 07:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
