(2088337, 276940, 5885, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and detail and exposure is outstanding. Composition is a bit week IMO, but then again I''m not real fond of "landscapes". Gonna keep my personal tastes out of it though and give you the score I believe you have earned. 9 from me, good job! Oh, hell why not, make it a 10!</td>', 'Wonderful color and detail and exposure is outstanding. Composition is a bit week IMO, but then again I''m not real fond of "landscapes". Gonna keep my personal tastes out of it though and give you the score I believe you have earned. 9 from me, good job! Oh, hell why not, make it a 10!', '2006-01-26 13:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
