(2088383, 281813, 43434, '<td valign="top">Like the countryside here, and she seems quite in focus, nice shot.</td>', 'Like the countryside here, and she seems quite in focus, nice shot.', '2006-01-26 14:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2088395, 281504, 43434, '<td valign="top">Almost a surreal picture.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Almost a surreal picture.  Nice capture.', '2006-01-26 14:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2088398, 281964, 5885, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but am slightly turned off by the shadows on the white BG (sorry, big pet peeve of mine). Moving the subject away from the wall (I''m guessing that''s what it is) would have helped eliminate this.  Also, the shadow under her face is a bit harsh. I''d recommend foil, facing up toward her face, be placed at about chest level for this type of shot. <br/> <br/>Overall, other technicals look pretty good and I love the composition, style and makeup.</td>', 'I like this photo, but am slightly turned off by the shadows on the white BG (sorry, big pet peeve of mine). Moving the subject away from the wall (I''m guessing that''s what it is) would have helped eliminate this.  Also, the shadow under her face is a bit harsh. I''d recommend foil, facing up toward her face, be placed at about chest level for this type of shot.  Overall, other technicals look pretty good and I love the composition, style and makeup.', '2006-01-26 14:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2088400, 280769, 43434, '<td valign="top">Interesting caputure but I am lost as to the actual focus of the picutre, is it the bird of the water?</td>', 'Interesting caputure but I am lost as to the actual focus of the picutre, is it the bird of the water?', '2006-01-26 14:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
