(2088409, 280809, 5885, '<td valign="top">Wow, the technicals alone in this shot impress me. Such sharp crisp detail and wonderful exposure. B&amp;W treatment is extraordinary. Very wonderful portrait! 10!</td>', 'Wow, the technicals alone in this shot impress me. Such sharp crisp detail and wonderful exposure. B&W treatment is extraordinary. Very wonderful portrait! 10!', '2006-01-26 14:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
