(2088491, 277511, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette, however, right away when I saw this shot I noticed there was something "wrong" with it.  I didn´t see the extra legs till after viewing for about 30 seconds, I suspect many people miss it :)  Anyway, nice work, you got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Nice silhouette, however, right away when I saw this shot I noticed there was something "wrong" with it.  I didn´t see the extra legs till after viewing for about 30 seconds, I suspect many people miss it :)  Anyway, nice work, you got a 7 from me.', '2006-01-26 14:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2088492, 278337, 43434, '<td valign="top">You have missed on opportunity of maximise the potential of this shot with it being so small.  It would have had much more impact if it had been 640 on one side.  I like the DOF used. I think that the size will cause people to mark it down though. :(</td>', 'You have missed on opportunity of maximise the potential of this shot with it being so small.  It would have had much more impact if it had been 640 on one side.  I like the DOF used. I think that the size will cause people to mark it down though. :(', '2006-01-26 14:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
