(2090056, 275621, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very sharp.  The wood detail is excellent, and the water does not have the broken look that many images of water do.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very sharp.  The wood detail is excellent, and the water does not have the broken look that many images of water do.  Nice job.', '2006-01-26 22:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
