(2090059, 277758, 43434, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  The details in it are a little lost, is that due to movement, it makes everything look silky.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  The details in it are a little lost, is that due to movement, it makes everything look silky.', '2006-01-26 22:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
