(2090063, 281100, 11854, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. I know the splash is the focus of the picture, but I would have liked it better if her head wasn''t cut off.</td>', 'Nice colors. I know the splash is the focus of the picture, but I would have liked it better if her head wasn''t cut off.', '2006-01-26 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
