(2092189, 281225, 47933, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo and subject. I like the shadowing in the right of the frame but the one on the left sort of distracts from the composition. Very nice. 8</td>', 'Gorgeous photo and subject. I like the shadowing in the right of the frame but the one on the left sort of distracts from the composition. Very nice. 8', '2006-01-27 12:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
