(2093111, 277667, 2780, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this is far too saturated to the point of looking unrealistic.</td>', 'In my opinion this is far too saturated to the point of looking unrealistic.', '2006-01-27 18:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093112, 281641, 30392, '<td valign="top">yes! I love this one. I like the simplicity and the barren feeling. the title is spot on!</td>', 'yes! I love this one. I like the simplicity and the barren feeling. the title is spot on!', '2006-01-27 18:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093113, 276745, 2780, '<td valign="top">And a very nice one at that! The eyes are captures really well and I love the high key lighting.</td>', 'And a very nice one at that! The eyes are captures really well and I love the high key lighting.', '2006-01-27 18:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093115, 280493, 41337, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot. I like the pose and composition. I guess some might find her head looking too big given the wide angle but it doesn''t bother me too much. The one thing I don''t really care for is the treatment of the grass which looks too painterly-like. If the whole image was like that it wouldn''t be a big deal.</td>', 'An interesting shot. I like the pose and composition. I guess some might find her head looking too big given the wide angle but it doesn''t bother me too much. The one thing I don''t really care for is the treatment of the grass which looks too painterly-like. If the whole image was like that it wouldn''t be a big deal.', '2006-01-27 18:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093116, 279776, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been useful to use a polariser to get rid of the reflections in the glass, because other than that it''s a nice photo.</td>', 'I think it would have been useful to use a polariser to get rid of the reflections in the glass, because other than that it''s a nice photo.', '2006-01-27 18:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093117, 280923, 3032, '<td valign="top">Excellent catch, the tower in the background is like one from a fairytale. I need to go back there one day, it is a lovely town for photography, especially outside the busy tourist hours.</td>', 'Excellent catch, the tower in the background is like one from a fairytale. I need to go back there one day, it is a lovely town for photography, especially outside the busy tourist hours.', '2006-01-27 18:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093118, 280112, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very unique loooking. Bumping up.</td>', 'Very unique loooking. Bumping up.', '2006-01-27 18:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093120, 278337, 2780, '<td valign="top">In my opinion the composition is too centered and the focus is too soft. The colours also seem a little flat and the image size would be better off making use of the full 640 pixels.</td>', 'In my opinion the composition is too centered and the focus is too soft. The colours also seem a little flat and the image size would be better off making use of the full 640 pixels.', '2006-01-27 18:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093122, 281524, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! I''m not a fan of the border but since the photo here is so good I''ll give it a 10 anyway!</td>', 'Excellent shot! I''m not a fan of the border but since the photo here is so good I''ll give it a 10 anyway!', '2006-01-27 18:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093123, 276802, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the lines and the bright red colour. Including ther ferrari logo would have been a nice finishing touch.</td>', 'I like the lines and the bright red colour. Including ther ferrari logo would have been a nice finishing touch.', '2006-01-27 18:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093124, 275330, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and DoF here, the colours really pop nicely. Really nice shot,</td>', 'Great contrast and DoF here, the colours really pop nicely. Really nice shot,', '2006-01-27 18:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093125, 276754, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and detail in the feathers. Nice shot.</td>', 'Great contrast and detail in the feathers. Nice shot.', '2006-01-27 18:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093128, 281779, 2780, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast here, it adds a lot of drama, as does the motion blur. 10</td>', 'I love the contrast here, it adds a lot of drama, as does the motion blur. 10', '2006-01-27 19:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093129, 280582, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love it.</td>', 'Great shot, I love it.', '2006-01-27 19:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093131, 279632, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the leading lines, and the levels are nicely balanced here too. Just nothing really in the shot that holds my interest a lot.</td>', 'I like the composition with the leading lines, and the levels are nicely balanced here too. Just nothing really in the shot that holds my interest a lot.', '2006-01-27 19:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093132, 280499, 2780, '<td valign="top">Wow I love this! 10</td>', 'Wow I love this! 10', '2006-01-27 19:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093133, 274718, 3032, '<td valign="top">You see this face, relatively old and full of grooves and grey hairs. He must have experienced a lot by now and the dirt on his face suggest that he is working with cattle this moment and it is a hard job. But the look is a bit fearsome, like he can combat a raging bull anytime but fears to be photographed. The only other emotion that comes to mind is sadness, like he just lost someone or a calf.<br/> <br/>Great portrait, well lit, good toning, good composition.</td>', 'You see this face, relatively old and full of grooves and grey hairs. He must have experienced a lot by now and the dirt on his face suggest that he is working with cattle this moment and it is a hard job. But the look is a bit fearsome, like he can combat a raging bull anytime but fears to be photographed. The only other emotion that comes to mind is sadness, like he just lost someone or a calf. Great portrait, well lit, good toning, good composition.', '2006-01-27 19:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093137, 276219, 30392, '<td valign="top">WOW, holy crap! this one just stands out so much. I''ve voted  on 44% at the moment and it''s by far the best shot I''ve seen. 10 and I''ll come back when i''m 100%</td>', 'WOW, holy crap! this one just stands out so much. I''ve voted  on 44% at the moment and it''s by far the best shot I''ve seen. 10 and I''ll come back when i''m 100%', '2006-01-27 19:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093139, 274611, 30392, '<td valign="top">One of the best shot in this challenge, should be top 10!</td>', 'One of the best shot in this challenge, should be top 10!', '2006-01-27 19:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093140, 281438, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting and the post-processing make this portrait seem a little flat and <i>slighly</i> snapshotty.</td>', 'I think the lighting and the post-processing make this portrait seem a little flat and slighly snapshotty.', '2006-01-27 19:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093142, 280499, 30392, '<td valign="top">ribbon!! I''ve voted on 98% and this pic stands out</td>', 'ribbon!! I''ve voted on 98% and this pic stands out', '2006-01-27 19:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
