(2093281, 278097, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the composition is a bit too centered, but I like the use of shallow DoF.</td>', 'I think the composition is a bit too centered, but I like the use of shallow DoF.', '2006-01-27 20:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
