(2093637, 281973, 20330, '<td valign="top">i love all the little stars! nice texture. 9</td>', 'i love all the little stars! nice texture. 9', '2006-01-27 22:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093644, 276713, 18552, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and sense of motion in your picture.</td>', 'I love the colors and sense of motion in your picture.', '2006-01-27 22:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093647, 280809, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is really an excellent portrait. How I wish it wasn''t the style to cut off the top of the subject''s head in portraits.</td>', 'This is really an excellent portrait. How I wish it wasn''t the style to cut off the top of the subject''s head in portraits.', '2006-01-27 22:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093651, 277201, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is cool - almost looks like it could have been taken on Mars instead of earth.</td>', 'This is cool - almost looks like it could have been taken on Mars instead of earth.', '2006-01-27 22:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093656, 279372, 18552, '<td valign="top">How cute! I love their outfits. They look like grown ups in miniature. Great candid shot.</td>', 'How cute! I love their outfits. They look like grown ups in miniature. Great candid shot.', '2006-01-27 22:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093658, 279948, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The composition, colours, lighting, bokeh all excellent.</td>', 'Great shot. The composition, colours, lighting, bokeh all excellent.', '2006-01-27 22:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093662, 280464, 10867, '<td valign="top">This is basically a pleasing image, but the cyan colour cast detracts from it.  Have you tried removing the colour cast using levels, or colour balance or selective colour (PS CS2) or their equivalents in another piece of software?  It should be relatively easy to do, and your image be much improved--in my opinion, anyway.</td>', 'This is basically a pleasing image, but the cyan colour cast detracts from it.  Have you tried removing the colour cast using levels, or colour balance or selective colour (PS CS2) or their equivalents in another piece of software?  It should be relatively easy to do, and your image be much improved--in my opinion, anyway.', '2006-01-27 22:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093663, 280237, 2780, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the centered composition works well here, but the contrast between the green and the red looks good.</td>', 'I''m not sure the centered composition works well here, but the contrast between the green and the red looks good.', '2006-01-27 22:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093666, 278877, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. Took a while to spot the people but it''s subtle things like that which makes a good photo great.</td>', 'Really nice shot. Took a while to spot the people but it''s subtle things like that which makes a good photo great.', '2006-01-27 22:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093669, 280198, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really great shot. He stands out so well against the background. Lovely.</td>', 'Really great shot. He stands out so well against the background. Lovely.', '2006-01-27 22:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093671, 279724, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I''ve tried taking photos of these shows before and it''s harder than it looks!</td>', 'Nice capture. I''ve tried taking photos of these shows before and it''s harder than it looks!', '2006-01-27 22:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093674, 275223, 18552, '<td valign="top">How beautiful. The castle and sky are fantastic.</td>', 'How beautiful. The castle and sky are fantastic.', '2006-01-27 22:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093677, 279465, 2780, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, I really like it. I wish there was just a little off the top and a little more at the bottom tho.</td>', 'Lovely photo, I really like it. I wish there was just a little off the top and a little more at the bottom tho.', '2006-01-27 22:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093679, 280784, 2780, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice to make this sepia. I''m undecided on whether I think it works or not, but I do like the lighting.</td>', 'Interesting choice to make this sepia. I''m undecided on whether I think it works or not, but I do like the lighting.', '2006-01-27 22:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093683, 276840, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice colours but seems a little soft overall. I think a USM would work wonders with this shot.</td>', 'Really nice colours but seems a little soft overall. I think a USM would work wonders with this shot.', '2006-01-27 22:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093684, 281926, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like how all the colours match. I think it looks slightly too bright tho, perhaps increasing contrast will help give it more impact.</td>', 'I like how all the colours match. I think it looks slightly too bright tho, perhaps increasing contrast will help give it more impact.', '2006-01-27 22:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093687, 276207, 2780, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, 10. I hope you share a large version of this after the challenge so we can see all the detail!</td>', 'Fantastic, 10. I hope you share a large version of this after the challenge so we can see all the detail!', '2006-01-27 22:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093688, 276521, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good use of selective desaturation. 8</td>', 'Good use of selective desaturation. 8', '2006-01-27 22:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093689, 279645, 2780, '<td valign="top">The halos around the train look to have come from using USM with a radius too high. Try it with 0.3 or 0.4 for this sized photo.</td>', 'The halos around the train look to have come from using USM with a radius too high. Try it with 0.3 or 0.4 for this sized photo.', '2006-01-27 22:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093692, 276545, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot, made me look twice!</td>', 'Great shot, made me look twice!', '2006-01-27 22:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093694, 278859, 2780, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen on the border but I really like the strong lighting contrast.</td>', 'I''m not keen on the border but I really like the strong lighting contrast.', '2006-01-27 22:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093699, 276736, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouettes and nice colours here. Well composed too.</td>', 'Nice silhouettes and nice colours here. Well composed too.', '2006-01-27 22:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093700, 280858, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the use of grain here but I dislike the border. A simple thinner black or white one would have looked much better I think.</td>', 'I like the use of grain here but I dislike the border. A simple thinner black or white one would have looked much better I think.', '2006-01-27 22:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093702, 281602, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the horizon should be leveled by rotating CCW a little, and also the contrast should be increased to get the silhouette black rather than grey as it is now.</td>', 'I think the horizon should be leveled by rotating CCW a little, and also the contrast should be increased to get the silhouette black rather than grey as it is now.', '2006-01-27 22:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093703, 275994, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and the high contrast here, nice job.</td>', 'I like the simplicity and the high contrast here, nice job.', '2006-01-27 22:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093704, 278217, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, but I would have liked to see the whole of the text in the shot uncropped. I also find the out of focus mirror(?) to be a bit distracting in front of his face.</td>', 'Nice portrait, but I would have liked to see the whole of the text in the shot uncropped. I also find the out of focus mirror(?) to be a bit distracting in front of his face.', '2006-01-27 22:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093706, 278359, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice unique portrait, but seems a little flat to me. Try increasing the contrast a bit.</td>', 'Nice unique portrait, but seems a little flat to me. Try increasing the contrast a bit.', '2006-01-27 22:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093708, 277956, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great timing to capture such nice detail in the wings. Really nice shot.</td>', 'Great timing to capture such nice detail in the wings. Really nice shot.', '2006-01-27 22:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093711, 274852, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is just so lovely. It really does look like the perfect scene for a Christmas card.</td>', 'This is just so lovely. It really does look like the perfect scene for a Christmas card.', '2006-01-27 22:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093712, 281894, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice work here! Is it infrared? Whatever it is, I love it! 10</td>', 'Really nice work here! Is it infrared? Whatever it is, I love it! 10', '2006-01-27 22:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093713, 277497, 2780, '<td valign="top">Seems a little soft overall, and the composition is a bit cluttered, but it looks like a nice scene.</td>', 'Seems a little soft overall, and the composition is a bit cluttered, but it looks like a nice scene.', '2006-01-27 22:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093715, 279842, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the high key lighting and how it has made a pattern on her face. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the high key lighting and how it has made a pattern on her face. Nice shot.', '2006-01-27 22:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093717, 280366, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I love the warm tones and the beam of light hitting the man. 10</td>', 'Excellent! I love the warm tones and the beam of light hitting the man. 10', '2006-01-27 22:46:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2093719, 280323, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a bit dark overall, and I would have cropped the post off on the right, but other than that it''s a nice composition with a nice burst of colour in the clouds.</td>', 'I think it''s a bit dark overall, and I would have cropped the post off on the right, but other than that it''s a nice composition with a nice burst of colour in the clouds.', '2006-01-27 22:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093721, 277764, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice capture! I especially like the rainbow in there! Great!</td>', 'Really nice capture! I especially like the rainbow in there! Great!', '2006-01-27 22:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093725, 274775, 2780, '<td valign="top">Lovely silhouette and great colours. 9</td>', 'Lovely silhouette and great colours. 9', '2006-01-27 22:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093727, 280517, 2780, '<td valign="top">Awww really cute photo! The colours seem slightly washed out but a tiny increase in contrast in PP would help that no problemo.</td>', 'Awww really cute photo! The colours seem slightly washed out but a tiny increase in contrast in PP would help that no problemo.', '2006-01-27 22:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093728, 277985, 2780, '<td valign="top">Seems a little too cluttered in my opinion, and the composition a bit too central, but I like the colours and the light.</td>', 'Seems a little too cluttered in my opinion, and the composition a bit too central, but I like the colours and the light.', '2006-01-27 22:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093729, 281526, 34309, '<td valign="top">This is ubelievable!!!!!!!!!!<br/>i love it!!!!! Dont know what else to say!!!!<br/>This is a "10 pointer":)</td>', 'This is ubelievable!!!!!!!!!!i love it!!!!! Dont know what else to say!!!!This is a "10 pointer":)', '2006-01-27 22:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093731, 274926, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice use of long exposure to get the water looking smoothe. I think it seems a bit bright overall though.</td>', 'Nice use of long exposure to get the water looking smoothe. I think it seems a bit bright overall though.', '2006-01-27 22:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093733, 276964, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent colour, contrast, and DoF here. 9</td>', 'Excellent colour, contrast, and DoF here. 9', '2006-01-27 22:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093735, 276960, 2780, '<td valign="top">I feel the wheel is too close to the edge of the frame, but I like the high contrast B&amp;W work.</td>', 'I feel the wheel is too close to the edge of the frame, but I like the high contrast B&W work.', '2006-01-27 22:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093739, 281265, 2780, '<td valign="top">Sensational night shot! The blue tones and the great contrast are what really makes it! I''ve never seen one with such a great sky as this either. 10</td>', 'Sensational night shot! The blue tones and the great contrast are what really makes it! I''ve never seen one with such a great sky as this either. 10', '2006-01-27 22:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093742, 274769, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice simplicity and a good title to make people take a second look! Good work.</td>', 'Nice simplicity and a good title to make people take a second look! Good work.', '2006-01-27 22:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093747, 279649, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot, but seems a bit bright! The concept and DoF are really well done, but I just feel a shorter exposure time would have made it so much better, to stop the shirts being blown out.</td>', 'Really nice shot, but seems a bit bright! The concept and DoF are really well done, but I just feel a shorter exposure time would have made it so much better, to stop the shirts being blown out.', '2006-01-27 22:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093750, 281760, 34309, '<td valign="top">What a detail and precision!!<br/>You captures this drgonfly beautifully!!<br/>Well done:)</td>', 'What a detail and precision!!You captures this drgonfly beautifully!!Well done:)', '2006-01-27 22:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093752, 275177, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really bright colours here, maybe a tad too vibrant? I like the composition though with the leading lines, and the reflection is really nice.</td>', 'Really bright colours here, maybe a tad too vibrant? I like the composition though with the leading lines, and the reflection is really nice.', '2006-01-27 22:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093753, 281896, 34309, '<td valign="top">This is how I think heaven is going to look like!!<br/>I love the bird in the foreground!!<br/>Absolutely beautiful!!!!</td>', 'This is how I think heaven is going to look like!!I love the bird in the foreground!!Absolutely beautiful!!!!', '2006-01-27 22:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093757, 281315, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent B&amp;W work. I think USM very lightly would perfect this, as I think it''s currently slightly soft.</td>', 'Excellent B&W work. I think USM very lightly would perfect this, as I think it''s currently slightly soft.', '2006-01-27 22:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093758, 275399, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice macro with good use of DoF, however I find the highlights on the wing a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice macro with good use of DoF, however I find the highlights on the wing a bit distracting.', '2006-01-27 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093763, 276417, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice lighting, and the centered composition works well in my opinion. Lovely colours too.</td>', 'Really nice lighting, and the centered composition works well in my opinion. Lovely colours too.', '2006-01-27 22:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093766, 280712, 2780, '<td valign="top">Slightly soft overall, but I like the high contrast and composition with the reflection.</td>', 'Slightly soft overall, but I like the high contrast and composition with the reflection.', '2006-01-27 22:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093770, 275323, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the border slightly overshadows the photo, but the photo is very good when you realise you''re meant to look at it! The mistiness adds a good sense of mystery and them both looking to the left adds to that too.</td>', 'I think the border slightly overshadows the photo, but the photo is very good when you realise you''re meant to look at it! The mistiness adds a good sense of mystery and them both looking to the left adds to that too.', '2006-01-27 22:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093773, 275288, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good use of DoF here, and you captured so much detail. Nice shot.</td>', 'Good use of DoF here, and you captured so much detail. Nice shot.', '2006-01-27 22:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093778, 281605, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. I love the blue tones. I feel maybe there''s a little too much empty space at the bottom though, making the boats too centered and the overall photo a little "top-heavy".</td>', 'This is really nice. I love the blue tones. I feel maybe there''s a little too much empty space at the bottom though, making the boats too centered and the overall photo a little "top-heavy".', '2006-01-27 22:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093781, 277109, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great DoF but it''s a shame about the overexposure at the top. Really nice vibrant colours though!</td>', 'Great DoF but it''s a shame about the overexposure at the top. Really nice vibrant colours though!', '2006-01-27 22:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093784, 281606, 2780, '<td valign="top">I love the harsh lighting here, and the detail you''ve captured is great. Really good shot! 9</td>', 'I love the harsh lighting here, and the detail you''ve captured is great. Really good shot! 9', '2006-01-27 22:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093788, 281731, 2780, '<td valign="top">I love this, except for the slight over-exposure. I imagine it was tough conditions for exposing correctly though! I like the upwards view rather than the standard ''forward-light beams'' view. It makes an interesting swirl pattern.</td>', 'I love this, except for the slight over-exposure. I imagine it was tough conditions for exposing correctly though! I like the upwards view rather than the standard ''forward-light beams'' view. It makes an interesting swirl pattern.', '2006-01-27 22:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093790, 281460, 2780, '<td valign="top">I love the emptiness and the dreariness of this shot. Really nicely done.</td>', 'I love the emptiness and the dreariness of this shot. Really nicely done.', '2006-01-27 23:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093793, 277621, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! The framing by the trees, the colour, the symmetry, all make this worthy of more than a 10. But I''m afraid a 10 is all I can give you. Oh, and a fav.</td>', 'Excellent shot! The framing by the trees, the colour, the symmetry, all make this worthy of more than a 10. But I''m afraid a 10 is all I can give you. Oh, and a fav.', '2006-01-27 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093796, 274549, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice study of shape and the lighting excentuates the shape too, nicely done. Maybe not much to hold interest for long but it''s a good abstract piece.</td>', 'Nice study of shape and the lighting excentuates the shape too, nicely done. Maybe not much to hold interest for long but it''s a good abstract piece.', '2006-01-27 23:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093797, 274568, 27164, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colors and complimentary border.  Great detail as well.</td>', 'Nice bright colors and complimentary border.  Great detail as well.', '2006-01-27 23:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093799, 279674, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a really great shot. The DoF is perfect and the composition is too. 10</td>', 'This is a really great shot. The DoF is perfect and the composition is too. 10', '2006-01-27 23:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093801, 276959, 2780, '<td valign="top">What the hell kind of a bike is that?! lol :) Really nice shot, I love the blue&gt;yellow colours and the mist. I wish that one light wasnt directly above his head but still a great shot. 9</td>', 'What the hell kind of a bike is that?! lol :) Really nice shot, I love the blue>yellow colours and the mist. I wish that one light wasnt directly above his head but still a great shot. 9', '2006-01-27 23:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093802, 274894, 27164, '<td valign="top">Nice rural image, I really like the composition here and the purple color of the flowers contrasted with the bleak light yellow colors of desolation.</td>', 'Nice rural image, I really like the composition here and the purple color of the flowers contrasted with the bleak light yellow colors of desolation.', '2006-01-27 23:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093807, 274594, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is the last photo I came to vote on, where I am leaving my 830th comment! Actually I''ve left more but a few photos have been DQd along the way! :)<br/> <br/>I like the simplicity of the composition, compared to the amount of detail in the textures of the shack. I think the colours maybe slightly too saturated, but thats just personal preference. I think this would have looked good in B&amp;W with really high contrast, but that would be the obvious choice! I like how you''ve chosen to do the exact opposite and create a bright colourful piece. Nice work.<br/> <br/>"You have commented on 830 of 830 images (100%) in this challenge."</td>', 'This is the last photo I came to vote on, where I am leaving my 830th comment! Actually I''ve left more but a few photos have been DQd along the way! :) I like the simplicity of the composition, compared to the amount of detail in the textures of the shack. I think the colours maybe slightly too saturated, but thats just personal preference. I think this would have looked good in B&W with really high contrast, but that would be the obvious choice! I like how you''ve chosen to do the exact opposite and create a bright colourful piece. Nice work. "You have commented on 830 of 830 images (100%) in this challenge."', '2006-01-27 23:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093808, 281933, 27164, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but I wish the Parthenon and surrounding rubble weren''t so mid-tone grey.  I think that in post-processing you should have selected just the stone and lightened it up so as not to blow out the sky.  This is a nice shot with great composition but I think it could greatly benefit from a bump in contrast.</td>', 'Nice image, but I wish the Parthenon and surrounding rubble weren''t so mid-tone grey.  I think that in post-processing you should have selected just the stone and lightened it up so as not to blow out the sky.  This is a nice shot with great composition but I think it could greatly benefit from a bump in contrast.', '2006-01-27 23:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093868, 280937, 25355, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many people will miss seeing the person there.</td>', 'I wonder how many people will miss seeing the person there.', '2006-01-27 23:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093900, 280484, 23561, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see more of her face. I like the blue hue. 9</td>', 'I wish I could see more of her face. I like the blue hue. 9', '2006-01-27 23:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093902, 281547, 25355, '<td valign="top">Very weird-looking insect, but then - a lot of insect look weird! Nice tonal range with the green background and complementary colours in the legs.</td>', 'Very weird-looking insect, but then - a lot of insect look weird! Nice tonal range with the green background and complementary colours in the legs.', '2006-01-27 23:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093935, 281626, 25355, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I suspect bobster. I''m probably wrong, of course. An interesting landmark, to say the least!</td>', 'For some reason, I suspect bobster. I''m probably wrong, of course. An interesting landmark, to say the least!', '2006-01-27 23:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093938, 281919, 23561, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I''m just an amature, so I may not be sure what I''m saying here, but this is what I think. I like the texture in the clouds, the sunbeams, and how that last bit of sun is making the tip of the tower glow. The way the clouds flow really pull you into the picture, the past the glowing tower and off to that last ray of sun that you don''t want to set. This is the kind of picture I want to capable of. Very good work. 10</td>', 'I really like this. I''m just an amature, so I may not be sure what I''m saying here, but this is what I think. I like the texture in the clouds, the sunbeams, and how that last bit of sun is making the tip of the tower glow. The way the clouds flow really pull you into the picture, the past the glowing tower and off to that last ray of sun that you don''t want to set. This is the kind of picture I want to capable of. Very good work. 10', '2006-01-27 23:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093942, 281946, 23561, '<td valign="top">Different...</td>', 'Different...', '2006-01-27 23:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093951, 280198, 25355, '<td valign="top">While the black and white gives this an old-world charm, I''d love to see this in colour. Excellent composition, well done.</td>', 'While the black and white gives this an old-world charm, I''d love to see this in colour. Excellent composition, well done.', '2006-01-27 23:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093960, 278093, 47402, '<td valign="top">Picture is so small it is hard to see any detail.</td>', 'Picture is so small it is hard to see any detail.', '2006-01-27 23:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093963, 275968, 23561, '<td valign="top">Are those eyes really blue? I might have center the horse more, but I like the stop-action. 9</td>', 'Are those eyes really blue? I might have center the horse more, but I like the stop-action. 9', '2006-01-27 23:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093972, 277764, 25754, '<td valign="top">A wonderful moment and great frozen water action. The girl at the far end really makes this shot.</td>', 'A wonderful moment and great frozen water action. The girl at the far end really makes this shot.', '2006-01-27 23:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2094096, 277621, 23561, '<td valign="top">What a catch. Was this luck, of did you stake out where the deer normally visit? 10 from me.</td>', 'What a catch. Was this luck, of did you stake out where the deer normally visit? 10 from me.', '2006-01-28 00:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
