(2096131, 281090, 43115, '<td valign="top">As a stand-alone photo it is interesting, but not stellar.<br/> <br/>However, the title DRAWS me in... Is this <i>his</i> last Christmas?  Is he sick?  Is he dieing?  He does look a little pale.  Hmm...  Now I''m really thinking about it.<br/> <br/>Good job.  A wonderful example of how important the title can be.</td>', 'As a stand-alone photo it is interesting, but not stellar. However, the title DRAWS me in... Is this his last Christmas?  Is he sick?  Is he dieing?  He does look a little pale.  Hmm...  Now I''m really thinking about it. Good job.  A wonderful example of how important the title can be.', '2006-01-28 20:29:07.000000', NULL, 1);
