(2096601, 282007, 19978, '<td valign="top">Shots like this make me crazy. Can such talent really exist? Can you really capture a shot like this? Yes you can. I''m guessing this was moonlit, and I''m suspicious that I know the photographer too. Whatever, this is a stunner. One of my few 10s for this challenge. I''ll be looking this one up right after voting ends - if it''s not already on the front page, of course...</td>', 'Shots like this make me crazy. Can such talent really exist? Can you really capture a shot like this? Yes you can. I''m guessing this was moonlit, and I''m suspicious that I know the photographer too. Whatever, this is a stunner. One of my few 10s for this challenge. I''ll be looking this one up right after voting ends - if it''s not already on the front page, of course...', '2006-01-28 22:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
