(2097154, 279195, 30490, '<td valign="top">She is quite the cutie!  Normally shots this small get my little pat instructions about reading the tutorial about posting photos to DPC, and using all of the image size available to contestents.  (Consider it said) This shot even though it is very small and tough to see the detail, caught my eye.  There is a charm about this little girl that comes through loud and clear.  I am going to give this a 6 because I believe this image if larger would really impress me.  Please repost after the challenge to your portfolio a larger version of this image!</td>', 'She is quite the cutie!  Normally shots this small get my little pat instructions about reading the tutorial about posting photos to DPC, and using all of the image size available to contestents.  (Consider it said) This shot even though it is very small and tough to see the detail, caught my eye.  There is a charm about this little girl that comes through loud and clear.  I am going to give this a 6 because I believe this image if larger would really impress me.  Please repost after the challenge to your portfolio a larger version of this image!', '2006-01-29 02:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
