(2097431, 274635, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Santorini. This place has such a potential for photographers. I would have concentrated on a smaller part of the labirynth of architecture. This looks a bit cluttered. It does have some nice aspects - the diagonal line of blue spires. You could have gotten away with a bit of burning in some more shadows, it looks a bit hot. 7</td>', 'Beautiful Santorini. This place has such a potential for photographers. I would have concentrated on a smaller part of the labirynth of architecture. This looks a bit cluttered. It does have some nice aspects - the diagonal line of blue spires. You could have gotten away with a bit of burning in some more shadows, it looks a bit hot. 7', '2006-01-29 04:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097433, 275943, 10275, '<td valign="top">Lovely, just lovely!</td>', 'Lovely, just lovely!', '2006-01-29 04:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097440, 281326, 10275, '<td valign="top">Scene with a lot of potential, even on what looks like a dull day. In this case, it would have been better to exclude more of the sky and concentrate on the shapes of the land. Also, tripod is very important on days like this one. Your photo suffers from blur. Colour should be tiny bit boosted as well to compensate for the dullness due to the weather. You could have made it more moody.</td>', 'Scene with a lot of potential, even on what looks like a dull day. In this case, it would have been better to exclude more of the sky and concentrate on the shapes of the land. Also, tripod is very important on days like this one. Your photo suffers from blur. Colour should be tiny bit boosted as well to compensate for the dullness due to the weather. You could have made it more moody.', '2006-01-29 04:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
