(2097461, 281436, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very nice attempt. Lovely soft lighting. For a nature shot, you really need the foreground sharp and let the softness fall further into the image. If you are after shallow depth of field, than focus on the foreground and let the background go soft - much more pleasing effect.</td>', 'Very nice attempt. Lovely soft lighting. For a nature shot, you really need the foreground sharp and let the softness fall further into the image. If you are after shallow depth of field, than focus on the foreground and let the background go soft - much more pleasing effect.', '2006-01-29 05:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
