(2097523, 280870, 29904, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky,lines, texture, and contrast!  I''m thinking it may have been better with the sun blocked out all together if possible.  I seems overexposed (of coarse) and distracting.  Otherwise, love this!</td>', 'Beautiful sky,lines, texture, and contrast!  I''m thinking it may have been better with the sun blocked out all together if possible.  I seems overexposed (of coarse) and distracting.  Otherwise, love this!', '2006-01-29 05:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097528, 281627, 29904, '<td valign="top">You could tilt this a degree clockwise, it feels off.  The sun is quite blinding, but then I''m still working on how to control that one myself.  Try closing down your aperature if you can and expose darker, then post-process lighten selectively.  So glad you''re in a happy place :)</td>', 'You could tilt this a degree clockwise, it feels off.  The sun is quite blinding, but then I''m still working on how to control that one myself.  Try closing down your aperature if you can and expose darker, then post-process lighten selectively.  So glad you''re in a happy place :)', '2006-01-29 05:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
