(2097550, 274652, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool surreal colours! The shoes are a bit too bright compared to the face. It seems to me you used a lot of dodge- and burning, so you might have lighted up tha face a bit. 9.</td>', 'Cool surreal colours! The shoes are a bit too bright compared to the face. It seems to me you used a lot of dodge- and burning, so you might have lighted up tha face a bit. 9.', '2006-01-29 06:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097552, 275479, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the dark mood here. The sky is really opressing. 9.</td>', 'I like the dark mood here. The sky is really opressing. 9.', '2006-01-29 06:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097553, 281875, 27845, '<td valign="top">The perpsective you chose, along with the monotone conversion, give your shot an abstract quality. I like how you focused on shapes an lightness tones. 9.</td>', 'The perpsective you chose, along with the monotone conversion, give your shot an abstract quality. I like how you focused on shapes an lightness tones. 9.', '2006-01-29 06:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097558, 279330, 27845, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s one of the best concert shots I''ve seen in quite a long time! I like how you managed to have both the action on stage and the audience''s reaction in the same image. What''s more, even the sky seems to think that this band rocks. The B/W conversion works well too. Excellent work. 10. Adding to favs.</td>', 'Wow, that''s one of the best concert shots I''ve seen in quite a long time! I like how you managed to have both the action on stage and the audience''s reaction in the same image. What''s more, even the sky seems to think that this band rocks. The B/W conversion works well too. Excellent work. 10. Adding to favs.', '2006-01-29 06:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097562, 274654, 27845, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting image. I like the distorting effect of the mirroring water surface.<br/>I''m also inerested in the noise in your image. It looks really good, I''d love to know how you created it. 10.</td>', 'This is a very interesting image. I like the distorting effect of the mirroring water surface.I''m also inerested in the noise in your image. It looks really good, I''d love to know how you created it. 10.', '2006-01-29 06:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097564, 276837, 46063, '<td valign="top">Superb! Congrats.</td>', 'Superb! Congrats.', '2006-01-29 06:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097565, 278462, 27845, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky. I like how the smooth clouds clash with the detoriated stone ruins of the castle. The plant on the far right is slightly distracting though. Good timing for the right light conditions! 10.</td>', 'Lovely sky. I like how the smooth clouds clash with the detoriated stone ruins of the castle. The plant on the far right is slightly distracting though. Good timing for the right light conditions! 10.', '2006-01-29 06:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097566, 278697, 27845, '<td valign="top">If you had cropped the image a bit tighter on the left and right, you would have emphasized the image''s abstract quality: it would have taken away all hints to determine where the leaf ends, thus creating much more impact. 8.</td>', 'If you had cropped the image a bit tighter on the left and right, you would have emphasized the image''s abstract quality: it would have taken away all hints to determine where the leaf ends, thus creating much more impact. 8.', '2006-01-29 06:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097568, 280955, 46063, '<td valign="top">I have the impression that he is thinking "Don''t let me too long in there"!<br/>Cute. Congrats.</td>', 'I have the impression that he is thinking "Don''t let me too long in there"!Cute. Congrats.', '2006-01-29 06:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
