(2097926, 281852, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition.  I like the perspective on the palm in the foreground and the interest in the sky.  This would be improved by leveling the horizon.  A little more contrast and saturation might also help a little.</td>', 'This is a nice composition.  I like the perspective on the palm in the foreground and the interest in the sky.  This would be improved by leveling the horizon.  A little more contrast and saturation might also help a little.', '2006-01-29 09:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097928, 275136, 30508, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  Very moody.  I love it.</td>', 'Stunning.  Very moody.  I love it.', '2006-01-29 09:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097929, 280860, 30508, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Lots of interest and well-framed.</td>', 'Great capture.  Lots of interest and well-framed.', '2006-01-29 09:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097932, 274995, 30508, '<td valign="top">Great view, great sky, great perspective.  As I look at this, the only thing I wish is that there was a little less of the lower right and a little more of the yellow boats in the bottom left (I like the pattern and repetition there).  Still magnificent, though.</td>', 'Great view, great sky, great perspective.  As I look at this, the only thing I wish is that there was a little less of the lower right and a little more of the yellow boats in the bottom left (I like the pattern and repetition there).  Still magnificent, though.', '2006-01-29 09:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097935, 277956, 30508, '<td valign="top">Great detail and depth of field.  A polarizer could have cut down the glare on the water a little more to help isolate the subject.</td>', 'Great detail and depth of field.  A polarizer could have cut down the glare on the water a little more to help isolate the subject.', '2006-01-29 09:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097938, 274611, 30508, '<td valign="top">Seen this one of yours before, but honestly, I never get tired of it.  Superb composition, great colors.  I like that you can see a little of the interior space so it doesn''t just look like an abstract frame.</td>', 'Seen this one of yours before, but honestly, I never get tired of it.  Superb composition, great colors.  I like that you can see a little of the interior space so it doesn''t just look like an abstract frame.', '2006-01-29 09:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097940, 276166, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and use of natural framing.  It''s not quite as sharp as I would like it, though.  Perhaps because of having to use a longer shutter speed to compensate for the dark lighting.  Also, a tighter crop might have helped a little bit.  This framing leaves me wondering a little whether this is a landscape with some ducks in it, or a photo of ducks in their surroundings.  It is kind of caught in between the two.</td>', 'Nice composition and use of natural framing.  It''s not quite as sharp as I would like it, though.  Perhaps because of having to use a longer shutter speed to compensate for the dark lighting.  Also, a tighter crop might have helped a little bit.  This framing leaves me wondering a little whether this is a landscape with some ducks in it, or a photo of ducks in their surroundings.  It is kind of caught in between the two.', '2006-01-29 09:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097943, 279625, 30508, '<td valign="top">I like this as an abstract, but I think it might have been better with a tighter crop to emphasize the abstract instead of trying to show the surroundings.  Also, it would have been better if you had posted it larger.</td>', 'I like this as an abstract, but I think it might have been better with a tighter crop to emphasize the abstract instead of trying to show the surroundings.  Also, it would have been better if you had posted it larger.', '2006-01-29 09:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097945, 281896, 48245, '<td valign="top">I like this picture but I wish the balloons came in better</td>', 'I like this picture but I wish the balloons came in better', '2006-01-29 09:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097949, 276106, 30508, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  Great model and great expression.  Perfect depth of feild, composition and use of color.  I am very jealous of your portrait skills!</td>', 'Stunning.  Great model and great expression.  Perfect depth of feild, composition and use of color.  I am very jealous of your portrait skills!', '2006-01-29 10:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097953, 278142, 30508, '<td valign="top">Great candid and very interesting subject.  I like the composition and how you''ve filled the frame with the subject.</td>', 'Great candid and very interesting subject.  I like the composition and how you''ve filled the frame with the subject.', '2006-01-29 10:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097958, 277617, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject and composition.  A longer shutter speed might have added some more softness to the water and given this a slightly less hard mood.</td>', 'Nice choice of subject and composition.  A longer shutter speed might have added some more softness to the water and given this a slightly less hard mood.', '2006-01-29 10:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097965, 276537, 30508, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the message of this.  There''s something, though, that I can''t quite put my finger on that doesn''t feel right.  It might be that the background tone is not different enough from the left side of her belly, so it doesn''t stand out quite as much as I would like.  Still a wonderful image, though.</td>', 'I like the composition and the message of this.  There''s something, though, that I can''t quite put my finger on that doesn''t feel right.  It might be that the background tone is not different enough from the left side of her belly, so it doesn''t stand out quite as much as I would like.  Still a wonderful image, though.', '2006-01-29 10:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097968, 281265, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very cool image.  I really like the washed out areas and high contrast.  I think it really adds to the mood.</td>', 'Very cool image.  I really like the washed out areas and high contrast.  I think it really adds to the mood.', '2006-01-29 10:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097973, 274654, 30508, '<td valign="top">Love it!  So simple, so subtle, yet so deep.  I love the grain -- it really creates the mood here.  I like the choice of color, too.</td>', 'Love it!  So simple, so subtle, yet so deep.  I love the grain -- it really creates the mood here.  I like the choice of color, too.', '2006-01-29 10:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097977, 280940, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and subject.  It seems like the focal plane is just a little off, but I like the shallow depth of field.</td>', 'Nice composition and subject.  It seems like the focal plane is just a little off, but I like the shallow depth of field.', '2006-01-29 10:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097985, 281885, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very intersting subject.  Good timing and control of lighting.  The background looks a little too separated from the subject as if it was done in post-processing instead of naturally.  The edges around the subject look just a little off.</td>', 'Very intersting subject.  Good timing and control of lighting.  The background looks a little too separated from the subject as if it was done in post-processing instead of naturally.  The edges around the subject look just a little off.', '2006-01-29 10:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097991, 277431, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject and very good control of the tonal range from those bright whites to the dark black in her hair.  I think you could have cropped off some of the top, and I would like to have seen all of her hands.  Still a wonderful image though.</td>', 'Very interesting subject and very good control of the tonal range from those bright whites to the dark black in her hair.  I think you could have cropped off some of the top, and I would like to have seen all of her hands.  Still a wonderful image though.', '2006-01-29 10:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097994, 281609, 30508, '<td valign="top">What an amazing image!  Wonderful.</td>', 'What an amazing image!  Wonderful.', '2006-01-29 10:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097995, 280198, 1041, '<td valign="top">Composition and subject matter are just fantastic.  I like the man''s stance.  Is he in bare feet?  One of those pictures that can open up a lot of questions in your mind and keep the viewer engaged beyond just the beautiful image itself.</td>', 'Composition and subject matter are just fantastic.  I like the man''s stance.  Is he in bare feet?  One of those pictures that can open up a lot of questions in your mind and keep the viewer engaged beyond just the beautiful image itself.', '2006-01-29 10:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097996, 275787, 30508, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail.  Great shot.</td>', 'Amazing detail.  Great shot.', '2006-01-29 10:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097999, 277237, 30508, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Such a beautiful model, but somehow my eyes can''t escape hers.  They make such a strong focal point that you can''t help but be drawn in.  I love it!</td>', 'Great composition. Such a beautiful model, but somehow my eyes can''t escape hers.  They make such a strong focal point that you can''t help but be drawn in.  I love it!', '2006-01-29 10:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098002, 279890, 30508, '<td valign="top">What a great photo.  I wish there was a way to have her eyes in focus as well as the butterfly.  My eye keeps getting drawn to her eyes as the focal point instead of the butterfly, and her expression is such an important part of what makes this photo.</td>', 'What a great photo.  I wish there was a way to have her eyes in focus as well as the butterfly.  My eye keeps getting drawn to her eyes as the focal point instead of the butterfly, and her expression is such an important part of what makes this photo.', '2006-01-29 10:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098005, 281316, 1041, '<td valign="top">I kept going back and forth for a while, covering up the ship on the right to see what was the stronger image, and I finally decided they are both spectacular in their own way.  I like the contrast of the colorful boat against the otherwiese muted, limited color palette, yet at the same time it makes them feel a little bit as if they were pasted there (I am not suggesting they were).  Maybe desaturate a bit?</td>', 'I kept going back and forth for a while, covering up the ship on the right to see what was the stronger image, and I finally decided they are both spectacular in their own way.  I like the contrast of the colorful boat against the otherwiese muted, limited color palette, yet at the same time it makes them feel a little bit as if they were pasted there (I am not suggesting they were).  Maybe desaturate a bit?', '2006-01-29 10:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098007, 276207, 30508, '<td valign="top">A stunning landscape.  Nicely done.  This might benefit from some more dramatic lighting, though.  Still, I think the subtelty of the lighting in this does add a serene quality to the image.</td>', 'A stunning landscape.  Nicely done.  This might benefit from some more dramatic lighting, though.  Still, I think the subtelty of the lighting in this does add a serene quality to the image.', '2006-01-29 10:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098011, 275945, 1041, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic and creative portrait.  The composition is just so spot-on and the title really compliments the picture.  I like the position of the hands and how that one, very clear and bright eye is lookind directly at me.  Tonal range is also good.  Really, there''s nothing I would change.</td>', 'This is a fantastic and creative portrait.  The composition is just so spot-on and the title really compliments the picture.  I like the position of the hands and how that one, very clear and bright eye is lookind directly at me.  Tonal range is also good.  Really, there''s nothing I would change.', '2006-01-29 10:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098013, 274541, 30508, '<td valign="top">Literally breathtaking.  There is so much that I like about this -- the lines formed by the clouds in the sky, the perfect tonal range, great contrast while maintaining the subtle nature of the image.</td>', 'Literally breathtaking.  There is so much that I like about this -- the lines formed by the clouds in the sky, the perfect tonal range, great contrast while maintaining the subtle nature of the image.', '2006-01-29 10:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098014, 275932, 30508, '<td valign="top">Technically amazing and beautiful subjects.  Honestly, it would be a better image without the effluent, but I have to give you credit on the timing and it''s certainly much funnier as is.</td>', 'Technically amazing and beautiful subjects.  Honestly, it would be a better image without the effluent, but I have to give you credit on the timing and it''s certainly much funnier as is.', '2006-01-29 10:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098017, 275323, 11895, '<td valign="top">nice subject but the border is on the heavy side, it takes attention away from your image</td>', 'nice subject but the border is on the heavy side, it takes attention away from your image', '2006-01-29 10:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098018, 276533, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice mountain, nice lake, nice resort.  Well shot, good composition.  Looks like it belongs in a travel magazine.</td>', 'Nice mountain, nice lake, nice resort.  Well shot, good composition.  Looks like it belongs in a travel magazine.', '2006-01-29 10:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098020, 277138, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  I think the composition might be better if you cropped it vertically to emphasize the relationship between the sun, the dock, and the object in the water (is that a dolphin?)  As a landscape, the focal points are a little too centralized and leave the edges of the image a little empty.</td>', 'Nice colors.  I think the composition might be better if you cropped it vertically to emphasize the relationship between the sun, the dock, and the object in the water (is that a dolphin?)  As a landscape, the focal points are a little too centralized and leave the edges of the image a little empty.', '2006-01-29 10:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098024, 275891, 30508, '<td valign="top">What''s not to love?</td>', 'What''s not to love?', '2006-01-29 10:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098025, 277006, 43671, '<td valign="top">Nice scenic shot.</td>', 'Nice scenic shot.', '2006-01-29 10:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
