(2098031, 280090, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image.  I think a tighter crop to remove some of the left and the bottom of the image would have added a little more impact to this.</td>', 'Very interesting image.  I think a tighter crop to remove some of the left and the bottom of the image would have added a little more impact to this.', '2006-01-29 10:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
