(2098051, 275713, 30508, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful.  I like the use of the foreground to draw the viewer in and frame the reflections on the water.  Great colors.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful.  I like the use of the foreground to draw the viewer in and frame the reflections on the water.  Great colors.', '2006-01-29 10:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
