(2098056, 275098, 40679, '<td valign="top">I love the vintage look in this photo! looks like she walked out of the 60s (?). allthoug the white parts of the photo are blown out, I don''t mind in this photo. the eyes of your model are intruiging. love it, bump you to a 9 :)</td>', 'I love the vintage look in this photo! looks like she walked out of the 60s (?). allthoug the white parts of the photo are blown out, I don''t mind in this photo. the eyes of your model are intruiging. love it, bump you to a 9 :)', '2006-01-29 10:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
