(2098072, 280366, 40679, '<td valign="top">the location is fantastic. together with the man sitting alone &amp; the ray of light this is a very dramatic photo, filled with hope. bumped to a 10 and added to my faves :)</td>', 'the location is fantastic. together with the man sitting alone & the ray of light this is a very dramatic photo, filled with hope. bumped to a 10 and added to my faves :)', '2006-01-29 10:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
