(2098126, 278574, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Perfect focus and good composition.  This is one of those situations where it might have been better to zoom out and show the full arm and hand to he/she pointing (if in fact they were).  Of course that might not have worked at all, though :)</td>', 'Nice shot.  Perfect focus and good composition.  This is one of those situations where it might have been better to zoom out and show the full arm and hand to he/she pointing (if in fact they were).  Of course that might not have worked at all, though :)', '2006-01-29 11:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
