(2098136, 281836, 25742, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and setup, but the pp is a bit too strong for my taste. but this is a captivating photo, so I''m not decided what to think of it.</td>', 'I like the pose and setup, but the pp is a bit too strong for my taste. but this is a captivating photo, so I''m not decided what to think of it.', '2006-01-29 11:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
