(2098309, 275320, 10867, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2006-01-29 13:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098318, 274545, 10867, '<td valign="top">The lighting is wonderful. I feel, though, that the ship may be too small in the frame for the image to be fully effective.  Ifthis were mine, I would probably crop a bit from the top and the right.  Also, because the ship is so small (on my screen, anyway), I can''t really tell for sure which direction it''s headed in.  It looks to me, though, as if it''s headed out of the frame.  I''ve always heard that moving objects should have more room in front of them than behind them in a photo.  Great lighting, though, and a horizon that''s absolutely straight!</td>', 'The lighting is wonderful. I feel, though, that the ship may be too small in the frame for the image to be fully effective.  Ifthis were mine, I would probably crop a bit from the top and the right.  Also, because the ship is so small (on my screen, anyway), I can''t really tell for sure which direction it''s headed in.  It looks to me, though, as if it''s headed out of the frame.  I''ve always heard that moving objects should have more room in front of them than behind them in a photo.  Great lighting, though, and a horizon that''s absolutely straight!', '2006-01-29 13:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098320, 274927, 42125, '<td valign="top">You have a beutiful face.</td>', 'You have a beutiful face.', '2006-01-29 13:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098335, 281631, 27845, '<td valign="top">Looks like one of Jacko''s water series. Nice colour background and water shape. The lighting is okay, just the bright spots in the middle keep it from being perfect. The two in the water should be easy to clone out, the one in the glass is more difficult. 9.</td>', 'Looks like one of Jacko''s water series. Nice colour background and water shape. The lighting is okay, just the bright spots in the middle keep it from being perfect. The two in the water should be easy to clone out, the one in the glass is more difficult. 9.', '2006-01-29 13:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098340, 274931, 27845, '<td valign="top">I would like to try this as well, with a higher magnification though. DOF is a mess, huh? Nice colours. 9.</td>', 'I would like to try this as well, with a higher magnification though. DOF is a mess, huh? Nice colours. 9.', '2006-01-29 13:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
