(2098380, 281629, 10867, '<td valign="top">This is a really good portrait.  The pose and the expression are flattering and look natural and relaxed, the skin tones are perfect, and the red accents add appeal.  The only problem is the light areas (the large one behind the model''s head and the smaller ones elsewhere in the background). They definitely draw the eye away from the model. That''s a real pity, because with a less obtrusive background, this portrait would be really excellent.</td>', 'This is a really good portrait.  The pose and the expression are flattering and look natural and relaxed, the skin tones are perfect, and the red accents add appeal.  The only problem is the light areas (the large one behind the model''s head and the smaller ones elsewhere in the background). They definitely draw the eye away from the model. That''s a real pity, because with a less obtrusive background, this portrait would be really excellent.', '2006-01-29 13:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098383, 281739, 10867, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  The face is very good--nice catchlights and expression, lots of detail,  and good lighting.  However, there seems to me to be too much negative space at the top of the frame.  You might want to crop down to about 3/4" above the model''s head.  Also, there are some hotspots on the white shirt that you might want to tone down a little.</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  The face is very good--nice catchlights and expression, lots of detail,  and good lighting.  However, there seems to me to be too much negative space at the top of the frame.  You might want to crop down to about 3/4" above the model''s head.  Also, there are some hotspots on the white shirt that you might want to tone down a little.', '2006-01-29 13:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098395, 280609, 10867, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, but perhaps just a tad oversharpened.  I can see a trace of white haloes around the birds.</td>', 'Wonderful, but perhaps just a tad oversharpened.  I can see a trace of white haloes around the birds.', '2006-01-29 13:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
