(2098501, 280021, 43115, '<td valign="top">A classic portrait.  I love the warmth of the natural light you used to illuminate this shot.  However, on my monitor (which is calbrated) the glow around her mouth and cheeks is a little too much.  If you added saturation or glow in PP then I think you went a little too far.  If not, then I think you need to check your camera settings. :)  Still, it''s a great shot, and in my top tier for this competitive challenge.</td>', 'A classic portrait.  I love the warmth of the natural light you used to illuminate this shot.  However, on my monitor (which is calbrated) the glow around her mouth and cheeks is a little too much.  If you added saturation or glow in PP then I think you went a little too far.  If not, then I think you need to check your camera settings. :)  Still, it''s a great shot, and in my top tier for this competitive challenge.', '2006-01-29 14:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098506, 277764, 43115, '<td valign="top">Great colors in this one.  I know it was probably a split second capture, but the extra girl in the top center of the frame is really distracting from the subjects in the foreground.  I wonder if you could have cloned her out without running afoul of the major elements clause (probably not) or if you had waited around for a while another shot would have presented itself...<br/> <br/>Anyway, it''s a great shot, and in the top third of the challenge, in my opinion.</td>', 'Great colors in this one.  I know it was probably a split second capture, but the extra girl in the top center of the frame is really distracting from the subjects in the foreground.  I wonder if you could have cloned her out without running afoul of the major elements clause (probably not) or if you had waited around for a while another shot would have presented itself... Anyway, it''s a great shot, and in the top third of the challenge, in my opinion.', '2006-01-29 14:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098507, 276840, 18201, '<td valign="top">pretty shot, the mountains in the back are a bit out of focus</td>', 'pretty shot, the mountains in the back are a bit out of focus', '2006-01-29 14:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
