(2098514, 279948, 43115, '<td valign="top">Great shot... I love me some penguins!<br/> <br/>Good composition, this shot is an excellent example of the rule of thirds really making a photo <i>work</i>.  The negaitve space is great, and I love the way the heads of the penguins lead you all the way to the one standing out from the crowd.</td>', 'Great shot... I love me some penguins! Good composition, this shot is an excellent example of the rule of thirds really making a photo work.  The negaitve space is great, and I love the way the heads of the penguins lead you all the way to the one standing out from the crowd.', '2006-01-29 14:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
