(2098533, 276545, 43115, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  I especially like the guy staring back at the advert girl.  I do wonder if you didn''t oversaturate this a little, as on my (calibrated) monitor, the people''s faces look a <i>little</i> too pink.  I''ve learned that people''s skin usually doesn''t play well with saturation adjustments... in an advanced challenge there''s no reason you couldn''t mask them off from your saturation adjustment.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  I especially like the guy staring back at the advert girl.  I do wonder if you didn''t oversaturate this a little, as on my (calibrated) monitor, the people''s faces look a little too pink.  I''ve learned that people''s skin usually doesn''t play well with saturation adjustments... in an advanced challenge there''s no reason you couldn''t mask them off from your saturation adjustment.', '2006-01-29 14:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
