(2099135, 274550, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and lighting. Very well done. Bumping up after second look.</td>', 'I like the composition and lighting. Very well done. Bumping up after second look.', '2006-01-29 18:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099137, 275691, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple image. I like the lines created by the posts and wires. Wherever you are...the grass is definitely greener on the other side of the fence. :-)</td>', 'Nice, simple image. I like the lines created by the posts and wires. Wherever you are...the grass is definitely greener on the other side of the fence. :-)', '2006-01-29 18:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099138, 277667, 4767, '<td valign="top">The calm before the storm?  Or a lifting storm?  Vivid colors, intersting image.</td>', 'The calm before the storm?  Or a lifting storm?  Vivid colors, intersting image.', '2006-01-29 18:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099140, 281197, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the patterns and waves. For me, if there was a bit more overall contrast between shadows and highlights, I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'I like the patterns and waves. For me, if there was a bit more overall contrast between shadows and highlights, I would have scored it higher.', '2006-01-29 18:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099141, 274921, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''ve always enjoyed photos that study light and dark patterns through windows, doorways, etc. My favorite part of your image is the shadow cast on the inside wall.</td>', 'I''ve always enjoyed photos that study light and dark patterns through windows, doorways, etc. My favorite part of your image is the shadow cast on the inside wall.', '2006-01-29 18:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099143, 279566, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  From the title I''d expected a little more of the hands, less of the shrub, however, I like it either way.</td>', 'Nice photo.  From the title I''d expected a little more of the hands, less of the shrub, however, I like it either way.', '2006-01-29 18:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099144, 275343, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. The coloring looks a bit on the green side to me, but nice photo overall.</td>', 'I like the composition. The coloring looks a bit on the green side to me, but nice photo overall.', '2006-01-29 18:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099145, 280732, 28141, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I like the colors in this much better than the one that placed second in the old &amp; new challenge.</td>', 'Great shot.  I like the colors in this much better than the one that placed second in the old & new challenge.', '2006-01-29 18:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099146, 281511, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) makes me want to grab an oar, a canoe, my camera and head on out into the tranquility of your scene.</td>', ':-) makes me want to grab an oar, a canoe, my camera and head on out into the tranquility of your scene.', '2006-01-29 18:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099147, 277143, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like how the earrings match her eye color - nice touch.</td>', 'I like how the earrings match her eye color - nice touch.', '2006-01-29 18:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099150, 281813, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I''m curious how this would look in a vertical format because of the way her arms are positioned. This would work well in a brochure or advertising flyer.</td>', 'Nice image. I''m curious how this would look in a vertical format because of the way her arms are positioned. This would work well in a brochure or advertising flyer.', '2006-01-29 18:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099153, 280858, 4767, '<td valign="top">I like the photo much better than the frame.  Having the border the same tone as the feets weakens the image, imnho. White would have been better; none at all best. 6</td>', 'I like the photo much better than the frame.  Having the border the same tone as the feets weakens the image, imnho. White would have been better; none at all best. 6', '2006-01-29 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099154, 279938, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the blue/purple haziness. Your image reminds me how small we (people) are in relation to the world - thank you.</td>', 'I like the blue/purple haziness. Your image reminds me how small we (people) are in relation to the world - thank you.', '2006-01-29 18:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099155, 280787, 41675, '<td valign="top">Great rainbow shot. Would make a terrific postcard.</td>', 'Great rainbow shot. Would make a terrific postcard.', '2006-01-29 18:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099156, 281582, 4767, '<td valign="top">I like the HAPPY sign - a great vehicle shot, happy timing to have the sign...</td>', 'I like the HAPPY sign - a great vehicle shot, happy timing to have the sign...', '2006-01-29 18:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099157, 281139, 41675, '<td valign="top">I find cats so amazing. Nice, quiet, thoughtful shot. My favorite part is the light reflecting on her fur.</td>', 'I find cats so amazing. Nice, quiet, thoughtful shot. My favorite part is the light reflecting on her fur.', '2006-01-29 18:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099158, 281317, 4767, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Van Gough''s <b>Starry Night</b>.  I like this a LOT!</td>', 'Reminds me of Van Gough''s Starry Night.  I like this a LOT!', '2006-01-29 18:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099160, 274939, 36006, '<td valign="top">Loriprophoto??Tennessee Stud?? interesting comp, great light, great texture, b&amp;w need tweeking, color great, emotive, overall a great pix</td>', 'Loriprophoto??Tennessee Stud?? interesting comp, great light, great texture, b&w need tweeking, color great, emotive, overall a great pix', '2006-01-29 18:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099164, 281964, 4767, '<td valign="top">Stained glass windows to her soul?  Seems she must have a colorful personality.</td>', 'Stained glass windows to her soul?  Seems she must have a colorful personality.', '2006-01-29 19:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099168, 279178, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and composition. The colors are bright and cheery.</td>', 'I like the angle and composition. The colors are bright and cheery.', '2006-01-29 19:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099173, 281438, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the portrait itself, it''s the background I find distracting.</td>', 'I like the portrait itself, it''s the background I find distracting.', '2006-01-29 19:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099175, 281469, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. I like the composition.</td>', 'Very nice image. I like the composition.', '2006-01-29 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099178, 281766, 41675, '<td valign="top">Neat and different view - I like that. You have a good eye - or two :-)</td>', 'Neat and different view - I like that. You have a good eye - or two :-)', '2006-01-29 19:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099180, 275787, 41675, '<td valign="top">Great shot. So crisp. I think the use of black and white is very effective.</td>', 'Great shot. So crisp. I think the use of black and white is very effective.', '2006-01-29 19:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099181, 278828, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your photo makes me smile. So very colorful and I love his joyful expression. Nice.</td>', 'Your photo makes me smile. So very colorful and I love his joyful expression. Nice.', '2006-01-29 19:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099182, 276545, 41675, '<td valign="top">You found a great backdrop. My favorite part is the man on the far left and the way he is looking. Well done.</td>', 'You found a great backdrop. My favorite part is the man on the far left and the way he is looking. Well done.', '2006-01-29 19:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099184, 281083, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very pretty fall image. My favorite part is the white birch trunks against the vivid leaf colors.</td>', 'Very pretty fall image. My favorite part is the white birch trunks against the vivid leaf colors.', '2006-01-29 19:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099185, 275065, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like cats, but this shot makes them seem kind of creepy - its those eyes.</td>', 'I like cats, but this shot makes them seem kind of creepy - its those eyes.', '2006-01-29 19:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099186, 278434, 41675, '<td valign="top">There''s something about your image I like. Aside from great colors in the sky and water - maybe it''s the perspective. Whatever it is (I''m not one of those tech photogs as you can tell) I like it.</td>', 'There''s something about your image I like. Aside from great colors in the sky and water - maybe it''s the perspective. Whatever it is (I''m not one of those tech photogs as you can tell) I like it.', '2006-01-29 19:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099193, 281104, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of your image, besides such a sweet subject, is the lighting.</td>', 'My favorite part of your image, besides such a sweet subject, is the lighting.', '2006-01-29 19:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099194, 282005, 8860, '<td valign="top">Provided it''s the sun we''re talking about here, and not some bogus, selectively kind, unproven, society wrecking, fictional creation of ignorant humans 2000 years ago - then yes, I can see it!<br/> <br/>Great symmetry. Your mountain is a little under defined though.<br/>: )</td>', 'Provided it''s the sun we''re talking about here, and not some bogus, selectively kind, unproven, society wrecking, fictional creation of ignorant humans 2000 years ago - then yes, I can see it! Great symmetry. Your mountain is a little under defined though.: )', '2006-01-29 19:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099197, 277828, 41675, '<td valign="top">It''s a good photo, and I''ve scored it accordingly, but for me, some of the black/grunge areas are overdone and over the top - especially around the teeth and gums. Either that or she needs to see a dentist, quick!</td>', 'It''s a good photo, and I''ve scored it accordingly, but for me, some of the black/grunge areas are overdone and over the top - especially around the teeth and gums. Either that or she needs to see a dentist, quick!', '2006-01-29 19:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099198, 279674, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Lots to focus on - great subject, very well taken.</td>', 'Lovely. Lots to focus on - great subject, very well taken.', '2006-01-29 19:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099199, 274694, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of your photo. It does indeed look like a happy dog!</td>', 'I like the simplicity of your photo. It does indeed look like a happy dog!', '2006-01-29 19:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099200, 281560, 8860, '<td valign="top">A more unusual shot of the subject. Nice.</td>', 'A more unusual shot of the subject. Nice.', '2006-01-29 19:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099201, 280563, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yes, love the sentiment here. Well captured.</td>', 'Yes, love the sentiment here. Well captured.', '2006-01-29 19:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099203, 280474, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your photo. His dark eyes makes me think he''s up to mischief though. :-)</td>', 'I like your photo. His dark eyes makes me think he''s up to mischief though. :-)', '2006-01-29 19:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099204, 276619, 41675, '<td valign="top">I think it''s pretty amazing you caught this just at the exact moment the ball and bat are connecting - an extra point for that.</td>', 'I think it''s pretty amazing you caught this just at the exact moment the ball and bat are connecting - an extra point for that.', '2006-01-29 19:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099205, 278315, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing how much more powerful this shot is when you obscure the nose and mouth. I would have done that, since the crop is awkward here. Great eyes with such depth.</td>', 'It''s amazing how much more powerful this shot is when you obscure the nose and mouth. I would have done that, since the crop is awkward here. Great eyes with such depth.', '2006-01-29 19:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099207, 280782, 41675, '<td valign="top">There''s just something pricelss about this photo. Two senior ladies, decked out with their jewelry and enjoying a meal together. You have a good eye</td>', 'There''s just something pricelss about this photo. Two senior ladies, decked out with their jewelry and enjoying a meal together. You have a good eye', '2006-01-29 19:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099208, 275853, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like how the different "layers" lead the eyes upwards and into your photo. Had there been a bit more color saturation or light/contrast, I would have scored this even higher.</td>', 'I like how the different "layers" lead the eyes upwards and into your photo. Had there been a bit more color saturation or light/contrast, I would have scored this even higher.', '2006-01-29 19:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099215, 281303, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the different angle you chose to shoot this from. The solid black background really helps everything else "pop" all the more.</td>', 'I like the different angle you chose to shoot this from. The solid black background really helps everything else "pop" all the more.', '2006-01-29 19:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099218, 276533, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice sceneic shot. It would make a great postcard. Appears to be a bit over sharpened on my monitor, but good composition.</td>', 'Nice sceneic shot. It would make a great postcard. Appears to be a bit over sharpened on my monitor, but good composition.', '2006-01-29 19:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099219, 275921, 38032, '<td valign="top">cool, original, informative 8</td>', 'cool, original, informative 8', '2006-01-29 19:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099222, 279221, 41675, '<td valign="top">It''s those eyes - they''re riveting. Well done.</td>', 'It''s those eyes - they''re riveting. Well done.', '2006-01-29 19:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099226, 280448, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the wingspread and the light on the bird''s breast the best.</td>', 'I like the wingspread and the light on the bird''s breast the best.', '2006-01-29 19:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099229, 280517, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a darling kitty photo. So sweet and cute. lol - great title for the image!</td>', 'What a darling kitty photo. So sweet and cute. lol - great title for the image!', '2006-01-29 19:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099230, 277184, 38032, '<td valign="top">scary title - interesting how it affects the viewer o fthe image (the title that is).</td>', 'scary title - interesting how it affects the viewer o fthe image (the title that is).', '2006-01-29 19:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099231, 280940, 41675, '<td valign="top">This must have been taken on a Monday - at least your photo conveys how I feel when the work week begins. (ha, ha) Sweet animal portrait - well done.</td>', 'This must have been taken on a Monday - at least your photo conveys how I feel when the work week begins. (ha, ha) Sweet animal portrait - well done.', '2006-01-29 19:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099234, 275862, 29792, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the softening was done with a filter or photoshop, but it looks great nonetheless.  It just works for this photo and the composition you chose.  The two foreground horses seem a bit underexposed, but that could just be my monitor.  Good work.</td>', 'I''m not sure if the softening was done with a filter or photoshop, but it looks great nonetheless.  It just works for this photo and the composition you chose.  The two foreground horses seem a bit underexposed, but that could just be my monitor.  Good work.', '2006-01-29 19:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099235, 281731, 8860, '<td valign="top">I doubt it''s possible to go wrong with this wonderful subject, but this looks great!</td>', 'I doubt it''s possible to go wrong with this wonderful subject, but this looks great!', '2006-01-29 19:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099241, 274652, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like everything about your image, but it''s those sneakers that keep drawing my eyes away from more interesting points of your photo. All I can think of is Ronald McDonald''s shoes - or maybe it''s the striped socks.</td>', 'I like everything about your image, but it''s those sneakers that keep drawing my eyes away from more interesting points of your photo. All I can think of is Ronald McDonald''s shoes - or maybe it''s the striped socks.', '2006-01-29 19:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099243, 279466, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your photo gives my soul a quiet sense of tranquility. Nicely composed and I like the overall softness of it. Bumping up after a second look.</td>', 'Your photo gives my soul a quiet sense of tranquility. Nicely composed and I like the overall softness of it. Bumping up after a second look.', '2006-01-29 19:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099247, 276219, 8860, '<td valign="top">Shit! No wonder the planet''s heating up... God bless America?<br/> <br/>Great viewpoint, exposure and choice of time of day. Love it.</td>', 'Shit! No wonder the planet''s heating up... God bless America? Great viewpoint, exposure and choice of time of day. Love it.', '2006-01-29 19:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099248, 277821, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like his bright colors, especially around the eyes and hat. The blurred and busy background is somewhat distracting to me, but fun image.</td>', 'I like his bright colors, especially around the eyes and hat. The blurred and busy background is somewhat distracting to me, but fun image.', '2006-01-29 19:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099250, 274863, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''ve always found solace in watching the mist rise from waterways. I like the empty bench and tree.</td>', 'I''ve always found solace in watching the mist rise from waterways. I like the empty bench and tree.', '2006-01-29 19:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
