(2100931, 281264, 9668, '<td valign="top">The border really annoys me in this image. The first thing I noticed was here eyes, but almost immediatly after that, my attention was drawn to the top border. If you hadn''t cut so much off I would be ok with it, but since there is such a large slice missing, it bothers me. Becuase instead of focusing on the beautiful image, I am thinking about the border. I don''t know. Still, very well done, lovely juxtaposition of the green and pink.</td>', 'The border really annoys me in this image. The first thing I noticed was here eyes, but almost immediatly after that, my attention was drawn to the top border. If you hadn''t cut so much off I would be ok with it, but since there is such a large slice missing, it bothers me. Becuase instead of focusing on the beautiful image, I am thinking about the border. I don''t know. Still, very well done, lovely juxtaposition of the green and pink.', '2006-01-30 04:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
