(2101987, 278097, 19944, '<td valign="top">This is sharp and shows great DOF, but I would have found a better surface upon which to place the shell.  That concrete wall is just not appealing, especially considering how prominent it is in the photo.</td>', 'This is sharp and shows great DOF, but I would have found a better surface upon which to place the shell.  That concrete wall is just not appealing, especially considering how prominent it is in the photo.', '2006-01-30 12:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
