(2104219, 281316, 17507, '<td valign="top">love the moment that this captures. perfect timing. the unusual composition is quite refreshing. there''s a bit of glow around the boat that''s distracting... possibly this could have been minimized or somewhat alleviated by splitting the USM layer into Lighten and Darken layers, and adjusting the opacity or masking them. The monochrome blue works wonderfully for this image, and the splash of color in the boat helps strengthen that secondary visual anchor. great picture</td>', 'love the moment that this captures. perfect timing. the unusual composition is quite refreshing. there''s a bit of glow around the boat that''s distracting... possibly this could have been minimized or somewhat alleviated by splitting the USM layer into Lighten and Darken layers, and adjusting the opacity or masking them. The monochrome blue works wonderfully for this image, and the splash of color in the boat helps strengthen that secondary visual anchor. great picture', '2006-01-31 01:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104220, 280498, 17507, '<td valign="top">cool shallow DOF effect. I think the impact could be somewhat improved if the background scissors were placed so that one of its fingerholes provides a circular frame for the eye of the needle.</td>', 'cool shallow DOF effect. I think the impact could be somewhat improved if the background scissors were placed so that one of its fingerholes provides a circular frame for the eye of the needle.', '2006-01-31 01:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
