(2104224, 277445, 17507, '<td valign="top">wow, the line of the water lilies makes this photo look almost as if the plants are underwater, and the camera is sitting half above and half below the water line. don''t know if this was intentional, but it definitely adds to the photo.</td>', 'wow, the line of the water lilies makes this photo look almost as if the plants are underwater, and the camera is sitting half above and half below the water line. don''t know if this was intentional, but it definitely adds to the photo.', '2006-01-31 01:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
