(2104238, 276106, 17507, '<td valign="top">beatiful tonal quality; she looks like she''s glowing. the shirt is a bit too bright - I have no problem with whites in a photo, but in that part of this composition, they are distracting. I like the texture of the background, which is complex enough to keep some interest while subdued enough to keep the focus on the subject. the sharpness of the hair is well done also. the pose and expression look genuine.</td>', 'beatiful tonal quality; she looks like she''s glowing. the shirt is a bit too bright - I have no problem with whites in a photo, but in that part of this composition, they are distracting. I like the texture of the background, which is complex enough to keep some interest while subdued enough to keep the focus on the subject. the sharpness of the hair is well done also. the pose and expression look genuine.', '2006-01-31 01:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104243, 281409, 17507, '<td valign="top">D&amp;L outtake? :)<br/>great clarity and colors in this shot.</td>', 'D&L outtake? :)great clarity and colors in this shot.', '2006-01-31 01:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104244, 279667, 17507, '<td valign="top">looks like skiprow... if not, take it as a compliment</td>', 'looks like skiprow... if not, take it as a compliment', '2006-01-31 01:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104245, 281132, 29904, '<td valign="top">Wow, wonderful depth of field!  perfect focus, exposure, composition, color...<br/>my only suggestion would have been to stand up just a hair so the head of the tulip is surrounded by green.</td>', 'Wow, wonderful depth of field!  perfect focus, exposure, composition, color...my only suggestion would have been to stand up just a hair so the head of the tulip is surrounded by green.', '2006-01-31 01:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104246, 274611, 17507, '<td valign="top">great picture and intriguing shapes. not sure why you named it ''christmas in seattle'' - christmastime or not, christmas doesn''t seem to play into this photo at all, so having it in the title seems arbitrary. I say this only because this is an excellent image, and it deserves an excellent title.</td>', 'great picture and intriguing shapes. not sure why you named it ''christmas in seattle'' - christmastime or not, christmas doesn''t seem to play into this photo at all, so having it in the title seems arbitrary. I say this only because this is an excellent image, and it deserves an excellent title.', '2006-01-31 01:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104249, 275478, 17507, '<td valign="top">hm, this looks like it used a technique i''ve found quite interesting-<br/>don''t know if this is what you did, but i''ve done it a few times-<br/>duplicate layer <br/>dupe to B/W<br/>copy B/W<br/>invert top B/W layer<br/>change overlay mode to "Hard Mix"<br/>add slight gaussian blur to hard mix layer<br/>merge B/W layers<br/>change B/W layer overlay mode to "Multiply" or "Overlay"<br/> <br/>--except when I do it, it''s mostly just a "hey, this is nifty" kind of thing; here you''ve made the grittyness and ultra-detail-enhancement really work. the eyes especially are great.</td>', 'hm, this looks like it used a technique i''ve found quite interesting-don''t know if this is what you did, but i''ve done it a few times-duplicate layer dupe to B/Wcopy B/Winvert top B/W layerchange overlay mode to "Hard Mix"add slight gaussian blur to hard mix layermerge B/W layerschange B/W layer overlay mode to "Multiply" or "Overlay" --except when I do it, it''s mostly just a "hey, this is nifty" kind of thing; here you''ve made the grittyness and ultra-detail-enhancement really work. the eyes especially are great.', '2006-01-31 01:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104250, 276529, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2006-01-31 01:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104251, 279001, 17507, '<td valign="top">hm. the patterns in the water look a lot like an audio speaker.</td>', 'hm. the patterns in the water look a lot like an audio speaker.', '2006-01-31 01:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104252, 274652, 17507, '<td valign="top">ah yes, I see you are once again making use of your most willing model. Great color work.</td>', 'ah yes, I see you are once again making use of your most willing model. Great color work.', '2006-01-31 01:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
