(2104594, 282006, 38032, '<td valign="top">there is something really different and amazing about this.   I think there is a human quality to the bird that makes him/her more emotional or something.  The crop is perfect and the pole in the dstance --- just very unique and well done.  The title doesn''t matter but I would call it something more dramatic.  I''d be curious to know where / how this was taken.  PS: I hope the bird is real :) ... 9</td>', 'there is something really different and amazing about this.   I think there is a human quality to the bird that makes him/her more emotional or something.  The crop is perfect and the pole in the dstance --- just very unique and well done.  The title doesn''t matter but I would call it something more dramatic.  I''d be curious to know where / how this was taken.  PS: I hope the bird is real :) ... 9', '2006-01-31 07:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104596, 280609, 38032, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s great!   If there was enough res I would love just the bird head / neck / wing crop 8</td>', 'Wow that''s great!   If there was enough res I would love just the bird head / neck / wing crop 8', '2006-01-31 07:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104601, 278122, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot-  but on my screen the black is only at about 80% - -the shame is that your monitor is probably different  and it looks 100%.   this is a phenomena everywhere that kills me because I have 3 monitors between work and home and even when using just one I sometimes get different results when saving for web. ... anyway .. back to your photo:   I would also have rotated to make the horizon straight.   It''s a valient effort and there is somethign stirring about it that is really grabbing me.   8</td>', 'This is a great shot-  but on my screen the black is only at about 80% - -the shame is that your monitor is probably different  and it looks 100%.   this is a phenomena everywhere that kills me because I have 3 monitors between work and home and even when using just one I sometimes get different results when saving for web. ... anyway .. back to your photo:   I would also have rotated to make the horizon straight.   It''s a valient effort and there is somethign stirring about it that is really grabbing me.   8', '2006-01-31 07:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104605, 276469, 38032, '<td valign="top">This has a great personal vibe to it.  I love the high-tone skin and what i believe to be the reflection on the ground in a puddle???  The model is beautiful and I like the way she is enguaged with the camera. The contrast of the bacground brings humanity to it. 7</td>', 'This has a great personal vibe to it.  I love the high-tone skin and what i believe to be the reflection on the ground in a puddle???  The model is beautiful and I like the way she is enguaged with the camera. The contrast of the bacground brings humanity to it. 7', '2006-01-31 07:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
