(2104640, 281896, 16126, '<td valign="top">This is my top pick for blue, great shot! I like this even better than your yellow ribbon a few months ago, better contrast, better balance between foreground and background. And the balloons appear to be luminescent here, wonderful!</td>', 'This is my top pick for blue, great shot! I like this even better than your yellow ribbon a few months ago, better contrast, better balance between foreground and background. And the balloons appear to be luminescent here, wonderful!', '2006-01-31 08:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
