(2104726, 280021, 39349, '<td valign="top">Peter, this has to be one of my favs of yours. Just perfect in every way. Her smile and eyes are just mesmerizing. Perfect if you ask me, 10!</td>', 'Peter, this has to be one of my favs of yours. Just perfect in every way. Her smile and eyes are just mesmerizing. Perfect if you ask me, 10!', '2006-01-31 08:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
