(2104730, 279637, 39349, '<td valign="top">I love the tones in this shot. Well done.</td>', 'I love the tones in this shot. Well done.', '2006-01-31 08:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104732, 280112, 39349, '<td valign="top">I like this selective desaturation. Shot feels natural; like I''m a part of the moment. Well done.</td>', 'I like this selective desaturation. Shot feels natural; like I''m a part of the moment. Well done.', '2006-01-31 08:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104733, 277506, 39349, '<td valign="top">Hey I was just there! Nice shot, my only complaint is that the border might be a tad too much, but hey, IT''S VEGAS BABY!</td>', 'Hey I was just there! Nice shot, my only complaint is that the border might be a tad too much, but hey, IT''S VEGAS BABY!', '2006-01-31 09:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104738, 276240, 39349, '<td valign="top">A bit too high contrast for my taste. Still a powerful image. I do like how this shot gives me a feeling like it is something out of a dream though, perhaps even a nightmare for some reason... <br/> <br/>I like the central tracks in the shot leading you into the picture but as they end they leave me nothing else to look at. I''m interested in the building to the left but I can''t really make much out on it. Maybe a different perspective on the tracks? Lower and off to either side to get a different angle maybe?<br/> <br/>I really think you have something here, I''d like to see different variations of this dream-scape.</td>', 'A bit too high contrast for my taste. Still a powerful image. I do like how this shot gives me a feeling like it is something out of a dream though, perhaps even a nightmare for some reason...  I like the central tracks in the shot leading you into the picture but as they end they leave me nothing else to look at. I''m interested in the building to the left but I can''t really make much out on it. Maybe a different perspective on the tracks? Lower and off to either side to get a different angle maybe? I really think you have something here, I''d like to see different variations of this dream-scape.', '2006-01-31 09:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104740, 281878, 39349, '<td valign="top">This shot really dose something for me. Powerful image.</td>', 'This shot really dose something for me. Powerful image.', '2006-01-31 09:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104741, 277181, 39349, '<td valign="top">Joey, Joey, Joey, no grunge filter? HEHE, no worries this shot still rocks! Well done man. I love your view of the world, this is a refreshing portrait I like the contrast of the beautiful girl and the grungy alley she''s in. Perfect title for this shot. I hope it''s doing well.<br/> <br/>Nald</td>', 'Joey, Joey, Joey, no grunge filter? HEHE, no worries this shot still rocks! Well done man. I love your view of the world, this is a refreshing portrait I like the contrast of the beautiful girl and the grungy alley she''s in. Perfect title for this shot. I hope it''s doing well. Nald', '2006-01-31 09:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104742, 275946, 39349, '<td valign="top">Unbelievably beautiful, breathtaking shot, nothing but a 10 from me.</td>', 'Unbelievably beautiful, breathtaking shot, nothing but a 10 from me.', '2006-01-31 09:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104744, 274592, 39349, '<td valign="top">Justin, this is just an awesome shot. Jennifer is a gorgeous model with piercing eyes that demand attention. You''ve got the skills man. I like how you framed this shot and the even tones work so well here. DOF is perfect, well done Justin. 10 from me.</td>', 'Justin, this is just an awesome shot. Jennifer is a gorgeous model with piercing eyes that demand attention. You''ve got the skills man. I like how you framed this shot and the even tones work so well here. DOF is perfect, well done Justin. 10 from me.', '2006-01-31 09:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
