(2105154, 275946, 12253, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  This is gorgeous; I love the colors and the scene in general.  One minor nit, it seems a bit soft: I''d like to see sharper detail in the buildings.  I bet this is somewhere in the top 10!  (Rated 9)</td>', 'Returning for comment.  This is gorgeous; I love the colors and the scene in general.  One minor nit, it seems a bit soft: I''d like to see sharper detail in the buildings.  I bet this is somewhere in the top 10!  (Rated 9)', '2006-01-31 12:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105157, 275251, 12253, '<td valign="top">Fantastic painterly effect.  I''m betting a top 10 image here.  Good luck.</td>', 'Fantastic painterly effect.  I''m betting a top 10 image here.  Good luck.', '2006-01-31 12:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105163, 281716, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Wonderfully crisp, with good composition.  Full Marks, Good Luck!</td>', 'Excellent.  Wonderfully crisp, with good composition.  Full Marks, Good Luck!', '2006-01-31 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105166, 274592, 12253, '<td valign="top">Return for comment.  I remember when you posted this, I thought it was simply fantastic, and my opinion has not changed!  Good luck!  Full marks from me.</td>', 'Return for comment.  I remember when you posted this, I thought it was simply fantastic, and my opinion has not changed!  Good luck!  Full marks from me.', '2006-01-31 12:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105171, 275309, 12253, '<td valign="top">Return for comment.  This has a wonderful, painterly feel.  Great scene.  I think you might consider fixing the barrel distortion on the horizon though, the curvature is a little distracting.  Top 20 picture, is my guess (bumping to 9)</td>', 'Return for comment.  This has a wonderful, painterly feel.  Great scene.  I think you might consider fixing the barrel distortion on the horizon though, the curvature is a little distracting.  Top 20 picture, is my guess (bumping to 9)', '2006-01-31 12:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105175, 281896, 12253, '<td valign="top">Return for comment.  This is so beautiful!  What an incredible scene and capture.  I think it''s almost perfect.  The one change I''d like to see is slightly more contrast or saturation in the sky area, to bring out the balloons a little more.  Just enough to make them sing without losing the lovely depth and layering you''ve achieved here.  Good luck in the challenge--into my favs!</td>', 'Return for comment.  This is so beautiful!  What an incredible scene and capture.  I think it''s almost perfect.  The one change I''d like to see is slightly more contrast or saturation in the sky area, to bring out the balloons a little more.  Just enough to make them sing without losing the lovely depth and layering you''ve achieved here.  Good luck in the challenge--into my favs!', '2006-01-31 12:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
