(2105735, 276617, 18932, '<td valign="top">I kind of don''t know what to think, but it intersting and the colours are nice. Would have liked to see more of the beach :P Seriously though, this is an interesting take on a portrait, and is nice photograph to boot. 7/10</td>', 'I kind of don''t know what to think, but it intersting and the colours are nice. Would have liked to see more of the beach :P Seriously though, this is an interesting take on a portrait, and is nice photograph to boot. 7/10', '2006-01-31 15:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105740, 280942, 43115, '<td valign="top">I think the focus in this shot is in the wrong spot:  on the top of the hat instead of the girl''s eyes.  Otherwise really nice shot.</td>', 'I think the focus in this shot is in the wrong spot:  on the top of the hat instead of the girl''s eyes.  Otherwise really nice shot.', '2006-01-31 15:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105742, 280448, 25742, '<td valign="top">beautiful detail in the feathers even though the bg seems noisy</td>', 'beautiful detail in the feathers even though the bg seems noisy', '2006-01-31 15:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105743, 281865, 18932, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and depth of field. Quite sharp too. 7/10</td>', 'Lovely colours and depth of field. Quite sharp too. 7/10', '2006-01-31 15:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105752, 279780, 50034, '<td valign="top">...And one to "crow" on!</td>', '...And one to "crow" on!', '2006-01-31 15:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105762, 274921, 18932, '<td valign="top">Could have been better with a blue sky, a nice photo, but unfortunately not much more. 5/10</td>', 'Could have been better with a blue sky, a nice photo, but unfortunately not much more. 5/10', '2006-01-31 15:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105773, 278072, 18932, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Great subject and a pretty good take on it, I know these are hard to take. 6/10</td>', 'Nice work. Great subject and a pretty good take on it, I know these are hard to take. 6/10', '2006-01-31 15:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105781, 275196, 18932, '<td valign="top">Wow. 10. Depth of field and stopping motion here is superb. May have worked a tad better if there was evidence of some motion (the drops help massively here, makes the photo much more dynamic) but I''m not marking down on that, lovely work.</td>', 'Wow. 10. Depth of field and stopping motion here is superb. May have worked a tad better if there was evidence of some motion (the drops help massively here, makes the photo much more dynamic) but I''m not marking down on that, lovely work.', '2006-01-31 15:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105784, 274678, 10867, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2006-01-31 15:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105785, 274847, 10867, '<td valign="top">Wow!!</td>', 'Wow!!', '2006-01-31 15:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105793, 277475, 18932, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. The sky''s a bit bland but everything else makes up for it. Nice subject, would like to see a black and white conversion of this. The textures are lovely, 7/10</td>', 'Nice subject. The sky''s a bit bland but everything else makes up for it. Nice subject, would like to see a black and white conversion of this. The textures are lovely, 7/10', '2006-01-31 15:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105796, 279380, 18932, '<td valign="top">Very nice except for the reflections on the glasses good use of desaturation, and the depth of field is just about perfect for mine. 8/10</td>', 'Very nice except for the reflections on the glasses good use of desaturation, and the depth of field is just about perfect for mine. 8/10', '2006-01-31 15:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105799, 281179, 43115, '<td valign="top">Wish this was bigger (the full 640 pixels).</td>', 'Wish this was bigger (the full 640 pixels).', '2006-01-31 15:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105804, 278624, 34217, '<td valign="top">I went to Brooks in Santa Barbara.  This reminds me of my very first class there, we had to photograph the mission with a 4x5.</td>', 'I went to Brooks in Santa Barbara.  This reminds me of my very first class there, we had to photograph the mission with a 4x5.', '2006-01-31 16:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105809, 280021, 34217, '<td valign="top">Nice expression and tones.  However, the light on the face is coming up from the bottom.  When you light someones face you really should be at least level with their face, but it is better to be higher then the face.  Then you don''t get shadows under the eyes or light the bottom of the nose.</td>', 'Nice expression and tones.  However, the light on the face is coming up from the bottom.  When you light someones face you really should be at least level with their face, but it is better to be higher then the face.  Then you don''t get shadows under the eyes or light the bottom of the nose.', '2006-01-31 16:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105810, 280517, 50034, '<td valign="top">What?  Cats drink milk!...Don''t cha know?  :)  Stan</td>', 'What?  Cats drink milk!...Don''t cha know?  :)  Stan', '2006-01-31 16:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105812, 277364, 34217, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!  So Beautiful.  I want a print!</td>', 'WOW!!!  So Beautiful.  I want a print!', '2006-01-31 16:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105813, 276925, 43115, '<td valign="top">Critical sharpness (focus) keeps this from being a 10.</td>', 'Critical sharpness (focus) keeps this from being a 10.', '2006-01-31 16:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
