(2105871, 281053, 50034, '<td valign="top">Zone Defense! <br/>Almost a 10, except for the near camo-effect of background.  However, stopping not one but two humming birds mid-flight is a feat in itself.  Not much time to think about background.<br/>To that I say, "Great photographic prowess!"  Stan</td>', 'Zone Defense! Almost a 10, except for the near camo-effect of background.  However, stopping not one but two humming birds mid-flight is a feat in itself.  Not much time to think about background.To that I say, "Great photographic prowess!"  Stan', '2006-01-31 16:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
