(2106195, 276859, 7969, '<td valign="top">Photography I have heard is about editing.  Editing the out everything except what you want the viewer to see.  When I look at this I am not sure what you want me to see.  The ''balls'' the shoppers, the mall, also words are really bad in photos for the most part, first thing we want to do is read them, so unless they are the focus fund a way to avoid them.  <br/>The editing can be done by zooming in or by using shallow depth of field.<br/>Just my thoughts...good luck</td>', 'Photography I have heard is about editing.  Editing the out everything except what you want the viewer to see.  When I look at this I am not sure what you want me to see.  The ''balls'' the shoppers, the mall, also words are really bad in photos for the most part, first thing we want to do is read them, so unless they are the focus fund a way to avoid them.  The editing can be done by zooming in or by using shallow depth of field.Just my thoughts...good luck', '2006-01-31 17:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
