(2106977, 279850, 35602, '<td valign="top">This image looks like it would be wonderful as a poster.  It is nicely done, and I really like the softness the fog gave the horse.</td>', 'This image looks like it would be wonderful as a poster.  It is nicely done, and I really like the softness the fog gave the horse.', '2006-01-31 21:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
