(2106986, 281099, 35602, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  Just the right amount of everything.  The only problem is the fringing on the roofs.  They could be edited out by using defringe, or using painbrush to remove the outline.</td>', 'Wonderful image.  Just the right amount of everything.  The only problem is the fringing on the roofs.  They could be edited out by using defringe, or using painbrush to remove the outline.', '2006-01-31 21:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
