(2106998, 281517, 25678, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait.  My only problem is the placement of her hand.  The position it''s in makes it look like she''s holding her throat, which can be nice, but from a different angle.  Otherwise, great expression, and great eyes!</td>', 'This is a great portrait.  My only problem is the placement of her hand.  The position it''s in makes it look like she''s holding her throat, which can be nice, but from a different angle.  Otherwise, great expression, and great eyes!', '2006-01-31 21:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
