(2107068, 281542, 39349, '<td valign="top">Amazing DOF for this shot. I feel that I could sit with this man and learn quite a few things about life. What a pleasure it was to run into this while voting. This has to be in the top spots for this challenge, you''ve nailed it and should be more than proud of what you have here. You''ve more than earned a 10 from me for this stunning and humbling photo of wisdom and peace.</td>', 'Amazing DOF for this shot. I feel that I could sit with this man and learn quite a few things about life. What a pleasure it was to run into this while voting. This has to be in the top spots for this challenge, you''ve nailed it and should be more than proud of what you have here. You''ve more than earned a 10 from me for this stunning and humbling photo of wisdom and peace.', '2006-01-31 22:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107071, 277667, 50034, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Amazing!  Inspiring!<br/>"The Heavens declare His majesty &amp; the firmament shows His handiwork!"  Great example of the LORD doing His good work!</td>', 'Wow!  Amazing!  Inspiring!"The Heavens declare His majesty & the firmament shows His handiwork!"  Great example of the LORD doing His good work!', '2006-01-31 22:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
