(2107080, 277388, 39349, '<td valign="top">I really get a feeling of dread when I look at this shot. You''ve really captured a great mood here. I''m drawn into this shot as if I was standing there debating on if I should approach this house or not. I like how the tree in the foreground is lacking detail forcing my eye back to "The Mansion" where it belongs. The dramatic sky finishes off this wonderful shot by helping in creating the atmosphere of enter at your own risk. <br/> <br/>10 from me and a fav.</td>', 'I really get a feeling of dread when I look at this shot. You''ve really captured a great mood here. I''m drawn into this shot as if I was standing there debating on if I should approach this house or not. I like how the tree in the foreground is lacking detail forcing my eye back to "The Mansion" where it belongs. The dramatic sky finishes off this wonderful shot by helping in creating the atmosphere of enter at your own risk.  10 from me and a fav.', '2006-01-31 22:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107082, 282010, 39349, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant. Beautiful tonal range.</td>', 'Simple and elegant. Beautiful tonal range.', '2006-01-31 22:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
