(2107564, 279985, 17507, '<td valign="top">wow, what a moment! love the crisp white background.<br/>I''m sure the blob in the lower right is some blurred object in the background, but the more I look at this photo, the more I get the sense that the tiger(?) has just coughed it up, like it''s some albino hairball...</td>', 'wow, what a moment! love the crisp white background.I''m sure the blob in the lower right is some blurred object in the background, but the more I look at this photo, the more I get the sense that the tiger(?) has just coughed it up, like it''s some albino hairball...', '2006-01-31 23:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107575, 281021, 17507, '<td valign="top">I like the IR sort of effect you have here (I don''t know whether you did this with an IR filter, or by switching channels around in Photoshop, or both, or what), and it helps this image stand out from the pack. Only thing I''m wondering is, why is the middle boy''s face so blue? Even a quick dab or two of the Desaturate sponge would have fixed this, I think.</td>', 'I like the IR sort of effect you have here (I don''t know whether you did this with an IR filter, or by switching channels around in Photoshop, or both, or what), and it helps this image stand out from the pack. Only thing I''m wondering is, why is the middle boy''s face so blue? Even a quick dab or two of the Desaturate sponge would have fixed this, I think.', '2006-01-31 23:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107578, 278864, 28141, '<td valign="top">Honestly, it would be better without the lights on the mountain.  Since you can''t really read the 2005, they just seem wierd and out of place.</td>', 'Honestly, it would be better without the lights on the mountain.  Since you can''t really read the 2005, they just seem wierd and out of place.', '2006-01-31 23:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
