(2108671, 278871, 5792, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on this super image from Antelope Canyon. Yours is the  classic "light ray" view. You beat out my good friend Tina Faust''s Antelope Canyon image by a placing. Both are great pictures.</td>', 'Congratulations on this super image from Antelope Canyon. Yours is the  classic "light ray" view. You beat out my good friend Tina Faust''s Antelope Canyon image by a placing. Both are great pictures.', '2006-02-01 03:47:30.000000', NULL, 0),
