(2108748, 276549, 19831, '<td valign="top">Big congrats! So glad to see this at least in the top 10. I absolutely love this photo!</td>', 'Big congrats! So glad to see this at least in the top 10. I absolutely love this photo!', '2006-02-01 04:14:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2108761, 281896, 40820, '<td valign="top">apart from the early morning mist and light...what appeals to me in this pic is the depth...it''s one of those pics you can just keep looking at...gives one an amazing feeling of openess and freedom...i would give anything to be in one of those balloons!!...well done!</td>', 'apart from the early morning mist and light...what appeals to me in this pic is the depth...it''s one of those pics you can just keep looking at...gives one an amazing feeling of openess and freedom...i would give anything to be in one of those balloons!!...well done!', '2006-02-01 04:20:58.000000', NULL, 0),
