(2108811, 274540, 5792, '<td valign="top">Zoomer... congrats on a fine image and placement in this challenge. Yours is the highest placing black and white in this challenge. Great to see an Oregonian image do well! I might be up that way in May and try to catch up with you either in Oregon or in Spokane. That would be fun!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-01 04:48:52.</i></td>', 'Zoomer... congrats on a fine image and placement in this challenge. Yours is the highest placing black and white in this challenge. Great to see an Oregonian image do well! I might be up that way in May and try to catch up with you either in Oregon or in Spokane. That would be fun!', '2006-02-01 04:44:57.000000', '2006-02-01 04:48:52.000000', 0),
(2108819, 277676, 16106, '<td valign="top">I look at this and think, there is so much more i could be doing with my wide angle lens. An amazing display of subtle shadows and colors, a nice reprive from the supersaturations.</td>', 'I look at this and think, there is so much more i could be doing with my wide angle lens. An amazing display of subtle shadows and colors, a nice reprive from the supersaturations.', '2006-02-01 04:47:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2108835, 281606, 5792, '<td valign="top">Mick... what an amazing high quality image. You are to be commended for placing high in this very, very competative challenge. Btw, thanks again for your framing advice, my January showing was a good success and I sold a couple prints. I will be in Oregon in early to mid-May and would like to get together to take pictures if that can be arranged.</td>', 'Mick... what an amazing high quality image. You are to be commended for placing high in this very, very competative challenge. Btw, thanks again for your framing advice, my January showing was a good success and I sold a couple prints. I will be in Oregon in early to mid-May and would like to get together to take pictures if that can be arranged.', '2006-02-01 04:56:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2108845, 275667, 5792, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your great capture of Cannon Beach. It is a place I know very well and you have photographed it exceptionally good with this fine sepia.</td>', 'Congratulations on your great capture of Cannon Beach. It is a place I know very well and you have photographed it exceptionally good with this fine sepia.', '2006-02-01 05:02:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2108849, 274894, 5792, '<td valign="top">An exceptional image by an exceptional artist!</td>', 'An exceptional image by an exceptional artist!', '2006-02-01 05:05:09.000000', NULL, 0),
