(2108912, 274654, 42132, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ubique:</b></div><hr/><i> Hmmm ... I''ve looked again.  Actually, more than once.  I regret my 8; this was a 10.  There''s something enduring about it.  It will still look this good when at least 450 of the shots that finished higher are mercifully forgotten. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks for returning for another look and this gracious comment,much appreciated,<br/>Christine</td>', 'Originally posted by ubique: Hmmm ... I''ve looked again.  Actually, more than once.  I regret my 8; this was a 10.  There''s something enduring about it.  It will still look this good when at least 450 of the shots that finished higher are mercifully forgotten.  Thanks for returning for another look and this gracious comment,much appreciated,Christine', '2006-02-01 06:02:42.000000', NULL, 0),
