(2111261, 274652, 35517, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Firsty:</b></div><hr/><i> great result Kel for an excellent photo<br/>if this was your second pick which one is first </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>thanks keith, my first pick would''ve been ''Trapped'' <a href="//www.kellymuncephotography.com/-/kellymuncephotography/detail.asp?photoID=925561&amp;cat=14790" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Here</a> but back then i didn''t know how to post process properly, so i didn''t know to duplicate a photo, so that IS the original...<br/>thanks heaps again...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-01 16:01:43.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Firsty: great result Kel for an excellent photoif this was your second pick which one is first   thanks keith, my first pick would''ve been ''Trapped'' Here but back then i didn''t know how to post process properly, so i didn''t know to duplicate a photo, so that IS the original...thanks heaps again...', '2006-02-01 16:00:42.000000', '2006-02-01 16:01:43.000000', 0),
(2111278, 276894, 41337, '<td valign="top">Well I liked the border. It does work with this photo. I don''t understand some of the comments you got. Sure it isn''t the most perfect photo from a technical aspect but really all the issues brought up are minor, and don''t detract from the image as whole. People are just too caught up on trival things that they miss out on actually experiencing the photo. I think this photo "works" much better than several of the top ten photos in this challenge but that''s just me.</td>', 'Well I liked the border. It does work with this photo. I don''t understand some of the comments you got. Sure it isn''t the most perfect photo from a technical aspect but really all the issues brought up are minor, and don''t detract from the image as whole. People are just too caught up on trival things that they miss out on actually experiencing the photo. I think this photo "works" much better than several of the top ten photos in this challenge but that''s just me.', '2006-02-01 16:04:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2111280, 274652, 16241, '<td valign="top">great shot, congrats!</td>', 'great shot, congrats!', '2006-02-01 16:05:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2111295, 274775, 41337, '<td valign="top">I gave this high marks. Loved the color. Maybe if there was a stampede of wildebeest running through this it would have ranked much much better. Wait, did I just say that?</td>', 'I gave this high marks. Loved the color. Maybe if there was a stampede of wildebeest running through this it would have ranked much much better. Wait, did I just say that?', '2006-02-01 16:07:38.000000', NULL, 0),
