(2111582, 274847, 38818, '<td valign="top">I visited Kenya a few years back, and I saw this same scene, except the hippo was a crocodile, and the crocodile snuck up and attacked a young wildebeest. The mother didn''t notice untill she crossed. It truly is an amazing sight isnt it!</td>', 'I visited Kenya a few years back, and I saw this same scene, except the hippo was a crocodile, and the crocodile snuck up and attacked a young wildebeest. The mother didn''t notice untill she crossed. It truly is an amazing sight isnt it!', '2006-02-01 17:31:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2111610, 281896, 29770, '<td valign="top">I must say, the first time I saw this photo, it was hard to believe it was a real single shot picture.  Congrats on the Blue.  It was well deseerved.  Congrats.</td>', 'I must say, the first time I saw this photo, it was hard to believe it was a real single shot picture.  Congrats on the Blue.  It was well deseerved.  Congrats.', '2006-02-01 17:43:21.000000', NULL, 0),
