(2111817, 281747, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yup - it''s been said already. Simple and impactful because of it - and your observation and effective use of long lens.<br/> <br/><b>Imagineer Virtual Fave</b>[TM]<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-01 18:49:08.</i></td>', 'Yup - it''s been said already. Simple and impactful because of it - and your observation and effective use of long lens. Imagineer Virtual Fave[TM]', '2006-02-01 18:48:50.000000', '2006-02-01 18:49:08.000000', 0),
