(2111858, 275168, 1717, '<td valign="top">unbelievable!  i will never understand how amazing shots like this finish so low...maybe because it doesn''t look like it belongs on a greeting card at the local Hallmark store.  where it DOES belong is printed on a huge canvas and hanging in an art gallery!  i think it''s just exquisite.</td>', 'unbelievable!  i will never understand how amazing shots like this finish so low...maybe because it doesn''t look like it belongs on a greeting card at the local Hallmark store.  where it DOES belong is printed on a huge canvas and hanging in an art gallery!  i think it''s just exquisite.', '2006-02-01 19:01:50.000000', NULL, 0),
