(2112175, 280860, 15305, '<td valign="top">Wow!!!  We were really close!!!!  Maguero and me with a group of friends were also at Península de Nicoya from the 27th to the 1st. <br/>29th we were at Playa Blanca, about 29 miles from Cabo Blanco and the next day we were at Montezuma, merely 7 miles from Cabo Blanco!!<br/> <br/>I hope you enjoyed your stay in CR.  Congratulations on your picture.</td>', 'Wow!!!  We were really close!!!!  Maguero and me with a group of friends were also at Península de Nicoya from the 27th to the 1st. 29th we were at Playa Blanca, about 29 miles from Cabo Blanco and the next day we were at Montezuma, merely 7 miles from Cabo Blanco!! I hope you enjoyed your stay in CR.  Congratulations on your picture.', '2006-02-01 20:11:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2112190, 281747, 25754, '<td valign="top">one of my top picks in this challenge. amazing!!!</td>', 'one of my top picks in this challenge. amazing!!!', '2006-02-01 20:16:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2112192, 277650, 24674, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. It is sort of interesting. It''s a shame it scored so low.</td>', 'I like this photo. It is sort of interesting. It''s a shame it scored so low.', '2006-02-01 20:16:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2112214, 277431, 34659, '<td valign="top">Overall I like the shot, but there are a couple of things I would probably try to see how they look.  I would crop much more off the top and a little more off the sides (zoom in closer).  I would also try to burn some of her dress to bring out some of the detail &amp; depth there.  Last thing is run it through Neat Image to clean up the slight OOF/noise.  Just some suggestions - not sure that any or all of them would help, but they might make it pop a little more.  Currently it seems to lack a little luster.</td>', 'Overall I like the shot, but there are a couple of things I would probably try to see how they look.  I would crop much more off the top and a little more off the sides (zoom in closer).  I would also try to burn some of her dress to bring out some of the detail & depth there.  Last thing is run it through Neat Image to clean up the slight OOF/noise.  Just some suggestions - not sure that any or all of them would help, but they might make it pop a little more.  Currently it seems to lack a little luster.', '2006-02-01 20:25:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2112254, 275223, 44996, '<td valign="top">This ranked top ten in my book. Nice job Chiqui!</td>', 'This ranked top ten in my book. Nice job Chiqui!', '2006-02-01 20:33:30.000000', NULL, 0),
