(2115882, 280226, 10390, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t surprise me that this photo didn''t finish at the top, although I would have given it a ribbon (I gave it a 9), I''m so weird... but it amazes me though that it did end as low as it did... most people rated it with 5 or 6, maybe because they didn''t give it the time it needs to make up their mind about it.. 5 or 6 is average, so maybe most of the voters couldn''t make up their mind with a quick few seconds look at it and left it with this not bad/not good rating... I would bet that if there would have been maybe 20 photos in this challenge the rating would be higher...<br/> <br/>I really like this shot, this is something to enlarge and put up on a wall! Congrats with the photo, sorry about the result..</td>', 'It doesn''t surprise me that this photo didn''t finish at the top, although I would have given it a ribbon (I gave it a 9), I''m so weird... but it amazes me though that it did end as low as it did... most people rated it with 5 or 6, maybe because they didn''t give it the time it needs to make up their mind about it.. 5 or 6 is average, so maybe most of the voters couldn''t make up their mind with a quick few seconds look at it and left it with this not bad/not good rating... I would bet that if there would have been maybe 20 photos in this challenge the rating would be higher... I really like this shot, this is something to enlarge and put up on a wall! Congrats with the photo, sorry about the result..', '2006-02-02 20:02:37.000000', NULL, 0),
