(2120898, 276894, 47368, '<td valign="top">Thank you Yanko, I appreciate your comment. I personally had a lot of postive comments on this photo, so that''s why I entered it in Best of 2005, so imagine how shot down and disappointed I was at some of the comments. But if I didn''t want it critiqued I wouldn''t have entered it. I have to learn to take the good comments with the bad and learn from them. But thanks again</td>', 'Thank you Yanko, I appreciate your comment. I personally had a lot of postive comments on this photo, so that''s why I entered it in Best of 2005, so imagine how shot down and disappointed I was at some of the comments. But if I didn''t want it critiqued I wouldn''t have entered it. I have to learn to take the good comments with the bad and learn from them. But thanks again', '2006-02-04 07:00:55.000000', NULL, 0),
