(2120980, 275841, 28710, '<td valign="top">Another picture definitely robbed.<br/> <br/>Sad to see. I had this pegged for top three.<br/> <br/>Nothing bad here at all. It was one of the easiest tens I handed out in the challenge.<br/> <br/>Clarity, background tones and most of all the expression captured made this a no-brainer for me. Congratz on the 0 1''s.</td>', 'Another picture definitely robbed. Sad to see. I had this pegged for top three. Nothing bad here at all. It was one of the easiest tens I handed out in the challenge. Clarity, background tones and most of all the expression captured made this a no-brainer for me. Congratz on the 0 1''s.', '2006-02-04 08:07:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2120986, 276052, 28710, '<td valign="top">I was thinking this would get at least top 50. The background threw it a bit for me, bringing it down to a 9. I got a bit of astro-turf feel from it, rather than a classy satin or velvet.<br/> <br/>She is lovely and in spite of the somewhat artificial look, I love that eye!<br/> <br/>The hair is well done too.</td>', 'I was thinking this would get at least top 50. The background threw it a bit for me, bringing it down to a 9. I got a bit of astro-turf feel from it, rather than a classy satin or velvet. She is lovely and in spite of the somewhat artificial look, I love that eye! The hair is well done too.', '2006-02-04 08:10:20.000000', NULL, 0),
