(2121476, 276041, 37430, '<td valign="top">Hi Makka,<br/> <br/>Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>My standard text :)<br/>-------------------<br/>I''m by no means expert in area of photography. My comments are purely based on my limited understanding of technology and art behind digital photography. Apart from doing detailed evaluation of your submission, my intent is to learn different styles of photography by critically evaluating selective submissions. I hope following comments of mine are helpful to you.<br/> <br/>Composition :<br/>-------------<br/> <br/>This is a beautiful picture which captures the emotions very well and it makes a great wedding photograph. Sometimes what may be the greatest photo to those who are involved, might not click to others in general and I guess thats the reason why it did not scored more than 6 (not that 5.89 is a bad score)<br/> <br/>Camera Work :<br/>---------------<br/> <br/>Camera work is good. Image seems to be properly exposed. Good crop and(just enough) car in background looks good.<br/> <br/>Post-processing :<br/>-----------------<br/> <br/>Again good work on this one. I cannot think of any other way this could have been made better.<br/> <br/>Summary :<br/>----------<br/> <br/>Overall a good composition. I did not voted for this challenge but I would have also given something between 6-7 which is above average score but then this could be because I like the pictures which convey emotions :)<br/> <br/>If you''ve got any questions about this critique, please feel free to contact me via email, PM or IM (1530GMT-2330GMT)<br/> <br/>Wish you a great day!<br/>-Tej</td>', 'Hi Makka, Greetings from the Critique Club! My standard text :)-------------------I''m by no means expert in area of photography. My comments are purely based on my limited understanding of technology and art behind digital photography. Apart from doing detailed evaluation of your submission, my intent is to learn different styles of photography by critically evaluating selective submissions. I hope following comments of mine are helpful to you. Composition :------------- This is a beautiful picture which captures the emotions very well and it makes a great wedding photograph. Sometimes what may be the greatest photo to those who are involved, might not click to others in general and I guess thats the reason why it did not scored more than 6 (not that 5.89 is a bad score) Camera Work :--------------- Camera work is good. Image seems to be properly exposed. Good crop and(just enough) car in background looks good. Post-processing :----------------- Again good work on this one. I cannot think of any other way this could have been made better. Summary :---------- Overall a good composition. I did not voted for this challenge but I would have also given something between 6-7 which is above average score but then this could be because I like the pictures which convey emotions :) If you''ve got any questions about this critique, please feel free to contact me via email, PM or IM (1530GMT-2330GMT) Wish you a great day!-Tej', '2006-02-04 13:22:04.000000', NULL, 0),
