(2244518, 281846, 32569, '<td valign="top">When I saw this challenge, I couldn''t resist entering this even though I did not have ANY original file with me (was overseas for 2 months.)<br/> <br/>I really liked this image, but what I was hestatant about bringing it online was the filter (was done for my friend - she likes pastel effect) because in the rule, it clearly stated that filter would definitely generate really low score.  With that in mind, I still really wanted to enter this just to hear what people feel about this image.  After a weekend of thinking, I still decided to enter and grabbed what was on my website.<br/> <br/>Gladly, besides that I risked my image with the unavoidable filter and size, I am really delighted to see that are quite a few people really loved my image.  Thank you everyone, these days I have been working with several photographers and had great experience.  Sorry that I haven''t been able to keep up my portfolio with yours.  I will see if I can come back online soon : )<br/></td>', 'When I saw this challenge, I couldn''t resist entering this even though I did not have ANY original file with me (was overseas for 2 months.) I really liked this image, but what I was hestatant about bringing it online was the filter (was done for my friend - she likes pastel effect) because in the rule, it clearly stated that filter would definitely generate really low score.  With that in mind, I still really wanted to enter this just to hear what people feel about this image.  After a weekend of thinking, I still decided to enter and grabbed what was on my website. Gladly, besides that I risked my image with the unavoidable filter and size, I am really delighted to see that are quite a few people really loved my image.  Thank you everyone, these days I have been working with several photographers and had great experience.  Sorry that I haven''t been able to keep up my portfolio with yours.  I will see if I can come back online soon : )', '2006-03-21 14:38:39.000000', NULL, 0),
