(2344878, 274851, 55140, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for this kind of shot. The colours are fantastic! I''d be being pretentious if I even tried to offer any improvements but as a couple of people mentioned below, the position of the boat could have been more favourable for you. Not that you could have done anything about it of course! Fantastic shot.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for this kind of shot. The colours are fantastic! I''d be being pretentious if I even tried to offer any improvements but as a couple of people mentioned below, the position of the boat could have been more favourable for you. Not that you could have done anything about it of course! Fantastic shot.', '2006-04-26 06:48:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2351809, 275667, 19708, '<td valign="top">Wow!<br/>Quite surreal and warm.<br/>A bit of banding in the clouds, but hey, 150k limits do that.<br/>Certainly a shot I would be proud to have my name under.</td>', 'Wow!Quite surreal and warm.A bit of banding in the clouds, but hey, 150k limits do that.Certainly a shot I would be proud to have my name under.', '2006-04-27 21:52:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2352961, 277680, 4517, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SisiSimone:</b></div><hr/><i> Hello, Marbo, This is a very beautiful image! Thank you very much for sharing that Infrared Tutorial video. That was very generous of you. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It was just something i found on the web, nothing to do with me.<br/>I`m not that generous :)</td>', 'Originally posted by SisiSimone: Hello, Marbo, This is a very beautiful image! Thank you very much for sharing that Infrared Tutorial video. That was very generous of you.   It was just something i found on the web, nothing to do with me.I`m not that generous :)', '2006-04-28 10:12:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2355448, 275177, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great job here Justin. The blues are eerily smooth and overly saturated which I like. Great landscape shot!</td>', 'Great job here Justin. The blues are eerily smooth and overly saturated which I like. Great landscape shot!', '2006-04-29 03:34:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2358495, 279454, 30861, '<td valign="top">If you compare this shot with your "heron" shot at the same location, looking at composition only, you can see, I am sure, how much stronger the other one is. Here you have a surprsingly static composition considering the grace of allt he component elements. It''s dividing into 3 horizontal bands, none of the alone especially powerful or compellin.<br/> <br/>You have other issues as well, especially with sharpening, which has haloed the poles, and also with not having the image aligned vertically (the lighthouse is falling over, and there''s no real horizon to worry about, so...)<br/> <br/>On the plus side, the merging of sky and water is fantastic, positively ephemeral. As with the other, I''d love to play with this one if you sent me the original. It''s the best way I have of showing what I mean, which is why I do so much of my "commenting" in the forums where evryone can study the work being done.</td>', 'If you compare this shot with your "heron" shot at the same location, looking at composition only, you can see, I am sure, how much stronger the other one is. Here you have a surprsingly static composition considering the grace of allt he component elements. It''s dividing into 3 horizontal bands, none of the alone especially powerful or compellin. You have other issues as well, especially with sharpening, which has haloed the poles, and also with not having the image aligned vertically (the lighthouse is falling over, and there''s no real horizon to worry about, so...) On the plus side, the merging of sky and water is fantastic, positively ephemeral. As with the other, I''d love to play with this one if you sent me the original. It''s the best way I have of showing what I mean, which is why I do so much of my "commenting" in the forums where evryone can study the work being done.', '2006-04-29 16:16:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2359279, 281131, 19982, '<td valign="top">Such a natural and innocent look.  Love the lighting too.  Well done.</td>', 'Such a natural and innocent look.  Love the lighting too.  Well done.', '2006-04-29 20:15:52.000000', NULL, 0),
