(2381728, 278751, 58389, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by emorgan49:</b></div><hr/><i>  I could same something lame about the lovely muted colors, the compositional use of diagonals, perfect DOF.  But I can''t find words to decribe the magic of this gentle portrait. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>i don`t even have the tehnical words he mentioned.. and i hope i never will. the image is trully peaceful and it manages to pass it on to the viewer. that`s why i think it a great shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by emorgan49:  I could same something lame about the lovely muted colors, the compositional use of diagonals, perfect DOF.  But I can''t find words to decribe the magic of this gentle portrait.   i don`t even have the tehnical words he mentioned.. and i hope i never will. the image is trully peaceful and it manages to pass it on to the viewer. that`s why i think it a great shot.', '2006-05-04 11:27:42.000000', NULL, 0),
