(2384680, 279756, 12611, '<td valign="top">Really quite nice on many levels; its surely creepy, but the tones and textures are so interesting. The white is really quite interesting.The red in perfect spots. Perhaps to see the iris color would ahve been an intersting variant; but I could still picture this matted in black and hung 6 feet wide on the wall.</td>', 'Really quite nice on many levels; its surely creepy, but the tones and textures are so interesting. The white is really quite interesting.The red in perfect spots. Perhaps to see the iris color would ahve been an intersting variant; but I could still picture this matted in black and hung 6 feet wide on the wall.', '2006-05-05 09:04:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2384819, 279903, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is great--vibrant lines and great colors.  I love it as is, but I see a derivative that''s worth looking at: take a look at it cropped at the right a bit, in fact, enough to make it square.  Now it has the same flow as wave''s, and the direction is uniform.  Square shots make nice abstracts.  (BTW, thanks for your comments on my shots!)</td>', 'This is great--vibrant lines and great colors.  I love it as is, but I see a derivative that''s worth looking at: take a look at it cropped at the right a bit, in fact, enough to make it square.  Now it has the same flow as wave''s, and the direction is uniform.  Square shots make nice abstracts.  (BTW, thanks for your comments on my shots!)', '2006-05-05 10:16:54.000000', NULL, 0),
