(2801112, 275404, 52945, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot. You''ve really managed to capture a moment in time forever. And all the technicals are spot on.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by biteme:</b></div><hr/><i> I really don''t understand commenters can say the hole in her hose is distracting / should''ve been cloned away / should''ve been fixed. IMO that''s the thing this photo is all about!<br/></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The hole doesn''t bother me at all, didn''t even really notice it until I read the comments about it.</td>', 'Amazing shot. You''ve really managed to capture a moment in time forever. And all the technicals are spot on. Originally posted by biteme: I really don''t understand commenters can say the hole in her hose is distracting / should''ve been cloned away / should''ve been fixed. IMO that''s the thing this photo is all about!  The hole doesn''t bother me at all, didn''t even really notice it until I read the comments about it.', '2006-09-05 16:49:04.000000', NULL, 0),
