(4510001, 281807, 48697, '<td valign="top">Wow, great capture, I would be proud of this shot too!  The timing to catch this is great. I will agree with some of the other post that a bit of sharpening and maybe a boost of contrast with USM would take this to the next level of amazing.  I might crop a bit off the right side as well but that is just a matter of taste for me, anyway, well done and congrats on a fine pic. If you ever give it a run through some sharpening let me know as I would love to see it! Trevor~</td>', 'Wow, great capture, I would be proud of this shot too!  The timing to catch this is great. I will agree with some of the other post that a bit of sharpening and maybe a boost of contrast with USM would take this to the next level of amazing.  I might crop a bit off the right side as well but that is just a matter of taste for me, anyway, well done and congrats on a fine pic. If you ever give it a run through some sharpening let me know as I would love to see it! Trevor~', '2008-02-23 14:49:14.000000', NULL, 0),
