(5659706, 281265, 51538, '<td valign="top">Useful for small size repro but I bet it is full of noise in the corners.  You should in reality shoot this image again with your updated camera/lens.  Not only will it be cleaner as regards noise/artifacts but it will also be a more useful size.</td>', 'Useful for small size repro but I bet it is full of noise in the corners.  You should in reality shoot this image again with your updated camera/lens.  Not only will it be cleaner as regards noise/artifacts but it will also be a more useful size.', '2009-09-23 17:35:22.000000', NULL, 0),
